{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_15","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand how games store state and how to get it into the frame.\n\nI found the game is stored in sim.state.play. I will build SurgeryFrame by downcasting the game inside Sim::frame. I need to read GameBox and understand how play state is stored. The plan requires spawning a room without a player, then despawning it. For surgery, the build function should load a minimal floor, remove the default player, set focus, and assign the Surgery game. Without a room file, the view might be empty except for DynamicMesh.\n\nThe plate mesh fills the view, so an empty floor is acceptable. I will examine starter::build and sim initialization. I need to verify whether the shader multiplies per-vertex color with instance color. I also need to inspect the ViewBuilder emit signature and the App struct fields for scene, sim, and ui.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b0aa84c-96ba-44b4-b250-93fa207f0844-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","offset":947,"limit":200}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b0aa84c-96ba-44b4-b250-93fa207f0844-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b0aa84c-96ba-44b4-b250-93fa207f0844-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pa