{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_18","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Physics simulation on an empty world should be inexpensive.\n\nHistory clones the entire SimState every tick for 30 seconds. Surgery state must stay compact because rewind clones it. Story text and mesh data will be kept as static external data, not inside the simulation state. The state will only store lightweight indices and progress lists. This keeps the history window manageable.\n\nThe full test suite runs about 200,000 steps. History clones add roughly 10 seconds of CPU overhead. Total runtime is estimated at 30 to 60 seconds. This is acceptable if the simulation state stays small.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-193290e4-5887-4b05-9354-79540c955af1-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"self\\.arpg\\.emit|fn build\\(","glob":"**/pav_view/src/build.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-193290e4-5887-4b05-9354-79540c955af1-41","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_tools/src/tools.rs","offset":100,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-193290e4-5887-4b05-9354-79540c955af1-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_tools/src/tools.rs","offset":1680,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-193290e4-5887-4b05-9354-79540c955af1-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/lib.rs","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call