unnecessary_cast)]\\n\\npub mod ai;\\npub mod anim;\\npub mod animation_edit;\\npub mod animation_preview;\\npub mod arpg;\\n10→pub mod behaviors;\\npub mod catalogue;\\npub mod character;\\npub mod clip_browser;\\npub mod clips;\\npub mod color;\\npub mod course;\\npub mod creature_preview;\\npub mod creatures;\\npub mod destruct;\\n20→pub mod entity;\\npub mod feel;\\npub mod figure;\\npub mod frame;\\npub mod fxdef;\\npub mod games;\\npub mod guide;\\npub mod health;\\npub mod history;\\npub mod input;\\n30→pub mod issue;\\npub mod joints;\\npub mod level;\\npub mod material;\\npub mod moves;\\npub mod nav;\\npub mod params;\\npub mod parts;\\npub mod physics;\\npub mod projectile;\\n40→pub mod prop_instance;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! Pavilion simulation core: headless (no window, GPU or audio dependencies).\\n// `x as Real` casts are no-ops with f32 physics but required by the f64 switch.\\n#![allow(clippy::unnecessary_cast)]\\n\\npub mod ai;\\npub mod anim;\\npub mod animation_edit;\\npub mod animation_preview;\\npub mod arpg;\\n10→pub mod behaviors;\\npub mod catalogue;\\npub mod character;\\npub mod clip_browser;\\npub mod clips;\\npub mod color;\\npub mod course;\\npub mod creature_preview;\\npub mod creatures;\\npub mod destruct;\\n20→pub mod entity;\\npub mod feel;\\npub mod figure;\\npub mod frame;\\npub mod fxdef;\\npub mod games;\\npub mod guide;\\npub mod health;\\npub mod history;\\npub mod input;\\n30→pub mod issue;\\npub mod joints;\\npub mod level;\\npub mod material;\\npub mod moves;\\npub mod nav;\\npub mod params;\\npub mod parts;\\npub mod physics;\\npub mod projectile;\\n40→pub mod prop_instance;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/lib.rs\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"//! Pavilion simulation core: headless (no window, GPU or audio depend