{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f3b60ffb-59a6-4b91-8e95-1ddaa0d19ea9-85","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\n\\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\\n\\nDev folder and HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n\\n## Now\\n\\n- Surgical sim: slots, heartbeat, tools, strains, cases 0–7, Code Blue, bot, shell, audio, hub, pack.\\n\\n## Notes for the exit interview\\n\\n- Tests and engine changes get logged here as they happen.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\n\\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\\n\\nDev folder and HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n\\n## Now\\n\\n- Surgical sim: slots, heartbeat, tools, strains, cases 0–7, Code Blue, bot, shell, audio, hub, pack.\\n\\n## Notes for the exit interview\\n\\n- Tests and engine changes get logged here as they happen.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f3b60ffb-59a6-4b91-8e95-1ddaa0d19ea9-86","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- [ ] Clone the engine in the dev subfolder, confirm the commit, read its start and make-a-game docs, pick the title with a real RNG, and start `PROGRESS.md`.\",\"new_string\":\"- [x] Clone the engine in the dev subfolder, confirm the commit, read its start and make-a-game docs, pick the title with a real RNG, and start `PROGRESS.md`.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/goal/plan.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/goal/plan.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/goal/plan.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- [ ] Clone the engine in the dev subfolder, confirm the commit, read its start and make-a-game docs, pick the title with a real RNG, and start `PROGRESS.md`.\",\"old_line\":36,\"new_string\":\"- [x] Clone the engine in the dev subfolder, confirm the commit, read its start and make-a-game docs, pick the title with a real RNG, and start `PROGRESS.md`.\",\"new_line\":36,\"context_before\":\"Keep rules in one deterministic sim the headless tools can tick: surgeon slots, heartbeat, tools, strains, story phases, and the bot live there, with no wall clock, threads, or files. Drive the cursor in real time during the Hush via scaled sim dt, not the engine speed control. Let rendering, egui shell, and audio only read a single frame snapshot plus cue ids, so a browser client can decode the same snapshot. Keep the shell’s input abstract so pad, mouse, and tests share it, including while the sim is paused. Put cases, lines, plates, and rigs in text with file-and-line errors. Expose status, step, and shell commands on `window.__game` for the browser. Pack one HTML that works from `file://`. These are structure hints, not a required layout.\\n\\n## Task checklist\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- [ ] Open the sim/input/camera/product seams and ship one overhead operation (field, vitals, heartbeat, one tool, bot win) that also boots in the packed page with the session client in place.\\n- [ ] Add every instrument, hazard, rating, chain, Code, death/retry, and cases 0–2 as data; teach the bot; add the cue table and coverage tests.\\n- [ ] Add the 10-foot shell: menus, pause, settings, save, glyphs, attract, touch-only, and dev sliders with reset.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f3b60ffb-59a6-4b91-8e95-1ddaa0d19ea9-87","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[49,48,57,52,50,56,32,99,114,97,116,101,115,47,112,97,118,95,117,105,47,102,111,110,116,115,47,66,97,114,108,111,119,67,111,110,100,101,110,115,101,100,45,83,101,109,105,66,111,108,100,46,116,116,102,10,32,49,54,55,48,55,32,119,101,98,47,115,101,115,115,105,111,110,46,106,115,10,32,49,51,54,50,52,32,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,48,49,53,95,95,120,52,50,54,55,55,97,47,119,111,114,107,47,72,97,110,100,115,32,111,102,32,72,97,114,98,111,114,58,32,83,101,99,111,110,100,32,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,32,67,101,110,116,101,114,58,32,83,101,99,111,110,100,32,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,4