{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_58","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking whether advance_stage resets idle.\n\nadvance_stage does not reset idle. Now writing frame.rs, content.rs, bot.rs, and the main module. Case phases will use static arrays with 'static references.\n\nSpawnDef and PhaseDef will be defined in content.rs and re-exported. The story stays earnest. Ops logic may go into a separate ops.rs file. Now drafting frame.rs and content.rs.\n\nDrafting SpawnDef and PhaseDef structs with static spawn slices. CaseDef is next.\n\nCaseDef is Copy because its slice fields are Copy. Strain constants use 255 for none and 254 for no plate change. Unlock bits map to hush, echo, and duet. The story text will be about twelve lines per entry.\n\nFour surgeon names are fixed. A `case_def` accessor and an `every_line` iterator will be added to content.rs. The banned list stays in tests, not the content module. The opening story block introduces the four surgeons and a patient with a crushed forearm.\n\nMara leads the first night. Sixteen story blocks will yield about 192 lines. Clinical callouts will add roughly sixteen more for a total near 208. The file is being written with care for string quotes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e59aae6c-7f11-4c65-8d4e-177811acc62d-46","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/frame.rs","content":"//! What one draw of the operation needs. Built fresh each frame; not part of the saved state.\n\nuse glam::Vec3;\n\nuse super::kinds::TITLE;\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\npub struct CameraShot {\n    pub tilt: f32,\n    pub yaw: f32,\n    pub distance: f32,\n    pub fov_deg: f32,\n    pub target: Vec3,\n    pub follow_lag: f32,\n    pub height_offset: f32,\n}\n\nimpl Default for CameraShot {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            tilt: 73.0,\n            yaw: 0.0,\n            distance: 19.9,\n            fov_deg: 36.0,\n            target: Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2),\n            follow_lag: 0.0,\n            height_offset: 0.0,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\npub struct HazardView {\n    pub id: u32,\n    pub kind: u8,\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n    pub radius: f32,\n    pub work: f32,\n    pub need: f32,\n    pub alive: bool,\n    pub hidden: bool,\n    pub stage: u8,\n    pub stages: u8,\n    pub axis: f32,\n    pub aux: f32,\n    pub bits: u8,\n    pub tool: u8,\n    pub grabbed: bool,\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\npub struct CursorView {\n    pub active: bool,\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n    pub tool: u8,\n    pub score: i32,\n    pub chain: u32,\n    pub meter: f32,\n    pub color: [f32; 3],\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\npub struct PopupView {\n    pub rating: u8,\n    pub life: f32,\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n}\n\n/// Draw-only snapshot. The view reads this and does not consult the sim.\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\npub struct SurgeryFrame {\n    pub title: &'static str,\n    pub mode: u8,\n    pub case_id: i8,\n    pub op_name: String,\n    pub patient: String,\n    pub plate: u8,\n    pub plate_next: u8,\n    pub plate_blend: f32,\n    pub vitals: f32,\n    pub bpm: f32,\n    pub phase: f32,\n    pub flat: bool,\n    pub on_beat: bool,\n    pub timer: f32,\n    pub elapsed: f32,\n    pub score: i32,\n    pub par: i32,\n    pub rank: u8,\n    pub chain: u32,\n    pub mistakes: u32,\n    pub code_t: f32,\n    pub codes_left: u8,\n    pub shocks_done: u8,\n    pub shocks_need: u8,\n    pub fever: f32,\n    pub heat_on: bool,\n    pub heat_angle: f32,\n    pub gift_hush: f32,\n    pub gift_echo: f32,\n    pub gift_duet: f32,\n    pub gifts_unlocked: u8,\n    pub banner: String,\n    pub callout: String,\n    pub story_who: String,\n    pub story_line: String,\n    pub difficulty: u8,\n    pub players: u8,\n    pub music: f32,\n    pub effects: f32,\n    pub voices: f32,\n    pub camera: CameraShot,\n    pub hazards: Vec<HazardView>,\n    pub cursors: [CursorView; 4],\n    pub echo_x: f32,\n    pub echo_z: f32,\n    pub echo_on: bool,\n    pub popups: Vec<PopupView>,\n    pub coverage_tools: [u32; 11],\n    pub coverage_hazards: [u32; 19],\n    pub coverage_strains: [u32; 18],\n    pub coverage_gifts: [u32; 3],\n    pub coverage_code: u32,\n    pub coverage_ratings: [u32; 4],\n    pub attract: bool,\n    pub card_ready: bool,\n}\n\nimpl SurgeryFrame {\n    pub fn empty() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            title: TITLE,\n            mode: 0,\n            case_id: 0,\n            op_name: String::new(),\n            patient: String::new(),\n            plate: 0,\n            plate_next: 0,\n            plate_blend: 1.0,\n            vitals: 100.0,\n            bpm: 72.0,\n            phase: 0.0,\n            flat: false,\n            on_beat: false,\n            timer: 0.0,\n            elapsed: 0.0,\n            score: 0,\n            par: 1,\n            rank: 0,\n            chain: 0,\n            mistakes: 0,\n            code_t: -1.0,\n            codes_left: 0,\n            shocks_done: 0,\n            shocks_need: 0,\n            fever: 0.0,\n            heat_on: false,\n            heat_angle: 0.0,\n            gift_hush: 0.0,\n            gift_echo: 0.0,\n            gift_duet: 0.0,\n            gifts_unlocked: 0,\n            banner: String::new(),\n            callout: String::new(),\n            story_who: String::new(),\n            story_line: String::new(),\n            difficulty: 0,\n            players: 1,\n            music: 0.10,\n            effects: 0.80,\n            voices: 0.70,\n            camera: CameraShot::default(),\n            hazards: Vec::new(),\n            cursors: [CursorView {\n                active: false,\n                x: 0.0,\n                z: 0.0,\n                tool: 0,\n                score: 0,\n                chain: 0,\n                meter: 0.0,\n                color: [1.0, 1.0, 1.0],\n            }; 4],\n            echo_x: 0.0,\n            echo_z: 0.0,\n            echo_on: false,\n            popups: Vec::new(),\n            coverage_tools: [0; 11],\n            coverage_hazards: [0; 19],\n            coverage_strains: [0; 18],\n            coverage_gifts: [0; 3],\n            coverage_code: 0,\n            coverage_ratings: [0; 4],\n            attract: false,\n            card_ready: false,\n        }\n    }\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":16446,"output_tokens":2612,"cache_read_input_tokens":102528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"58a26573-a74c-4986-b0af-e04688c0b6f9"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e59aae6c-7f11-4c65-8d4e-177811acc62d-46","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! What one draw of the operation needs. Built fresh each frame; not part of the saved state.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\n\\nuse super::kinds::TITLE;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\npub struct CameraShot {\\n    pub tilt: f32,\\n    pub yaw: f32,\\n    pub distance: f32,\\n    pub fov_deg: f32,\\n    pub target: Vec3,\\n    pub follow_lag: f32,\\n    pub height_offset: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for CameraShot {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            tilt: 73.0,\\n            yaw: 0.0,\\n            distance: 19.9,\\n            fov_deg: 36.0,\\n            target: Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2),\\n            follow_lag: 0.0,\\n            height_offset: 0.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\npub struct HazardView {\\n    pub id: u32,\\n    pub kind: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub radius: f32,\\n    pub work: f32,\\n    pub need: f32,\\n    pub alive: bool,\\n    pub hidden: bool,\\n    pub stage: u8,\\n    pub stages: u8,\\n    pub axis: f32,\\n    pub aux: f32,\\n    pub bits: u8,\\n    pub tool: u8,\\n    pub grabbed: bool,\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\npub struct CursorView {\\n    pub active: bool,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub tool: u8,\\n    pub score: i32,\\n    pub chain: u32,\\n    pub meter: f32,\\n    pub color: [f32; 3],\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\\npub struct PopupView {\\n    pub rating: u8,\\n    pub life: f32,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n}\\n\\n/// Draw-only snapshot. The view reads this and does not consult the sim.\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug)]\\npub struct SurgeryFrame {\\n    pub title: &'static str,\\n    pub mode: u8,\\n    pub case_id: i8,\\n    pub op_name: String,\\n    pub patient: String,\\n    pub plate: u8,\\n    pub plate_next: u8,\\n    pub plate_blend: f32,\\n    pub vitals: f32,\\n    pub bpm: f32,\\n    pub phase: f32,\\n    pub flat: bool,\\n    pub on_beat: bool,\\n    pub timer: f32,\\n    pub elapsed: f32,\\n    pub score: i32,\\n    pub par: i32,\\n    pub rank: u8,\\n    pub chain: u32,\\n    pub mistakes: u32,\\n    pub code_t: f32,\\n    pub codes_left: u8,\\n    pub shocks_done: u8,\\n    pub shocks_need: u8,\\n    pub fever: f32,\\n    pub heat_on: bool,\\n    pub heat_angle: f32,\\n    pub gift_hush: f32,\\n    pub gift_echo: f32,\\n    pub gift_duet: f32,\\n    pub gifts_unlocked: u8,\\n    pub banner: String,\\n    pub callout: String,\\n    pub story_who: String,\\n    pub story_line: String,\\n    pub difficulty: u8,\\n    pub players: u8,\\n    pub music: f32,\\n    pub effects: f32,\\n    pub voices: f32,\\n    pub camera: CameraShot,\\n    pub hazards: Vec<HazardView>,\\n    pub cursors: [CursorView; 4],\\n    pub echo_x: f32,\\n    pub echo_z: f32,\\n    pub echo_on: bool,\\n    pub popups: Vec<PopupView>,\\n    pub coverage_tools: [u32; 11],\\n    pub coverage_hazards: [u32; 19],\\n    pub coverage_strains: [u32; 18],\\n    pub coverage_gifts: [u32; 3],\\n    pub coverage_code: u32,\\n    pub coverage_ratings: [u32; 4],\\n    pub attract: bool,\\n    pub card_ready: bool,\\n}\\n\\nimpl SurgeryFrame {\\n    pub fn empty() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            title: TITLE,\\n            mode: 0,\\n            case_id: 0,\\n            op_name: String::new(),\\n            patient: String::new(),\\n            plate: 0,\\n            plate_next: 0,\\n            plate_blend: 1.0,\\n            vitals: 100.0,\\n            bpm: 72.0,\\n            phase: 0.0,\\n            flat: false,\\n            on_beat: false,\\n            timer: 0.0,\\n            elapsed: 0.0,\\n            score: 0,\\n            par: 1,\\n            rank: 0,\\n            chain: 0,\\n            mistakes: 0,\\n            code_t: -1.0,\\n            codes_left: 0,\\n            shocks_done: 0,\\n            shocks_need: 0,\\n            fever: 0.0,\\n            heat_on: false,\\n            heat_angle: 0.0,\\n            gift_hush: 0.0,\\n            gift_echo: 0.0,\\n            gift_duet: 0.0,\\n            gifts_unlocked: 0,\\n            banner: String::new(),\\n            callout: String::new(),\\n            story_who: String::new(),\\n            story_line: String::new(),\\n            difficulty: 0,\\n            players: 1,\\n            music: 0.10,\\n            effects: 0.80,\\n            voices: 0.70,\\n            camera: CameraShot::default(),\\n            hazards: Vec::new(),\\n            cursors: [CursorView {\\n                active: false,\\n                x: 0.0,\\n                z: 0.0,\\n                tool: 0,\\n                score: 0,\\n                chain: 0,\\n                meter: 0.0,\\n                color: [1.0, 1.0, 1.0],\\n            }; 4],\\n            echo_x: 0.0,\\n            echo_z: 0.0,\\n            echo_on: false,\\n            popups: Vec::new(),\\n            coverage_tools: [0; 11],\\n            coverage_hazards: [0; 19],\\n            coverage_strains: [0; 18],\\n            coverage_gifts: [0; 3],\\n            coverage_code: 0,\\n            coverage_ratings: [0; 4],\\n            attract: false,\\n            card_ready: false,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/frame.rs has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/frame.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matr