{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_59","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing content.rs next. It will be a large file.\n\nStructuring content.rs with gift unlock constants and a compact story function using static arrays. Adding spawn helper macros to keep the file readable.Continuing the game implementation.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The draw snapshot is in. I’ll add the cases, the bot, and the operation loop next, then compile."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f6745e83-0858-40ed-94cc-d41342479d59-47","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"output_tokens":197,"cache_read_input_tokens":121600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"f068b31a-43b0-43bd-95ee-8a41b683fe2a"}
