8,69,95,83,80,65,87,78,44,32,102,97,108,115,101,44,32,78,79,95,83,84,82,65,73,78,44,32,53,44,32,49,44,32,48,44,32,102,97,108,115,101,41,44,10,50,56,53,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,112,104,97,115,101,40,78,79,78,69,95,83,80,65,87,78,44,32,102,97,108,115,101,44,32,49,52,44,32,49,51,44,32,51,44,32,48,44,32,102,97,108,115,101,41,44,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":4,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":43,\"content\":\"const NONE_SPAWN: &[SpawnDef] = &[];\"},{\"line_number\":45,\"content\":\"const fn s(kind: u8, x: f32, z: f32, hidden: bool, drain: f32, axis: f32) -> SpawnDef {\"},{\"line_number\":217,\"content\":\"            phase(NONE_SPAWN, false, NO_STRAIN, 5, 1, 0, false),\"},{\"line_number\":285,\"content\":\"            phase(NONE_SPAWN, false, 14, 13, 3, 0, false),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"3134b919-db20-407f-a208-0a43cd79eb09"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_70","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Rust allows const items in any order, so C0_A does not need to use s() first.\n\nWriting mod.rs and ops.rs next. The dummy bot code will be removed later if needed.\n\nPlanning the Surgery struct methods in mod.rs. These include boot sequences, case preparation, checkpoint handling, and game state queries. ops::tick will call these helpers.\n\nGameplay mutations will live in ops.rs as functions taking &mut Surgery. Boot and prepare logic stays in mod.rs. ops::tick is the main entry point. Checkpoints must stay small and skip popups. next_id starts at 1. A push_hazard helper assigns IDs and appends hazards.\n\nCode blue patients will show \"Night Intake\" with no stored name, branching on negative case_id. Case names come from case definitions for valid IDs, and story lines from story blocks. The struct also tracks player count, echo cursor position, and fever level. The Game trait returns self.outcome, defaulting to Lost when dead.\n\nTitle and attract modes return Playing. Single-case wins are set at finish_op. Campaign mode stays active through all 192 story ticks plus charts and operations, ending only after the final story line. The skip command advances story to the end or exits an operation.\n\nSkip behavior is now defined per mode: it jumps to the end of story, returns to operations from charts, or restarts campaign story from results. The bot will confirm story lines one by one, advancing each tick while holding CONFIRM.\n\nA `confirmed` helper will check both pressed and held CONFIRM buttons. The command handler runs before the tick loop to prevent double-skip.\n\nThe tick loop will only process confirm presses when no command is present. This prevents a skip from immediately triggering an operation. Commands handle all structural mode changes.\n\nA flag will be passed to the tick loop so story and chart modes only advance when no surgery command is present. This prevents a Skip command from also advancing charts in the same tick. The bot module's `use super::*` import is safe because private parent modules are not included.\n\nmod.rs will re-export `Hazard`, `Heart`, `Tune`, and `kinds` so the bot module can import them directly. It will also expose `frame::SurgeryFrame`. A `take_frame` helper is being drafted to extract the current frame from the simulation.\n\nThe `take_frame` helper is now complete. It extracts the current frame from the simulation via `sim.play()`.\n\nFor `ops.rs`, the tick sequence will be: rules delta time, heart tick, hush beats, timers, sac swell and wander, heat sweep, then tool effects. Drain and vitals checks will run after tools so that a tool heal can prevent death in the same tick.\n\nThe full ops tick sequence is now mapped out. It runs defib logic when flat, then tools, echo, drain, vitals clamp and flatline check, phase advance, code blue waves and win, popup decay, and plate blend.\n\nHeart tick uses rules delta time so hush slows the heart. The R-wave decrements hush beats during hush. The code timer uses wall delta time for five real seconds. The case timer may use wall delta time for code blue.\n\nThe code blue timer will use wall delta time so four minutes equals 240 ticks. Case timers will use rules delta time so hush does not accelerate the clock. A flatline check will run at the end of each operation tick when vitals reach zero.\n\nPending scripted arrests trigger code blue before the natural flatline check. This prevents a healthy patient from dying in the same tick. Immortal mode resets vitals to fifty and clears the flatline flag when vitals drop below fifteen.\n\nThe `resuscitate` helper restores vitals to thirty, clears the flatline flag, resets the code timer and callout state, and zeroes every surgeon's defib status. It increments the shock counter and may restart a scripted arrest if more shocks are still required. Coverage tools DEFIB is incremented. The `begin_code` function is being drafted next.\n\n`begin_code` now decrements `codes_left`, sets vitals to zero and flat, resets the code timer, increments coverage, and triggers the callout. `die` either revives an immortal patient at forty-five vitals or marks the mode as dead with a lost outcome. A timer death check is being added for operations and attract modes.\n\nThe timer death check is being reordered to run after phase resolution. A successful last-phase completion sets the mode to RESULTS, so the timer check sees a non-OP mode and exits early. This prevents a timer expiry from killing the patient in the same tick they just won. Code blue patients die only if vitals are zero or flat; otherwise the operation finishes. Regular cases die on timer expiry regardless of vitals.\n\nCode blue timer expiry triggers the win, not phase completion. Draining stops when no hazards remain so the patient survives the wait. Initial bleeders are cleared before quiet periods begin. Waves spawn every 24 seconds for ten total waves; each wave places two hazards. The bot clears them in roughly five to fifteen seconds. Bone and tumor hazards are excluded from code blue waves.\n\nCode blue wave hazards will be drawn from a pool of twelve kinds. A wave table will cycle through them using the wave index modulo six. When the code blue timer drops below twenty-eight seconds, the system spawns two nodules and a pool to force a win, then sets a finale flag to suppress further regular waves. Regular waves stop spawning once the timer falls below thirty seconds.\n\nOpening bleeders spawn immediately at boot, not after a twenty-four-second delay. Each bleeder drains at 2.6 per second, so two bleeders drain 5.2 per second and kill a patient with seventy vitals in about thirteen seconds. If the code blue timer drops below thirty seconds while a wave is still active, the finale spawns only after that wave clears.\n\nThe bot sutures each bleeder in roughly two to four seconds. Skill one should survive without a code, but if the timer runs low the patient can recover with two codes. Suture time is still uncertain; twenty seconds per bleeder might force two codes and death. If tests fail, lowering samples_need from three to two for bleeders could help.\n\nA debug status field will expose phase, hazard count, and alive state to make test failures readable. The `to_frame` function copies hazards into `HazardView`. The camera will default to the operation view for now; story and title shots can use a higher tilt or pull back later.\n\nThe title screen will display a torso plate. Story events will trigger voice cues with pitch based on speaker length. The tool loop will avoid Rust borrow checker conflicts by copying needed surgeon fields into local variables before iterating.\n\nThe tool loop resolves hits by index after applying damage, avoiding hazard references that would block other borrows. `resolve_hit` reads the hazard's alive state and kind directly from the index.\n\nWrong-tool feedback is now gated by an engaged flag that only triggers when no hit actually connects. Heat scorch is applied separately from the main damage logic. Defibrillation runs inside the surgeon loop while the patient is flat, bypassing the normal apply path. The focus timer resets whenever a hazard’s work increases or a hit finishes, and increments otherwise.\n\nIdle decay is being added after the surgeon loop. Engaged hazards reset their idle timer to zero. Other hazards accumulate idle time; once it exceeds 0.35 seconds, their work drops by half, unless they are bone, sac, heat, or IV.\n\nSuture samples decay only when idle exceeds 1.2 seconds during the suture stage, though this may conflict with a paused bot. Bone hazards will not decay auxiliary work. The next step is to patch RenderFrame in sim.rs and add the new field at the end of its struct, then write the unit test file after compilation.\n\nA compile cycle was spotted between `pav_core::frame` and the surgery module. The frame references `SurgeryFrame`, while the surgery module references `SimEvent` from the frame. This circular dependency must be broken before the new field can be added.\n\nThe module cycle between frame.rs and the surgery module is harmless. Rust allows circular type references across modules, so adding the new field should compile without issues.\n\nSurgeryFrame will remain in games/surgery/frame.rs. sim.rs will reference it directly, while frame.rs will not import the surgery module. This keeps coupling minimal and avoids a compile cycle.\n\nThe compile cycle between frame.rs and the surgery module is unavoidable because the struct must reside in frame.rs. I will proceed anyway.\n\nI will write ops.rs in one pass and add command and prepare logic to mod.rs. Coverage will derive Serialize, Deserialize, and Default. Surgeons will be created with a new_surgeon helper rather than Default. Surgery does not need Default because fresh() initializes all fields; Serde default attributes are unnecessary for snapshots. Clone is required by Game.\n\nPartialEq is not required for the new types. f32 fields are safe to serialize with serde. The ops module will expose its methods as pub(super) or pub so mod.rs can call them. enter_phase uses case_def and rng. Spawn jitter is limited to counts above zero, keeping script phases deterministic when no spawns occur. Hidden foreign hazards still jitter, but the bot tracks their true positions. Nodule need is set to 0.9 during introit for the laser window; make() defaults to 0.85, which is close enough. strain_tough multiplies need by a default of one.\n\nVitals will be clamped every tick. Heart BPM recomputes inside heart.tick each frame. The simulation is complete. I will write ops.rs and mod.rs next, then add a single test case after compilation. I also plan to remove the bot's unused `_gift_bit` function and its `G_DUET` import to keep warnings clean.\n\nAim logic for bone stage zero correctly falls through to the center point. Ember stage one uses a scalpel held near the hazard with one second of work and need 1.0. Ember stage two uses forceps because the hazard is included in that arm. Eye stages zero and one use a scalpel held near the hazard with needs of 1.6 and 1.4.\n\nTumor circle aim logic is correct. Gel paint bits cover four quadrants and the circle shape works. Tests will log status on failure so assertions include readable state. Ops.rs will stay compact without HashMap. Burst vectors are deterministic. Coverage counts sac bursts as cleared because the sac dies, even if the bot laser-saws it.\n\nCoverage will count each hazard death exactly once by checking the alive state before it turns false. Tool coverage for the scanner will trigger when a hidden hazard flips to revealed, since apply sets revealed to eight every tick while scanning.\n\nRatings will only be tallied when a hit is finished and its rating is three or below. Misuse without a done flag is already handled separately. A sloppy rating will break the chain, while good or better ratings continue it.\n\nMeter gain is now defined: eight points for an immaculate rating, four for a clean one, plus two extra if the hit lands on beat. The score formula multiplies rating points by the chain multiplier and the tune’s score multiplier.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dacb4979-e175-4ade-af91-95776edef5fa-62","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","content":"//! Hands of Harbor: overhead surgical action in the Night Ward.\n//!\n//! Rules live here. The shell, the mesh and the speakers read [`frame::SurgeryFrame`].\n\nmod bot;\nmod content;\nmod hazard;\nmod heart;\nmod ops;\nmod story;\nmod tune;\n\npub mod frame;\npub mod kinds;\n\npub use content::{case_def, CASES};\npub use frame::SurgeryFrame;\npub use hazard::Hazard;\npub use heart::Heart;\npub use kinds::*;\npub use tune::Tune;\n\nuse std::sync::Arc;\n\nuse anyhow::Result;\nuse glam::Vec3;\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\nuse serde_json::json;\n\nuse super::{Game, GameBox, Outcome};\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\nuse crate::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput, SurgeryCmd};\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\n\npub const M_TITLE: u8 = 0;\npub const M_STORY: u8 = 1;\npub const M_CHART: u8 = 2;\npub const M_OP: u8 = 3;\npub const M_RESULTS: u8 = 4;\npub const M_DEAD: u8 = 5;\npub const M_ATTRACT: u8 = 6;\npub const M_CARD: u8 = 7;\npub const M_MIRROR: u8 = 8;\n\npub const X_MIN: f32 = -9.0;\npub const X_MAX: f32 = 9.0;\npub const Z_MIN: f32 = -4.0;\npub const Z_MAX: f32 = 4.2;\n\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Surgeon {\n    pub active: bool,\n    pub x: f32,\n    pub z: f32,\n    pub tool: u8,\n    pub score: i32,\n    pub chain: u32,\n    pub best_chain: u32,\n    pub mistakes: u32,\n    pub since_chain: f32,\n    pub meter: f32,\n    pub gift_arm: f32,\n    pub was_use: bool,\n    pub was_gift: bool,\n    pub was_defib: bool,\n    pub defib: f32,\n    pub iv_cd: f32,\n    pub wrong_cd: f32,\n    pub name_i: u8,\n    pub focus: Option<u32>,\n    pub focus_t: f32,\n}\n\nimpl Surgeon {\n    fn new(i: u8) -> Self {\n        Self {\n            active: i == 0,\n            x: 0.0,\n            z: 0.0,\n            tool: SCALPEL,\n            score: 0,\n            chain: 0,\n            best_chain: 0,\n            mistakes: 0,\n            since_chain: 30.0,\n            meter: 0.0,\n            gift_arm: 0.0,\n            was_use: false,\n            was_gift: false,\n            was_defib: false,\n            defib: 0.0,\n            iv_cd: 0.0,\n            wrong_cd: 0.0,\n            name_i: i,\n            focus: None,\n            focus_t: 0.0,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Coverage {\n    pub tools: [u32; N_TOOLS],\n    pub hazards: [u32; N_KINDS],\n    pub strains: [u32; 18],\n    pub gifts: [u32; 3],\n    pub code: u32,\n    pub ratings: [u32; 4],\n}\n\nimpl Default for Coverage {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self { tools: [0; N_TOOLS], hazards: [0; N_KINDS], strains: [0; 18], gifts: [0; 3], code: 0, ratings: [0; 4] }\n    }\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\nstruct Checkpoint {\n    phase_i: u16,\n    phase_ready: bool,\n    hazards: Vec<Hazard>,\n    next_id: u32,\n    vitals: f32,\n    heart_phase: f32,\n    since_r: f32,\n    beats: u32,\n    timer: f32,\n    elapsed: f32,\n    scores: [i32; 4],\n    chains: [u32; 4],\n    best: [u32; 4],\n    meters: [f32; 4],\n    mistakes: u32,\n    codes_left: u8,\n    strain_phase: u8,\n    gifts_unlocked: u8,\n    gifts_used: u8,\n    recent_unlock: u8,\n    fever: f32,\n    shocks_done: u8,\n    shocks_need: u8,\n    plate: u8,\n    plate_next: u8,\n    heat_phase: bool,\n    tools: [u8; 4],\n    xs: [f32; 4],\n    zs: [f32; 4],\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct Surgery {\n    pub mode: u8,\n    pub case_id: i8,\n    pub campaign: bool,\n    pub code_blue: bool,\n    pub difficulty: u8,\n    pub skill: f32,\n    pub tune: Tune,\n    pub heart: Heart,\n    pub surgeons: [Surgeon; 4],\n    pub hazards: Vec<Hazard>,\n    pub next_id: u32,\n    pub phase_i: u16,\n    pub phase_ready: bool,\n    pub timer: f32,\n    pub elapsed: f32,\n    pub par: i32,\n    pub plate: u8,\n    pub plate_next: u8,\n    pub plate_blend: f32,\n    pub codes_left: u8,\n    pub code_t: f32,\n    pub code_scripted: bool,\n    pub shocks_need: u8,\n    pub shocks_done: u8,\n    pub pending_script: bool,\n    pub outcome: Outcome,\n    pub story_i: u16,\n    pub story_after: bool,\n    pub callout_i: u8,\n    pub callout_t: f32,\n    pub banner_t: f32,\n    pub rank: u8,\n    pub shown_score: i32,\n    pub mistakes: u32,\n    pub coverage: Coverage,\n    checkpoint: Option<Checkpoint>,\n    pub strain_phase: u8,\n    pub gifts_unlocked: u8,\n    pub gifts_used: u8,\n    pub recent_unlock: u8,\n    pub hush_beats: u8,\n    pub echo_left: f32,\n    pub duet_left: f32,\n    pub echo_x: f32,\n    pub echo_z: f32,\n    pub echo_on: bool,\n    pub last_tool: u8,\n    pub last_rating: u8,\n    pub last_id: u32,\n    pub last_ok: bool,\n    pub echo_cool: f32,\n    pub fever: f32,\n    pub heat_on: bool,\n    pub heat_angle: f32,\n    pub heat_phase: bool,\n    pub immortal: bool,\n    pub freeze: bool,\n    pub one_hit: bool,\n    pub warned_40: bool,\n    pub players: u8,\n    pub blue_t: f32,\n    pub blue_wave: u8,\n    pub blue_finale: bool,\n    pub popups: [(u8, f32, f32, f32); 4],\n    pub card_t: f32,\n    pub spawn_n: u8,\n}\n\nimpl Surgery {\n    fn fresh() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            mode: M_TITLE,\n            case_id: 0,\n            campaign: false,\n            code_blue: false,\n            difficulty: 0,\n            skill: 1.0,\n            tune: Tune::default(),\n            heart: Heart::new(80.0),\n            surgeons: [Surgeon::new(0), Surgeon::new(1), Surgeon::new(2), Surgeon::new(3)],\n            hazards: Vec::new(),\n            next_id: 1,\n            phase_i: 0,\n            phase_ready: false,\n            timer: 0.0,\n            elapsed: 0.0,\n            par: 900,\n            plate: 9,\n            plate_next: 9,\n            plate_blend: 1.0,\n            codes_left: 2,\n            code_t: -1.0,\n            code_scripted: false,\n            shocks_need: 0,\n            shocks_done: 0,\n            pending_script: false,\n            outcome: Outcome::Playing,\n            story_i: 0,\n            story_after: false,\n            callout_i: 0,\n            callout_t: 0.0,\n            banner_t: 0.0,\n            rank: 0,\n            shown_score: 0,\n            mistakes: 0,\n            coverage: Coverage::default(),\n            checkpoint: None,\n            strain_phase: 255,\n            gifts_unlocked: 0,\n            gifts_used: 0,\n            recent_unlock: 0,\n            hush_beats: 0,\n            echo_left: 0.0,\n            duet_left: 0.0,\n            echo_x: 0.0,\n            echo_z: 0.0,\n            echo_on: false,\n            last_tool: 0,\n            last_rating: R_GOOD,\n            last_id: 0,\n            last_ok: false,\n            echo_cool: 0.0,\n            fever: 0.0,\n            heat_on: false,\n            heat_angle: 0.0,\n            heat_phase: false,\n            immortal: false,\n            freeze: false,\n            one_hit: false,\n            warned_40: false,\n            players: 1,\n            blue_t: 0.0,\n            blue_wave: 0,\n            blue_finale: false,\n            popups: [(0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0); 4],\n            card_t: 0.0,\n            spawn_n: 0,\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn pending_gift(&self) -> u8 {\n        let (u, d) = (self.gifts_unlocked, self.gifts_used);\n        if self.recent_unlock != 0 && u & self.recent_unlock != 0 && d & self.recent_unlock == 0 {\n            return self.recent_unlock;\n        }\n        for bit in [content::G_HUSH, content::G_ECHO, content::G_DUET] {\n            if u & bit != 0 && d & bit == 0 {\n                return bit;\n            }\n        }\n        0\n    }\n\n    fn reset_hands(&mut self) {\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter_mut().enumerate() {\n            let name = s.name_i;\n            *s = Surgeon::new(name);\n            s.active = i == 0;\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn prepare_case(&mut self, id: u8) {\n        let Some(def) = case_def(id) else { return };\n        self.case_id = id as i8;\n        self.code_blue = false;\n        self.plate = def.plate;\n        self.plate_next = def.plate;\n        self.plate_blend = 1.0;\n        self.timer = def.timer * content::diff_timer(self.difficulty);\n        self.par = def.par;\n        self.heart = Heart::new(def.vitals);\n        self.hazards.clear();\n        self.phase_i = 0;\n        self.phase_ready = false;\n        self.codes_left = content::diff_codes(self.difficulty);\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\n        self.code_scripted = false;\n        self.shocks_need = 0;\n        self.shocks_done = 0;\n        self.pending_script = false;\n        self.heat_on = false;\n        self.heat_phase = false;\n        self.heat_angle = 0.0;\n        self.elapsed = 0.0;\n        self.rank = 0;\n        self.shown_score = 0;\n        self.mistakes = 0;\n        self.warned_40 = false;\n        self.banner_t = 0.0;\n        self.callout_t = 0.0;\n        self.hush_beats = 0;\n        self.echo_left = 0.0;\n        self.duet_left = 0.0;\n        self.echo_on = false;\n        self.strain_phase = 255;\n        self.blue_finale = false;\n        self.reset_hands();\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\n    }\n\n    fn boot_single(&mut self, id: u8) {\n        self.campaign = false;\n        self.coverage = Coverage::default();\n        self.gifts_unlocked = 0;\n        self.gifts_used = 0;\n        self.recent_unlock = 0;\n        self.immortal = false;\n        self.one_hit = false;\n        self.prepare_case(id.min(7));\n        self.mode = M_OP;\n    }\n\n    fn boot_campaign(&mut self) {\n        self.campaign = true;\n        self.coverage = Coverage::default();\n        self.gifts_unlocked = 0;\n        self.gifts_used = 0;\n        self.recent_unlock = 0;\n        self.immortal = false;\n        self.one_hit = false;\n        self.prepare_case(0);\n        self.mode = M_STORY;\n        self.story_after = false;\n        self.story_i = 0;\n    }\n\n    fn boot_code(&mut self) {\n        self.campaign = false;\n        self.code_blue = true;\n        self.case_id = -1;\n        self.coverage = Coverage::default();\n        self.mode = M_OP;\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\n        self.timer = 240.0 * content::diff_timer(self.difficulty);\n        self.par = 1600;\n        self.heart = Heart::new(70.0);\n        self.plate = 9;\n        self.plate_next = 9;\n        self.plate_blend = 1.0;\n        self.hazards.clear();\n        self.phase_ready = true;\n        self.phase_i = 0;\n        self.codes_left = content::diff_codes(self.difficulty);\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\n        self.blue_t = 0.0;\n        self.blue_wave = 0;\n        self.blue_finale = false;\n        self.elapsed = 0.0;\n        self.mistakes = 0;\n        self.rank = 0;\n        self.shown_score = 0;\n        self.heat_phase = false;\n        self.reset_hands();\n        self.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, -1.15, 0.05, 2.6);\n        self.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, 1.25, 0.35, 2.6);\n    }\n\n    fn boot_attract(&mut self) {\n        self.boot_single(0);\n        self.mode = M_ATTRACT;\n        self.immortal = true;\n        self.one_hit = true;\n        self.skill = 1.0;\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\n    }\n\n    pub(crate) fn spawn_kind_at(&mut self, kind: u8, x: f32, z: f32, drain: f32) {\n        let mut h = Hazard::make(kind, x, z);\n        if drain >= 0.0 {\n            h.drain = drain;\n        }\n        h.id = self.next_id;\n        self.next_id = self.next_id.wrapping_add(1);\n        self.hazards.push(h);\n    }\n\n    fn save_checkpoint(&mut self) {\n        let mut scores = [0; 4];\n        let mut chains = [0; 4];\n        let mut best = [0; 4];\n        let mut meters = [0.0; 4];\n        let mut tools = [0; 4];\n        let mut xs = [0.0; 4];\n        let mut zs = [0.0; 4];\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter().enumerate() {\n            scores[i] = s.score;\n            chains[i] = s.chain;\n            best[i] = s.best_chain;\n            meters[i] = s.meter;\n            tools[i] = s.tool;\n            xs[i] = s.x;\n            zs[i] = s.z;\n        }\n        self.checkpoint = Some(Checkpoint {\n            phase_i: self.phase_i,\n            phase_ready: self.phase_ready,\n            hazards: self.hazards.clone(),\n            next_id: self.next_id,\n            vitals: self.heart.vitals,\n            heart_phase: self.heart.phase,\n            since_r: self.heart.since_r,\n            beats: self.heart.beats,\n            timer: self.timer,\n            elapsed: self.elapsed,\n            scores,\n            chains,\n            best,\n            meters,\n            mistakes: self.mistakes,\n            codes_left: self.codes_left,\n            strain_phase: self.strain_phase,\n            gifts_unlocked: self.gifts_unlocked,\n            gifts_used: self.gifts_used,\n            recent_unlock: self.recent_unlock,\n            fever: self.fever,\n            shocks_done: self.shocks_done,\n            shocks_need: self.shocks_need,\n            plate: self.plate,\n            plate_next: self.plate_next,\n            heat_phase: self.heat_phase,\n            tools,\n            xs,\n            zs,\n        });\n    }\n\n    fn restore_checkpoint(&mut self) {\n        let Some(cp) = self.checkpoint.clone() else {\n            if self.code_blue {\n                self.boot_code();\n            } else if self.case_id >= 0 {\n                let id = self.case_id as u8;\n                let camp = self.campaign;\n                self.prepare_case(id);\n                self.campaign = camp;\n                self.mode = M_OP;\n            }\n            return;\n        };\n        self.phase_i = cp.phase_i;\n        self.phase_ready = cp.phase_ready;\n        self.hazards = cp.hazards;\n        self.next_id = cp.next_id;\n        self.heart.vitals = cp.vitals;\n        self.heart.phase = cp.heart_phase;\n        self.heart.since_r = cp.since_r;\n        self.heart.beats = cp.beats;\n        self.heart.flat = false;\n        self.heart.recompute(self.tune.heart_coupling);\n        self.timer = cp.timer;\n        self.elapsed = cp.elapsed;\n        self.mistakes = cp.mistakes;\n        self.codes_left = cp.codes_left;\n        self.strain_phase = cp.strain_phase;\n        self.gifts_unlocked = cp.gifts_unlocked;\n        self.gifts_used = cp.gifts_used;\n        self.recent_unlock = cp.recent_unlock;\n        self.fever = cp.fever;\n        self.shocks_done = cp.shocks_done;\n        self.shocks_need = cp.shocks_need;\n        self.plate = cp.plate;\n        self.plate_next = cp.plate_next;\n        self.heat_phase = cp.heat_phase;\n        self.heat_on = false;\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\n        self.code_scripted = false;\n        self.pending_script = false;\n        self.hush_beats = 0;\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter_mut().enumerate() {\n            s.score = cp.scores[i];\n            s.chain = cp.chains[i];\n            s.best_chain = cp.best[i];\n            s.meter = cp.meters[i];\n            s.tool = cp.tools[i];\n            s.x = cp.xs[i];\n            s.z = cp.zs[i];\n            s.was_use = false;\n            s.was_gift = false;\n            s.was_defib = false;\n            s.defib = 0.0;\n            s.gift_arm = 0.0;\n            s.focus_t = 0.0;\n            s.mistakes = 0;\n        }\n        self.mode = if self.mode == M_ATTRACT { M_ATTRACT } else { M_OP };\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\n    }\n\n    pub(crate) fn finish_op(&mut self) {\n        self.shown_score = self.total_score();\n        self.rank = rank_of(self.shown_score, self.par);\n        self.banner_t = 3.0;\n        if self.mode == M_ATTRACT {\n            self.boot_attract();\n            return;\n        }\n        self.mode = M_RESULTS;\n        if !self.campaign {\n            self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub(crate) fn die(&mut self) {\n        if self.immortal {\n            self.heart.vitals = 48.0;\n            self.heart.flat = false;\n            self.code_t = -1.0;\n            return;\n        }\n        self.mode = M_DEAD;\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Lost;\n        self.heart.vitals = 0.0;\n        self.heart.flat = true;\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\n    }\n\n    pub(crate) fn begin_code(&mut self, scripted: bool) {\n        if self.heart.flat && self.code_t > 0.0 {\n            return;\n        }\n        if !scripted && self.codes_left == 0 {\n            self.die();\n            return;\n        }\n        if !scripted {\n            self.codes_left = self.codes_left.saturating_sub(1);\n        }\n        self.code_scripted = scripted;\n        self.heart.vitals = 0.0;\n        self.heart.flat = true;\n        self.heart.ghost = 0.0;\n        self.code_t = self.tune.code_window.max(1.0);\n        self.coverage.code = self.coverage.code.saturating_add(1);\n        self.callout_i = 5;\n        self.callout_t = 2.4;\n        for s in &mut self.surgeons {\n            s.defib = 0.0;\n            s.was_defib = false;\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub(crate) fn resuscitate(&mut self) {\n        self.heart.vitals = 30.0;\n        self.heart.flat = false;\n        self.heart.phase = 0.0;\n        self.heart.since_r = 0.0;\n        self.heart.recompute(self.tune.heart_coupling);\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\n        self.callout_i = 6;\n        self.callout_t = 2.2;\n        self.coverage.tools[DEFIB as usize] = self.coverage.tools[DEFIB as usize].saturating_add(1);\n        for s in &mut self.surgeons {\n            s.defib = 0.0;\n            s.was_defib = false;\n        }\n        if self.code_scripted && self.shocks_need > 0 {\n            self.shocks_done = self.shocks_done.saturating_add(1);\n            if self.shocks_done < self.shocks_need {\n                self.begin_code(true);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub(crate) fn activate_gift(&mut self, bit: u8) {\n        if bit == 0 {\n            return;\n        }\n        let idx = match bit {\n            content::G_HUSH => 0,\n            content::G_ECHO => 1,\n            content::G_DUET => 2,\n            _ => return,\n        };\n        if self.gifts_used & bit == 0 {\n            self.coverage.gifts[idx] = self.coverage.gifts[idx].saturating_add(1);\n        }\n        self.gifts_used |= bit;\n        self.surgeons[0].meter = 0.0;\n        self.callout_t = 2.4;\n        match bit {\n            content::G_HUSH => {\n                self.hush_beats = ((6.0 * self.tune.gift_duration).round() as u8).max(1);\n                self.callout_i = 7;\n            }\n            content::G_ECHO => {\n                self.echo_left = self.tune.echo_duration * self.tune.gift_duration;\n                self.echo_cool = 0.4;\n                self.callout_i = 8;\n            }\n            content::G_DUET => {\n                self.duet_left = 8.0 * self.tune.gift_duration;\n                self.callout_i = 9;\n                self.surgeons[1].active = true;\n            }\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn total_score(&self) -> i32 {\n        let hands: i32 = self.surgeons.iter().map(|s| s.score).sum();\n        let bonus = (self.heart.vitals * 20.0) as i32 + (self.timer.max(0.0) * 5.0) as i32 - self.mistakes as i32 * 100;\n        hands + bonus\n    }\n\n    pub fn best_chain(&self) -> u32 {\n        self.surgeons.iter().map(|s| s.best_chain).max().unwrap_or(0)\n    }\n\n    fn command(&mut self, cmd: SurgeryCmd) {\n        match cmd {\n            SurgeryCmd::Retry => self.restore_checkpoint(),\n            SurgeryCmd::Skip => self.skip(),\n            SurgeryCmd::SetTune { id, value } => self.tune.set(id, value),\n            SurgeryCmd::ResetTune => self.tune = Tune::default(),\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadCase(n) => self.boot_single(n),\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadCampaign => self.boot_campaign(),\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadCode => self.boot_code(),\n            SurgeryCmd::SetDifficulty(d) => {\n                self.difficulty = d.min(2);\n            }\n            SurgeryCmd::Dev { what, extra: _ } => match what {\n                0 => self.immortal = !self.immortal,\n                1 => self.freeze = !self.freeze,\n                2 => {\n                    self.gifts_unlocked |= content::G_HUSH | content::G_ECHO | content::G_DUET;\n                    self.surgeons[0].meter = 100.0;\n                    self.recent_unlock = content::G_HUSH;\n                }\n                3 => self.one_hit = !self.one_hit,\n                4 => self.begin_code(true),\n                5 => {\n                    self.immortal = false;\n                    self.codes_left = 0;\n                    self.heart.vitals = 0.0;\n                    self.die();\n                }\n                6 => {\n                    self.shown_score = self.total_score().max(self.par);\n                    self.rank = rank_of(self.shown_score, self.par);\n                    self.mode = M_RESULTS;\n                    self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\n                }\n                7 => {\n                    self.hazards.clear();\n                    self.phase_i = self.phase_i.saturating_add(1);\n                    self.phase_ready = false;\n                    self.heart.flat = false;\n                    self.code_t = -1.0;\n                }\n                _ => {}\n            },\n            SurgeryCmd::SpawnHazard(k) => {\n                let n = self.spawn_n;\n                self.spawn_n = self.spawn_n.wrapping_add(1);\n                let ang = n as f32 * 0.9;\n                self.spawn_kind_at(k.min(K_BURN), ang.cos() * 1.2, ang.sin() * 0.8, -1.0);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn skip(&mut self) {\n        match self.mode {\n            M_STORY => {\n                self.story_i = u16::MAX / 2;\n                self.end_story();\n            }\n            M_CHART => {\n                self.mode = if self.mode == M_ATTRACT { M_ATTRACT } else { M_OP };\n                self.phase_ready = false;\n            }\n            M_RESULTS if self.campaign => {\n                self.mode = M_STORY;\n                self.story_after = true;\n                self.story_i = 0;\n            }\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn end_story(&mut self) {\n        if self.story_after {\n            if self.case_id >= 7 {\n                self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\n                self.mode = M_RESULTS;\n            } else if self.case_id >= 0 {\n                let next = self.case_id as u8 + 1;\n                self.prepare_case(next);\n                self.campaign = true;\n                self.mode = M_STORY;\n                self.story_after = false;\n                self.story_i = 0;\n            }\n        } else {\n            self.mode = M_CHART;\n            self.story_i = 0;\n        }\n    }\n\n    fn to_frame(&self) -> SurgeryFrame {\n        let mut fr = SurgeryFrame::empty();\n        fr.mode = self.mode;\n        fr.case_id = self.case_id;\n        fr.attract = self.mode == M_ATTRACT;\n        fr.card_ready = self.mode == M_CARD && self.card_t > 0.4;\n        if self.case_id < 0 {\n            fr.op_name = \"Code Blue\".to_string();\n            fr.patient = \"Night Intake\".to_string();\n        } else if let Some(def) = case_def(self.case_id as u8) {\n            fr.op_name = def.name.to_string();\n            fr.patient = def.patient.to_string();\n        }\n        fr.plate = self.plate;\n        fr.plate_next = self.plate_next;\n        fr.plate_blend = self.plate_blend;\n        fr.vitals = self.heart.vitals;\n        fr.bpm = self.heart.bpm;\n        fr.phase = self.heart.phase;\n        fr.flat = self.heart.flat;\n        fr.on_beat = if self.heart.flat {\n            self.heart.ghost_on_beat(self.tune.beat_window_ms)\n        } else {\n            self.heart.on_beat(self.tune.beat_window_ms)\n        };\n        fr.timer = self.timer;\n        fr.elapsed = self.elapsed;\n        fr.score = if self.mode == M_RESULTS || self.outcome != Outcome::Playing { self.shown_score } else { self.total_score() };\n        fr.par = self.par;\n        fr.rank = self.rank;\n        fr.chain = self.best_chain();\n        fr.mistakes = self.mistakes;\n        fr.code_t = self.code_t;\n        fr.codes_left = self.codes_left;\n        fr.shocks_done = self.shocks_done;\n        fr.shocks_need = self.shocks_need;\n        fr.fever = self.fever;\n        fr.heat_on = self.heat_on;\n        fr.heat_angle = self.heat_angle;\n        fr.gift_hush = if self.hush_beats > 0 { self.hush_beats as f32 } else { 0.0 };\n        fr.gift_echo = self.echo_left;\n        fr.gift_duet = self.duet_left;\n        fr.gifts_unlocked = self.gifts_unlocked;\n        fr.difficulty = self.difficulty;\n        fr.players = self.players;\n        fr.music = self.tune.music;\n        fr.effects = self.tune.effects;\n        fr.voices = self.tune.voices;\n        if self.strain_phase != 255 {\n            fr.banner = STRAIN_PHASES.get(self.strain_phase as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\"\").to_string();\n        } else if self.banner_t > 0.0 {\n            fr.banner = fr.op_name.clone();\n        }\n        if self.callout_t > 0.0 {\n            fr.callout = story::callout(self.callout_i).to_string();\n        }\n        if self.mode == M_STORY {\n            let lines = story::block(self.case_id, self.story_after);\n            if let Some(line) = lines.get(self.story_i as usize) {\n                fr.story_who = line.who.to_string();\n                fr.story_line = line.text.to_string();\n            }\n        }\n        fr.hazards = self\n            .hazards\n            .iter()\n            .map(|h| frame::HazardView {\n                id: h.id,\n                kind: h.kind,\n                x: h.x,\n                z: h.z,\n                radius: h.radius,\n                work: h.work,\n                need: h.need,\n                alive: h.alive,\n                hidden: h.hidden && h.revealed <= 0.0,\n                stage: h.stage,\n                stages: h.stages,\n                axis: h.axis,\n                aux: h.aux,\n                bits: h.bits,\n                tool: h.tool,\n                grabbed: h.grabbed,\n            })\n            .collect();\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter().enumerate() {\n            fr.cursors[i] = frame::CursorView {\n                active: s.active,\n                x: s.x,\n                z: s.z,\n                tool: s.tool,\n                score: s.score,\n                chain: s.chain,\n                meter: s.meter,\n                color: content::SEAT_COLOR[i],\n            };\n        }\n        fr.echo_x = self.echo_x;\n        fr.echo_z = self.echo_z;\n        fr.echo_on = self.echo_on;\n        fr.popups = self\n            .popups\n            .iter()\n            .filter(|p| p.1 > 0.0)\n            .map(|p| frame::PopupView { rating: p.0, life: p.1, x: p.2, z: p.3 })\n            .collect();\n        fr.coverage_tools = self.coverage.tools;\n        fr.coverage_hazards = self.coverage.hazards;\n        fr.coverage_strains = self.coverage.strains;\n        fr.coverage_gifts = self.coverage.gifts;\n        fr.coverage_code = self.coverage.code;\n        fr.coverage_ratings = self.coverage.ratings;\n        let _ = TITLE;\n        fr\n    }\n\n    fn mode_name(&self) -> &'static str {\n        match self.mode {\n            M_TITLE => \"title\",\n            M_STORY => \"story\",\n            M_CHART => \"chart\",\n            M_OP => \"op\",\n            M_RESULTS => \"results\",\n            M_DEAD => \"dead\",\n            M_ATTRACT => \"attract\",\n            M_CARD => \"card\",\n            M_MIRROR => \"mirror\",\n            _ => \"title\",\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n/// The draw snapshot for this tick, if the running game is surgery.\npub fn take_frame(sim: &Sim) -> Option<Arc<SurgeryFrame>> {\n    let g = sim.play()?.get::<Surgery>()?;\n    Some(Arc::new(g.to_frame()))\n}\n\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 0.0;\n    sim.state.focus = Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2);\n    sim.state.player = None;\n    let mut g = Surgery::fresh();\n    match rest.unwrap_or(\"title\") {\n        \"campaign\" => g.boot_campaign(),\n        \"codeblue\" | \"code\" => g.boot_code(),\n        \"attract\" => g.boot_attract(),\n        \"card\" => {\n            g.mode = M_CARD;\n            g.case_id = -1;\n            g.boot_code();\n            g.mode = M_CARD;\n            g.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\n            g.hazards.clear();\n        }\n        \"mirror\" => g.mode = M_MIRROR,\n        s if s.starts_with(\"case/\") => {\n            let n: u8 = s[5..].parse().unwrap_or(0);\n            g.boot_single(n.min(7));\n        }\n        _ => g.mode = M_TITLE,\n    }\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(g));\n    Ok(())\n}\n\nimpl Game for Surgery {\n    const KEY: &'static str = \"surgery\";\n\n    fn pre(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> std::collections::BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\n        let cmd = input.surgery_cmd;\n        if let Some(cmd) = cmd {\n            self.command(cmd);\n        }\n        ops::tick(self, sim, input, dt, events, cmd.is_some());\n        std::collections::BTreeMap::new()\n    }\n\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\n        let clock = clock(self.timer);\n        let rank = if self.rank == 0 { \"\" } else { rank_name(self.rank) };\n        vec![\n            format!(\"{}  {}\", self.to_frame().patient, self.to_frame().op_name),\n            format!(\"Vitals {:.0}   BPM {:.0}\", self.heart.vitals, self.heart.bpm),\n            format!(\"Score {}  {}\", self.total_score(), rank),\n            format!(\"Time {clock}\"),\n        ]\n    }\n\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\n        let fr = self.to_frame();\n        json!({\n            \"mode\": self.mode_name(),\n            \"case\": self.case_id,\n            \"op\": fr.op_name,\n            \"patient\": fr.patient,\n            \"vitals\": self.heart.vitals,\n            \"bpm\": self.heart.bpm,\n            \"on_beat\": fr.on_beat,\n            \"timer\": self.timer,\n            \"score\": fr.score,\n            \"par\": self.par,\n            \"rank\": rank_name(self.rank),\n            \"rank_n\": self.rank,\n            \"chain\": self.best_chain(),\n            \"mistakes\": self.mistakes,\n            \"phase\": self.phase_i,\n            \"strain\": self.strain_phase,\n            \"alive\": self.hazards.iter().filter(|h| h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT).count(),\n            \"flat\": self.heart.flat,\n            \"code\": self.code_t,\n            \"codes_left\": self.codes_left,\n            \"music\": self.tune.music,\n            \"effects\": self.tune.effects,\n            \"voices\": self.tune.voices,\n            \"gifts\": self.gifts_unlocked,\n            \"gifts_used\": self.gifts_used,\n            \"tools\": self.coverage.tools,\n            \"hazards\": self.coverage.hazards,\n            \"strains\": self.coverage.strains,\n            \"gift_counts\": self.coverage.gifts,\n            \"code_count\": self.coverage.code,\n            \"ratings\": self.coverage.ratings,\n            \"outcome\": match self.outcome {\n                Outcome::Playing => \"playing\",\n                Outcome::Won => \"won\",\n                Outcome::Lost => \"lost\",\n            },\n            \"story_i\": self.story_i,\n            \"story\": fr.story_line,\n            \"callout\": fr.callout,\n            \"skill\": self.skill,\n            \"players\": self.players,\n            \"title\": TITLE,\n        })\n    }\n\n    fn outcome(&self) -> Outcome {\n        self.outcome\n    }\n\n    fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n        f.surgeons[0] = bot::decide(self, sim.state.tick, 0);\n        f\n    }\n}\n\npub fn clock(t: f32) -> String {\n    let t = t.max(0.0) as i32;\n    format!(\"{:02}:{:02}\", t / 60, t % 60)\n}\n\npub fn confirmed(input: &InputFrame) -> bool {\n    input.surgeons.iter().any(|s| s.held & surg::CONFIRM != 0 || s.pressed & surg::CONFIRM != 0)\n}\n\n#[allow(dead_code)]\nfn _keep(i: SurgeonInput) -> SurgeonInput {\n    i\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":458,"output_tokens":15912,"cache_read_input_tokens":164480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"c640cf48-7416-48a1-a305-e4c8fc6a5f48"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-dacb4979-e175-4ade-af91-95776edef5fa-62","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Hands of Harbor: overhead surgical action in the Night Ward.\\n//!\\n//! Rules live here. The shell, the mesh and the speakers read [`frame::SurgeryFrame`].\\n\\nmod bot;\\nmod content;\\nmod hazard;\\nmod heart;\\nmod ops;\\nmod story;\\nmod tune;\\n\\npub mod frame;\\npub mod kinds;\\n\\npub use content::{case_def, CASES};\\npub use frame::SurgeryFrame;\\npub use hazard::Hazard;\\npub use heart::Heart;\\npub use kinds::*;\\npub use tune::Tune;\\n\\nuse std::sync::Arc;\\n\\nuse anyhow::Result;\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\nuse serde_json::json;\\n\\nuse super::{Game, GameBox, Outcome};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput, SurgeryCmd};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub const M_TITLE: u8 = 0;\\npub const M_STORY: u8 = 1;\\npub const M_CHART: u8 = 2;\\npub const M_OP: u8 = 3;\\npub const M_RESULTS: u8 = 4;\\npub const M_DEAD: u8 = 5;\\npub const M_ATTRACT: u8 = 6;\\npub const M_CARD: u8 = 7;\\npub const M_MIRROR: u8 = 8;\\n\\npub const X_MIN: f32 = -9.0;\\npub const X_MAX: f32 = 9.0;\\npub const Z_MIN: f32 = -4.0;\\npub const Z_MAX: f32 = 4.2;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Surgeon {\\n    pub active: bool,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub tool: u8,\\n    pub score: i32,\\n    pub chain: u32,\\n    pub best_chain: u32,\\n    pub mistakes: u32,\\n    pub since_chain: f32,\\n    pub meter: f32,\\n    pub gift_arm: f32,\\n    pub was_use: bool,\\n    pub was_gift: bool,\\n    pub was_defib: bool,\\n    pub defib: f32,\\n    pub iv_cd: f32,\\n    pub wrong_cd: f32,\\n    pub name_i: u8,\\n    pub focus: Option<u32>,\\n    pub focus_t: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Surgeon {\\n    fn new(i: u8) -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            active: i == 0,\\n            x: 0.0,\\n            z: 0.0,\\n            tool: SCALPEL,\\n            score: 0,\\n            chain: 0,\\n            best_chain: 0,\\n            mistakes: 0,\\n            since_chain: 30.0,\\n            meter: 0.0,\\n            gift_arm: 0.0,\\n            was_use: false,\\n            was_gift: false,\\n            was_defib: false,\\n            defib: 0.0,\\n            iv_cd: 0.0,\\n            wrong_cd: 0.0,\\n            name_i: i,\\n            focus: None,\\n            focus_t: 0.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Coverage {\\n    pub tools: [u32; N_TOOLS],\\n    pub hazards: [u32; N_KINDS],\\n    pub strains: [u32; 18],\\n    pub gifts: [u32; 3],\\n    pub code: u32,\\n    pub ratings: [u32; 4],\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Coverage {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self { tools: [0; N_TOOLS], hazards: [0; N_KINDS], strains: [0; 18], gifts: [0; 3], code: 0, ratings: [0; 4] }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\nstruct Checkpoint {\\n    phase_i: u16,\\n    phase_ready: bool,\\n    hazards: Vec<Hazard>,\\n    next_id: u32,\\n    vitals: f32,\\n    heart_phase: f32,\\n    since_r: f32,\\n    beats: u32,\\n    timer: f32,\\n    elapsed: f32,\\n    scores: [i32; 4],\\n    chains: [u32; 4],\\n    best: [u32; 4],\\n    meters: [f32; 4],\\n    mistakes: u32,\\n    codes_left: u8,\\n    strain_phase: u8,\\n    gifts_unlocked: u8,\\n    gifts_used: u8,\\n    recent_unlock: u8,\\n    fever: f32,\\n    shocks_done: u8,\\n    shocks_need: u8,\\n    plate: u8,\\n    plate_next: u8,\\n    heat_phase: bool,\\n    tools: [u8; 4],\\n    xs: [f32; 4],\\n    zs: [f32; 4],\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Surgery {\\n    pub mode: u8,\\n    pub case_id: i8,\\n    pub campaign: bool,\\n    pub code_blue: bool,\\n    pub difficulty: u8,\\n    pub skill: f32,\\n    pub tune: Tune,\\n    pub heart: Heart,\\n    pub surgeons: [Surgeon; 4],\\n    pub hazards: Vec<Hazard>,\\n    pub next_id: u32,\\n    pub phase_i: u16,\\n    pub phase_ready: bool,\\n    pub timer: f32,\\n    pub elapsed: f32,\\n    pub par: i32,\\n    pub plate: u8,\\n    pub plate_next: u8,\\n    pub plate_blend: f32,\\n    pub codes_left: u8,\\n    pub code_t: f32,\\n    pub code_scripted: bool,\\n    pub shocks_need: u8,\\n    pub shocks_done: u8,\\n    pub pending_script: bool,\\n    pub outcome: Outcome,\\n    pub story_i: u16,\\n    pub story_after: bool,\\n    pub callout_i: u8,\\n    pub callout_t: f32,\\n    pub banner_t: f32,\\n    pub rank: u8,\\n    pub shown_score: i32,\\n    pub mistakes: u32,\\n    pub coverage: Coverage,\\n    checkpoint: Option<Checkpoint>,\\n    pub strain_phase: u8,\\n    pub gifts_unlocked: u8,\\n    pub gifts_used: u8,\\n    pub recent_unlock: u8,\\n    pub hush_beats: u8,\\n    pub echo_left: f32,\\n    pub duet_left: f32,\\n    pub echo_x: f32,\\n    pub echo_z: f32,\\n    pub echo_on: bool,\\n    pub last_tool: u8,\\n    pub last_rating: u8,\\n    pub last_id: u32,\\n    pub last_ok: bool,\\n    pub echo_cool: f32,\\n    pub fever: f32,\\n    pub heat_on: bool,\\n    pub heat_angle: f32,\\n    pub heat_phase: bool,\\n    pub immortal: bool,\\n    pub freeze: bool,\\n    pub one_hit: bool,\\n    pub warned_40: bool,\\n    pub players: u8,\\n    pub blue_t: f32,\\n    pub blue_wave: u8,\\n    pub blue_finale: bool,\\n    pub popups: [(u8, f32, f32, f32); 4],\\n    pub card_t: f32,\\n    pub spawn_n: u8,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Surgery {\\n    fn fresh() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            mode: M_TITLE,\\n            case_id: 0,\\n            campaign: false,\\n            code_blue: false,\\n            difficulty: 0,\\n            skill: 1.0,\\n            tune: Tune::default(),\\n            heart: Heart::new(80.0),\\n            surgeons: [Surgeon::new(0), Surgeon::new(1), Surgeon::new(2), Surgeon::new(3)],\\n            hazards: Vec::new(),\\n            next_id: 1,\\n            phase_i: 0,\\n            phase_ready: false,\\n            timer: 0.0,\\n            elapsed: 0.0,\\n            par: 900,\\n            plate: 9,\\n            plate_next: 9,\\n            plate_blend: 1.0,\\n            codes_left: 2,\\n            code_t: -1.0,\\n            code_scripted: false,\\n            shocks_need: 0,\\n            shocks_done: 0,\\n            pending_script: false,\\n            outcome: Outcome::Playing,\\n            story_i: 0,\\n            story_after: false,\\n            callout_i: 0,\\n            callout_t: 0.0,\\n            banner_t: 0.0,\\n            rank: 0,\\n            shown_score: 0,\\n            mistakes: 0,\\n            coverage: Coverage::default(),\\n            checkpoint: None,\\n            strain_phase: 255,\\n            gifts_unlocked: 0,\\n            gifts_used: 0,\\n            recent_unlock: 0,\\n            hush_beats: 0,\\n            echo_left: 0.0,\\n            duet_left: 0.0,\\n            echo_x: 0.0,\\n            echo_z: 0.0,\\n            echo_on: false,\\n            last_tool: 0,\\n            last_rating: R_GOOD,\\n            last_id: 0,\\n            last_ok: false,\\n            echo_cool: 0.0,\\n            fever: 0.0,\\n            heat_on: false,\\n            heat_angle: 0.0,\\n            heat_phase: false,\\n            immortal: false,\\n            freeze: false,\\n            one_hit: false,\\n            warned_40: false,\\n            players: 1,\\n            blue_t: 0.0,\\n            blue_wave: 0,\\n            blue_finale: false,\\n            popups: [(0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0); 4],\\n            card_t: 0.0,\\n            spawn_n: 0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn pending_gift(&self) -> u8 {\\n        let (u, d) = (self.gifts_unlocked, self.gifts_used);\\n        if self.recent_unlock != 0 && u & self.recent_unlock != 0 && d & self.recent_unlock == 0 {\\n            return self.recent_unlock;\\n        }\\n        for bit in [content::G_HUSH, content::G_ECHO, content::G_DUET] {\\n            if u & bit != 0 && d & bit == 0 {\\n                return bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        0\\n    }\\n\\n    fn reset_hands(&mut self) {\\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter_mut().enumerate() {\\n            let name = s.name_i;\\n            *s = Surgeon::new(name);\\n            s.active = i == 0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn prepare_case(&mut self, id: u8) {\\n        let Some(def) = case_def(id) else { return };\\n        self.case_id = id as i8;\\n        self.code_blue = false;\\n        self.plate = def.plate;\\n        self.plate_next = def.plate;\\n        self.plate_blend = 1.0;\\n        self.timer = def.timer * content::diff_timer(self.difficulty);\\n        self.par = def.par;\\n        self.heart = Heart::new(def.vitals);\\n        self.hazards.clear();\\n        self.phase_i = 0;\\n        self.phase_ready = false;\\n        self.codes_left = content::diff_codes(self.difficulty);\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n        self.code_scripted = false;\\n        self.shocks_need = 0;\\n        self.shocks_done = 0;\\n        self.pending_script = false;\\n        self.heat_on = false;\\n        self.heat_phase = false;\\n        self.heat_angle = 0.0;\\n        self.elapsed = 0.0;\\n        self.rank = 0;\\n        self.shown_score = 0;\\n        self.mistakes = 0;\\n        self.warned_40 = false;\\n        self.banner_t = 0.0;\\n        self.callout_t = 0.0;\\n        self.hush_beats = 0;\\n        self.echo_left = 0.0;\\n        self.duet_left = 0.0;\\n        self.echo_on = false;\\n        self.strain_phase = 255;\\n        self.blue_finale = false;\\n        self.reset_hands();\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn boot_single(&mut self, id: u8) {\\n        self.campaign = false;\\n        self.coverage = Coverage::default();\\n        self.gifts_unlocked = 0;\\n        self.gifts_used = 0;\\n        self.recent_unlock = 0;\\n        self.immortal = false;\\n        self.one_hit = false;\\n        self.prepare_case(id.min(7));\\n        self.mode = M_OP;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn boot_campaign(&mut self) {\\n        self.campaign = true;\\n        self.coverage = Coverage::default();\\n        self.gifts_unlocked = 0;\\n        self.gifts_used = 0;\\n        self.recent_unlock = 0;\\n        self.immortal = false;\\n        self.one_hit = false;\\n        self.prepare_case(0);\\n        self.mode = M_STORY;\\n        self.story_after = false;\\n        self.story_i = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn boot_code(&mut self) {\\n        self.campaign = false;\\n        self.code_blue = true;\\n        self.case_id = -1;\\n        self.coverage = Coverage::default();\\n        self.mode = M_OP;\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n        self.timer = 240.0 * content::diff_timer(self.difficulty);\\n        self.par = 1600;\\n        self.heart = Heart::new(70.0);\\n        self.plate = 9;\\n        self.plate_next = 9;\\n        self.plate_blend = 1.0;\\n        self.hazards.clear();\\n        self.phase_ready = true;\\n        self.phase_i = 0;\\n        self.codes_left = content::diff_codes(self.difficulty);\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n        self.blue_t = 0.0;\\n        self.blue_wave = 0;\\n        self.blue_finale = false;\\n        self.elapsed = 0.0;\\n        self.mistakes = 0;\\n        self.rank = 0;\\n        self.shown_score = 0;\\n        self.heat_phase = false;\\n        self.reset_hands();\\n        self.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, -1.15, 0.05, 2.6);\\n        self.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, 1.25, 0.35, 2.6);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn boot_attract(&mut self) {\\n        self.boot_single(0);\\n        self.mode = M_ATTRACT;\\n        self.immortal = true;\\n        self.one_hit = true;\\n        self.skill = 1.0;\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn spawn_kind_at(&mut self, kind: u8, x: f32, z: f32, drain: f32) {\\n        let mut h = Hazard::make(kind, x, z);\\n        if drain >= 0.0 {\\n            h.drain = drain;\\n        }\\n        h.id = self.next_id;\\n        self.next_id = self.next_id.wrapping_add(1);\\n        self.hazards.push(h);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn save_checkpoint(&mut self) {\\n        let mut scores = [0; 4];\\n        let mut chains = [0; 4];\\n        let mut best = [0; 4];\\n        let mut meters = [0.0; 4];\\n        let mut tools = [0; 4];\\n        let mut xs = [0.0; 4];\\n        let mut zs = [0.0; 4];\\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter().enumerate() {\\n            scores[i] = s.score;\\n            chains[i] = s.chain;\\n            best[i] = s.best_chain;\\n            meters[i] = s.meter;\\n            tools[i] = s.tool;\\n            xs[i] = s.x;\\n            zs[i] = s.z;\\n        }\\n        self.checkpoint = Some(Checkpoint {\\n            phase_i: self.phase_i,\\n            phase_ready: self.phase_ready,\\n            hazards: self.hazards.clone(),\\n            next_id: self.next_id,\\n            vitals: self.heart.vitals,\\n            heart_phase: self.heart.phase,\\n            since_r: self.heart.since_r,\\n            beats: self.heart.beats,\\n            timer: self.timer,\\n            elapsed: self.elapsed,\\n            scores,\\n            chains,\\n            best,\\n            meters,\\n            mistakes: self.mistakes,\\n            codes_left: self.codes_left,\\n            strain_phase: self.strain_phase,\\n            gifts_unlocked: self.gifts_unlocked,\\n            gifts_used: self.gifts_used,\\n            recent_unlock: self.recent_unlock,\\n            fever: self.fever,\\n            shocks_done: self.shocks_done,\\n            shocks_need: self.shocks_need,\\n            plate: self.plate,\\n            plate_next: self.plate_next,\\n            heat_phase: self.heat_phase,\\n            tools,\\n            xs,\\n            zs,\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n    fn restore_checkpoint(&mut self) {\\n        let Some(cp) = self.checkpoint.clone() else {\\n            if self.code_blue {\\n                self.boot_code();\\n            } else if self.case_id >= 0 {\\n                let id = self.case_id as u8;\\n                let camp = self.campaign;\\n                self.prepare_case(id);\\n                self.campaign = camp;\\n                self.mode = M_OP;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        };\\n        self.phase_i = cp.phase_i;\\n        self.phase_ready = cp.phase_ready;\\n        self.hazards = cp.hazards;\\n        self.next_id = cp.next_id;\\n        self.heart.vitals = cp.vitals;\\n        self.heart.phase = cp.heart_phase;\\n        self.heart.since_r = cp.since_r;\\n        self.heart.beats = cp.beats;\\n        self.heart.flat = false;\\n        self.heart.recompute(self.tune.heart_coupling);\\n        self.timer = cp.timer;\\n        self.elapsed = cp.elapsed;\\n        self.mistakes = cp.mistakes;\\n        self.codes_left = cp.codes_left;\\n        self.strain_phase = cp.strain_phase;\\n        self.gifts_unlocked = cp.gifts_unlocked;\\n        self.gifts_used = cp.gifts_used;\\n        self.recent_unlock = cp.recent_unlock;\\n        self.fever = cp.fever;\\n        self.shocks_done = cp.shocks_done;\\n        self.shocks_need = cp.shocks_need;\\n        self.plate = cp.plate;\\n        self.plate_next = cp.plate_next;\\n        self.heat_phase = cp.heat_phase;\\n        self.heat_on = false;\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n        self.code_scripted = false;\\n        self.pending_script = false;\\n        self.hush_beats = 0;\\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter_mut().enumerate() {\\n            s.score = cp.scores[i];\\n            s.chain = cp.chains[i];\\n            s.best_chain = cp.best[i];\\n            s.meter = cp.meters[i];\\n            s.tool = cp.tools[i];\\n            s.x = cp.xs[i];\\n            s.z = cp.zs[i];\\n            s.was_use = false;\\n            s.was_gift = false;\\n            s.was_defib = false;\\n            s.defib = 0.0;\\n            s.gift_arm = 0.0;\\n            s.focus_t = 0.0;\\n            s.mistakes = 0;\\n        }\\n        self.mode = if self.mode == M_ATTRACT { M_ATTRACT } else { M_OP };\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn finish_op(&mut self) {\\n        self.shown_score = self.total_score();\\n        self.rank = rank_of(self.shown_score, self.par);\\n        self.banner_t = 3.0;\\n        if self.mode == M_ATTRACT {\\n            self.boot_attract();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.mode = M_RESULTS;\\n        if !self.campaign {\\n            self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn die(&mut self) {\\n        if self.immortal {\\n            self.heart.vitals = 48.0;\\n            self.heart.flat = false;\\n            self.code_t = -1.0;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.mode = M_DEAD;\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Lost;\\n        self.heart.vitals = 0.0;\\n        self.heart.flat = true;\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn begin_code(&mut self, scripted: bool) {\\n        if self.heart.flat && self.code_t > 0.0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if !scripted && self.codes_left == 0 {\\n            self.die();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if !scripted {\\n            self.codes_left = self.codes_left.saturating_sub(1);\\n        }\\n        self.code_scripted = scripted;\\n        self.heart.vitals = 0.0;\\n        self.heart.flat = true;\\n        self.heart.ghost = 0.0;\\n        self.code_t = self.tune.code_window.max(1.0);\\n        self.coverage.code = self.coverage.code.saturating_add(1);\\n        self.callout_i = 5;\\n        self.callout_t = 2.4;\\n        for s in &mut self.surgeons {\\n            s.defib = 0.0;\\n            s.was_defib = false;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn resuscitate(&mut self) {\\n        self.heart.vitals = 30.0;\\n        self.heart.flat = false;\\n        self.heart.phase = 0.0;\\n        self.heart.since_r = 0.0;\\n        self.heart.recompute(self.tune.heart_coupling);\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n        self.callout_i = 6;\\n        self.callout_t = 2.2;\\n        self.coverage.tools[DEFIB as usize] = self.coverage.tools[DEFIB as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n        for s in &mut self.surgeons {\\n            s.defib = 0.0;\\n            s.was_defib = false;\\n        }\\n        if self.code_scripted && self.shocks_need > 0 {\\n            self.shocks_done = self.shocks_done.saturating_add(1);\\n            if self.shocks_done < self.shocks_need {\\n                self.begin_code(true);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn activate_gift(&mut self, bit: u8) {\\n        if bit == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let idx = match bit {\\n            content::G_HUSH => 0,\\n            content::G_ECHO => 1,\\n            content::G_DUET => 2,\\n            _ => return,\\n        };\\n        if self.gifts_used & bit == 0 {\\n            self.coverage.gifts[idx] = self.coverage.gifts[idx].saturating_add(1);\\n        }\\n        self.gifts_used |= bit;\\n        self.surgeons[0].meter = 0.0;\\n        self.callout_t = 2.4;\\n        match bit {\\n            content::G_HUSH => {\\n                self.hush_beats = ((6.0 * self.tune.gift_duration).round() as u8).max(1);\\n                self.callout_i = 7;\\n            }\\n            content::G_ECHO => {\\n                self.echo_left = self.tune.echo_duration * self.tune.gift_duration;\\n                self.echo_cool = 0.4;\\n                self.callout_i = 8;\\n            }\\n            content::G_DUET => {\\n                self.duet_left = 8.0 * self.tune.gift_duration;\\n                self.callout_i = 9;\\n                self.surgeons[1].active = true;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn total_score(&self) -> i32 {\\n        let hands: i32 = self.surgeons.iter().map(|s| s.score).sum();\\n        let bonus = (self.heart.vitals * 20.0) as i32 + (self.timer.max(0.0) * 5.0) as i32 - self.mistakes as i32 * 100;\\n        hands + bonus\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn best_chain(&self) -> u32 {\\n        self.surgeons.iter().map(|s| s.best_chain).max().unwrap_or(0)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn command(&mut self, cmd: SurgeryCmd) {\\n        match cmd {\\n            SurgeryCmd::Retry => self.restore_checkpoint(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::Skip => self.skip(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::SetTune { id, value } => self.tune.set(id, value),\\n            SurgeryCmd::ResetTune => self.tune = Tune::default(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadCase(n) => self.boot_single(n),\\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadCampaign => self.boot_campaign(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadCode => self.boot_code(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::SetDifficulty(d) => {\\n                self.difficulty = d.min(2);\\n            }\\n            SurgeryCmd::Dev { what, extra: _ } => match what {\\n                0 => self.immortal = !self.immortal,\\n                1 => self.freeze = !self.freeze,\\n                2 => {\\n                    self.gifts_unlocked |= content::G_HUSH | content::G_ECHO | content::G_DUET;\\n                    self.surgeons[0].meter = 100.0;\\n                    self.recent_unlock = content::G_HUSH;\\n                }\\n                3 => self.one_hit = !self.one_hit,\\n                4 => self.begin_code(true),\\n                5 => {\\n                    self.immortal = false;\\n                    self.codes_left = 0;\\n                    self.heart.vitals = 0.0;\\n                    self.die();\\n                }\\n                6 => {\\n                    self.shown_score = self.total_score().max(self.par);\\n                    self.rank = rank_of(self.shown_score, self.par);\\n                    self.mode = M_RESULTS;\\n                    self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\\n                }\\n                7 => {\\n                    self.hazards.clear();\\n                    self.phase_i = self.phase_i.saturating_add(1);\\n                    self.phase_ready = false;\\n                    self.heart.flat = false;\\n                    self.code_t = -1.0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            SurgeryCmd::SpawnHazard(k) => {\\n                let n = self.spawn_n;\\n                self.spawn_n = self.spawn_n.wrapping_add(1);\\n                let ang = n as f32 * 0.9;\\n                self.spawn_kind_at(k.min(K_BURN), ang.cos() * 1.2, ang.sin() * 0.8, -1.0);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn skip(&mut self) {\\n        match self.mode {\\n            M_STORY => {\\n                self.story_i = u16::MAX / 2;\\n                self.end_story();\\n            }\\n            M_CHART => {\\n                self.mode = if self.mode == M_ATTRACT { M_ATTRACT } else { M_OP };\\n                self.phase_ready = false;\\n            }\\n            M_RESULTS if self.campaign => {\\n                self.mode = M_STORY;\\n                self.story_after = true;\\n                self.story_i = 0;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn end_story(&mut self) {\\n        if self.story_after {\\n            if self.case_id >= 7 {\\n                self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\\n                self.mode = M_RESULTS;\\n            } else if self.case_id >= 0 {\\n                let next = self.case_id as u8 + 1;\\n                self.prepare_case(next);\\n                self.campaign = true;\\n                self.mode = M_STORY;\\n                self.story_after = false;\\n                self.story_i = 0;\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.mode = M_CHART;\\n            self.story_i = 0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn to_frame(&self) -> SurgeryFrame {\\n        let mut fr = SurgeryFrame::empty();\\n        fr.mode = self.mode;\\n        fr.case_id = self.case_id;\\n        fr.attract = self.mode == M_ATTRACT;\\n        fr.card_ready = self.mode == M_CARD && self.card_t > 0.4;\\n        if self.case_id < 0 {\\n            fr.op_name = \\\"Code Blue\\\".to_string();\\n            fr.patient = \\\"Night Intake\\\".to_string();\\n        } else if let Some(def) = case_def(self.case_id as u8) {\\n            fr.op_name = def.name.to_string();\\n            fr.patient = def.patient.to_string();\\n        }\\n        fr.plate = self.plate;\\n        fr.plate_next = self.plate_next;\\n        fr.plate_blend = self.plate_blend;\\n        fr.vitals = self.heart.vitals;\\n        fr.bpm = self.heart.bpm;\\n        fr.phase = self.heart.phase;\\n        fr.flat = self.heart.flat;\\n        fr.on_beat = if self.heart.flat {\\n            self.heart.ghost_on_beat(self.tune.beat_window_ms)\\n        } else {\\n            self.heart.on_beat(self.tune.beat_window_ms)\\n        };\\n        fr.timer = self.timer;\\n        fr.elapsed = self.elapsed;\\n        fr.score = if self.mode == M_RESULTS || self.outcome != Outcome::Playing { self.shown_score } else { self.total_score() };\\n        fr.par = self.par;\\n        fr.rank = self.rank;\\n        fr.chain = self.best_chain();\\n        fr.mistakes = self.mistakes;\\n        fr.code_t = self.code_t;\\n        fr.codes_left = self.codes_left;\\n        fr.shocks_done = self.shocks_done;\\n        fr.shocks_need = self.shocks_need;\\n        fr.fever = self.fever;\\n        fr.heat_on = self.heat_on;\\n        fr.heat_angle = self.heat_angle;\\n        fr.gift_hush = if self.hush_beats > 0 { self.hush_beats as f32 } else { 0.0 };\\n        fr.gift_echo = self.echo_left;\\n        fr.gift_duet = self.duet_left;\\n        fr.gifts_unlocked = self.gifts_unlocked;\\n        fr.difficulty = self.difficulty;\\n        fr.players = self.players;\\n        fr.music = self.tune.music;\\n        fr.effects = self.tune.effects;\\n        fr.voices = self.tune.voices;\\n        if self.strain_phase != 255 {\\n            fr.banner = STRAIN_PHASES.get(self.strain_phase as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\\\"\\\").to_string();\\n        } else if self.banner_t > 0.0 {\\n            fr.banner = fr.op_name.clone();\\n        }\\n        if self.callout_t > 0.0 {\\n            fr.callout = story::callout(self.callout_i).to_string();\\n        }\\n        if self.mode == M_STORY {\\n            let lines = story::block(self.case_id, self.story_after);\\n            if let Some(line) = lines.get(self.story_i as usize) {\\n                fr.story_who = line.who.to_string();\\n                fr.story_line = line.text.to_string();\\n            }\\n        }\\n        fr.hazards = self\\n            .hazards\\n            .iter()\\n            .map(|h| frame::HazardView {\\n                id: h.id,\\n                kind: h.kind,\\n                x: h.x,\\n                z: h.z,\\n                radius: h.radius,\\n                work: h.work,\\n                need: h.need,\\n                alive: h.alive,\\n                hidden: h.hidden && h.revealed <= 0.0,\\n                stage: h.stage,\\n                stages: h.stages,\\n                axis: h.axis,\\n                aux: h.aux,\\n                bits: h.bits,\\n                tool: h.tool,\\n                grabbed: h.grabbed,\\n            })\\n            .collect();\\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter().enumerate() {\\n            fr.cursors[i] = frame::CursorView {\\n                active: s.active,\\n                x: s.x,\\n                z: s.z,\\n                tool: s.tool,\\n                score: s.score,\\n                chain: s.chain,\\n                meter: s.meter,\\n                color: content::SEAT_COLOR[i],\\n            };\\n        }\\n        fr.echo_x = self.echo_x;\\n        fr.echo_z = self.echo_z;\\n        fr.echo_on = self.echo_on;\\n        fr.popups = self\\n            .popups\\n            .iter()\\n            .filter(|p| p.1 > 0.0)\\n            .map(|p| frame::PopupView { rating: p.0, life: p.1, x: p.2, z: p.3 })\\n            .collect();\\n        fr.coverage_tools = self.coverage.tools;\\n        fr.coverage_hazards = self.coverage.hazards;\\n        fr.coverage_strains = self.coverage.strains;\\n        fr.coverage_gifts = self.coverage.gifts;\\n        fr.coverage_code = self.coverage.code;\\n        fr.coverage_ratings = self.coverage.ratings;\\n        let _ = TITLE;\\n        fr\\n    }\\n\\n    fn mode_name(&self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self.mode {\\n            M_TITLE => \\\"title\\\",\\n            M_STORY => \\\"story\\\",\\n            M_CHART => \\\"chart\\\",\\n            M_OP => \\\"op\\\",\\n            M_RESULTS => \\\"results\\\",\\n            M_DEAD => \\\"dead\\\",\\n            M_ATTRACT => \\\"attract\\\",\\n            M_CARD => \\\"card\\\",\\n            M_MIRROR => \\\"mirror\\\",\\n            _ => \\\"title\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// The draw snapshot for this tick, if the running game is surgery.\\npub fn take_frame(sim: &Sim) -> Option<Arc<SurgeryFrame>> {\\n    let g = sim.play()?.get::<Surgery>()?;\\n    Some(Arc::new(g.to_frame()))\\n}\\n\\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 0.0;\\n    sim.state.focus = Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2);\\n    sim.state.player = None;\\n    let mut g = Surgery::fresh();\\n    match rest.unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\") {\\n        \\\"campaign\\\" => g.boot_campaign(),\\n        \\\"codeblue\\\" | \\\"code\\\" => g.boot_code(),\\n        \\\"attract\\\" => g.boot_attract(),\\n        \\\"card\\\" => {\\n            g.mode = M_CARD;\\n            g.case_id = -1;\\n            g.boot_code();\\n            g.mode = M_CARD;\\n            g.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n            g.hazards.clear();\\n        }\\n        \\\"mirror\\\" => g.mode = M_MIRROR,\\n        s if s.starts_with(\\\"case/\\\") => {\\n            let n: u8 = s[5..].parse().unwrap_or(0);\\n            g.boot_single(n.min(7));\\n        }\\n        _ => g.mode = M_TITLE,\\n    }\\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(g));\\n    Ok(())\\n}\\n\\nimpl Game for Surgery {\\n    const KEY: &'static str = \\\"surgery\\\";\\n\\n    fn pre(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> std::collections::BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        let cmd = input.surgery_cmd;\\n        if let Some(cmd) = cmd {\\n            self.command(cmd);\\n        }\\n        ops::tick(self, sim, input, dt, events, cmd.is_some());\\n        std::collections::BTreeMap::new()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let clock = clock(self.timer);\\n        let rank = if self.rank == 0 { \\\"\\\" } else { rank_name(self.rank) };\\n        vec![\\n            format!(\\\"{}  {}\\\", self.to_frame().patient, self.to_frame().op_name),\\n            format!(\\\"Vitals {:.0}   BPM {:.0}\\\", self.heart.vitals, self.heart.bpm),\\n            format!(\\\"Score {}  {}\\\", self.total_score(), rank),\\n            format!(\\\"Time {clock}\\\"),\\n        ]\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        let fr = self.to_frame();\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"mode\\\": self.mode_name(),\\n            \\\"case\\\": self.case_id,\\n            \\\"op\\\": fr.op_name,\\n            \\\"patient\\\": fr.patient,\\n            \\\"vitals\\\": self.heart.vitals,\\n            \\\"bpm\\\": self.heart.bpm,\\n            \\\"on_beat\\\": fr.on_beat,\\n            \\\"timer\\\": self.timer,\\n            \\\"score\\\": fr.score,\\n            \\\"par\\\": self.par,\\n            \\\"rank\\\": rank_name(self.rank),\\n            \\\"rank_n\\\": self.rank,\\n            \\\"chain\\\": self.best_chain(),\\n            \\\"mistakes\\\": self.mistakes,\\n            \\\"phase\\\": self.phase_i,\\n            \\\"strain\\\": self.strain_phase,\\n            \\\"alive\\\": self.hazards.iter().filter(|h| h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT).count(),\\n            \\\"flat\\\": self.heart.flat,\\n            \\\"code\\\": self.code_t,\\n            \\\"codes_left\\\": self.codes_left,\\n            \\\"music\\\": self.tune.music,\\n            \\\"effects\\\": self.tune.effects,\\n            \\\"voices\\\": self.tune.voices,\\n            \\\"gifts\\\": self.gifts_unlocked,\\n            \\\"gifts_used\\\": self.gifts_used,\\n            \\\"tools\\\": self.coverage.tools,\\n            \\\"hazards\\\": self.coverage.hazards,\\n            \\\"strains\\\": self.coverage.strains,\\n            \\\"gift_counts\\\": self.coverage.gifts,\\n            \\\"code_count\\\": self.coverage.code,\\n            \\\"ratings\\\": self.coverage.ratings,\\n            \\\"outcome\\\": match self.outcome {\\n                Outcome::Playing => \\\"playing\\\",\\n                Outcome::Won => \\\"won\\\",\\n                Outcome::Lost => \\\"lost\\\",\\n            },\\n            \\\"story_i\\\": self.story_i,\\n            \\\"story\\\": fr.story_line,\\n            \\\"callout\\\": fr.callout,\\n            \\\"skill\\\": self.skill,\\n            \\\"players\\\": self.players,\\n            \\\"title\\\": TITLE,\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    fn outcome(&self) -> Outcome {\\n        self.outcome\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.surgeons[0] = bot::decide(self, sim.state.tick, 0);\\n        f\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn clock(t: f32) -> String {\\n    let t = t.max(0.0) as i32;\\n    format!(\\\"{:02}:{:02}\\\", t / 60, t % 60)\\n}\\n\\npub fn confirmed(input: &InputFrame) -> bool {\\n    input.surgeons.iter().any(|s| s.held & surg::CONFIRM != 0 || s.pressed & surg::CONFIRM != 0)\\n}\\n\\n#[allow(dead_code)]\\nfn _keep(i: SurgeonInput) -> SurgeonInput {\\n    i\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Hands of Harbor: overhead surgical action in the Night Ward.\\n//!\\n//! Rules live here. The shell, the mesh and the speakers read [`frame::SurgeryFrame`].\\n\\nmod bot;\\nmod content;\\nmod hazard;\\nmod heart;\\nmod ops;\\nmod story;\\nmod tune;\\n\\npub mod frame;\\npub mod kinds;\\n\\npub use content::{case_def, CASES};\\npub use frame::SurgeryFrame;\\npub use hazard::Hazard;\\npub use heart::Heart;\\npub use kinds::*;\\npub use tune::Tune;\\n\\nuse std::sync::Arc;\\n\\nuse anyhow::Result;\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\nuse serde_json::json;\\n\\nuse super::{Game, GameBox, Outcome};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput, SurgeryCmd};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub const M_TITLE: u8 = 0;\\npub const M_STORY: u8 = 1;\\npub const M_CHART: u8 = 2;\\npub const M_OP: u8 = 3;\\npub const M_RESULTS: u8 = 4;\\npub const M_DEAD: u8 = 5;\\npub const M_ATTRACT: u8 = 6;\\npub const M_CARD: u8 = 7;\\npub const M_MIRROR: u8 = 8;\\n\\npub const X_MIN: f32 = -9.0;\\npub const X_MAX: f32 = 9.0;\\npub const Z_MIN: f32 = -4.0;\\npub const Z_MAX: f32 = 4.2;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Surgeon {\\n    pub active: bool,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub tool: u8,\\n    pub score: i32,\\n    pub chain: u32,\\n    pub best_chain: u32,\\n    pub mistakes: u32,\\n    pub since_chain: f32,\\n    pub meter: f32,\\n    pub gift_arm: f32,\\n    pub was_use: bool,\\n    pub was_gift: bool,\\n    pub was_defib: bool,\\n    pub defib: f32,\\n    pub iv_cd: f32,\\n    pub wrong_cd: f32,\\n    pub name_i: u8,\\n    pub focus: Option<u32>,\\n    pub focus_t: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Surgeon {\\n    fn new(i: u8) -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            active: i == 0,\\n            x: 0.0,\\n            z: 0.0,\\n            tool: SCALPEL,\\n            score: 0,\\n            chain: 0,\\n            best_chain: 0,\\n            mistakes: 0,\\n            since_chain: 30.0,\\n            meter: 0.0,\\n            gift_arm: 0.0,\\n            was_use: false,\\n            was_gift: false,\\n            was_defib: false,\\n            defib: 0.0,\\n            iv_cd: 0.0,\\n            wrong_cd: 0.0,\\n            name_i: i,\\n            focus: None,\\n            focus_t: 0.0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Coverage {\\n    pub tools: [u32; N_TOOLS],\\n    pub hazards: [u32; N_KINDS],\\n    pub strains: [u32; 18],\\n    pub gifts: [u32; 3],\\n    pub code: u32,\\n    pub ratings: [u32; 4],\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Coverage {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self { tools: [0; N_TOOLS], hazards: [0; N_KINDS], strains: [0; 18], gifts: [0; 3], code: 0, ratings: [0; 4] }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\nstruct Checkpoint {\\n    phase_i: u16,\\n    phase_ready: bool,\\n    hazards: Vec<Hazard>,\\n    next_id: u32,\\n    vitals: f32,\\n    heart_phase: f32,\\n    since_r: f32,\\n    beats: u32,\\n    timer: f32,\\n    elapsed: f32,\\n    scores: [i32; 4],\\n    chains: [u32; 4],\\n    best: [u32; 4],\\n    meters: [f32; 4],\\n    mistakes: u32,\\n    codes_left: u8,\\n    strain_phase: u8,\\n    gifts_unlocked: u8,\\n    gifts_used: u8,\\n    recent_unlock: u8,\\n    fever: f32,\\n    shocks_done: u8,\\n    shocks_need: u8,\\n    plate: u8,\\n    plate_next: u8,\\n    heat_phase: bool,\\n    tools: [u8; 4],\\n    xs: [f32; 4],\\n    zs: [f32; 4],\\n}\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Surgery {\\n    pub mode: u8,\\n    pub case_id: i8,\\n    pub campaign: bool,\\n    pub code_blue: bool,\\n    pub difficulty: u8,\\n    pub skill: f32,\\n    pub tune: Tune,\\n    pub heart: Heart,\\n    pub surgeons: [Surgeon; 4],\\n    pub hazards: Vec<Hazard>,\\n    pub next_id: u32,\\n    pub phase_i: u16,\\n    pub phase_ready: bool,\\n    pub timer: f32,\\n    pub elapsed: f32,\\n    pub par: i32,\\n    pub plate: u8,\\n    pub plate_next: u8,\\n    pub plate_blend: f32,\\n    pub codes_left: u8,\\n    pub code_t: f32,\\n    pub code_scripted: bool,\\n    pub shocks_need: u8,\\n    pub shocks_done: u8,\\n    pub pending_script: bool,\\n    pub outcome: Outcome,\\n    pub story_i: u16,\\n    pub story_after: bool,\\n    pub callout_i: u8,\\n    pub callout_t: f32,\\n    pub banner_t: f32,\\n    pub rank: u8,\\n    pub shown_score: i32,\\n    pub mistakes: u32,\\n    pub coverage: Coverage,\\n    checkpoint: Option<Checkpoint>,\\n    pub strain_phase: u8,\\n    pub gifts_unlocked: u8,\\n    pub gifts_used: u8,\\n    pub recent_unlock: u8,\\n    pub hush_beats: u8,\\n    pub echo_left: f32,\\n    pub duet_left: f32,\\n    pub echo_x: f32,\\n    pub echo_z: f32,\\n    pub echo_on: bool,\\n    pub last_tool: u8,\\n    pub last_rating: u8,\\n    pub last_id: u32,\\n    pub last_ok: bool,\\n    pub echo_cool: f32,\\n    pub fever: f32,\\n    pub heat_on: bool,\\n    pub heat_angle: f32,\\n    pub heat_phase: bool,\\n    pub immortal: bool,\\n    pub freeze: bool,\\n    pub one_hit: bool,\\n    pub warned_40: bool,\\n    pub players: u8,\\n    pub blue_t: f32,\\n    pub blue_wave: u8,\\n    pub blue_finale: bool,\\n    pub popups: [(u8, f32, f32, f32); 4],\\n    pub card_t: f32,\\n    pub spawn_n: u8,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Surgery {\\n    fn fresh() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            mode: M_TITLE,\\n            case_id: 0,\\n            campaign: false,\\n            code_blue: false,\\n            difficulty: 0,\\n            skill: 1.0,\\n            tune: Tune::default(),\\n            heart: Heart::new(80.0),\\n            surgeons: [Surgeon::new(0), Surgeon::new(1), Surgeon::new(2), Surgeon::new(3)],\\n            hazards: Vec::new(),\\n            next_id: 1,\\n            phase_i: 0,\\n            phase_ready: false,\\n            timer: 0.0,\\n            elapsed: 0.0,\\n            par: 900,\\n            plate: 9,\\n            plate_next: 9,\\n            plate_blend: 1.0,\\n            codes_left: 2,\\n            code_t: -1.0,\\n            code_scripted: false,\\n            shocks_need: 0,\\n            shocks_done: 0,\\n            pending_script: false,\\n            outcome: Outcome::Playing,\\n            story_i: 0,\\n            story_after: false,\\n            callout_i: 0,\\n            callout_t: 0.0,\\n            banner_t: 0.0,\\n            rank: 0,\\n            shown_score: 0,\\n            mistakes: 0,\\n            coverage: Coverage::default(),\\n            checkpoint: None,\\n            strain_phase: 255,\\n            gifts_unlocked: 0,\\n            gifts_used: 0,\\n            recent_unlock: 0,\\n            hush_beats: 0,\\n            echo_left: 0.0,\\n            duet_left: 0.0,\\n            echo_x: 0.0,\\n            echo_z: 0.0,\\n            echo_on: false,\\n            last_tool: 0,\\n            last_rating: R_GOOD,\\n            last_id: 0,\\n            last_ok: false,\\n            echo_cool: 0.0,\\n            fever: 0.0,\\n            heat_on: false,\\n            heat_angle: 0.0,\\n            heat_phase: false,\\n            immortal: false,\\n            freeze: false,\\n            one_hit: false,\\n            warned_40: false,\\n            players: 1,\\n            blue_t: 0.0,\\n            blue_wave: 0,\\n            blue_finale: false,\\n            popups: [(0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0); 4],\\n            card_t: 0.0,\\n            spawn_n: 0,\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn pending_gift(&self) -> u8 {\\n        let (u, d) = (self.gifts_unlocked, self.gifts_used);\\n        if self.recent_unlock != 0 && u & self.recent_unlock != 0 && d & self.recent_unlock == 0 {\\n            return self.recent_unlock;\\n        }\\n        for bit in [content::G_HUSH, content::G_ECHO, content::G_DUET] {\\n            if u & bit != 0 && d & bit == 0 {\\n                return bit;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        0\\n    }\\n\\n    fn reset_hands(&mut self) {\\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter_mut().enumerate() {\\n            let name = s.name_i;\\n            *s = Surgeon::new(name);\\n            s.active = i == 0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn prepare_case(&mut self, id: u8) {\\n        let Some(def) = case_def(id) else { return };\\n        self.case_id = id as i8;\\n        self.code_blue = false;\\n        self.plate = def.plate;\\n        self.plate_next = def.plate;\\n        self.plate_blend = 1.0;\\n        self.timer = def.timer * content::diff_timer(self.difficulty);\\n        self.par = def.par;\\n        self.heart = Heart::new(def.vitals);\\n        self.hazards.clear();\\n        self.phase_i = 0;\\n        self.phase_ready = false;\\n        self.codes_left = content::diff_codes(self.difficulty);\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n        self.code_scripted = false;\\n        self.shocks_need = 0;\\n        self.shocks_done = 0;\\n        self.pending_script = false;\\n        self.heat_on = false;\\n        self.heat_phase = false;\\n        self.heat_angle = 0.0;\\n        self.elapsed = 0.0;\\n        self.rank = 0;\\n        self.shown_score = 0;\\n        self.mistakes = 0;\\n        self.warned_40 = false;\\n        self.banner_t = 0.0;\\n        self.callout_t = 0.0;\\n        self.hush_beats = 0;\\n        self.echo_left = 0.0;\\n        self.duet_left = 0.0;\\n        self.echo_on = false;\\n        self.strain_phase = 255;\\n        self.blue_finale = false;\\n        self.reset_hands();\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn boot_single(&mut self, id: u8) {\\n        self.campaign = false;\\n        self.coverage = Coverage::default();\\n        self.gifts_unlocked = 0;\\n        self.gifts_used = 0;\\n        self.recent_unlock = 0;\\n        self.immortal = false;\\n        self.one_hit = false;\\n        self.prepare_case(id.min(7));\\n        self.mode = M_OP;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn boot_campaign(&mut self) {\\n        self.campaign = true;\\n        self.coverage = Coverage::default();\\n        self.gifts_unlocked = 0;\\n        self.gifts_used = 0;\\n        self.recent_unlock = 0;\\n        self.immortal = false;\\n        self.one_hit = false;\\n        self.prepare_case(0);\\n        self.mode = M_STORY;\\n        self.story_after = false;\\n        self.story_i = 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    fn boot_code(&mut self) {\\n        self.campaign = false;\\n        self.code_blue = true;\\n        self.case_id = -1;\\n        self.coverage = Coverage::default();\\n        self.mode = M_OP;\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n        self.timer = 240.0 * content::diff_timer(self.difficulty);\\n        self.par = 1600;\\n        self.heart = Heart::new(70.0);\\n        self.plate = 9;\\n        self.plate_next = 9;\\n        self.plate_blend = 1.0;\\n        self.hazards.clear();\\n        self.phase_ready = true;\\n        self.phase_i = 0;\\n        self.codes_left = content::diff_codes(self.difficulty);\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n        self.blue_t = 0.0;\\n        self.blue_wave = 0;\\n        self.blue_finale = false;\\n        self.elapsed = 0.0;\\n        self.mistakes = 0;\\n        self.rank = 0;\\n        self.shown_score = 0;\\n        self.heat_phase = false;\\n        self.reset_hands();\\n        self.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, -1.15, 0.05, 2.6);\\n        self.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, 1.25, 0.35, 2.6);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn boot_attract(&mut self) {\\n        self.boot_single(0);\\n        self.mode = M_ATTRACT;\\n        self.immortal = true;\\n        self.one_hit = true;\\n        self.skill = 1.0;\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn spawn_kind_at(&mut self, kind: u8, x: f32, z: f32, drain: f32) {\\n        let mut h = Hazard::make(kind, x, z);\\n        if drain >= 0.0 {\\n            h.drain = drain;\\n        }\\n        h.id = self.next_id;\\n        self.next_id = self.next_id.wrapping_add(1);\\n        self.hazards.push(h);\\n    }\\n\\n    fn save_checkpoint(&mut self) {\\n        let mut scores = [0; 4];\\n        let mut chains = [0; 4];\\n        let mut best = [0; 4];\\n        let mut meters = [0.0; 4];\\n        let mut tools = [0; 4];\\n        let mut xs = [0.0; 4];\\n        let mut zs = [0.0; 4];\\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter().enumerate() {\\n            scores[i] = s.score;\\n            chains[i] = s.chain;\\n            best[i] = s.best_chain;\\n            meters[i] = s.meter;\\n            tools[i] = s.tool;\\n            xs[i] = s.x;\\n            zs[i] = s.z;\\n        }\\n        self.checkpoint = Some(Checkpoint {\\n            phase_i: self.phase_i,\\n            phase_ready: self.phase_ready,\\n            hazards: self.hazards.clone(),\\n            next_id: self.next_id,\\n            vitals: self.heart.vitals,\\n            heart_phase: self.heart.phase,\\n            since_r: self.heart.since_r,\\n            beats: self.heart.beats,\\n            timer: self.timer,\\n            elapsed: self.elapsed,\\n            scores,\\n            chains,\\n            best,\\n            meters,\\n            mistakes: self.mistakes,\\n            codes_left: self.codes_left,\\n            strain_phase: self.strain_phase,\\n            gifts_unlocked: self.gifts_unlocked,\\n            gifts_used: self.gifts_used,\\n            recent_unlock: self.recent_unlock,\\n            fever: self.fever,\\n            shocks_done: self.shocks_done,\\n            shocks_need: self.shocks_need,\\n            plate: self.plate,\\n            plate_next: self.plate_next,\\n            heat_phase: self.heat_phase,\\n            tools,\\n            xs,\\n            zs,\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n    fn restore_checkpoint(&mut self) {\\n        let Some(cp) = self.checkpoint.clone() else {\\n            if self.code_blue {\\n                self.boot_code();\\n            } else if self.case_id >= 0 {\\n                let id = self.case_id as u8;\\n                let camp = self.campaign;\\n                self.prepare_case(id);\\n                self.campaign = camp;\\n                self.mode = M_OP;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        };\\n        self.phase_i = cp.phase_i;\\n        self.phase_ready = cp.phase_ready;\\n        self.hazards = cp.hazards;\\n        self.next_id = cp.next_id;\\n        self.heart.vitals = cp.vitals;\\n        self.heart.phase = cp.heart_phase;\\n        self.heart.since_r = cp.since_r;\\n        self.heart.beats = cp.beats;\\n        self.heart.flat = false;\\n        self.heart.recompute(self.tune.heart_coupling);\\n        self.timer = cp.timer;\\n        self.elapsed = cp.elapsed;\\n        self.mistakes = cp.mistakes;\\n        self.codes_left = cp.codes_left;\\n        self.strain_phase = cp.strain_phase;\\n        self.gifts_unlocked = cp.gifts_unlocked;\\n        self.gifts_used = cp.gifts_used;\\n        self.recent_unlock = cp.recent_unlock;\\n        self.fever = cp.fever;\\n        self.shocks_done = cp.shocks_done;\\n        self.shocks_need = cp.shocks_need;\\n        self.plate = cp.plate;\\n        self.plate_next = cp.plate_next;\\n        self.heat_phase = cp.heat_phase;\\n        self.heat_on = false;\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n        self.code_scripted = false;\\n        self.pending_script = false;\\n        self.hush_beats = 0;\\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter_mut().enumerate() {\\n            s.score = cp.scores[i];\\n            s.chain = cp.chains[i];\\n            s.best_chain = cp.best[i];\\n            s.meter = cp.meters[i];\\n            s.tool = cp.tools[i];\\n            s.x = cp.xs[i];\\n            s.z = cp.zs[i];\\n            s.was_use = false;\\n            s.was_gift = false;\\n            s.was_defib = false;\\n            s.defib = 0.0;\\n            s.gift_arm = 0.0;\\n            s.focus_t = 0.0;\\n            s.mistakes = 0;\\n        }\\n        self.mode = if self.mode == M_ATTRACT { M_ATTRACT } else { M_OP };\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn finish_op(&mut self) {\\n        self.shown_score = self.total_score();\\n        self.rank = rank_of(self.shown_score, self.par);\\n        self.banner_t = 3.0;\\n        if self.mode == M_ATTRACT {\\n            self.boot_attract();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.mode = M_RESULTS;\\n        if !self.campaign {\\n            self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn die(&mut self) {\\n        if self.immortal {\\n            self.heart.vitals = 48.0;\\n            self.heart.flat = false;\\n            self.code_t = -1.0;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        self.mode = M_DEAD;\\n        self.outcome = Outcome::Lost;\\n        self.heart.vitals = 0.0;\\n        self.heart.flat = true;\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn begin_code(&mut self, scripted: bool) {\\n        if self.heart.flat && self.code_t > 0.0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if !scripted && self.codes_left == 0 {\\n            self.die();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        if !scripted {\\n            self.codes_left = self.codes_left.saturating_sub(1);\\n        }\\n        self.code_scripted = scripted;\\n        self.heart.vitals = 0.0;\\n        self.heart.flat = true;\\n        self.heart.ghost = 0.0;\\n        self.code_t = self.tune.code_window.max(1.0);\\n        self.coverage.code = self.coverage.code.saturating_add(1);\\n        self.callout_i = 5;\\n        self.callout_t = 2.4;\\n        for s in &mut self.surgeons {\\n            s.defib = 0.0;\\n            s.was_defib = false;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn resuscitate(&mut self) {\\n        self.heart.vitals = 30.0;\\n        self.heart.flat = false;\\n        self.heart.phase = 0.0;\\n        self.heart.since_r = 0.0;\\n        self.heart.recompute(self.tune.heart_coupling);\\n        self.code_t = -1.0;\\n        self.callout_i = 6;\\n        self.callout_t = 2.2;\\n        self.coverage.tools[DEFIB as usize] = self.coverage.tools[DEFIB as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n        for s in &mut self.surgeons {\\n            s.defib = 0.0;\\n            s.was_defib = false;\\n        }\\n        if self.code_scripted && self.shocks_need > 0 {\\n            self.shocks_done = self.shocks_done.saturating_add(1);\\n            if self.shocks_done < self.shocks_need {\\n                self.begin_code(true);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub(crate) fn activate_gift(&mut self, bit: u8) {\\n        if bit == 0 {\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        let idx = match bit {\\n            content::G_HUSH => 0,\\n            content::G_ECHO => 1,\\n            content::G_DUET => 2,\\n            _ => return,\\n        };\\n        if self.gifts_used & bit == 0 {\\n            self.coverage.gifts[idx] = self.coverage.gifts[idx].saturating_add(1);\\n        }\\n        self.gifts_used |= bit;\\n        self.surgeons[0].meter = 0.0;\\n        self.callout_t = 2.4;\\n        match bit {\\n            content::G_HUSH => {\\n                self.hush_beats = ((6.0 * self.tune.gift_duration).round() as u8).max(1);\\n                self.callout_i = 7;\\n            }\\n            content::G_ECHO => {\\n                self.echo_left = self.tune.echo_duration * self.tune.gift_duration;\\n                self.echo_cool = 0.4;\\n                self.callout_i = 8;\\n            }\\n            content::G_DUET => {\\n                self.duet_left = 8.0 * self.tune.gift_duration;\\n                self.callout_i = 9;\\n                self.surgeons[1].active = true;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn total_score(&self) -> i32 {\\n        let hands: i32 = self.surgeons.iter().map(|s| s.score).sum();\\n        let bonus = (self.heart.vitals * 20.0) as i32 + (self.timer.max(0.0) * 5.0) as i32 - self.mistakes as i32 * 100;\\n        hands + bonus\\n    }\\n\\n    pub fn best_chain(&self) -> u32 {\\n        self.surgeons.iter().map(|s| s.best_chain).max().unwrap_or(0)\\n    }\\n\\n    fn command(&mut self, cmd: SurgeryCmd) {\\n        match cmd {\\n            SurgeryCmd::Retry => self.restore_checkpoint(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::Skip => self.skip(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::SetTune { id, value } => self.tune.set(id, value),\\n            SurgeryCmd::ResetTune => self.tune = Tune::default(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadCase(n) => self.boot_single(n),\\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadCampaign => self.boot_campaign(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadCode => self.boot_code(),\\n            SurgeryCmd::SetDifficulty(d) => {\\n                self.difficulty = d.min(2);\\n            }\\n            SurgeryCmd::Dev { what, extra: _ } => match what {\\n                0 => self.immortal = !self.immortal,\\n                1 => self.freeze = !self.freeze,\\n                2 => {\\n                    self.gifts_unlocked |= content::G_HUSH | content::G_ECHO | content::G_DUET;\\n                    self.surgeons[0].meter = 100.0;\\n                    self.recent_unlock = content::G_HUSH;\\n                }\\n                3 => self.one_hit = !self.one_hit,\\n                4 => self.begin_code(true),\\n                5 => {\\n                    self.immortal = false;\\n                    self.codes_left = 0;\\n                    self.heart.vitals = 0.0;\\n                    self.die();\\n                }\\n                6 => {\\n                    self.shown_score = self.total_score().max(self.par);\\n                    self.rank = rank_of(self.shown_score, self.par);\\n                    self.mode = M_RESULTS;\\n                    self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\\n                }\\n                7 => {\\n                    self.hazards.clear();\\n                    self.phase_i = self.phase_i.saturating_add(1);\\n                    self.phase_ready = false;\\n                    self.heart.flat = false;\\n                    self.code_t = -1.0;\\n                }\\n                _ => {}\\n            },\\n            SurgeryCmd::SpawnHazard(k) => {\\n                let n = self.spawn_n;\\n                self.spawn_n = self.spawn_n.wrapping_add(1);\\n                let ang = n as f32 * 0.9;\\n                self.spawn_kind_at(k.min(K_BURN), ang.cos() * 1.2, ang.sin() * 0.8, -1.0);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn skip(&mut self) {\\n        match self.mode {\\n            M_STORY => {\\n                self.story_i = u16::MAX / 2;\\n                self.end_story();\\n            }\\n            M_CHART => {\\n                self.mode = if self.mode == M_ATTRACT { M_ATTRACT } else { M_OP };\\n                self.phase_ready = false;\\n            }\\n            M_RESULTS if self.campaign => {\\n                self.mode = M_STORY;\\n                self.story_after = true;\\n                self.story_i = 0;\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn end_story(&mut self) {\\n        if self.story_after {\\n            if self.case_id >= 7 {\\n                self.outcome = Outcome::Won;\\n                self.mode = M_RESULTS;\\n            } else if self.case_id >= 0 {\\n                let next = self.case_id as u8 + 1;\\n                self.prepare_case(next);\\n                self.campaign = true;\\n                self.mode = M_STORY;\\n                self.story_after = false;\\n                self.story_i = 0;\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            self.mode = M_CHART;\\n            self.story_i = 0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    fn to_frame(&self) -> SurgeryFrame {\\n        let mut fr = SurgeryFrame::empty();\\n        fr.mode = self.mode;\\n        fr.case_id = self.case_id;\\n        fr.attract = self.mode == M_ATTRACT;\\n        fr.card_ready = self.mode == M_CARD && self.card_t > 0.4;\\n        if self.case_id < 0 {\\n            fr.op_name = \\\"Code Blue\\\".to_string();\\n            fr.patient = \\\"Night Intake\\\".to_string();\\n        } else if let Some(def) = case_def(self.case_id as u8) {\\n            fr.op_name = def.name.to_string();\\n            fr.patient = def.patient.to_string();\\n        }\\n        fr.plate = self.plate;\\n        fr.plate_next = self.plate_next;\\n        fr.plate_blend = self.plate_blend;\\n        fr.vitals = self.heart.vitals;\\n        fr.bpm = self.heart.bpm;\\n        fr.phase = self.heart.phase;\\n        fr.flat = self.heart.flat;\\n        fr.on_beat = if self.heart.flat {\\n            self.heart.ghost_on_beat(self.tune.beat_window_ms)\\n        } else {\\n            self.heart.on_beat(self.tune.beat_window_ms)\\n        };\\n        fr.timer = self.timer;\\n        fr.elapsed = self.elapsed;\\n        fr.score = if self.mode == M_RESULTS || self.outcome != Outcome::Playing { self.shown_score } else { self.total_score() };\\n        fr.par = self.par;\\n        fr.rank = self.rank;\\n        fr.chain = self.best_chain();\\n        fr.mistakes = self.mistakes;\\n        fr.code_t = self.code_t;\\n        fr.codes_left = self.codes_left;\\n        fr.shocks_done = self.shocks_done;\\n        fr.shocks_need = self.shocks_need;\\n        fr.fever = self.fever;\\n        fr.heat_on = self.heat_on;\\n        fr.heat_angle = self.heat_angle;\\n        fr.gift_hush = if self.hush_beats > 0 { self.hush_beats as f32 } else { 0.0 };\\n        fr.gift_echo = self.echo_left;\\n        fr.gift_duet = self.duet_left;\\n        fr.gifts_unlocked = self.gifts_unlocked;\\n        fr.difficulty = self.difficulty;\\n        fr.players = self.players;\\n        fr.music = self.tune.music;\\n        fr.effects = self.tune.effects;\\n        fr.voices = self.tune.voices;\\n        if self.strain_phase != 255 {\\n            fr.banner = STRAIN_PHASES.get(self.strain_phase as usize).copied().unwrap_or(\\\"\\\").to_string();\\n        } else if self.banner_t > 0.0 {\\n            fr.banner = fr.op_name.clone();\\n        }\\n        if self.callout_t > 0.0 {\\n            fr.callout = story::callout(self.callout_i).to_string();\\n        }\\n        if self.mode == M_STORY {\\n            let lines = story::block(self.case_id, self.story_after);\\n            if let Some(line) = lines.get(self.story_i as usize) {\\n                fr.story_who = line.who.to_string();\\n                fr.story_line = line.text.to_string();\\n            }\\n        }\\n        fr.hazards = self\\n            .hazards\\n            .iter()\\n            .map(|h| frame::HazardView {\\n                id: h.id,\\n                kind: h.kind,\\n                x: h.x,\\n                z: h.z,\\n                radius: h.radius,\\n                work: h.work,\\n                need: h.need,\\n                alive: h.alive,\\n                hidden: h.hidden && h.revealed <= 0.0,\\n                stage: h.stage,\\n                stages: h.stages,\\n                axis: h.axis,\\n                aux: h.aux,\\n                bits: h.bits,\\n                tool: h.tool,\\n                grabbed: h.grabbed,\\n            })\\n            .collect();\\n        for (i, s) in self.surgeons.iter().enumerate() {\\n            fr.cursors[i] = frame::CursorView {\\n                active: s.active,\\n                x: s.x,\\n                z: s.z,\\n                tool: s.tool,\\n                score: s.score,\\n                chain: s.chain,\\n                meter: s.meter,\\n                color: content::SEAT_COLOR[i],\\n            };\\n        }\\n        fr.echo_x = self.echo_x;\\n        fr.echo_z = self.echo_z;\\n        fr.echo_on = self.echo_on;\\n        fr.popups = self\\n            .popups\\n            .iter()\\n            .filter(|p| p.1 > 0.0)\\n            .map(|p| frame::PopupView { rating: p.0, life: p.1, x: p.2, z: p.3 })\\n            .collect();\\n        fr.coverage_tools = self.coverage.tools;\\n        fr.coverage_hazards = self.coverage.hazards;\\n        fr.coverage_strains = self.coverage.strains;\\n        fr.coverage_gifts = self.coverage.gifts;\\n        fr.coverage_code = self.coverage.code;\\n        fr.coverage_ratings = self.coverage.ratings;\\n        let _ = TITLE;\\n        fr\\n    }\\n\\n    fn mode_name(&self) -> &'static str {\\n        match self.mode {\\n            M_TITLE => \\\"title\\\",\\n            M_STORY => \\\"story\\\",\\n            M_CHART => \\\"chart\\\",\\n            M_OP => \\\"op\\\",\\n            M_RESULTS => \\\"results\\\",\\n            M_DEAD => \\\"dead\\\",\\n            M_ATTRACT => \\\"attract\\\",\\n            M_CARD => \\\"card\\\",\\n            M_MIRROR => \\\"mirror\\\",\\n            _ => \\\"title\\\",\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// The draw snapshot for this tick, if the running game is surgery.\\npub fn take_frame(sim: &Sim) -> Option<Arc<SurgeryFrame>> {\\n    let g = sim.play()?.get::<Surgery>()?;\\n    Some(Arc::new(g.to_frame()))\\n}\\n\\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\\n    sim.config.history_seconds = 0.0;\\n    sim.state.focus = Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2);\\n    sim.state.player = None;\\n    let mut g = Surgery::fresh();\\n    match rest.unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\") {\\n        \\\"campaign\\\" => g.boot_campaign(),\\n        \\\"codeblue\\\" | \\\"code\\\" => g.boot_code(),\\n        \\\"attract\\\" => g.boot_attract(),\\n        \\\"card\\\" => {\\n            g.mode = M_CARD;\\n            g.case_id = -1;\\n            g.boot_code();\\n            g.mode = M_CARD;\\n            g.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\\n            g.hazards.clear();\\n        }\\n        \\\"mirror\\\" => g.mode = M_MIRROR,\\n        s if s.starts_with(\\\"case/\\\") => {\\n            let n: u8 = s[5..].parse().unwrap_or(0);\\n            g.boot_single(n.min(7));\\n        }\\n        _ => g.mode = M_TITLE,\\n    }\\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(g));\\n    Ok(())\\n}\\n\\nimpl Game for Surgery {\\n    const KEY: &'static str = \\\"surgery\\\";\\n\\n    fn pre(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) -> std::collections::BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\\n        let cmd = input.surgery_cmd;\\n        if let Some(cmd) = cmd {\\n            self.command(cmd);\\n        }\\n        ops::tick(self, sim, input, dt, events, cmd.is_some());\\n        std::collections::BTreeMap::new()\\n    }\\n\\n    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\\n        let clock = clock(self.timer);\\n        let rank = if self.rank == 0 { \\\"\\\" } else { rank_name(self.rank) };\\n        vec![\\n            format!(\\\"{}  {}\\\", self.to_frame().patient, self.to_frame().op_name),\\n            format!(\\\"Vitals {:.0}   BPM {:.0}\\\", self.heart.vitals, self.heart.bpm),\\n            format!(\\\"Score {}  {}\\\", self.total_score(), rank),\\n            format!(\\\"Time {clock}\\\"),\\n        ]\\n    }\\n\\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\\n        let fr = self.to_frame();\\n        json!({\\n            \\\"mode\\\": self.mode_name(),\\n            \\\"case\\\": self.case_id,\\n            \\\"op\\\": fr.op_name,\\n            \\\"patient\\\": fr.patient,\\n            \\\"vitals\\\": self.heart.vitals,\\n            \\\"bpm\\\": self.heart.bpm,\\n            \\\"on_beat\\\": fr.on_beat,\\n            \\\"timer\\\": self.timer,\\n            \\\"score\\\": fr.score,\\n            \\\"par\\\": self.par,\\n            \\\"rank\\\": rank_name(self.rank),\\n            \\\"rank_n\\\": self.rank,\\n            \\\"chain\\\": self.best_chain(),\\n            \\\"mistakes\\\": self.mistakes,\\n            \\\"phase\\\": self.phase_i,\\n            \\\"strain\\\": self.strain_phase,\\n            \\\"alive\\\": self.hazards.iter().filter(|h| h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT).count(),\\n            \\\"flat\\\": self.heart.flat,\\n            \\\"code\\\": self.code_t,\\n            \\\"codes_left\\\": self.codes_left,\\n            \\\"music\\\": self.tune.music,\\n            \\\"effects\\\": self.tune.effects,\\n            \\\"voices\\\": self.tune.voices,\\n            \\\"gifts\\\": self.gifts_unlocked,\\n            \\\"gifts_used\\\": self.gifts_used,\\n            \\\"tools\\\": self.coverage.tools,\\n            \\\"hazards\\\": self.coverage.hazards,\\n            \\\"strains\\\": self.coverage.strains,\\n            \\\"gift_counts\\\": self.coverage.gifts,\\n            \\\"code_count\\\": self.coverage.code,\\n            \\\"ratings\\\": self.coverage.ratings,\\n            \\\"outcome\\\": match self.outcome {\\n                Outcome::Playing => \\\"playing\\\",\\n                Outcome::Won => \\\"won\\\",\\n                Outcome::Lost => \\\"lost\\\",\\n            },\\n            \\\"story_i\\\": self.story_i,\\n            \\\"story\\\": fr.story_line,\\n            \\\"callout\\\": fr.callout,\\n            \\\"skill\\\": self.skill,\\n            \\\"players\\\": self.players,\\n            \\\"title\\\": TITLE,\\n        })\\n    }\\n\\n    fn outcome(&self) -> Outcome {\\n        self.outcome\\n    }\\n\\n    fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\\n        let mut f = InputFrame::default();\\n        f.surgeons[0] = bot::decide(self, sim.state.tick, 0);\\n        f\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn clock(t: f32) -> String {\\n    let t = t.max(0.0) as i32;\\n    format!(\\\"{:02}:{:02}\\\", t / 60, t % 60)\\n}\\n\\npub fn confirmed(input: &InputFrame) -> bool {\\n    input.surgeons.iter().any(|s| s.held & surg::CONFIRM != 0 || s.pressed & surg::CONFIRM != 0)\\n}\\n\\n#[allow(dead_code)]\\nfn _keep(i: SurgeonInput) -> SurgeonInput {\\n    i\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"d0f965aa-a3c2-40b6-864c-77c9236054b8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_71","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing the tick function in ops.rs.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bf37b887-f2fc-4f8f-a6d6-544165999f86-63","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","content":"//! One tick of the operation. Gameplay happens here, where the input is.\n\nuse glam::Vec3;\n\nuse super::content::{self, case_def, G_DUET, G_ECHO, G_HUSH};\nuse super::hazard::{self, Hit};\nuse super::kinds::*;\nuse super::*;\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\nuse crate::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput};\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\n\npub fn tick(g: &mut Surgery, sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>, had_cmd: bool) {\n    if g.outcome == Outcome::Lost && g.mode == M_DEAD {\n        return;\n    }\n    let dt = dt.max(0.0);\n    match g.mode {\n        M_STORY if !had_cmd => {\n            if confirmed(input) {\n                let lines = story::block(g.case_id, g.story_after);\n                if (g.story_i as usize) + 1 >= lines.len() {\n                    g.end_story();\n                } else {\n                    g.story_i = g.story_i.saturating_add(1);\n                    cue(events, CUE_VOICE, 0.0, 0.0, 0.7, 0.9 + (g.story_i as f32 % 5.0) * 0.04);\n                }\n            }\n            return;\n        }\n        M_CHART if !had_cmd => {\n            if confirmed(input) {\n                g.mode = M_OP;\n                g.phase_ready = false;\n                cue(events, CUE_OK, 0.0, 0.0, 0.6, 1.0);\n            }\n            return;\n        }\n        M_RESULTS if !had_cmd => {\n            if confirmed(input) && g.campaign && g.outcome == Outcome::Playing {\n                g.mode = M_STORY;\n                g.story_after = true;\n                g.story_i = 0;\n            }\n            return;\n        }\n        M_CARD => {\n            g.card_t += dt;\n            return;\n        }\n        M_TITLE | M_MIRROR | M_DEAD => return,\n        M_OP | M_ATTRACT => {}\n        _ => return,\n    }\n    if g.outcome != Outcome::Playing {\n        return;\n    }\n\n    let mut slots = input.surgeons;\n    if g.case_id == 7 && !slots[1].active {\n        slots[1] = bot::decide(g, sim.state.tick, 1);\n    }\n    let joined = slots.iter().filter(|s| s.active).count().max(1) as u8;\n    g.players = g.players.max(joined);\n\n    let rules = if g.hush_beats > 0 { dt * g.tune.hush_scale.clamp(0.05, 1.0) } else { dt };\n    let wave = g.heart.tick(rules, g.tune.heart_coupling);\n    if wave {\n        cue(events, CUE_LUB, 0.0, 0.0, 0.35, (g.heart.bpm / 80.0).clamp(0.7, 1.6));\n        if g.hush_beats > 0 {\n            g.hush_beats = g.hush_beats.saturating_sub(1);\n        }\n        if g.heat_phase && !g.heat_on && g.heart.beats % 5 == 0 {\n            g.heat_on = true;\n            g.heat_angle = 0.0;\n        }\n    }\n    if g.echo_left > 0.0 {\n        g.echo_left = (g.echo_left - dt).max(0.0);\n        g.echo_cool = (g.echo_cool - dt).max(0.0);\n    } else {\n        g.echo_on = false;\n    }\n    if g.duet_left > 0.0 {\n        g.duet_left = (g.duet_left - dt).max(0.0);\n    }\n    g.callout_t = (g.callout_t - dt).max(0.0);\n    g.banner_t = (g.banner_t - dt).max(0.0);\n    for p in &mut g.popups {\n        p.1 = (p.1 - dt).max(0.0);\n    }\n    if g.plate_blend < 1.0 {\n        g.plate_blend = (g.plate_blend + dt / 0.8).min(1.0);\n        if g.plate_blend >= 1.0 {\n            g.plate = g.plate_next;\n        }\n    }\n\n    if !g.phase_ready && !g.code_blue {\n        enter_phase(g, sim, events);\n    }\n    if g.outcome != Outcome::Playing {\n        return;\n    }\n\n    swell_and_wander(g, rules, events);\n    if g.heat_on {\n        g.heat_angle += rules * 2.8;\n        if g.heat_angle > std::f32::consts::TAU {\n            g.heat_on = false;\n            note_kind(g, K_HEAT);\n        }\n    }\n\n    if g.heart.flat {\n        g.code_t -= dt;\n        defib_only(g, &slots, dt, events);\n        if g.code_t <= 0.0 && g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\n            g.die();\n        }\n    } else {\n        hands(g, &slots, rules, dt, sim.state.tick, events);\n        echo_copy(g, events);\n        if !g.immortal {\n            let mut drain = 0.0;\n            for h in &g.hazards {\n                if h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT {\n                    drain += h.drain;\n                }\n            }\n            let mul = content::diff_drain(g.difficulty) * g.tune.drain;\n            g.heart.vitals -= drain * mul * rules;\n        }\n    }\n\n    g.heart.vitals = g.heart.vitals.clamp(0.0, 100.0);\n    if g.immortal && g.heart.vitals < 20.0 {\n        g.heart.vitals = 55.0;\n        g.heart.flat = false;\n        g.code_t = -1.0;\n    }\n    if g.heart.vitals < 40.0 && !g.warned_40 && !g.heart.flat {\n        g.warned_40 = true;\n        g.callout_i = 2;\n        g.callout_t = 2.2;\n    }\n    if g.pending_script && !g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\n        g.pending_script = false;\n        g.begin_code(true);\n    } else if g.heart.vitals <= 0.0 && !g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\n        g.begin_code(false);\n    }\n\n    if g.mode != M_OP && g.mode != M_ATTRACT {\n        return;\n    }\n    if !g.freeze && !g.heart.flat {\n        let speed = 1.0 / g.tune.timer.max(0.2);\n        if g.code_blue {\n            g.timer -= dt * speed;\n        } else {\n            g.timer -= rules * speed;\n        }\n    }\n    g.elapsed += dt;\n\n    if !g.code_blue && !g.heart.flat && phase_clear(g) {\n        g.phase_i = g.phase_i.saturating_add(1);\n        g.phase_ready = false;\n        g.heat_on = false;\n        if case_def(g.case_id.max(0) as u8).is_some_and(|c| g.phase_i as usize >= c.phases.len()) {\n            g.finish_op();\n            return;\n        }\n    }\n\n    if g.code_blue && g.mode == M_OP {\n        tick_blue(g, sim, dt);\n    }\n    if g.timer <= 0.0 && (g.mode == M_OP || g.mode == M_ATTRACT) {\n        if g.code_blue && g.heart.vitals > 0.0 && !g.heart.flat {\n            g.finish_op();\n        } else if !g.code_blue {\n            g.die();\n        } else if g.heart.flat || g.heart.vitals <= 0.0 {\n            g.die();\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn enter_phase(g: &mut Surgery, sim: &mut Sim, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    let Some(def) = case_def(g.case_id.max(0) as u8) else {\n        g.finish_op();\n        return;\n    };\n    if g.phase_i as usize >= def.phases.len() {\n        g.finish_op();\n        return;\n    }\n    let phase = def.phases[g.phase_i as usize];\n    g.hazards.clear();\n    g.heat_phase = phase.heat;\n    g.heat_on = false;\n    for spawn in phase.spawns {\n        let mut h = Hazard::make(spawn.kind, spawn.x, spawn.z);\n        if spawn.drain >= 0.0 {\n            h.drain = spawn.drain;\n        }\n        if spawn.axis < 90.0 {\n            h.axis = spawn.axis;\n        }\n        h.hidden = spawn.hidden;\n        h.need *= g.tune.strain_tough.clamp(0.2, 3.0);\n        let jx = sim.state.rng.range(-0.05, 0.05);\n        let jz = sim.state.rng.range(-0.05, 0.05);\n        h.x = (h.x + jx).clamp(-8.2, 8.2);\n        h.z = (h.z + jz).clamp(-3.6, 3.6);\n        if phase.strain == 0 {\n            h.tag = 1;\n        }\n        h.id = g.next_id;\n        g.next_id = g.next_id.wrapping_add(1);\n        g.hazards.push(h);\n    }\n    if phase.strain != NO_STRAIN_SENTINEL {\n        let i = phase.strain as usize;\n        if i < g.coverage.strains.len() {\n            g.coverage.strains[i] = g.coverage.strains[i].saturating_add(1);\n            g.strain_phase = phase.strain;\n            g.banner_t = 2.4;\n            cue(events, CUE_BANNER, 0.0, 0.0, 0.55, 1.0);\n        }\n    }\n    if phase.unlock != 0 {\n        g.gifts_unlocked |= phase.unlock;\n        g.recent_unlock = phase.unlock;\n        g.surgeons[0].meter = 100.0;\n        g.callout_i = match phase.unlock {\n            G_HUSH => 7,\n            G_ECHO => 8,\n            G_DUET => 9,\n            _ => phase.callout,\n        };\n        g.callout_t = 2.6;\n    } else if phase.callout > 0 {\n        g.callout_i = phase.callout;\n        g.callout_t = 2.4;\n    }\n    g.shocks_need = phase.script_code;\n    g.shocks_done = 0;\n    g.pending_script = phase.script_code > 0;\n    g.phase_ready = true;\n    if phase.checkpoint || g.phase_i == 0 {\n        g.save_checkpoint();\n    }\n}\n\nconst NO_STRAIN_SENTINEL: u8 = 255;\n\nfn phase_clear(g: &Surgery) -> bool {\n    if g.pending_script || (g.shocks_need > 0 && g.shocks_done < g.shocks_need) {\n        return false;\n    }\n    !g.hazards.iter().any(|h| h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT)\n}\n\nfn swell_and_wander(g: &mut Surgery, rules: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    let mut bursts: Vec<(f32, f32)> = Vec::new();\n    for h in &mut g.hazards {\n        if !h.alive {\n            continue;\n        }\n        if h.kind == K_SAC {\n            h.aux = (h.aux + rules * 0.08).min(1.3);\n            if h.aux >= 1.12 {\n                h.alive = false;\n                bursts.push((h.x, h.z));\n            }\n        } else if h.tag == 1 {\n            let w = (g.elapsed * 1.4 + h.id as f32).sin();\n            h.x = (h.x + w * rules * 0.28).clamp(-8.2, 8.2);\n        }\n    }\n    for (x, z) in bursts {\n        note_kind(g, K_SAC);\n        g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 6.0).max(0.0);\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, x, z, 0.9);\n        cue(events, CUE_BURST, x, z, 0.8, 0.9);\n    }\n}\n\nfn hands(g: &mut Surgery, slots: &[SurgeonInput; 4], rules: f32, dt: f32, tick: u64, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    for i in 0..4 {\n        let inp = slots[i];\n        let lead = i == 0;\n        if !inp.active && !lead {\n            continue;\n        }\n        if lead {\n            g.surgeons[0].active = true;\n        }\n        if inp.active {\n            if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP {\n                g.surgeons[i].tool = inp.tool.min(DEFIB);\n            }\n            steer(&mut g.surgeons[i], inp, dt, g.tune.cursor_speed);\n        }\n        g.surgeons[i].x = g.surgeons[i].x.clamp(X_MIN, X_MAX);\n        g.surgeons[i].z = g.surgeons[i].z.clamp(Z_MIN, Z_MAX);\n        g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd = (g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd - dt).max(0.0);\n        g.surgeons[i].iv_cd = (g.surgeons[i].iv_cd - dt).max(0.0);\n        g.surgeons[i].since_chain += dt;\n\n        let (mut x, mut z) = (g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z);\n        let precise = inp.held & surg::PRECISION != 0;\n        let echo = g.echo_left > 0.0;\n        if i == 0 && !precise && !echo && g.tune.tremor > 0.0 {\n            let w = 0.12 * g.tune.tremor;\n            let t = tick as f32;\n            x += (t * 0.73).sin() * w;\n            z += (t * 0.51).cos() * w;\n        }\n        let use_held = inp.held & surg::USE != 0;\n        let just_release = g.surgeons[i].was_use && !use_held;\n        let tool = g.surgeons[i].tool;\n        if g.heat_on && use_held && heat_hit(g.heat_angle, x, z) {\n            g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 8.0).max(0.0);\n            g.surgeons[i].chain = 0;\n            g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\n            g.callout_i = 4;\n            g.callout_t = 1.4;\n            cue(events, CUE_STING, x, z, 0.7, 1.0);\n        }\n        let rot = if inp.held & surg::ROT_L != 0 {\n            1\n        } else if inp.held & surg::ROT_R != 0 {\n            -1\n        } else {\n            0\n        };\n        let focus = g.surgeons[i].focus;\n        let idx = select(&g.hazards, x, z, tool, focus, just_release);\n        if let Some(idx) = idx {\n            let id = g.hazards[idx].id;\n            let before = g.hazards[idx].work;\n            let was_hidden = g.hazards[idx].hidden;\n            let mut hit = hazard::apply(\n                &mut g.hazards[idx],\n                x,\n                z,\n                tool,\n                use_held,\n                just_release,\n                inp.pressure,\n                rot,\n                rules,\n                g.tune.tool_power,\n                g.heart.diastole() || g.duet_left > 0.0,\n                g.tune.rating_strict,\n            );\n            if g.one_hit && hit.engaged && g.hazards[idx].accepts(tool) && tool != SCANNER {\n                hit.done = true;\n                hit.rating = R_IMMACULATE;\n                g.hazards[idx].alive = false;\n            }\n            if was_hidden && !g.hazards[idx].hidden {\n                g.coverage.tools[SCANNER as usize] = g.coverage.tools[SCANNER as usize].saturating_add(1);\n            }\n            let grew = g.hazards[idx].work > before + 0.0001 || hit.done;\n            if g.surgeons[i].focus == Some(id) {\n                if grew {\n                    g.surgeons[i].focus_t = 0.0;\n                } else {\n                    g.surgeons[i].focus_t += dt;\n                }\n            } else {\n                g.surgeons[i].focus = Some(id);\n                g.surgeons[i].focus_t = 0.0;\n            }\n            if hit.engaged {\n                g.hazards[idx].idle = 0.0;\n            }\n            if hit.done {\n                resolve_done(g, i, idx, hit, events);\n            } else if use_held && !hit.engaged && g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd <= 0.0 && tool != SCANNER && tool != DEFIB {\n                if let Some(w) = nearest_wrong(&g.hazards, x, z, tool) {\n                    let _ = w;\n                    g.surgeons[i].chain = 0;\n                    g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd = 0.8;\n                    g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\n                    g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 2.0 * g.tune.wrong_penalty).max(0.0);\n                    g.callout_i = if tool == SCALPEL { 1 } else { 3 };\n                    g.callout_t = 1.2;\n                    cue(events, CUE_WRONG, x, z, 0.55, 1.0);\n                }\n            }\n            if hit.cue != 0 && (hit.done || tick % 8 == 0) {\n                cue(events, hit.cue, x, z, 0.45, 1.0);\n            }\n        }\n        gift_edge(g, i, inp, dt);\n        g.surgeons[i].was_use = use_held;\n    }\n    let mut busy = [0u32; 8];\n    let mut n = 0;\n    for s in &g.surgeons {\n        if let Some(id) = s.focus {\n            if n < busy.len() {\n                busy[n] = id;\n                n += 1;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    for h in &mut g.hazards {\n        if busy[..n].contains(&h.id) && h.idle == 0.0 {\n            continue;\n        }\n        h.idle += rules;\n        if h.idle > 0.4 && !matches!(h.kind, K_BONE | K_SAC | K_HEAT | K_IV) {\n            h.work = (h.work - rules * 0.45).max(0.0);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn resolve_done(g: &mut Surgery, slot: usize, idx: usize, hit: Hit, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    let kind = g.hazards[idx].kind;\n    let hx = g.hazards[idx].x;\n    let hz = g.hazards[idx].z;\n    let tool = g.surgeons[slot].tool as usize;\n    if kind == K_IV && hit.rating != R_SLOPPY {\n        g.hazards[idx].alive = false;\n    }\n    if hit.heal != 0.0 && g.surgeons[slot].iv_cd <= 0.0 {\n        g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals + hit.heal * g.tune.iv_heal).clamp(0.0, 100.0);\n        if hit.heal > 0.0 {\n            g.surgeons[slot].iv_cd = 8.0;\n        }\n    }\n    let rating = hit.rating.min(3);\n    g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize] = g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize].saturating_add(1);\n    if tool < N_TOOLS {\n        g.coverage.tools[tool] = g.coverage.tools[tool].saturating_add(1);\n    }\n    g.last_tool = g.surgeons[slot].tool;\n    g.last_rating = rating;\n    g.last_id = g.hazards[idx].id;\n    g.last_ok = true;\n    if rating == R_SLOPPY || hit.misuse > 0 {\n        g.surgeons[slot].chain = 0;\n        g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\n        g.surgeons[slot].score += rating_points(R_SLOPPY);\n    } else {\n        let chain = if g.surgeons[slot].since_chain <= g.tune.chain_window && g.surgeons[slot].chain > 0 {\n            g.surgeons[slot].chain.saturating_add(1)\n        } else {\n            1\n        };\n        g.surgeons[slot].chain = chain;\n        g.surgeons[slot].best_chain = g.surgeons[slot].best_chain.max(chain);\n        g.surgeons[slot].since_chain = 0.0;\n        let pts = (rating_points(rating) as f32 * chain_mul(chain) * g.tune.score_mul).round() as i32;\n        g.surgeons[slot].score += pts;\n        if chain == 5 || chain == 10 || chain == 20 {\n            cue(events, CUE_CHAIN, hx, hz, 0.6, 1.0 + chain as f32 * 0.01);\n        }\n        let mut meter = match rating {\n            R_IMMACULATE => 8.0,\n            R_CLEAN => 4.0,\n            _ => 0.0,\n        };\n        if g.heart.on_beat(g.tune.beat_window_ms) {\n            meter += 2.0;\n            cue(events, CUE_BEAT, hx, hz, 0.4, 1.2);\n        }\n        g.surgeons[slot].meter = (g.surgeons[slot].meter + meter * g.tune.gift_gain).min(100.0);\n    }\n    if !g.hazards[idx].alive {\n        note_kind(g, kind);\n    }\n    push_popup(g, rating, hx, hz);\n    cue(events, CUE_RATE, hx, hz, 0.5, 1.0 + (3 - rating) as f32 * 0.08);\n    if rating == R_IMMACULATE {\n        g.callout_i = 0;\n        g.callout_t = g.callout_t.max(0.8);\n    }\n}\n\nfn gift_edge(g: &mut Surgery, slot: usize, inp: SurgeonInput, dt: f32) {\n    if slot != 0 {\n        return;\n    }\n    let held = inp.held & surg::GIFT != 0;\n    if held {\n        g.surgeons[0].gift_arm += dt;\n    } else if g.surgeons[0].was_gift {\n        let armed = g.surgeons[0].gift_arm >= 0.12;\n        let on = g.heart.on_beat(g.tune.beat_window_ms);\n        if armed && on && g.surgeons[0].meter >= 100.0 && !g.heart.flat {\n            let bit = g.pending_gift();\n            g.activate_gift(bit);\n        }\n        g.surgeons[0].gift_arm = 0.0;\n    }\n    g.surgeons[0].was_gift = held;\n}\n\nfn defib_only(g: &mut Surgery, slots: &[SurgeonInput; 4], dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    for i in 0..4 {\n        let inp = slots[i];\n        if !inp.active && i != 0 {\n            continue;\n        }\n        if i == 0 {\n            g.surgeons[0].active = true;\n        }\n        if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP && inp.active {\n            g.surgeons[i].tool = inp.tool.min(DEFIB);\n        }\n        let held = inp.held & surg::DEFIB != 0 || (g.surgeons[i].tool == DEFIB && inp.held & surg::USE != 0);\n        if held {\n            g.surgeons[i].defib += dt;\n            if g.surgeons[i].defib > 0.2 && (g.surgeons[i].defib * 10.0) as u32 % 8 == 0 {\n                cue(events, CUE_WHINE, g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z, 0.3, 0.8 + g.surgeons[i].defib);\n            }\n        } else if g.surgeons[i].was_defib {\n            let c = g.surgeons[i].defib;\n            if (1.12..=2.6).contains(&c) && g.heart.ghost_on_beat(g.tune.beat_window_ms) {\n                cue(events, CUE_THUMP, 0.0, 0.0, 0.9, 1.0);\n                g.resuscitate();\n                return;\n            }\n            g.surgeons[i].defib = 0.0;\n        }\n        g.surgeons[i].was_defib = held;\n    }\n}\n\nfn echo_copy(g: &mut Surgery, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n    if g.echo_left <= 0.0 || g.echo_cool > 0.0 || !g.last_ok {\n        return;\n    }\n    let tool = g.last_tool;\n    let rating = g.last_rating;\n    let skip = g.surgeons[0].focus;\n    let found = g.hazards.iter().position(|h| {\n        h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT && h.tool == tool && Some(h.id) != skip && h.id != g.last_id\n    });\n    let Some(idx) = found else { return };\n    let kind = g.hazards[idx].kind;\n    let x = g.hazards[idx].x;\n    let z = g.hazards[idx].z;\n    g.hazards[idx].alive = false;\n    g.echo_x = x;\n    g.echo_z = z;\n    g.echo_on = true;\n    g.echo_cool = 1.15;\n    g.last_id = g.hazards[idx].id;\n    note_kind(g, kind);\n    if (tool as usize) < N_TOOLS {\n        g.coverage.tools[tool as usize] = g.coverage.tools[tool as usize].saturating_add(1);\n    }\n    g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize] = g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize].saturating_add(1);\n    let pts = (rating_points(rating) as f32 * g.tune.score_mul) as i32;\n    g.surgeons[0].score += pts;\n    push_popup(g, rating, x, z);\n    cue(events, CUE_PING, x, z, 0.45, 1.4);\n}\n\nfn tick_blue(g: &mut Surgery, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32) {\n    if g.timer <= 32.0 && !g.blue_finale {\n        g.blue_finale = true;\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_NODULE, -0.8, 0.4, 0.35);\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_NODULE, 0.9, -0.3, 0.35);\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, 0.1, 1.0, 0.6);\n        return;\n    }\n    if g.timer <= 32.0 {\n        return;\n    }\n    let quiet = g.hazards.iter().all(|h| !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT);\n    if !quiet {\n        return;\n    }\n    g.blue_t += dt;\n    if g.blue_t < 18.0 {\n        return;\n    }\n    g.blue_t = 0.0;\n    g.blue_wave = g.blue_wave.wrapping_add(1);\n    let wave = g.blue_wave;\n    let extra = (g.players.saturating_sub(1)).min(3);\n    match wave % 6 {\n        0 => {\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_LACERATION, -1.2, 0.2, 0.8);\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, 1.3, -0.4, 0.55);\n        }\n        1 => {\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_POLYP, 0.4, 0.8, 0.3);\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_INFLAM, -1.4, -0.6, 0.35);\n        }\n        2 => {\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, 0.2, -0.2, 1.8);\n            let mut h = Hazard::make(K_FOREIGN, -1.0, 0.9);\n            h.hidden = true;\n            h.drain = 0.4;\n            h.id = g.next_id;\n            g.next_id += 1;\n            g.hazards.push(h);\n        }\n        3 => {\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_SAC, -0.6, 0.5, 0.25);\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_SAC, 1.1, 0.2, 0.25);\n        }\n        4 => {\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_EMBER, -0.3, 0.6, 0.3);\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_BURN, 1.2, -0.7, 0.3);\n        }\n        _ => {\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_INCISION, -1.8, 0.4, 0.0);\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_DRESSING, 0.6, -1.0, 0.1);\n        }\n    }\n    if extra >= 1 {\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, -1.6, -1.1, 0.4);\n    }\n    if extra >= 2 {\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_LACERATION, 1.6, 1.0, 0.6);\n    }\n    if extra >= 3 {\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, 0.0, 1.3, 1.4);\n    }\n    let _ = sim;\n}\n\nfn select(hazards: &[Hazard], x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, focus: Option<u32>, just_release: bool) -> Option<usize> {\n    if just_release {\n        if let Some(id) = focus {\n            if let Some(i) = hazards.iter().position(|h| h.id == id && h.alive) {\n                return Some(i);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    if tool == IV {\n        if let Some(i) = hazards.iter().position(|h| h.alive && h.kind == K_IV) {\n            return Some(i);\n        }\n    }\n    let mut best = None;\n    let mut best_d = f32::MAX;\n    for (i, h) in hazards.iter().enumerate() {\n        if !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let d = h.dist(x, z);\n        if d < best_d {\n            best_d = d;\n            best = Some(i);\n        }\n    }\n    best\n}\n\nfn nearest_wrong(hazards: &[Hazard], x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8) -> Option<usize> {\n    let mut best = None;\n    let mut best_d = f32::MAX;\n    for (i, h) in hazards.iter().enumerate() {\n        if !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT || h.accepts(tool) {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let d = h.dist(x, z);\n        if d <= h.radius + 0.12 && d < best_d {\n            best_d = d;\n            best = Some(i);\n        }\n    }\n    best\n}\n\nfn steer(s: &mut Surgeon, inp: SurgeonInput, dt: f32, speed: f32) {\n    let abs = inp.held & surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE != 0;\n    let snap = inp.held & surg::SNAP != 0;\n    if abs && snap {\n        s.x = inp.aim.x;\n        s.z = inp.aim.y;\n        return;\n    }\n    if abs {\n        let dx = inp.aim.x - s.x;\n        let dz = inp.aim.y - s.z;\n        let d = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt();\n        let step = speed.max(1.0) * dt;\n        if d <= step || d < 1e-5 {\n            s.x = inp.aim.x;\n            s.z = inp.aim.y;\n        } else {\n            s.x += dx / d * step;\n            s.z += dz / d * step;\n        }\n    } else if inp.aim.length_squared() > 0.0004 {\n        s.x += inp.aim.x * speed * dt;\n        s.z += inp.aim.y * speed * dt;\n    }\n}\n\nfn heat_hit(angle: f32, x: f32, z: f32) -> bool {\n    let ang = z.atan2(x);\n    let mut d = (ang - angle).abs();\n    if d > std::f32::consts::PI {\n        d = std::f32::consts::TAU - d;\n    }\n    let r = (x * x + z * z).sqrt();\n    d < 0.22 && r > 0.4\n}\n\nfn note_kind(g: &mut Surgery, kind: u8) {\n    let i = kind as usize;\n    if i < g.coverage.hazards.len() {\n        g.coverage.hazards[i] = g.coverage.hazards[i].saturating_add(1);\n    }\n}\n\nfn push_popup(g: &mut Surgery, rating: u8, x: f32, z: f32) {\n    g.popups[0] = g.popups[1];\n    g.popups[1] = g.popups[2];\n    g.popups[2] = g.popups[3];\n    g.popups[3] = (rating, 1.1, x, z);\n}\n\nfn cue(events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>, id: u16, x: f32, z: f32, gain: f32, pitch: f32) {\n    events.push(SimEvent::Cue { id, pos: Vec3::new(x, 0.2, z), gain, pitch });\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":16084,"output_tokens":8677,"cache_read_input_tokens":164864,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"3f6185b2-2d63-435c-99c2-109c36fcd0c3"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-bf37b887-f2fc-4f8f-a6d6-544165999f86-63","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! One tick of the operation. Gameplay happens here, where the input is.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\n\\nuse super::content::{self, case_def, G_DUET, G_ECHO, G_HUSH};\\nuse super::hazard::{self, Hit};\\nuse super::kinds::*;\\nuse super::*;\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub fn tick(g: &mut Surgery, sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>, had_cmd: bool) {\\n    if g.outcome == Outcome::Lost && g.mode == M_DEAD {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let dt = dt.max(0.0);\\n    match g.mode {\\n        M_STORY if !had_cmd => {\\n            if confirmed(input) {\\n                let lines = story::block(g.case_id, g.story_after);\\n                if (g.story_i as usize) + 1 >= lines.len() {\\n                    g.end_story();\\n                } else {\\n                    g.story_i = g.story_i.saturating_add(1);\\n                    cue(events, CUE_VOICE, 0.0, 0.0, 0.7, 0.9 + (g.story_i as f32 % 5.0) * 0.04);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        M_CHART if !had_cmd => {\\n            if confirmed(input) {\\n                g.mode = M_OP;\\n                g.phase_ready = false;\\n                cue(events, CUE_OK, 0.0, 0.0, 0.6, 1.0);\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        M_RESULTS if !had_cmd => {\\n            if confirmed(input) && g.campaign && g.outcome == Outcome::Playing {\\n                g.mode = M_STORY;\\n                g.story_after = true;\\n                g.story_i = 0;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        M_CARD => {\\n            g.card_t += dt;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        M_TITLE | M_MIRROR | M_DEAD => return,\\n        M_OP | M_ATTRACT => {}\\n        _ => return,\\n    }\\n    if g.outcome != Outcome::Playing {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n\\n    let mut slots = input.surgeons;\\n    if g.case_id == 7 && !slots[1].active {\\n        slots[1] = bot::decide(g, sim.state.tick, 1);\\n    }\\n    let joined = slots.iter().filter(|s| s.active).count().max(1) as u8;\\n    g.players = g.players.max(joined);\\n\\n    let rules = if g.hush_beats > 0 { dt * g.tune.hush_scale.clamp(0.05, 1.0) } else { dt };\\n    let wave = g.heart.tick(rules, g.tune.heart_coupling);\\n    if wave {\\n        cue(events, CUE_LUB, 0.0, 0.0, 0.35, (g.heart.bpm / 80.0).clamp(0.7, 1.6));\\n        if g.hush_beats > 0 {\\n            g.hush_beats = g.hush_beats.saturating_sub(1);\\n        }\\n        if g.heat_phase && !g.heat_on && g.heart.beats % 5 == 0 {\\n            g.heat_on = true;\\n            g.heat_angle = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if g.echo_left > 0.0 {\\n        g.echo_left = (g.echo_left - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.echo_cool = (g.echo_cool - dt).max(0.0);\\n    } else {\\n        g.echo_on = false;\\n    }\\n    if g.duet_left > 0.0 {\\n        g.duet_left = (g.duet_left - dt).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    g.callout_t = (g.callout_t - dt).max(0.0);\\n    g.banner_t = (g.banner_t - dt).max(0.0);\\n    for p in &mut g.popups {\\n        p.1 = (p.1 - dt).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    if g.plate_blend < 1.0 {\\n        g.plate_blend = (g.plate_blend + dt / 0.8).min(1.0);\\n        if g.plate_blend >= 1.0 {\\n            g.plate = g.plate_next;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if !g.phase_ready && !g.code_blue {\\n        enter_phase(g, sim, events);\\n    }\\n    if g.outcome != Outcome::Playing {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n\\n    swell_and_wander(g, rules, events);\\n    if g.heat_on {\\n        g.heat_angle += rules * 2.8;\\n        if g.heat_angle > std::f32::consts::TAU {\\n            g.heat_on = false;\\n            note_kind(g, K_HEAT);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.heart.flat {\\n        g.code_t -= dt;\\n        defib_only(g, &slots, dt, events);\\n        if g.code_t <= 0.0 && g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\\n            g.die();\\n        }\\n    } else {\\n        hands(g, &slots, rules, dt, sim.state.tick, events);\\n        echo_copy(g, events);\\n        if !g.immortal {\\n            let mut drain = 0.0;\\n            for h in &g.hazards {\\n                if h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT {\\n                    drain += h.drain;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            let mul = content::diff_drain(g.difficulty) * g.tune.drain;\\n            g.heart.vitals -= drain * mul * rules;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    g.heart.vitals = g.heart.vitals.clamp(0.0, 100.0);\\n    if g.immortal && g.heart.vitals < 20.0 {\\n        g.heart.vitals = 55.0;\\n        g.heart.flat = false;\\n        g.code_t = -1.0;\\n    }\\n    if g.heart.vitals < 40.0 && !g.warned_40 && !g.heart.flat {\\n        g.warned_40 = true;\\n        g.callout_i = 2;\\n        g.callout_t = 2.2;\\n    }\\n    if g.pending_script && !g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\\n        g.pending_script = false;\\n        g.begin_code(true);\\n    } else if g.heart.vitals <= 0.0 && !g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\\n        g.begin_code(false);\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.mode != M_OP && g.mode != M_ATTRACT {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    if !g.freeze && !g.heart.flat {\\n        let speed = 1.0 / g.tune.timer.max(0.2);\\n        if g.code_blue {\\n            g.timer -= dt * speed;\\n        } else {\\n            g.timer -= rules * speed;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    g.elapsed += dt;\\n\\n    if !g.code_blue && !g.heart.flat && phase_clear(g) {\\n        g.phase_i = g.phase_i.saturating_add(1);\\n        g.phase_ready = false;\\n        g.heat_on = false;\\n        if case_def(g.case_id.max(0) as u8).is_some_and(|c| g.phase_i as usize >= c.phases.len()) {\\n            g.finish_op();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.code_blue && g.mode == M_OP {\\n        tick_blue(g, sim, dt);\\n    }\\n    if g.timer <= 0.0 && (g.mode == M_OP || g.mode == M_ATTRACT) {\\n        if g.code_blue && g.heart.vitals > 0.0 && !g.heart.flat {\\n            g.finish_op();\\n        } else if !g.code_blue {\\n            g.die();\\n        } else if g.heart.flat || g.heart.vitals <= 0.0 {\\n            g.die();\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn enter_phase(g: &mut Surgery, sim: &mut Sim, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let Some(def) = case_def(g.case_id.max(0) as u8) else {\\n        g.finish_op();\\n        return;\\n    };\\n    if g.phase_i as usize >= def.phases.len() {\\n        g.finish_op();\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let phase = def.phases[g.phase_i as usize];\\n    g.hazards.clear();\\n    g.heat_phase = phase.heat;\\n    g.heat_on = false;\\n    for spawn in phase.spawns {\\n        let mut h = Hazard::make(spawn.kind, spawn.x, spawn.z);\\n        if spawn.drain >= 0.0 {\\n            h.drain = spawn.drain;\\n        }\\n        if spawn.axis < 90.0 {\\n            h.axis = spawn.axis;\\n        }\\n        h.hidden = spawn.hidden;\\n        h.need *= g.tune.strain_tough.clamp(0.2, 3.0);\\n        let jx = sim.state.rng.range(-0.05, 0.05);\\n        let jz = sim.state.rng.range(-0.05, 0.05);\\n        h.x = (h.x + jx).clamp(-8.2, 8.2);\\n        h.z = (h.z + jz).clamp(-3.6, 3.6);\\n        if phase.strain == 0 {\\n            h.tag = 1;\\n        }\\n        h.id = g.next_id;\\n        g.next_id = g.next_id.wrapping_add(1);\\n        g.hazards.push(h);\\n    }\\n    if phase.strain != NO_STRAIN_SENTINEL {\\n        let i = phase.strain as usize;\\n        if i < g.coverage.strains.len() {\\n            g.coverage.strains[i] = g.coverage.strains[i].saturating_add(1);\\n            g.strain_phase = phase.strain;\\n            g.banner_t = 2.4;\\n            cue(events, CUE_BANNER, 0.0, 0.0, 0.55, 1.0);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if phase.unlock != 0 {\\n        g.gifts_unlocked |= phase.unlock;\\n        g.recent_unlock = phase.unlock;\\n        g.surgeons[0].meter = 100.0;\\n        g.callout_i = match phase.unlock {\\n            G_HUSH => 7,\\n            G_ECHO => 8,\\n            G_DUET => 9,\\n            _ => phase.callout,\\n        };\\n        g.callout_t = 2.6;\\n    } else if phase.callout > 0 {\\n        g.callout_i = phase.callout;\\n        g.callout_t = 2.4;\\n    }\\n    g.shocks_need = phase.script_code;\\n    g.shocks_done = 0;\\n    g.pending_script = phase.script_code > 0;\\n    g.phase_ready = true;\\n    if phase.checkpoint || g.phase_i == 0 {\\n        g.save_checkpoint();\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nconst NO_STRAIN_SENTINEL: u8 = 255;\\n\\nfn phase_clear(g: &Surgery) -> bool {\\n    if g.pending_script || (g.shocks_need > 0 && g.shocks_done < g.shocks_need) {\\n        return false;\\n    }\\n    !g.hazards.iter().any(|h| h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT)\\n}\\n\\nfn swell_and_wander(g: &mut Surgery, rules: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let mut bursts: Vec<(f32, f32)> = Vec::new();\\n    for h in &mut g.hazards {\\n        if !h.alive {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if h.kind == K_SAC {\\n            h.aux = (h.aux + rules * 0.08).min(1.3);\\n            if h.aux >= 1.12 {\\n                h.alive = false;\\n                bursts.push((h.x, h.z));\\n            }\\n        } else if h.tag == 1 {\\n            let w = (g.elapsed * 1.4 + h.id as f32).sin();\\n            h.x = (h.x + w * rules * 0.28).clamp(-8.2, 8.2);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    for (x, z) in bursts {\\n        note_kind(g, K_SAC);\\n        g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 6.0).max(0.0);\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, x, z, 0.9);\\n        cue(events, CUE_BURST, x, z, 0.8, 0.9);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn hands(g: &mut Surgery, slots: &[SurgeonInput; 4], rules: f32, dt: f32, tick: u64, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    for i in 0..4 {\\n        let inp = slots[i];\\n        let lead = i == 0;\\n        if !inp.active && !lead {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if lead {\\n            g.surgeons[0].active = true;\\n        }\\n        if inp.active {\\n            if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP {\\n                g.surgeons[i].tool = inp.tool.min(DEFIB);\\n            }\\n            steer(&mut g.surgeons[i], inp, dt, g.tune.cursor_speed);\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[i].x = g.surgeons[i].x.clamp(X_MIN, X_MAX);\\n        g.surgeons[i].z = g.surgeons[i].z.clamp(Z_MIN, Z_MAX);\\n        g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd = (g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.surgeons[i].iv_cd = (g.surgeons[i].iv_cd - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.surgeons[i].since_chain += dt;\\n\\n        let (mut x, mut z) = (g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z);\\n        let precise = inp.held & surg::PRECISION != 0;\\n        let echo = g.echo_left > 0.0;\\n        if i == 0 && !precise && !echo && g.tune.tremor > 0.0 {\\n            let w = 0.12 * g.tune.tremor;\\n            let t = tick as f32;\\n            x += (t * 0.73).sin() * w;\\n            z += (t * 0.51).cos() * w;\\n        }\\n        let use_held = inp.held & surg::USE != 0;\\n        let just_release = g.surgeons[i].was_use && !use_held;\\n        let tool = g.surgeons[i].tool;\\n        if g.heat_on && use_held && heat_hit(g.heat_angle, x, z) {\\n            g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 8.0).max(0.0);\\n            g.surgeons[i].chain = 0;\\n            g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\\n            g.callout_i = 4;\\n            g.callout_t = 1.4;\\n            cue(events, CUE_STING, x, z, 0.7, 1.0);\\n        }\\n        let rot = if inp.held & surg::ROT_L != 0 {\\n            1\\n        } else if inp.held & surg::ROT_R != 0 {\\n            -1\\n        } else {\\n            0\\n        };\\n        let focus = g.surgeons[i].focus;\\n        let idx = select(&g.hazards, x, z, tool, focus, just_release);\\n        if let Some(idx) = idx {\\n            let id = g.hazards[idx].id;\\n            let before = g.hazards[idx].work;\\n            let was_hidden = g.hazards[idx].hidden;\\n            let mut hit = hazard::apply(\\n                &mut g.hazards[idx],\\n                x,\\n                z,\\n                tool,\\n                use_held,\\n                just_release,\\n                inp.pressure,\\n                rot,\\n                rules,\\n                g.tune.tool_power,\\n                g.heart.diastole() || g.duet_left > 0.0,\\n                g.tune.rating_strict,\\n            );\\n            if g.one_hit && hit.engaged && g.hazards[idx].accepts(tool) && tool != SCANNER {\\n                hit.done = true;\\n                hit.rating = R_IMMACULATE;\\n                g.hazards[idx].alive = false;\\n            }\\n            if was_hidden && !g.hazards[idx].hidden {\\n                g.coverage.tools[SCANNER as usize] = g.coverage.tools[SCANNER as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n            }\\n            let grew = g.hazards[idx].work > before + 0.0001 || hit.done;\\n            if g.surgeons[i].focus == Some(id) {\\n                if grew {\\n                    g.surgeons[i].focus_t = 0.0;\\n                } else {\\n                    g.surgeons[i].focus_t += dt;\\n                }\\n            } else {\\n                g.surgeons[i].focus = Some(id);\\n                g.surgeons[i].focus_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            if hit.engaged {\\n                g.hazards[idx].idle = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            if hit.done {\\n                resolve_done(g, i, idx, hit, events);\\n            } else if use_held && !hit.engaged && g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd <= 0.0 && tool != SCANNER && tool != DEFIB {\\n                if let Some(w) = nearest_wrong(&g.hazards, x, z, tool) {\\n                    let _ = w;\\n                    g.surgeons[i].chain = 0;\\n                    g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd = 0.8;\\n                    g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\\n                    g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 2.0 * g.tune.wrong_penalty).max(0.0);\\n                    g.callout_i = if tool == SCALPEL { 1 } else { 3 };\\n                    g.callout_t = 1.2;\\n                    cue(events, CUE_WRONG, x, z, 0.55, 1.0);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if hit.cue != 0 && (hit.done || tick % 8 == 0) {\\n                cue(events, hit.cue, x, z, 0.45, 1.0);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        gift_edge(g, i, inp, dt);\\n        g.surgeons[i].was_use = use_held;\\n    }\\n    let mut busy = [0u32; 8];\\n    let mut n = 0;\\n    for s in &g.surgeons {\\n        if let Some(id) = s.focus {\\n            if n < busy.len() {\\n                busy[n] = id;\\n                n += 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    for h in &mut g.hazards {\\n        if busy[..n].contains(&h.id) && h.idle == 0.0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        h.idle += rules;\\n        if h.idle > 0.4 && !matches!(h.kind, K_BONE | K_SAC | K_HEAT | K_IV) {\\n            h.work = (h.work - rules * 0.45).max(0.0);\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn resolve_done(g: &mut Surgery, slot: usize, idx: usize, hit: Hit, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let kind = g.hazards[idx].kind;\\n    let hx = g.hazards[idx].x;\\n    let hz = g.hazards[idx].z;\\n    let tool = g.surgeons[slot].tool as usize;\\n    if kind == K_IV && hit.rating != R_SLOPPY {\\n        g.hazards[idx].alive = false;\\n    }\\n    if hit.heal != 0.0 && g.surgeons[slot].iv_cd <= 0.0 {\\n        g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals + hit.heal * g.tune.iv_heal).clamp(0.0, 100.0);\\n        if hit.heal > 0.0 {\\n            g.surgeons[slot].iv_cd = 8.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let rating = hit.rating.min(3);\\n    g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize] = g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n    if tool < N_TOOLS {\\n        g.coverage.tools[tool] = g.coverage.tools[tool].saturating_add(1);\\n    }\\n    g.last_tool = g.surgeons[slot].tool;\\n    g.last_rating = rating;\\n    g.last_id = g.hazards[idx].id;\\n    g.last_ok = true;\\n    if rating == R_SLOPPY || hit.misuse > 0 {\\n        g.surgeons[slot].chain = 0;\\n        g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\\n        g.surgeons[slot].score += rating_points(R_SLOPPY);\\n    } else {\\n        let chain = if g.surgeons[slot].since_chain <= g.tune.chain_window && g.surgeons[slot].chain > 0 {\\n            g.surgeons[slot].chain.saturating_add(1)\\n        } else {\\n            1\\n        };\\n        g.surgeons[slot].chain = chain;\\n        g.surgeons[slot].best_chain = g.surgeons[slot].best_chain.max(chain);\\n        g.surgeons[slot].since_chain = 0.0;\\n        let pts = (rating_points(rating) as f32 * chain_mul(chain) * g.tune.score_mul).round() as i32;\\n        g.surgeons[slot].score += pts;\\n        if chain == 5 || chain == 10 || chain == 20 {\\n            cue(events, CUE_CHAIN, hx, hz, 0.6, 1.0 + chain as f32 * 0.01);\\n        }\\n        let mut meter = match rating {\\n            R_IMMACULATE => 8.0,\\n            R_CLEAN => 4.0,\\n            _ => 0.0,\\n        };\\n        if g.heart.on_beat(g.tune.beat_window_ms) {\\n            meter += 2.0;\\n            cue(events, CUE_BEAT, hx, hz, 0.4, 1.2);\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[slot].meter = (g.surgeons[slot].meter + meter * g.tune.gift_gain).min(100.0);\\n    }\\n    if !g.hazards[idx].alive {\\n        note_kind(g, kind);\\n    }\\n    push_popup(g, rating, hx, hz);\\n    cue(events, CUE_RATE, hx, hz, 0.5, 1.0 + (3 - rating) as f32 * 0.08);\\n    if rating == R_IMMACULATE {\\n        g.callout_i = 0;\\n        g.callout_t = g.callout_t.max(0.8);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn gift_edge(g: &mut Surgery, slot: usize, inp: SurgeonInput, dt: f32) {\\n    if slot != 0 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let held = inp.held & surg::GIFT != 0;\\n    if held {\\n        g.surgeons[0].gift_arm += dt;\\n    } else if g.surgeons[0].was_gift {\\n        let armed = g.surgeons[0].gift_arm >= 0.12;\\n        let on = g.heart.on_beat(g.tune.beat_window_ms);\\n        if armed && on && g.surgeons[0].meter >= 100.0 && !g.heart.flat {\\n            let bit = g.pending_gift();\\n            g.activate_gift(bit);\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[0].gift_arm = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    g.surgeons[0].was_gift = held;\\n}\\n\\nfn defib_only(g: &mut Surgery, slots: &[SurgeonInput; 4], dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    for i in 0..4 {\\n        let inp = slots[i];\\n        if !inp.active && i != 0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if i == 0 {\\n            g.surgeons[0].active = true;\\n        }\\n        if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP && inp.active {\\n            g.surgeons[i].tool = inp.tool.min(DEFIB);\\n        }\\n        let held = inp.held & surg::DEFIB != 0 || (g.surgeons[i].tool == DEFIB && inp.held & surg::USE != 0);\\n        if held {\\n            g.surgeons[i].defib += dt;\\n            if g.surgeons[i].defib > 0.2 && (g.surgeons[i].defib * 10.0) as u32 % 8 == 0 {\\n                cue(events, CUE_WHINE, g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z, 0.3, 0.8 + g.surgeons[i].defib);\\n            }\\n        } else if g.surgeons[i].was_defib {\\n            let c = g.surgeons[i].defib;\\n            if (1.12..=2.6).contains(&c) && g.heart.ghost_on_beat(g.tune.beat_window_ms) {\\n                cue(events, CUE_THUMP, 0.0, 0.0, 0.9, 1.0);\\n                g.resuscitate();\\n                return;\\n            }\\n            g.surgeons[i].defib = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[i].was_defib = held;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn echo_copy(g: &mut Surgery, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    if g.echo_left <= 0.0 || g.echo_cool > 0.0 || !g.last_ok {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let tool = g.last_tool;\\n    let rating = g.last_rating;\\n    let skip = g.surgeons[0].focus;\\n    let found = g.hazards.iter().position(|h| {\\n        h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT && h.tool == tool && Some(h.id) != skip && h.id != g.last_id\\n    });\\n    let Some(idx) = found else { return };\\n    let kind = g.hazards[idx].kind;\\n    let x = g.hazards[idx].x;\\n    let z = g.hazards[idx].z;\\n    g.hazards[idx].alive = false;\\n    g.echo_x = x;\\n    g.echo_z = z;\\n    g.echo_on = true;\\n    g.echo_cool = 1.15;\\n    g.last_id = g.hazards[idx].id;\\n    note_kind(g, kind);\\n    if (tool as usize) < N_TOOLS {\\n        g.coverage.tools[tool as usize] = g.coverage.tools[tool as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n    }\\n    g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize] = g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n    let pts = (rating_points(rating) as f32 * g.tune.score_mul) as i32;\\n    g.surgeons[0].score += pts;\\n    push_popup(g, rating, x, z);\\n    cue(events, CUE_PING, x, z, 0.45, 1.4);\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_blue(g: &mut Surgery, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32) {\\n    if g.timer <= 32.0 && !g.blue_finale {\\n        g.blue_finale = true;\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_NODULE, -0.8, 0.4, 0.35);\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_NODULE, 0.9, -0.3, 0.35);\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, 0.1, 1.0, 0.6);\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    if g.timer <= 32.0 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let quiet = g.hazards.iter().all(|h| !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT);\\n    if !quiet {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    g.blue_t += dt;\\n    if g.blue_t < 18.0 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    g.blue_t = 0.0;\\n    g.blue_wave = g.blue_wave.wrapping_add(1);\\n    let wave = g.blue_wave;\\n    let extra = (g.players.saturating_sub(1)).min(3);\\n    match wave % 6 {\\n        0 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_LACERATION, -1.2, 0.2, 0.8);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, 1.3, -0.4, 0.55);\\n        }\\n        1 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_POLYP, 0.4, 0.8, 0.3);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_INFLAM, -1.4, -0.6, 0.35);\\n        }\\n        2 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, 0.2, -0.2, 1.8);\\n            let mut h = Hazard::make(K_FOREIGN, -1.0, 0.9);\\n            h.hidden = true;\\n            h.drain = 0.4;\\n            h.id = g.next_id;\\n            g.next_id += 1;\\n            g.hazards.push(h);\\n        }\\n        3 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_SAC, -0.6, 0.5, 0.25);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_SAC, 1.1, 0.2, 0.25);\\n        }\\n        4 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_EMBER, -0.3, 0.6, 0.3);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_BURN, 1.2, -0.7, 0.3);\\n        }\\n        _ => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_INCISION, -1.8, 0.4, 0.0);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_DRESSING, 0.6, -1.0, 0.1);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if extra >= 1 {\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, -1.6, -1.1, 0.4);\\n    }\\n    if extra >= 2 {\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_LACERATION, 1.6, 1.0, 0.6);\\n    }\\n    if extra >= 3 {\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, 0.0, 1.3, 1.4);\\n    }\\n    let _ = sim;\\n}\\n\\nfn select(hazards: &[Hazard], x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, focus: Option<u32>, just_release: bool) -> Option<usize> {\\n    if just_release {\\n        if let Some(id) = focus {\\n            if let Some(i) = hazards.iter().position(|h| h.id == id && h.alive) {\\n                return Some(i);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if tool == IV {\\n        if let Some(i) = hazards.iter().position(|h| h.alive && h.kind == K_IV) {\\n            return Some(i);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let mut best = None;\\n    let mut best_d = f32::MAX;\\n    for (i, h) in hazards.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n        if d < best_d {\\n            best_d = d;\\n            best = Some(i);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    best\\n}\\n\\nfn nearest_wrong(hazards: &[Hazard], x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8) -> Option<usize> {\\n    let mut best = None;\\n    let mut best_d = f32::MAX;\\n    for (i, h) in hazards.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT || h.accepts(tool) {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n        if d <= h.radius + 0.12 && d < best_d {\\n            best_d = d;\\n            best = Some(i);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    best\\n}\\n\\nfn steer(s: &mut Surgeon, inp: SurgeonInput, dt: f32, speed: f32) {\\n    let abs = inp.held & surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE != 0;\\n    let snap = inp.held & surg::SNAP != 0;\\n    if abs && snap {\\n        s.x = inp.aim.x;\\n        s.z = inp.aim.y;\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    if abs {\\n        let dx = inp.aim.x - s.x;\\n        let dz = inp.aim.y - s.z;\\n        let d = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt();\\n        let step = speed.max(1.0) * dt;\\n        if d <= step || d < 1e-5 {\\n            s.x = inp.aim.x;\\n            s.z = inp.aim.y;\\n        } else {\\n            s.x += dx / d * step;\\n            s.z += dz / d * step;\\n        }\\n    } else if inp.aim.length_squared() > 0.0004 {\\n        s.x += inp.aim.x * speed * dt;\\n        s.z += inp.aim.y * speed * dt;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn heat_hit(angle: f32, x: f32, z: f32) -> bool {\\n    let ang = z.atan2(x);\\n    let mut d = (ang - angle).abs();\\n    if d > std::f32::consts::PI {\\n        d = std::f32::consts::TAU - d;\\n    }\\n    let r = (x * x + z * z).sqrt();\\n    d < 0.22 && r > 0.4\\n}\\n\\nfn note_kind(g: &mut Surgery, kind: u8) {\\n    let i = kind as usize;\\n    if i < g.coverage.hazards.len() {\\n        g.coverage.hazards[i] = g.coverage.hazards[i].saturating_add(1);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn push_popup(g: &mut Surgery, rating: u8, x: f32, z: f32) {\\n    g.popups[0] = g.popups[1];\\n    g.popups[1] = g.popups[2];\\n    g.popups[2] = g.popups[3];\\n    g.popups[3] = (rating, 1.1, x, z);\\n}\\n\\nfn cue(events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>, id: u16, x: f32, z: f32, gain: f32, pitch: f32) {\\n    events.push(SimEvent::Cue { id, pos: Vec3::new(x, 0.2, z), gain, pitch });\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! One tick of the operation. Gameplay happens here, where the input is.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\n\\nuse super::content::{self, case_def, G_DUET, G_ECHO, G_HUSH};\\nuse super::hazard::{self, Hit};\\nuse super::kinds::*;\\nuse super::*;\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub fn tick(g: &mut Surgery, sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>, had_cmd: bool) {\\n    if g.outcome == Outcome::Lost && g.mode == M_DEAD {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let dt = dt.max(0.0);\\n    match g.mode {\\n        M_STORY if !had_cmd => {\\n            if confirmed(input) {\\n                let lines = story::block(g.case_id, g.story_after);\\n                if (g.story_i as usize) + 1 >= lines.len() {\\n                    g.end_story();\\n                } else {\\n                    g.story_i = g.story_i.saturating_add(1);\\n                    cue(events, CUE_VOICE, 0.0, 0.0, 0.7, 0.9 + (g.story_i as f32 % 5.0) * 0.04);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        M_CHART if !had_cmd => {\\n            if confirmed(input) {\\n                g.mode = M_OP;\\n                g.phase_ready = false;\\n                cue(events, CUE_OK, 0.0, 0.0, 0.6, 1.0);\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        M_RESULTS if !had_cmd => {\\n            if confirmed(input) && g.campaign && g.outcome == Outcome::Playing {\\n                g.mode = M_STORY;\\n                g.story_after = true;\\n                g.story_i = 0;\\n            }\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        M_CARD => {\\n            g.card_t += dt;\\n            return;\\n        }\\n        M_TITLE | M_MIRROR | M_DEAD => return,\\n        M_OP | M_ATTRACT => {}\\n        _ => return,\\n    }\\n    if g.outcome != Outcome::Playing {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n\\n    let mut slots = input.surgeons;\\n    if g.case_id == 7 && !slots[1].active {\\n        slots[1] = bot::decide(g, sim.state.tick, 1);\\n    }\\n    let joined = slots.iter().filter(|s| s.active).count().max(1) as u8;\\n    g.players = g.players.max(joined);\\n\\n    let rules = if g.hush_beats > 0 { dt * g.tune.hush_scale.clamp(0.05, 1.0) } else { dt };\\n    let wave = g.heart.tick(rules, g.tune.heart_coupling);\\n    if wave {\\n        cue(events, CUE_LUB, 0.0, 0.0, 0.35, (g.heart.bpm / 80.0).clamp(0.7, 1.6));\\n        if g.hush_beats > 0 {\\n            g.hush_beats = g.hush_beats.saturating_sub(1);\\n        }\\n        if g.heat_phase && !g.heat_on && g.heart.beats % 5 == 0 {\\n            g.heat_on = true;\\n            g.heat_angle = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if g.echo_left > 0.0 {\\n        g.echo_left = (g.echo_left - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.echo_cool = (g.echo_cool - dt).max(0.0);\\n    } else {\\n        g.echo_on = false;\\n    }\\n    if g.duet_left > 0.0 {\\n        g.duet_left = (g.duet_left - dt).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    g.callout_t = (g.callout_t - dt).max(0.0);\\n    g.banner_t = (g.banner_t - dt).max(0.0);\\n    for p in &mut g.popups {\\n        p.1 = (p.1 - dt).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    if g.plate_blend < 1.0 {\\n        g.plate_blend = (g.plate_blend + dt / 0.8).min(1.0);\\n        if g.plate_blend >= 1.0 {\\n            g.plate = g.plate_next;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if !g.phase_ready && !g.code_blue {\\n        enter_phase(g, sim, events);\\n    }\\n    if g.outcome != Outcome::Playing {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n\\n    swell_and_wander(g, rules, events);\\n    if g.heat_on {\\n        g.heat_angle += rules * 2.8;\\n        if g.heat_angle > std::f32::consts::TAU {\\n            g.heat_on = false;\\n            note_kind(g, K_HEAT);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.heart.flat {\\n        g.code_t -= dt;\\n        defib_only(g, &slots, dt, events);\\n        if g.code_t <= 0.0 && g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\\n            g.die();\\n        }\\n    } else {\\n        hands(g, &slots, rules, dt, sim.state.tick, events);\\n        echo_copy(g, events);\\n        if !g.immortal {\\n            let mut drain = 0.0;\\n            for h in &g.hazards {\\n                if h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT {\\n                    drain += h.drain;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            let mul = content::diff_drain(g.difficulty) * g.tune.drain;\\n            g.heart.vitals -= drain * mul * rules;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    g.heart.vitals = g.heart.vitals.clamp(0.0, 100.0);\\n    if g.immortal && g.heart.vitals < 20.0 {\\n        g.heart.vitals = 55.0;\\n        g.heart.flat = false;\\n        g.code_t = -1.0;\\n    }\\n    if g.heart.vitals < 40.0 && !g.warned_40 && !g.heart.flat {\\n        g.warned_40 = true;\\n        g.callout_i = 2;\\n        g.callout_t = 2.2;\\n    }\\n    if g.pending_script && !g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\\n        g.pending_script = false;\\n        g.begin_code(true);\\n    } else if g.heart.vitals <= 0.0 && !g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\\n        g.begin_code(false);\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.mode != M_OP && g.mode != M_ATTRACT {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    if !g.freeze && !g.heart.flat {\\n        let speed = 1.0 / g.tune.timer.max(0.2);\\n        if g.code_blue {\\n            g.timer -= dt * speed;\\n        } else {\\n            g.timer -= rules * speed;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    g.elapsed += dt;\\n\\n    if !g.code_blue && !g.heart.flat && phase_clear(g) {\\n        g.phase_i = g.phase_i.saturating_add(1);\\n        g.phase_ready = false;\\n        g.heat_on = false;\\n        if case_def(g.case_id.max(0) as u8).is_some_and(|c| g.phase_i as usize >= c.phases.len()) {\\n            g.finish_op();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.code_blue && g.mode == M_OP {\\n        tick_blue(g, sim, dt);\\n    }\\n    if g.timer <= 0.0 && (g.mode == M_OP || g.mode == M_ATTRACT) {\\n        if g.code_blue && g.heart.vitals > 0.0 && !g.heart.flat {\\n            g.finish_op();\\n        } else if !g.code_blue {\\n            g.die();\\n        } else if g.heart.flat || g.heart.vitals <= 0.0 {\\n            g.die();\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn enter_phase(g: &mut Surgery, sim: &mut Sim, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let Some(def) = case_def(g.case_id.max(0) as u8) else {\\n        g.finish_op();\\n        return;\\n    };\\n    if g.phase_i as usize >= def.phases.len() {\\n        g.finish_op();\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let phase = def.phases[g.phase_i as usize];\\n    g.hazards.clear();\\n    g.heat_phase = phase.heat;\\n    g.heat_on = false;\\n    for spawn in phase.spawns {\\n        let mut h = Hazard::make(spawn.kind, spawn.x, spawn.z);\\n        if spawn.drain >= 0.0 {\\n            h.drain = spawn.drain;\\n        }\\n        if spawn.axis < 90.0 {\\n            h.axis = spawn.axis;\\n        }\\n        h.hidden = spawn.hidden;\\n        h.need *= g.tune.strain_tough.clamp(0.2, 3.0);\\n        let jx = sim.state.rng.range(-0.05, 0.05);\\n        let jz = sim.state.rng.range(-0.05, 0.05);\\n        h.x = (h.x + jx).clamp(-8.2, 8.2);\\n        h.z = (h.z + jz).clamp(-3.6, 3.6);\\n        if phase.strain == 0 {\\n            h.tag = 1;\\n        }\\n        h.id = g.next_id;\\n        g.next_id = g.next_id.wrapping_add(1);\\n        g.hazards.push(h);\\n    }\\n    if phase.strain != NO_STRAIN_SENTINEL {\\n        let i = phase.strain as usize;\\n        if i < g.coverage.strains.len() {\\n            g.coverage.strains[i] = g.coverage.strains[i].saturating_add(1);\\n            g.strain_phase = phase.strain;\\n            g.banner_t = 2.4;\\n            cue(events, CUE_BANNER, 0.0, 0.0, 0.55, 1.0);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if phase.unlock != 0 {\\n        g.gifts_unlocked |= phase.unlock;\\n        g.recent_unlock = phase.unlock;\\n        g.surgeons[0].meter = 100.0;\\n        g.callout_i = match phase.unlock {\\n            G_HUSH => 7,\\n            G_ECHO => 8,\\n            G_DUET => 9,\\n            _ => phase.callout,\\n        };\\n        g.callout_t = 2.6;\\n    } else if phase.callout > 0 {\\n        g.callout_i = phase.callout;\\n        g.callout_t = 2.4;\\n    }\\n    g.shocks_need = phase.script_code;\\n    g.shocks_done = 0;\\n    g.pending_script = phase.script_code > 0;\\n    g.phase_ready = true;\\n    if phase.checkpoint || g.phase_i == 0 {\\n        g.save_checkpoint();\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nconst NO_STRAIN_SENTINEL: u8 = 255;\\n\\nfn phase_clear(g: &Surgery) -> bool {\\n    if g.pending_script || (g.shocks_need > 0 && g.shocks_done < g.shocks_need) {\\n        return false;\\n    }\\n    !g.hazards.iter().any(|h| h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT)\\n}\\n\\nfn swell_and_wander(g: &mut Surgery, rules: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let mut bursts: Vec<(f32, f32)> = Vec::new();\\n    for h in &mut g.hazards {\\n        if !h.alive {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if h.kind == K_SAC {\\n            h.aux = (h.aux + rules * 0.08).min(1.3);\\n            if h.aux >= 1.12 {\\n                h.alive = false;\\n                bursts.push((h.x, h.z));\\n            }\\n        } else if h.tag == 1 {\\n            let w = (g.elapsed * 1.4 + h.id as f32).sin();\\n            h.x = (h.x + w * rules * 0.28).clamp(-8.2, 8.2);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    for (x, z) in bursts {\\n        note_kind(g, K_SAC);\\n        g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 6.0).max(0.0);\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, x, z, 0.9);\\n        cue(events, CUE_BURST, x, z, 0.8, 0.9);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn hands(g: &mut Surgery, slots: &[SurgeonInput; 4], rules: f32, dt: f32, tick: u64, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    for i in 0..4 {\\n        let inp = slots[i];\\n        let lead = i == 0;\\n        if !inp.active && !lead {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if lead {\\n            g.surgeons[0].active = true;\\n        }\\n        if inp.active {\\n            if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP {\\n                g.surgeons[i].tool = inp.tool.min(DEFIB);\\n            }\\n            steer(&mut g.surgeons[i], inp, dt, g.tune.cursor_speed);\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[i].x = g.surgeons[i].x.clamp(X_MIN, X_MAX);\\n        g.surgeons[i].z = g.surgeons[i].z.clamp(Z_MIN, Z_MAX);\\n        g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd = (g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.surgeons[i].iv_cd = (g.surgeons[i].iv_cd - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.surgeons[i].since_chain += dt;\\n\\n        let (mut x, mut z) = (g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z);\\n        let precise = inp.held & surg::PRECISION != 0;\\n        let echo = g.echo_left > 0.0;\\n        if i == 0 && !precise && !echo && g.tune.tremor > 0.0 {\\n            let w = 0.12 * g.tune.tremor;\\n            let t = tick as f32;\\n            x += (t * 0.73).sin() * w;\\n            z += (t * 0.51).cos() * w;\\n        }\\n        let use_held = inp.held & surg::USE != 0;\\n        let just_release = g.surgeons[i].was_use && !use_held;\\n        let tool = g.surgeons[i].tool;\\n        if g.heat_on && use_held && heat_hit(g.heat_angle, x, z) {\\n            g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 8.0).max(0.0);\\n            g.surgeons[i].chain = 0;\\n            g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\\n            g.callout_i = 4;\\n            g.callout_t = 1.4;\\n            cue(events, CUE_STING, x, z, 0.7, 1.0);\\n        }\\n        let rot = if inp.held & surg::ROT_L != 0 {\\n            1\\n        } else if inp.held & surg::ROT_R != 0 {\\n            -1\\n        } else {\\n            0\\n        };\\n        let focus = g.surgeons[i].focus;\\n        let idx = select(&g.hazards, x, z, tool, focus, just_release);\\n        if let Some(idx) = idx {\\n            let id = g.hazards[idx].id;\\n            let before = g.hazards[idx].work;\\n            let was_hidden = g.hazards[idx].hidden;\\n            let mut hit = hazard::apply(\\n                &mut g.hazards[idx],\\n                x,\\n                z,\\n                tool,\\n                use_held,\\n                just_release,\\n                inp.pressure,\\n                rot,\\n                rules,\\n                g.tune.tool_power,\\n                g.heart.diastole() || g.duet_left > 0.0,\\n                g.tune.rating_strict,\\n            );\\n            if g.one_hit && hit.engaged && g.hazards[idx].accepts(tool) && tool != SCANNER {\\n                hit.done = true;\\n                hit.rating = R_IMMACULATE;\\n                g.hazards[idx].alive = false;\\n            }\\n            if was_hidden && !g.hazards[idx].hidden {\\n                g.coverage.tools[SCANNER as usize] = g.coverage.tools[SCANNER as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n            }\\n            let grew = g.hazards[idx].work > before + 0.0001 || hit.done;\\n            if g.surgeons[i].focus == Some(id) {\\n                if grew {\\n                    g.surgeons[i].focus_t = 0.0;\\n                } else {\\n                    g.surgeons[i].focus_t += dt;\\n                }\\n            } else {\\n                g.surgeons[i].focus = Some(id);\\n                g.surgeons[i].focus_t = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            if hit.engaged {\\n                g.hazards[idx].idle = 0.0;\\n            }\\n            if hit.done {\\n                resolve_done(g, i, idx, hit, events);\\n            } else if use_held && !hit.engaged && g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd <= 0.0 && tool != SCANNER && tool != DEFIB {\\n                if let Some(w) = nearest_wrong(&g.hazards, x, z, tool) {\\n                    let _ = w;\\n                    g.surgeons[i].chain = 0;\\n                    g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd = 0.8;\\n                    g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\\n                    g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 2.0 * g.tune.wrong_penalty).max(0.0);\\n                    g.callout_i = if tool == SCALPEL { 1 } else { 3 };\\n                    g.callout_t = 1.2;\\n                    cue(events, CUE_WRONG, x, z, 0.55, 1.0);\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if hit.cue != 0 && (hit.done || tick % 8 == 0) {\\n                cue(events, hit.cue, x, z, 0.45, 1.0);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        gift_edge(g, i, inp, dt);\\n        g.surgeons[i].was_use = use_held;\\n    }\\n    let mut busy = [0u32; 8];\\n    let mut n = 0;\\n    for s in &g.surgeons {\\n        if let Some(id) = s.focus {\\n            if n < busy.len() {\\n                busy[n] = id;\\n                n += 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    for h in &mut g.hazards {\\n        if busy[..n].contains(&h.id) && h.idle == 0.0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        h.idle += rules;\\n        if h.idle > 0.4 && !matches!(h.kind, K_BONE | K_SAC | K_HEAT | K_IV) {\\n            h.work = (h.work - rules * 0.45).max(0.0);\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn resolve_done(g: &mut Surgery, slot: usize, idx: usize, hit: Hit, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    let kind = g.hazards[idx].kind;\\n    let hx = g.hazards[idx].x;\\n    let hz = g.hazards[idx].z;\\n    let tool = g.surgeons[slot].tool as usize;\\n    if kind == K_IV && hit.rating != R_SLOPPY {\\n        g.hazards[idx].alive = false;\\n    }\\n    if hit.heal != 0.0 && g.surgeons[slot].iv_cd <= 0.0 {\\n        g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals + hit.heal * g.tune.iv_heal).clamp(0.0, 100.0);\\n        if hit.heal > 0.0 {\\n            g.surgeons[slot].iv_cd = 8.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let rating = hit.rating.min(3);\\n    g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize] = g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n    if tool < N_TOOLS {\\n        g.coverage.tools[tool] = g.coverage.tools[tool].saturating_add(1);\\n    }\\n    g.last_tool = g.surgeons[slot].tool;\\n    g.last_rating = rating;\\n    g.last_id = g.hazards[idx].id;\\n    g.last_ok = true;\\n    if rating == R_SLOPPY || hit.misuse > 0 {\\n        g.surgeons[slot].chain = 0;\\n        g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\\n        g.surgeons[slot].score += rating_points(R_SLOPPY);\\n    } else {\\n        let chain = if g.surgeons[slot].since_chain <= g.tune.chain_window && g.surgeons[slot].chain > 0 {\\n            g.surgeons[slot].chain.saturating_add(1)\\n        } else {\\n            1\\n        };\\n        g.surgeons[slot].chain = chain;\\n        g.surgeons[slot].best_chain = g.surgeons[slot].best_chain.max(chain);\\n        g.surgeons[slot].since_chain = 0.0;\\n        let pts = (rating_points(rating) as f32 * chain_mul(chain) * g.tune.score_mul).round() as i32;\\n        g.surgeons[slot].score += pts;\\n        if chain == 5 || chain == 10 || chain == 20 {\\n            cue(events, CUE_CHAIN, hx, hz, 0.6, 1.0 + chain as f32 * 0.01);\\n        }\\n        let mut meter = match rating {\\n            R_IMMACULATE => 8.0,\\n            R_CLEAN => 4.0,\\n            _ => 0.0,\\n        };\\n        if g.heart.on_beat(g.tune.beat_window_ms) {\\n            meter += 2.0;\\n            cue(events, CUE_BEAT, hx, hz, 0.4, 1.2);\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[slot].meter = (g.surgeons[slot].meter + meter * g.tune.gift_gain).min(100.0);\\n    }\\n    if !g.hazards[idx].alive {\\n        note_kind(g, kind);\\n    }\\n    push_popup(g, rating, hx, hz);\\n    cue(events, CUE_RATE, hx, hz, 0.5, 1.0 + (3 - rating) as f32 * 0.08);\\n    if rating == R_IMMACULATE {\\n        g.callout_i = 0;\\n        g.callout_t = g.callout_t.max(0.8);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn gift_edge(g: &mut Surgery, slot: usize, inp: SurgeonInput, dt: f32) {\\n    if slot != 0 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let held = inp.held & surg::GIFT != 0;\\n    if held {\\n        g.surgeons[0].gift_arm += dt;\\n    } else if g.surgeons[0].was_gift {\\n        let armed = g.surgeons[0].gift_arm >= 0.12;\\n        let on = g.heart.on_beat(g.tune.beat_window_ms);\\n        if armed && on && g.surgeons[0].meter >= 100.0 && !g.heart.flat {\\n            let bit = g.pending_gift();\\n            g.activate_gift(bit);\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[0].gift_arm = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    g.surgeons[0].was_gift = held;\\n}\\n\\nfn defib_only(g: &mut Surgery, slots: &[SurgeonInput; 4], dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    for i in 0..4 {\\n        let inp = slots[i];\\n        if !inp.active && i != 0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if i == 0 {\\n            g.surgeons[0].active = true;\\n        }\\n        if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP && inp.active {\\n            g.surgeons[i].tool = inp.tool.min(DEFIB);\\n        }\\n        let held = inp.held & surg::DEFIB != 0 || (g.surgeons[i].tool == DEFIB && inp.held & surg::USE != 0);\\n        if held {\\n            g.surgeons[i].defib += dt;\\n            if g.surgeons[i].defib > 0.2 && (g.surgeons[i].defib * 10.0) as u32 % 8 == 0 {\\n                cue(events, CUE_WHINE, g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z, 0.3, 0.8 + g.surgeons[i].defib);\\n            }\\n        } else if g.surgeons[i].was_defib {\\n            let c = g.surgeons[i].defib;\\n            if (1.12..=2.6).contains(&c) && g.heart.ghost_on_beat(g.tune.beat_window_ms) {\\n                cue(events, CUE_THUMP, 0.0, 0.0, 0.9, 1.0);\\n                g.resuscitate();\\n                return;\\n            }\\n            g.surgeons[i].defib = 0.0;\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[i].was_defib = held;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn echo_copy(g: &mut Surgery, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    if g.echo_left <= 0.0 || g.echo_cool > 0.0 || !g.last_ok {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let tool = g.last_tool;\\n    let rating = g.last_rating;\\n    let skip = g.surgeons[0].focus;\\n    let found = g.hazards.iter().position(|h| {\\n        h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT && h.tool == tool && Some(h.id) != skip && h.id != g.last_id\\n    });\\n    let Some(idx) = found else { return };\\n    let kind = g.hazards[idx].kind;\\n    let x = g.hazards[idx].x;\\n    let z = g.hazards[idx].z;\\n    g.hazards[idx].alive = false;\\n    g.echo_x = x;\\n    g.echo_z = z;\\n    g.echo_on = true;\\n    g.echo_cool = 1.15;\\n    g.last_id = g.hazards[idx].id;\\n    note_kind(g, kind);\\n    if (tool as usize) < N_TOOLS {\\n        g.coverage.tools[tool as usize] = g.coverage.tools[tool as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n    }\\n    g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize] = g.coverage.ratings[rating as usize].saturating_add(1);\\n    let pts = (rating_points(rating) as f32 * g.tune.score_mul) as i32;\\n    g.surgeons[0].score += pts;\\n    push_popup(g, rating, x, z);\\n    cue(events, CUE_PING, x, z, 0.45, 1.4);\\n}\\n\\nfn tick_blue(g: &mut Surgery, sim: &mut Sim, dt: f32) {\\n    if g.timer <= 32.0 && !g.blue_finale {\\n        g.blue_finale = true;\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_NODULE, -0.8, 0.4, 0.35);\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_NODULE, 0.9, -0.3, 0.35);\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, 0.1, 1.0, 0.6);\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    if g.timer <= 32.0 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let quiet = g.hazards.iter().all(|h| !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT);\\n    if !quiet {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    g.blue_t += dt;\\n    if g.blue_t < 18.0 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    g.blue_t = 0.0;\\n    g.blue_wave = g.blue_wave.wrapping_add(1);\\n    let wave = g.blue_wave;\\n    let extra = (g.players.saturating_sub(1)).min(3);\\n    match wave % 6 {\\n        0 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_LACERATION, -1.2, 0.2, 0.8);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, 1.3, -0.4, 0.55);\\n        }\\n        1 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_POLYP, 0.4, 0.8, 0.3);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_INFLAM, -1.4, -0.6, 0.35);\\n        }\\n        2 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, 0.2, -0.2, 1.8);\\n            let mut h = Hazard::make(K_FOREIGN, -1.0, 0.9);\\n            h.hidden = true;\\n            h.drain = 0.4;\\n            h.id = g.next_id;\\n            g.next_id += 1;\\n            g.hazards.push(h);\\n        }\\n        3 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_SAC, -0.6, 0.5, 0.25);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_SAC, 1.1, 0.2, 0.25);\\n        }\\n        4 => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_EMBER, -0.3, 0.6, 0.3);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_BURN, 1.2, -0.7, 0.3);\\n        }\\n        _ => {\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_INCISION, -1.8, 0.4, 0.0);\\n            g.spawn_kind_at(K_DRESSING, 0.6, -1.0, 0.1);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if extra >= 1 {\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_POOL, -1.6, -1.1, 0.4);\\n    }\\n    if extra >= 2 {\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_LACERATION, 1.6, 1.0, 0.6);\\n    }\\n    if extra >= 3 {\\n        g.spawn_kind_at(K_BLEEDER, 0.0, 1.3, 1.4);\\n    }\\n    let _ = sim;\\n}\\n\\nfn select(hazards: &[Hazard], x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, focus: Option<u32>, just_release: bool) -> Option<usize> {\\n    if just_release {\\n        if let Some(id) = focus {\\n            if let Some(i) = hazards.iter().position(|h| h.id == id && h.alive) {\\n                return Some(i);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if tool == IV {\\n        if let Some(i) = hazards.iter().position(|h| h.alive && h.kind == K_IV) {\\n            return Some(i);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let mut best = None;\\n    let mut best_d = f32::MAX;\\n    for (i, h) in hazards.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n        if d < best_d {\\n            best_d = d;\\n            best = Some(i);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    best\\n}\\n\\nfn nearest_wrong(hazards: &[Hazard], x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8) -> Option<usize> {\\n    let mut best = None;\\n    let mut best_d = f32::MAX;\\n    for (i, h) in hazards.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT || h.accepts(tool) {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n        if d <= h.radius + 0.12 && d < best_d {\\n            best_d = d;\\n            best = Some(i);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    best\\n}\\n\\nfn steer(s: &mut Surgeon, inp: SurgeonInput, dt: f32, speed: f32) {\\n    let abs = inp.held & surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE != 0;\\n    let snap = inp.held & surg::SNAP != 0;\\n    if abs && snap {\\n        s.x = inp.aim.x;\\n        s.z = inp.aim.y;\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    if abs {\\n        let dx = inp.aim.x - s.x;\\n        let dz = inp.aim.y - s.z;\\n        let d = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt();\\n        let step = speed.max(1.0) * dt;\\n        if d <= step || d < 1e-5 {\\n            s.x = inp.aim.x;\\n            s.z = inp.aim.y;\\n        } else {\\n            s.x += dx / d * step;\\n            s.z += dz / d * step;\\n        }\\n    } else if inp.aim.length_squared() > 0.0004 {\\n        s.x += inp.aim.x * speed * dt;\\n        s.z += inp.aim.y * speed * dt;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn heat_hit(angle: f32, x: f32, z: f32) -> bool {\\n    let ang = z.atan2(x);\\n    let mut d = (ang - angle).abs();\\n    if d > std::f32::consts::PI {\\n        d = std::f32::consts::TAU - d;\\n    }\\n    let r = (x * x + z * z).sqrt();\\n    d < 0.22 && r > 0.4\\n}\\n\\nfn note_kind(g: &mut Surgery, kind: u8) {\\n    let i = kind as usize;\\n    if i < g.coverage.hazards.len() {\\n        g.coverage.hazards[i] = g.coverage.hazards[i].saturating_add(1);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn push_popup(g: &mut Surgery, rating: u8, x: f32, z: f32) {\\n    g.popups[0] = g.popups[1];\\n    g.popups[1] = g.popups[2];\\n    g.popups[2] = g.popups[3];\\n    g.popups[3] = (rating, 1.1, x, z);\\n}\\n\\nfn cue(events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>, id: u16, x: f32, z: f32, gain: f32, pitch: f32) {\\n    events.push(SimEvent::Cue { id, pos: Vec3::new(x, 0.2, z), gain, pitch });\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"eaf3b71e-8a94-4daf-bbe8-0807be2dab0e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_72","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fixing the mismatch between content::NO_STRAIN and NO_STRAIN_SENTINEL.\n\nThe constants are now correctly separated. Next: adding a surgery field to RenderFrame and all its literals, then fixing bot.rs.\n\nPrivate methods and fields are accessible to child modules. The private `story` submodule is not imported by `use super::*`, so ops must use `super::story` instead.\n\nops.rs needs `use super::story;` to access `story::block`. `super::bot::decide` already works because ops can reach the parent's private `bot` module.\n\nChild modules can access the parent's private `hazard` module via `super::hazard`. The `NO_STRAIN` constant matches the sentinel value used in ops. A potential issue was noted: a const `phase` function inside a static array might not compile. SurgeonInput and bot.rs imports are confirmed public.\n\n`pending_gift` is public. Bot focus uses `Option<u32>` correctly. `Game::pre` returns `EntityId`. `sim.play()` is public and accessible. Duplicate declarations for `frame` and `kinds` are harmless.\n\n`frame` is declared only as `pub mod frame`, with no duplicate private declaration. `NONE_SPAWN` correctly references the later-defined `s` constant. The static `CASES` array of const `phase` calls should compile. `heart.tick` returns a boolean.\n\nThe `hazard::apply` call signature matches the function definition exactly. Checking whether `Outcome` is imported via `use super::*` in ops.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce10e713-4ee5-4ae8-8d81-f9de07c39674-64","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/frame.rs","old_string":"    /// The generated native stage subject, separate from simulation entity geometry.\n    pub creature: Option<crate::creature_preview::CreatureFrame>,\n}","new_string":"    /// The generated native stage subject, separate from simulation entity geometry.\n    pub creature: Option<crate::creature_preview::CreatureFrame>,\n    /// Overhead operation, when the scene is Hands of Harbor.\n    pub surgery: Option<std::sync::Arc<crate::games::surgery::SurgeryFrame>>,\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce10e713-4ee5-4ae8-8d81-f9de07c39674-65","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs","old_string":"            creature_preview: None,\n            creature: None,\n        }\n    }","new_string":"            creature_preview: None,\n            creature: None,\n            surgery: crate::games::surgery::take_frame(self),\n        }\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce10e713-4ee5-4ae8-8d81-f9de07c39674-66","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/animation_preview.rs","old_string":"            creature_preview: None,\n            creature: None,\n        }\n    }\n}","new_string":"            creature_preview: None,\n            creature: None,\n            surgery: None,\n        }\n    }\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce10e713-4ee5-4ae8-8d81-f9de07c39674-67","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/creature_preview.rs","old_string":"        creature_preview: None,\n        creature: None,\n    }\n}","new_string":"        