{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_74","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `frame()` function in `creature_preview.rs` might return a modified frame from an empty or alternate constructor.\n\nChecking whether `creature_preview.rs` builds its own `RenderFrame` or modifies an existing one. The prop may already be complete. Running `cargo check` on `pav_core` to catch any cycle issues. The updated helper should propagate changes through struct updates like `..empty`. Compilation is starting with 6 parallel jobs.\n\n`cargo check -p pav_core` is faster than `cargo test` for catching library errors. The first build may need to download dependencies since the registry might not be cached yet.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ac0fcc1-0eac-4272-8637-7d7176c98170-72","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=6 cargo check -p pav_core --offline 2>&1 | tail -n 80","description":"Compile pav_core to surface surgery errors","block_until_ms":300000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1365,"output_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":192512,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"22c98967-4a80-4966-8c7c-ea3b53d5bc5e"}
