{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_78","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code compiled successfully with only warnings. The simulation typechecks.\n\nWriting a focused test to run case 0. I'll use dead_code attributes on unused test helpers. The test will run as a binary and print status if it fails.\n\nThe test will run case 0 for up to 90 minutes and assert a win. I'll filter cargo test to avoid slower starter tests.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-81ec0612-00f2-4e84-8a6b-ffc1e4cca67c-76","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs","content":"//! Hands of Harbor: the shipped sim, from a fresh scene, played by its own bot.\n\nuse pav_core::games::Outcome;\nuse pav_core::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput, SurgeryCmd};\nuse pav_core::{Sim, SimState};\n\nfn status(sim: &Sim) -> String {\n    sim.play().unwrap().status(sim).to_string()\n}\n\nfn set_skill(sim: &mut Sim, skill: f32) {\n    sim.state.play.as_mut().unwrap().get_mut::<pav_core::games::surgery::Surgery>().unwrap().skill = skill;\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn case0_bot_wins() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"surgery/case/0\", 1).unwrap();\n    let (outcome, ticks) = sim.run_bot(60 * 180);\n    assert_eq!(outcome, Outcome::Won, \"{ticks} ticks {}\", status(&sim));\n    let rank = sim.play().unwrap().status(&sim)[\"rank_n\"].as_u64().unwrap_or(0);\n    assert!(rank >= 4, \"skill 1 should clear S, {}\", status(&sim));\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn idle_loses_case0() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"surgery/case/0\", 1).unwrap();\n    for _ in 0..(60 * 90) {\n        if sim.outcome() == Outcome::Lost {\n            break;\n        }\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n    }\n    assert_eq!(sim.outcome(), Outcome::Lost, \"{}\", status(&sim));\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2413,"output_tokens":936,"cache_read_input_tokens":194816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"5188dbc0-c847-4baa-af85-4d8bff3c38b6"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-81ec0612-00f2-4e84-8a6b-ffc1e4cca67c-76","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Hands of Harbor: the shipped sim, from a fresh scene, played by its own bot.\\n\\nuse pav_core::games::Outcome;\\nuse pav_core::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput, SurgeryCmd};\\nuse pav_core::{Sim, SimState};\\n\\nfn status(sim: &Sim) -> String {\\n    sim.play().unwrap().status(sim).to_string()\\n}\\n\\nfn set_skill(sim: &mut Sim, skill: f32) {\\n    sim.state.play.as_mut().unwrap().get_mut::<pav_core::games::surgery::Surgery>().unwrap().skill = skill;\\n}\\n\\n#[test]\\nfn case0_bot_wins() {\\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\\\"surgery/case/0\\\", 1).unwrap();\\n    let (outcome, ticks) = sim.run_bot(60 * 180);\\n    assert_eq!(outcome, Outcome::Won, \\\"{ticks} ticks {}\\\", status(&sim));\\n    let rank = sim.play().unwrap().status(&sim)[\\\"rank_n\\\"].as_u64().unwrap_or(0);\\n    assert!(rank >= 4, \\\"skill 1 should clear S, {}\\\", status(&sim));\\n}\\n\\n#[test]\\nfn idle_loses_case0() {\\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\\\"surgery/case/0\\\", 1).unwrap();\\n    for _ in 0..(60 * 90) {\\n        if sim.outcome() == Outcome::Lost {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\\n    }\\n    assert_eq!(sim.outcome(), Outcome::Lost, \\\"{}\\\", status(&sim));\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Hands of Harbor: the shipped sim, from a fresh scene, played by its own bot.\\n\\nuse pav_core::games::Outcome;\\nuse pav_core::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput, SurgeryCmd};\\nuse pav_core::{Sim, SimState};\\n\\nfn status(sim: &Sim) -> String {\\n    sim.play().unwrap().status(sim).to_string()\\n}\\n\\nfn set_skill(sim: &mut Sim, skill: f32) {\\n    sim.state.play.as_mut().unwrap().get_mut::<pav_core::games::surgery::Surgery>().unwrap().skill = skill;\\n}\\n\\n#[test]\\nfn case0_bot_wins() {\\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\\\"surgery/case/0\\\", 1).unwrap();\\n    let (outcome, ticks) = sim.run_bot(60 * 180);\\n    assert_eq!(outcome, Outcome::Won, \\\"{ticks} ticks {}\\\", status(&sim));\\n    let rank = sim.play().unwrap().status(&sim)[\\\"rank_n\\\"].as_u64().unwrap_or(0);\\n    assert!(rank >= 4, \\\"skill 1 should clear S, {}\\\", status(&sim));\\n}\\n\\n#[test]\\nfn idle_loses_case0() {\\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\\\"surgery/case/0\\\", 1).unwrap();\\n    for _ in 0..(60 * 90) {\\n        if sim.outcome() == Outcome::Lost {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\\n    }\\n    assert_eq!(sim.outcome(), Outcome::Lost, \\\"{}\\\", status(&sim));\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"534eb842-062c-4f31-8f3d-1f6254a2423f"}
