{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_81","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The suture might work if the cursor reaches it.\n\nDebugging by printing the surgeon state. Found a critical bug in idle decay: when the surgeon hits a hazard, idle resets to zero, which skips decay for that hazard. Work decay does not reset samples.\n\nConfirmed hands decay behaves correctly when engaged. Verified suture need and samples_need values. Will add debug prints at 120 and 600 ticks. Investigating why the bot tool returns None despite alive hazards, suspecting a copy issue with `Game::bot` taking `&self`.\n\nPhase hazards spawn in pre-step, so the first bot call sees no hazards. The second call sees them after the step. A `debug_dump` test with println and nocapture will be added. `aim_toward` clamps to the field, but hold distance uses the unclamped ideal target.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7d1955f9-c6d6-4270-8766-ae63f88a7ec7-79","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs","old_string":"#[test]\nfn case0_bot_wins() {","new_string":"#[test]\nfn debug_case0() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"surgery/case/0\", 1).unwrap();\n    for n in [60, 180, 400, 800] {\n        while sim.state.tick < n {\n            let f = sim.bot_input();\n            sim.step(&f);\n        }\n        let g = sim.play().unwrap().get::<pav_core::games::surgery::Surgery>().unwrap();\n        let s = &g.surgeons[0];\n        eprintln!(\n            \"t={} cursor=({:.2},{:.2}) tool={} use={} focus_t={:.2} vitals={:.1}\",\n            sim.state.tick, s.x, s.z, s.tool, s.was_use, s.focus_t, g.heart.vitals\n        );\n        for h in &g.hazards {\n            eprintln!(\n                \"  kind={} pos=({:.2},{:.2}) work={:.2} need={:.2} samples={}/{} aux={:.2} aux2={:.2} alive={} tool={} grab={}\",\n                h.kind, h.x, h.z, h.work, h.need, h.samples, h.samples_need, h.aux, h.aux2, h.alive, h.tool, h.grabbed\n            );\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn case0_bot_wins() {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4092,"output_tokens":991,"cache_read_input_tokens":199424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"26f54bea-89b5-4f0f-b7fa-674c10b59b1d"}
