{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_89","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fixing the match arm. Checking whether the bot's zigzag will register stitches given the 8-tick flip and travel time.\n\nSimulating the bot's movement tick by tick. The cursor passes close enough to zero between sides. The first aim point is 0.84 units away and takes about four ticks to reach. After that it waits for the eight-tick target flip.\n\nThe stitch should register when the side sign flips while the cursor is near the needle and within the required bounds. The path between aim points stays straight, so the along-needle position stays stable. A bug was found in the focus_t spiral: stitching does not increase `work` until the task finishes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ad2d4dff-80ee-47cd-940b-3be137772d3a-15","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tool_power|FIELDS|pub struct Tune|fn default","glob":"**/surgery/tune.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ad2d4dff-80ee-47cd-940b-3be137772d3a-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs","limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2847,"output_tokens":561,"cache_read_input_tokens":58496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"cb9ad699-9d2b-4dc8-bce0-a865647b9ccd"}
