{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_95","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fixed the critical bug where Case 0 bot wins at S or above.\n\nExpanding tests to all cases and the campaign. A fast seed-1 test will catch failures first. Then the full suite. The view, UI, audio, hub, and pack shells need architecture review.\n\nChecking PLAN.md requirements and the existing arpg view pattern to clone for surgery. The sim exists, but view, camera, and product seams still need building.\n\nThe sim must pass all cases and campaign tests first. Then view, shell, audio, hub, and pack will follow.\n\nA diagnostic test will run every case at skill 1 with code blue and print failures. I also need to check if run_bot stops on Won.\n\nCampaign runtime is acceptable at roughly one to a few minutes. I am now auditing specific failure modes before running the full suite: Case 2 scripted code timing, bone rotation mechanics, tether scalpel alignment, and hidden foreign object detection.\n\nScanner correctly reveals hidden objects before forceps. Nodule wander drift is slow enough for the bot to track. Gift and echo mechanics look sound.\n\nSacs in Case 4 are safe. Six targets take about five seconds total, well under the fourteen-second burst window.\n\nDies irae heat is manageable. The bot avoids the rotating beam and waits for cryo charge, so it should finish despite slower progress.\n\nDies irae vitals drain at 1.75 per second from five embers, giving roughly 39 seconds before death. The bot releases the heat tool when the beam passes while near an ember, which resets the charge to zero and forces a restart. This cycle could stall progress if it repeats too often.\n\nCase 7 is complex with scripted shocks, a tendril, and a partner bot. Code blue simulation is fast enough at roughly 0.05 seconds. Rank S scoring may need post-measurement par adjustments because other cases have higher targets.\n\nThe plan requires pars to be remeasured after simulation. If skill 1.0 lands below S, the par thresholds will be lowered so the bot scores at least S or ENCORE. I will run a diagnostic test that prints each case's score, rank, and outcome without asserting rank, then fix any failures.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2767d94a-21c9-44fa-8800-89cfdfd00af9-27","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^#+ ","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/goal/plan.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2767d94a-21c9-44fa-8800-89cfdfd00af9-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn run_bot|fn bot_input|history_seconds","glob":"**/pav_core/src/sim.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2767d94a-21c9-44fa-8800-89cfdfd00af9-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn finish_op|fn boot_code|fn die\\(","glob":"**/surgery/mod.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3931,"output_tokens":1680,"cache_read_input_tokens":76800,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"9d0df812-5ade-45e1-a9c3-adbbf08d0672"}
