{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_116","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Reading mesh.rs to find the MeshData vertex layout.\n\nPlanning the implementation order: view plate and instruments first, then a pure Rust shell state machine drawn by egui, followed by audio and product.rs. Will also check app.rs frame branching, SimHost, UI rendering, and the audio mixer.\n\nThe plate mesh will be 420×240 with roughly 100,000 vertices. Building it every frame is acceptable under unlimited performance. The height function will be clamped to avoid NaNs. The field spans x [-11, 11] and z [-6.3, 6.3]. The geometry will use a few ellipsoidal lobes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b0c95a7a-dadd-45ee-bdcf-aca0017da3d5-69","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_render/src/mesh.rs","limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b0c95a7a-dadd-45ee-bdcf-aca0017da3d5-70","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_render/src/scene.rs","offset":280,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b0c95a7a-dadd-45ee-bdcf-aca0017da3d5-71","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_render/src/scene.rs","offset":560,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b0c95a7a-dadd-45ee-bdcf-aca0017da3d5-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second