{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_126","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to implement a lot of code.\n\nI'll write the view, shell, and tests in parallel batches. The visual design will use a real plate mesh with SDF instruments, colored hazard spheres, and applied look settings. Paper theatre will become a real card stack using Chaikin+ear clipping instead of a stub. I'll add an offline music renderer to verify non-silence output and set the music bus default to 0.10. Next I'll inspect the Sun struct and write the plate file.\n\nI'll keep the frame stateless rather than adding surgery view state to ViewBuilder. For the plate mesh, I'm weighing a 210×120 grid against the planned 420×240 to balance density with build time.\n\nThe plate mesh will be 280×160, about 45,000 vertices. I'll apply the look at the end of ViewBuilder::build when surgery state is active. Camera rig parameters are set each frame in product.rs and session.rs.\n\nI'll set the camera rig in both product.rs and session.rs, then override scene.camera at the end of ViewBuilder::build when surgery is active. This guarantees the correct camera for any caller without remembering where to inject it.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-07ac0d6f-a291-4402-8c29-22a5022aab72-98","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub struct Sun","glob":"**/pav_render/src/scene.rs","-A":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-07ac0d6f-a291-4402-8c29-22a5022aab72-99","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/Cargo.toml"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1338,"output_tokens":966,"cache_read_input_tokens":196224,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717