{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_128","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Instance color is white. Vertex color carries the paint.\n\nWriting the plate geometry now. A toon highlight will brighten vertices where normal and light align closely. The height function uses lobe shapes for each plate, blended between adjacent plates. Low-amplitude noise based on grid coordinates adds surface variation.\n\nVeins are noise-thresholded. Hazards stamp color. Drape outside an ellipse is teal. Y is up, field is x and z. Normals derive from neighboring heights. Grid is 280 by 160 cells. Indices use two triangles per cell with CCW winding from above.\n\nCorrected the triangle winding to produce upward normals. NaN heights will be clamped to zero. Next steps are writing the geometry file, emitting hazard SDFs and a steel tool at the cursor, hooking build.rs, and writing a shell script. Product.rs needs access to App's private fields.\n\nProduct.rs is a child module of app.rs, so it can access App's private fields directly. The frame loop will check `surgery_active()` and call `surgery_frame(dt)` when active, returning early. The flag is true if the scene name starts with \"surgery\" or the host frame has surgery enabled; the startup scene is surgery/title.\n\nwindow_event will branch at the top when surgery is active. It will call a dedicated surgery event handler that records input and redraws without running engine shortcuts. Camera wheel and right-drag will be skipped, and handle_key will not be called.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5065f0d-551d-431b-91ef-246edcf1f8ef-102","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Shardfall|set_title|Window::default","glob":"**/pav_app/src/**/*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":986,"output_tokens":1017,"cache_read_input_tokens":198912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"da357b9b-c2f2-45c9-bcd8-6d1b567917c8"}
