{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_133","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Continuing work on \"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\", a surgical action drama game.\n\nThe simulation is green. The overhead plate and product frame path are next. I will assess the codebase and begin implementing the remaining systems.\n\nI will read the current files and PLAN sections for view, shell, audio, and product. Then I will implement in parallel. The simulation is largely complete.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The sim already clears every case on seed 1. Next I’ll wire the overhead plate and the product frame so a packed page draws the operation instead of the engine demo."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-da39eda2-a872-42ab-bbae-69c298b023ea-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"2","content":"Open sim/input/camera/product seams; one overhead op that boots packed","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"3","content":"All instruments, hazards, ratings, chains, Code, cases 0-2, bot, cues, tests","status":"pending"},{"id":"4","content":"10-foot shell: menus, pause, settings, save, glyphs, attract, touch-only, dev sliders","status":"pending"},{"id":"5","content":"Paper theatre, music buses at 0.10, gibberish voices through case 7","status":"pending"},{"id":"6","content":"Strains, gifts, tremor, Cryoprobe, Duet, cases 3-7, local 1-4, Code Blue","status":"pending"},{"id":"7","content":"Hub shim, card, mirror, host snapshots; harness and two-page check","status":"pending"},{"id":"8","content":"Balance, exit-interview, about block, pack HTML, delete target, save suite and launches","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-da39eda2-a872-42ab-bbae-69c298b023ea-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/bundled/skills/long-running-background-tasks/SKILL.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-da39eda2-a872-42ab-bbae-69c298b023ea-2","name":"grep","input":{"patter