{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_151","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will implement a comprehensive but pragmatic solution.\n\nThe implementation plan covers six files. `pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs` will hold the plate, instruments, hazards, and apply_look logic. `pav_ui/src/surgery/mod.rs` and `shell.rs` will manage the state machine and egui drawing. `headless.rs` will receive a new `draw_shell` method to avoid breaking the existing `Headless::frame` signature.\n\nThe headless renderer will use a new `surgery_frame` method. The UI flag and camera logic will account for the surgery state. Audio, product, hub, app, and settings changes are also planned. The default scene will not be altered; the surgery title will be packed with `--scene surgery/title`.\n\nThe window title will read \"TITLE\" when the scene starts with \"surgery\". The default engine binary scene remains \"town\". The packed page will use `--scene`.\n\nThe HUD will be empty. Existing starter tests will not break because they check the starter HUD.\n\nShell logic tests will live in `pav_ui/src/surgery/shell.rs` or `pav_ui/tests/surgery_shell.rs`. They can run without a GPU.\n\n`run_all.py`, pack injection, and `js-sys` / `window.__game` integration are also planned.\n\nrun_all.py will run three targeted test commands: `pav_core` surgery, `pav_ui` shell, and `pav_audio` music. It will capture output and print only failures. Ten seeds across eight cases at roughly two thousand ticks each should take about 0.3 seconds.\n\nThe bot retargets tools every tick when skill is below 0.2. A skill of zero should lose by overheating the laser and overdosing IV. The test will verify this behavior. If the bot does not lose, the bot logic or test input needs fixing.\n\nA random player will hold USE and switch tools each tick via tick % 11. Idle is the default input.\n\nSloppy rating requires spawning a hazard and holding the laser until auxiliary heat exceeds 1.08. The SpawnHazard implementation must be verified first.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d32cfc5-2b0b-4080-abda-eebd3482d543-71","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn command|SpawnHazard|fn spawn_hazard","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d32cfc5-2b0b-4080-abda-eebd3482d543-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs","offset":240,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d32cfc5-2b0b-4080-abda-eebd3482d543-73","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"js-sys","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/Cargo.toml"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d32cfc5-2b0b-4080-abda-eebd3482d543-74","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/Cargo.toml","offset":30,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1976,"output_tokens":1335,"cache_read_input_tokens":105344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"82e78240-cda4-40b0-afe8-0f58865b2854"}
