{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_160","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"On WASM, Sim is stored inside a RefCell on SimHost.\n\nA thread-local raw pointer to App will let JS closures access SimHost. App is owned uniquely by the game, so leaking a raw pointer avoids sharing it through Rc.\n\nThe closure will call `app.host.as_ref().unwrap().exec(|sim| ...)` to step the simulation. Setting the raw pointer before each frame prevents reentrancy panics, since Playwright evaluate runs on the same WASM thread.\n\nstatus() will return a thread-local JSON string built from the last published frame and shell state. This avoids reentering SimHost when called outside the Rust frame. The plan also requires step to run ticks immediately.\n\nstep() will advance the simulation immediately and rebuild the thread-local status string from the live Sim state. This prevents tests from seeing stale data until the next frame.\n\nThe status string will merge the simulation JSON with screen, device, and prompt state. Music will be embedded directly in the simulation status so the launch test can read it immediately.\n\n`do(json)` will parse shell commands like `{\"cmd\":\"confirm\"}` or `{\"cmd\":\"nav\",\"dir\":\"down\"}` and apply them.\n\n`do(json)` will also accept `tune`, `load`, and SurgeryCmd-like commands.\n\nOn WASM, the hub will read `window.__hub` each frame. If active, it waits for info before loading the card scene. It polls events, sends snapshots to clients, and calls ready() after the first frame.\n\nThe hub will start a countdown when the start event fires, then play the code blue scene with the provided seed once time reaches zero. Host snapshots will be sent at 15 Hz for clients to mirror. The shim will expose `H.server` and `H.players` flags so the hub can detect a server scenario and skip local drawing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-45e7b626-3af8-47c5-b8a5-62c522dbf7c5-88","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"ls -la \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer\" 2>/dev/null | head -40; echo '---hub---'; ls \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub\" 2>/dev/null | head","description":"List scratch and hub test files"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1721,"output_tokens":1311,"cache_read_input_tokens":116224,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"d54af592-1cfe-435c-8500-dbe3b8098a2f"}
