{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_191","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will add `apply_cmd` as a public wrapper and `LoadAttract`.\n\nI will add a compact `net_blob` and `apply_net` for network snapshots. I will also add `apply_mirror` to update vitals and hazards from numbers. The heart module is public.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b33427f1-72d7-46b8-a32e-ea9cc0ff1f20-133","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/hazard.rs","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b33427f1-72d7-46b8-a32e-ea9cc0ff1f20-134","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub fn spawn_kind_at|pub struct Hazard|pub x:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4002,"output_tokens":411,"cache_read_input_tokens":154752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"2cd0005b-53ea-4267-802a-93bab67f1404"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b33427f1-72d7-46b8-a32e-ea9cc0ff1f20-133","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→//! Hazards and the gesture each tool performs on them.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::kinds::*;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Hazard {\\n    pub id: u32,\\n10→    pub kind: u8,\\n    pub tool: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub radius: f32,\\n    pub work: f32,\\n    pub need: f32,\\n    pub drain: f32,\\n    pub alive: bool,\\n    pub hidden: bool,\\n20→    pub revealed: f32,\\n    pub stage: u8,\\n    pub stages: u8,\\n    pub axis: f32,\\n    /// Heat, frost, swell, or bone angle (degrees).\\n    pub aux: f32,\\n    /// Last signed side, or time since the last stitch.\\n    pub aux2: f32,\\n    pub samples: u8,\\n    pub samples_need: u8,\\n30→    pub quality: f32,\\n    pub grabbed: bool,\\n    pub grab_x: f32,\\n    pub grab_z: f32,\\n    pub bits: u8,\\n    pub priority: i16,\\n    pub tag: u8,\\n    /// Seconds since a tool last engaged this hazard. Work fades when this grows.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub idle: f32,\\n40→}\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! Hazards and the gesture each tool performs on them.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::kinds::*;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Hazard {\\n    pub id: u32,\\n10→    pub kind: u8,\\n    pub tool: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub radius: f32,\\n    pub work: f32,\\n    pub need: f32,\\n    pub drain: f32,\\n    pub alive: bool,\\n    pub hidden: bool,\\n20→    pub revealed: f32,\\n    pub stage: u8,\\n    pub stages: u8,\\n    pub axis: f32,\\n    /// Heat, frost, swell, or bone angle (degrees).\\n    pub aux: f32,\\n    /// Last signed side, or time since the last stitch.\\n    pub aux2: f32,\\n    pub samples: u8,\\n    pub samples_need: u8,\\n30→    pub quality: f32,\\n    pub grabbed: bool,\\n    pub grab_x: f32,\\n    pub grab_z: f32,\\n    pub bits: u8,\\n    pub priority: i16,\\n    pub tag: u8,\\n    /// Seconds since a tool last engaged this hazard. Work fades when this grows.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub idle: f32,\\n40→}\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/hazard.rs\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"//! Hazards and the gesture each tool performs on them.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\nuse super::kinds::*;\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\npub struct Hazard {\\n    pub id: u32,\\n    pub kind: u8,\\n    pub tool: u8,\\n    pub x: f32,\\n    pub z: f32,\\n    pub radius: f32,\\n    pub work: f32,\\n    pub need: f32,\\n    pub drain: f32,\\n    pub alive: bool,\\n    pub hidden: bool,\\n    pub revealed: f32,\\n    pub stage: u8,\\n    pub stages: u8,\\n    pub axis: f32,\\n    /// Heat, frost, swell, or bone angle (degrees).\\n    pub aux: f32,\\n    /// Last signed side, or time since the last stitch.\\n    pub aux2: f32,\\n    pub samples: u8,\\n    pub samples_need: u8,\\n    pub quality: f32,\\n    pub grabbed: bool,\\n    pub grab_x: f32,\\n    pub grab_z: f32,\\n    pub bits: u8,\\n    pub priority: i16,\\n    pub tag: u8,\\n    /// Seconds since a tool last engaged this hazard. Work fades when this grows.\\n    #[serde(default)]\\n    pub idle: f32,\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":642}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b33427f1-72d7-46b8-a32e-ea9cc0ff1f20-134","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,