,118,111,108,117,109,101,58,32,48,46,52,53,32,42,32,118,44,32,46,46,80,97,116,99,104,58,58,110,101,119,40,83,105,110,101,44,32,49,49,48,46,48,41,32,125,44,32,48,46,48,41,44,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":5,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\"pub struct Patch {\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"impl Patch {\"},{\"line_number\":214,\"content\":\"            Patch {\"},{\"line_number\":229,\"content\":\"                (Patch { decay: 0.12, volume: 0.35 * v, cutoff: 1100.0, cutoff_end: 200.0, ..Patch::new(Noise, 1.0) }, 0.0),\"},{\"line_number\":230,\"content\":\"                (Patch { freq_end: 45.0, glide: 0.1, decay: 0.14, volume: 0.45 * v, ..Patch::new(Sine, 110.0) }, 0.0),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"eb9355ec-42a4-45e5-a3db-db7ac586621e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_196","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Adding fields with defaults to `new()` is safe because all code uses `..Patch::new`.\n\nVoice struct needs formant state. A simple biquad filter is too complex because `next()` lacks sample rate. Two one-pole filters at the formant frequency will be mixed in instead.\n\nThe formant filter uses exponential smoothing with `dt` to avoid a sample rate. `formant_hz` and `formant_hz2` default to 0. Next is a music scheduler in `music.rs` that plays notes with delay.\n\nThe scheduler will use twelve named tracks. It schedules notes for a beat range and renders a track to audio. Melodies are stored as (beat, midi, duration) arrays. A dedicated music bus is added. Mixer fields are made public so tests can inspect defaults.\n\n`play()` routes to `play_on(BUS_EFFECTS)`. The stored voice gain already includes the bus gain, so live bus changes won't affect currently playing notes. Music volume defaults to 0.10 and cue sounds use bus 0.80. Tests will assert rendered track peaks are above 0.001.\n\nCue events now include position for panning. They are handled before the wildcard in `sounds_for` and mapped to unique IDs 1–31. A new `shell.rs` module defines a `Screen` enum with eleven states and per-screen item slices.\n\nThe shell input handler returns a vector of `Cmd` actions. These cover campaign loading, case selection, code loading, difficulty setting, retry, quit, tune control, dev mode, and story confirmation. A `prompt` function generates strings for UI and tests. The About screen lists four sections plus an import usage note. On touch devices the title screen shows only the sentence and Settings button; other buttons are hidden. The attract screen still appears after ten seconds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0d01f226-e130-4bf6-b559-1fed44e5719e-139","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":1,"limit":35}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":498,"output_tokens":1364,"cache_read_input_tokens":163840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"5b4f9856-e085-4357-9d5e-a274f447ac89"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0d01f226-e130-4bf6-b559-1fed44e5719e-139","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→//! Hands of Harbor: overhead surgical action in the Night Ward.\\n//!\\n//! Rules live here. The shell, the mesh and the speakers read [`frame::SurgeryFrame`].\\n\\nmod bot;\\nmod content;\\nmod hazard;\\nmod heart;\\nmod ops;\\n10→mod story;\\nmod tune;\\n\\npub mod frame;\\npub mod kinds;\\n\\npub use content::{case_def, CASES};\\npub use frame::SurgeryFrame;\\npub use hazard::Hazard;\\npub use heart::Heart;\\n20→pub use kinds::*;\\npub use tune::Tune;\\n\\nuse std::sync::Arc;\\n\\nuse anyhow::Result;\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\nuse serde_json::json;\\n\\n30→use super::{Game, GameBox, Outcome};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput, SurgeryCmd};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub const M_TITLE: u8 = 0;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! Hands of Harbor: overhead surgical action in the Night Ward.\\n//!\\n//! Rules live here. The shell, the mesh and the speakers read [`frame::SurgeryFrame`].\\n\\nmod bot;\\nmod content;\\nmod hazard;\\nmod heart;\\nmod ops;\\n10→mod story;\\nmod tune;\\n\\npub mod frame;\\npub mod kinds;\\n\\npub use content::{case_def, CASES};\\npub use frame::SurgeryFrame;\\npub use hazard::Hazard;\\npub use heart::Heart;\\n20→pub use kinds::*;\\npub use tune::Tune;\\n\\nuse std::sync::Arc;\\n\\nuse anyhow::Result;\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\nuse serde_json::json;\\n\\n30→use super::{Game, GameBox, Outcome};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput, SurgeryCmd};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub const M_TITLE: u8 = 0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":35,\"raw_output\":\"//! Hands of Harbor: overhead surgical action in the Night Ward.\\n//!\\n//! Rules live here. The shell, the mesh and the speakers read [`frame::SurgeryFrame`].\\n\\nmod bot;\\nmod content;\\nmod hazard;\\nmod heart;\\nmod ops;\\nmod story;\\nmod tune;\\n\\npub mod frame;\\npub mod kinds;\\n\\npub use content::{case_def, CASES};\\npub use frame::SurgeryFrame;\\npub use hazard::Hazard;\\npub use heart::Heart;\\npub use kinds::*;\\npub use tune::Tune;\\n\\nuse std::sync::Arc;\\n\\nuse anyhow::Result;\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\nuse serde_json::json;\\n\\nuse super::{Game, GameBox, Outcome};\\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, InputFrame, SurgeonInput, SurgeryCmd};\\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\\n\\npub const M_TITLE: u8 = 0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":1010}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"0c4dc747-ab2c-4af1-8af3-708bff2c165a"}
