{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_198","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Starting to write all the required files.\n\nDrafting the Harbor struct in product.rs with fields for shell, cursors, tool selection, music state, network connections, and game status.\n\nDefined the NetHand struct for network player data. Outlined the surgery_frame execution sequence: install the game once, poll hub and input devices, execute steps if remaining, pump the frame, read results, apply camera, build the scene, and handle server-side rendering.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-65e27590-861d-4b7f-a1e4-a45719c2f651-141","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"egui_ctx\\.|egui_state","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":416,"output_tokens":633,"cache_read_input_tokens":165888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"edc422f2-7649-42fd-a267-4453560d264e"}
