{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_200","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A simpler egui path will be used for the surgery.\n\nThe egui zoom will be set via `pixels_per_point` using the window height scaled to 1080 points. This matches the plan's zoom formula.\n\n`pixels_per_point` will be set on the egui context before `run_ui`, overriding the value from `UiInput::take`. This keeps the logical height at 1080 points regardless of DPI.\n\nFonts will be installed once during shell initialization via `ctx.set_fonts`. The surgery window event handler will record touches for UI but not gameplay, pass touch events to egui for the Settings button, exit on close, resize the graphics context, redraw frames, route keyboard input while resuming audio, and handle mouse input without wheel zoom or right-drag. An early branch must intercept these events before the engine match, yet still allow egui to receive clicks.\n\nThe surgery path will mirror the existing `egui_state.on_window_event` call first, then handle input directly without camera logic. A `surgery_mode()` check using `scene_name.starts_with(\"surgery\")` will gate both the window event handler and the frame loop. The scene is already set from settings before the window exists, so this check is safe.\n\nThe frame loop returns early when graphics are not ready, but `about_to_wait` still requests a redraw. The window title and error messages will use `pav_core::games::surgery::TITLE` for surgery scenes instead of \"Shardfall\". The launch test checks both the window title and page errors.\n\nThe HTML document title is set by the packer, and winit on web may mirror the window title into it. Since main.rs fatal errors fire before settings load, they cannot easily check the scene name. The simpler fix is to update fail() and the window title directly.\n\nThe console log line \"Shardfall\" in main.rs is not a page error. The test checks for visible window title and overlay text, not console output. I will still change the wasm main log and fatal error messages to use the game title when the scene query or baked scene indicates surgery.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d70b26d2-c876-4480-9c64-0156fc243c0f-144","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub struct UiInput|pub fn take|pub fn platform_output|pub fn on_window_event","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/uiinput.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2804,"output_tokens":1516,"cache_read_input_tokens":167296,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"ca962efa-73ba-437d-a916-fe14dbd66a00"}
