{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_213","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Adding a Harbor product before the fatal call.\n\nAdding `#[path = \"product.rs\"] mod product;` to app.rs. Rust 2018 file modules look for submodules in `app/product.rs` by default, so the explicit path is needed to locate `product.rs` beside `app.rs`.\n\nAdding `#[path = \"hub.rs\"] mod hub;` inside product.rs. The path resolves relative to src/. Product will be split into product.rs and hub.rs.\n\nPlanning to place the WASM `__game` installation hook in `hub.rs` as `install_game_hook`.\n\nAnticipating common compile errors and API changes across egui, egui-wgpu, winit, gilrs, and egui-geometry to avoid them.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e481615f-da39-4220-92e0-d94620d4361b-159","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"surgery:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/frame.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":371,"output_tokens":741,"cache_read_input_tokens":183808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"eb486bd5-3cec-4ba9-ab84-179fc3a92195"}
