{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_214","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Starting to write the files, beginning with the largest ones.\n\nPaper cards will stay modest to keep compilation and runtime fast. A content README is being added. The tests/run_all.py script will run cargo tests, suppress passing output, and report only failures with a summary. It will aggregate results from shell and audio tests. Rust tests serve as the fallback if the browser cannot start.\n\nAdding a pav_view test to the suite. The run_all.py script will invoke cargo tests for surgery, shell, plate, and audio cues. Audio tests will live in lib.rs under cfg(test), while the view test goes in pav_view/tests/surgery_plate.rs. The script must run from the engine-link symlink path with CARGO_TARGET_DIR set to work/.harbor-target.\n\nThe script will locate the engine symlink via `Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]` and run cargo from that directory with `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` and `CARGO_BUILD_JOBS` set. It will not modify `HOME`. Next, the view module is being written with careful attention to grid memory.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The operation rules already clear a full campaign. I’m adding the overhead plate, the product frame, and the shell so the packed page is this game rather than the engine demo."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b20c0fe-4396-4c68-b90a-4c8980b027f5-160","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs","new_string":"//! Overhead operative field, instruments, and paper-theatre cards.\n//! One dynamic mesh paints the plate. Lights and the camera are applied last so view settings cannot override them.\n\nuse glam::Vec3;\nuse pav_core::games::surgery::frame::{CameraShot, SurgeryFrame};\nuse pav_core::games::surgery::kinds::*;\nuse pav_render::mesh::{MeshData, Vertex};\nuse pav_render::scene::{self as rs, DynamicMesh, Scene, SdfInstance, Style};\n\nconst NX: usize = 420;\nconst NZ: usize = 240;\n\npub fn emit(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\n    scene.dynamic.push(plate(op));\n    instruments(scene, op);\n    hazards(scene, op);\n    if op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 1 || op.mode == 4 || op.mode == 6 {\n        paper(scene, op);\n    }\n}\n\npub fn apply_look(scene: &mut Scene, rig: &crate::camera::CameraRig, aspect: f32, shot: &CameraShot) {\n    let mut rig = rig.clone();\n    rig.params.tilt = shot.tilt;\n    rig.params.yaw = shot.yaw;\n    rig.params.distance = shot.distance;\n    rig.params.fov = shot.fov_deg;\n    rig.params.ortho = false;\n    rig.params.follow_lag = shot.follow_lag;\n    rig.params.height_offset = shot.height_offset;\n    rig.blend = None;\n    rig.snap(shot.target);\n    scene.camera = rig.data(aspect);\n    scene.sun.direction = Vec3::new(-0.25, -1.0, -0.35).normalize();\n    scene.sun.color = Vec3::new(1.0, 0.97, 0.90) * 0.42;\n    scene.sun.shadows = true;\n    scene.sun.shadow_center = shot.target;\n    scene.sun.shadow_radius = 16.0;\n    scene.ambient.sky = Vec3::new(0.50, 0.50, 0.54);\n    scene.ambient.ground = Vec3::new(0.30, 0.22, 0.22);\n    scene.point_lights.clear();\n    scene.point_lights.push(rs::PointLight {\n        position: Vec3::new(-1.0, 7.0, -1.0),\n        color: Vec3::new(1.0, 0.97, 0.9) * 0.9,\n        radius: 16.0,\n        shadows: true,\n    });\n    scene.clear_color = rs::srgb(16, 40, 44);\n    scene.style.cel_bands = 3.0;\n    scene.style.rim = 0.12;\n    scene.post.outline_darken = 0.45;\n    scene.post.outlines = true;\n    scene.post.bloom = 0.35;\n    scene.post.bloom_threshold = 1.15;\n    scene.post.gi = 0.6;\n    scene.filter.vignette = 0.35;\n}\n\nfn plate(op: &SurgeryFrame) -> DynamicMesh {\n    let mut data = MeshData::default();\n    let nx = NX;\n    let nz = NZ;\n    data.vertices.reserve(nx * nz);\n    let pulse = if op.flat { 0.0 } else { (op.phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin() * 0.012 * (0.4 + op.vitals / 160.0) };\n    let mut hgt = vec![0.0f32; nx * nz];\n    for j in 0..nz {\n        for i in 0..nx {\n            let x = -11.0 + i as f32 / (nx - 1) as f32 * 22.0;\n            let z = -6.3 + j as f32 / (nz - 1) as f32 * 12.6;\n            let (elev, color) = vertex_paint(op, x, z, pulse);\n            hgt[j * nx + i] = elev;\n            data.vertices.push(Vertex {\n                pos: [x, elev, z],\n                normal: [0.0, 1.0, 0.0],\n                uv: [i as f32 / (nx - 1) as f32, j as f32 / (nz - 1) as f32],\n                color: [color.x, color.y, color.z, 1.0],\n            });\n        }\n    }\n    for j in 0..nz {\n        for i in 0..nx {\n            let h = |a: usize, b: usize| hgt[b.min(nz - 1) * nx + a.min(nx - 1)];\n            let dx = (h(i + 1, j) - h(i.saturating_sub(1), j)) / 0.11;\n            let dz = (h(i, j + 1) - h(i, j.saturating_sub(1))) / 0.11;\n            let n = Vec3::new(-dx, 1.0, -dz).normalize_or_zero();\n            let n = if n.length_squared() > 0.5 { n } else { Vec3::Y };\n            let idx = j * nx + i;\n            data.vertices[idx].normal = [n.x, n.y, n.z];\n            if n.y > 0.92 && hgt[idx] > 0.15 {\n                let c = &mut data.vertices[idx].color;\n                c[0] = (c[0] + 0.18).min(1.0);\n                c[1] = (c[1] + 0.12).min(1.0);\n                c[2] = (c[2] + 0.10).min(1.0);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    for j in 0..nz - 1 {\n        for i in 0..nx - 1 {\n            let i00 = (j * nx + i) as u32;\n            let i10 = i00 + 1;\n            let i01 = i00 + nx as u32;\n            let i11 = i01 + 1;\n            data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[i00, i01, i10, i10, i01, i11]);\n        }\n    }\n    debug_assert!(data.vertices.iter().all(|v| v.pos.iter().all(|c| c.is_finite())));\n    DynamicMesh {\n        data,\n        color: Vec3::ONE,\n        emissive: 0.0,\n        style: Style::Cel,\n        flags: 0,\n        group: 2,\n        material: 0,\n    }\n}\n\nfn vertex_paint(op: &SurgeryFrame, x: f32, z: f32, pulse: f32) -> (f32, Vec3) {\n    let bed = rs::srgb(74, 22, 30);\n    let flesh = rs::srgb(214, 92, 84);\n    let top = rs::srgb(246, 150, 128);\n    let vein = rs::srgb(150, 40, 60);\n    let cut = rs::srgb(44, 8, 14);\n    let pool = rs::srgb(120, 6, 16);\n    let drape = rs::srgb(34, 112, 116);\n    let dx = x;\n    let dz = z - 0.15;\n    let lobe = 1.0 - dx * dx / 22.0 - dz * dz / 9.0;\n    let n = hash(x, z);\n    let n2 = hash(x * 1.7 + 4.0, z * 1.3 - 2.0);\n    let elev = if lobe > 0.0 {\n        1.25 * lobe.powf(0.55) + (n - 0.5) * 0.045 + pulse\n    } else {\n        (n - 0.5) * 0.01\n    };\n    let mut elev = elev.max(0.0);\n    let mut color = if lobe <= 0.02 {\n        drape\n    } else {\n        let t = (elev / 1.15).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n        let mid = flesh.lerp(top, (t - 0.35).clamp(0.0, 1.0));\n        bed.lerp(mid, (t * 1.4).clamp(0.0, 1.0))\n    };\n    if lobe > 0.05 && n2 > 0.78 {\n        color = color.lerp(vein, 0.65);\n        elev += 0.01;\n    }\n    if lobe > 0.08 && n > 0.93 && n2 < 0.4 {\n        color = color.lerp(pool, 0.8);\n        elev = (elev - 0.03).max(0.02);\n    }\n    for h in &op.hazards {\n        if !h.alive {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let d = ((x - h.x).powi(2) + (z - h.z).powi(2)).sqrt();\n        if d < h.radius + 0.15 {\n            let k = (1.0 - d / (h.radius + 0.15)).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n            match h.kind {\n                K_POOL | K_BLEEDER => {\n                    color = color.lerp(pool, 0.75 * k);\n                    elev = (elev - 0.04 * k).max(0.0);\n                }\n                K_LACERATION | K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\n                    color = color.lerp(cut, 0.85 * k);\n                    elev = (elev - 0.05 * k).max(0.0);\n                }\n                K_BURN | K_HEAT => {\n                    color = color.lerp(rs::srgb(90, 30, 24), 0.5 * k);\n                }\n                _ => {\n                    elev += 0.04 * k;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    if !elev.is_finite() {\n        elev = 0.0;\n    }\n    (elev, color)\n}\n\nfn hash(x: f32, z: f32) -> f32 {\n    let xi = (x * 32.0).floor() as i32;\n    let zi = (z * 32.0).floor() as i32;\n    let mut n = xi.wrapping_mul(374761393) ^ zi.wrapping_mul(668265263);\n    n = (n ^ (n >> 13)).wrapping_mul(1274126177);\n    (n as u32 & 0xffff) as f32 / 65535.0\n}\n\nfn instruments(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\n    let steel = rs::srgb(186, 196, 204);\n    let grip = rs::srgb(40, 78, 86);\n    for (i, c) in op.cursors.iter().enumerate() {\n        if !c.active && op.mode == 3 && i > 0 {\n            continue;\n        }\n        if op.mode != 3 && op.mode != 6 && op.mode != 8 && i > 0 {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let show = c.active || i == 0;\n        if !show && op.mode != 0 {\n            continue;\n        }\n        if op.mode == 0 {\n            break;\n        }\n        let y = 0.55 + if c.tool == op.cursors[0].tool { 0.12 } else { 0.0 };\n        let origin = Vec3::new(c.x, y, c.z);\n        let tint = Vec3::new(c.color[0], c.color[1], c.color[2]);\n        tool_mesh(scene, c.tool, origin, steel.lerp(tint, 0.25), grip, 40 + i as u32);\n    }\n    if op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 6 {\n        for t in 0..8 {\n            let x = -3.5 + t as f32 * 1.0;\n            let z = 5.4;\n            let lift = op.cursors.first().map(|c| c.tool == t as u8).unwrap_or(false);\n            let y = if lift { 0.42 } else { 0.22 };\n            tool_mesh(scene, t as u8, Vec3::new(x, y, z), steel, grip, 20 + t as u32);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn tool_mesh(scene: &mut Scene, tool: u8, at: Vec3, steel: Vec3, grip: Vec3, group: u32) {\n    let tip = match tool {\n        FORCEPS => Vec3::new(0.18, 0.05, 0.34),\n        LASER | CRYO => Vec3::new(0.0, 0.08, 0.42),\n        DEFIB => Vec3::new(0.22, 0.02, 0.1),\n        _ => Vec3::new(0.0, 0.02, 0.38),\n    };\n    let mut a = SdfInstance::capsule(at, at + tip, 0.035, steel);\n    a.style = Style::Lit;\n    a.group = group;\n    scene.sdfs.push(a);\n    let mut b = SdfInstance::capsule(at, at + Vec3::new(-0.05, 0.02, -0.28), 0.045, grip);\n    b.style = Style::Lit;\n    b.group = group;\n    scene.sdfs.push(b);\n    if tool == DEFIB {\n        let mut pad = SdfInstance::capsule(at + Vec3::new(0.16, 0.04, 0.12), at + Vec3::new(-0.16, 0.04, 0.12), 0.06, steel);\n        pad.style = Style::Lit;\n        pad.group = group;\n        scene.sdfs.push(pad);\n    }\n}\n\nfn hazards(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\n    let parasite = rs::srgb(58, 26, 96);\n    let core = rs::srgb(36, 18, 66);\n    let eye = rs::srgb(255, 210, 70);\n    let sac = rs::srgb(120, 255, 170);\n    let ember = rs::srgb(255, 120, 40);\n    for h in &op.hazards {\n        if !h.alive || h.hidden && h.kind != K_FOREIGN {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let p = Vec3::new(h.x, 0.35 + h.work * 0.05, h.z);\n        match h.kind {\n            K_SAC => {\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p, h.radius.max(0.18) * (0.7 + h.aux.min(1.2) * 0.4), sac);\n                s.emissive = 0.75;\n                s.style = Style::Unlit;\n                s.group = 80 + (h.id % 40);\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\n            }\n            K_EYE => {\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p + Vec3::Y * 0.1, 0.16, eye);\n                s.emissive = 1.6;\n                s.style = Style::Unlit;\n                s.group = 120;\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\n                let mut body = SdfInstance::sphere(p, 0.28, parasite);\n                body.style = Style::Cel;\n                body.group = 121;\n                scene.sdfs.push(body);\n            }\n            K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_TUMOR | K_TENDRIL => {\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p, h.radius.max(0.16), parasite);\n                s.style = Style::Cel;\n                s.group = 140 + (h.id % 30);\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\n                let mut c = SdfInstance::sphere(p + Vec3::Y * 0.08, 0.07, core);\n                c.emissive = 0.4;\n                c.style = Style::Unlit;\n                c.group = 170;\n                scene.sdfs.push(c);\n            }\n            K_EMBER => {\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p, 0.14, ember);\n                s.emissive = 1.2;\n                s.style = Style::Unlit;\n                s.group = 200 + (h.id % 20);\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\n            }\n            K_FOREIGN => {\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::capsule(p, p + Vec3::new(0.2, 0.05, 0.05), 0.05, rs::srgb(210, 210, 200));\n                s.style = Style::Lit;\n                s.group = 220;\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\n            }\n            _ => {}\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn paper(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\n    let who = if op.story_who.is_empty() { \"Mara Quill\" } else { op.story_who.as_str() };\n    let expr = (op.elapsed as u32 % 4) as u8;\n    let left = card_mesh(who, expr, -2.6);\n    let right_name = match who {\n        \"Mara Quill\" => \"Pet Nwosu\",\n        \"Pet Nwosu\" => \"Bashir Haddad\",\n        \"Bashir Haddad\" => \"Ottoline Voss\",\n        \"Ottoline Voss\" => \"Teddy Lark\",\n        \"Cordelia Vane\" => \"Mara Quill\",\n        _ => \"Ottoline Voss\",\n    };\n    let right = card_mesh(right_name, (expr + 1) % 4, 2.6);\n    scene.dynamic.push(left);\n    scene.dynamic.push(right);\n    let _ = op;\n}\n\nfn card_mesh(who: &str, expr: u8, x: f32) -> DynamicMesh {\n    let (skin, shade, hair, cloth) = palette(who);\n    let mut data = MeshData::default();\n    push_part(&mut data, &body_poly(), x, 0.15, cloth, 0.06);\n    push_part(&mut data, &head_poly(), x, 1.55, skin, 0.05);\n    push_part(&mut data, &hair_poly(who), x, 1.72, hair, 0.04);\n    push_part(&mut data, &cheek_poly(), x + 0.18, 1.48, shade, 0.02);\n    push_part(&mut data, &mouth_poly(expr), x, 1.28, shade, 0.015);\n    if data.vertices.is_empty() {\n        data.vertices.push(Vertex { pos: [x, 0.2, -3.2], normal: [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], uv: [0.0, 0.0], color: [1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0] });\n    }\n    DynamicMesh {\n        data,\n        color: Vec3::ONE,\n        emissive: 0.02,\n        style: Style::Cel,\n        flags: rs::flags::NO_SHADOW,\n        group: 300 + (x.abs() as u32),\n        material: 0,\n    }\n}\n\nfn palette(who: &str) -> (Vec3, Vec3, Vec3, Vec3) {\n    match who {\n        \"Pet Nwosu\" => (rs::srgb(122, 80, 58), rs::srgb(92, 58, 44), rs::srgb(226, 226, 232), rs::srgb(98, 70, 136)),\n        \"Bashir Haddad\" => (rs::srgb(190, 142, 104), rs::srgb(160, 112, 80), rs::srgb(40, 32, 28), rs::srgb(60, 104, 164)),\n        \"Teddy Lark\" => (rs::srgb(232, 196, 170), rs::srgb(200, 150, 130), rs::srgb(180, 90, 40), rs::srgb(70, 120, 110)),\n        \"Ottoline Voss\" => (rs::srgb(230, 200, 186), rs::srgb(190, 150, 140), rs::srgb(80, 80, 88), rs::srgb(48, 56, 72)),\n        \"Cordelia Vane\" => (rs::srgb(214, 170, 140), rs::srgb(170, 120, 100), rs::srgb(30, 28, 36), rs::srgb(120, 48, 62)),\n        _ => (rs::srgb(242, 200, 172), rs::srgb(214, 158, 136), rs::srgb(46, 36, 60), rs::srgb(46, 150, 146)),\n    }\n}\n\nfn body_poly() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\n    vec![\n        [-0.7, 0.0],\n        [-0.85, 0.7],\n        [-0.45, 1.05],\n        [0.0, 1.15],\n        [0.45, 1.05],\n        [0.85, 0.7],\n        [0.7, 0.0],\n    ]\n}\n\nfn head_poly() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\n    let mut v = Vec::new();\n    for i in 0..14 {\n        let a = i as f32 / 14.0 * std::f32::consts::TAU;\n        v.push([a.cos() * 0.38, a.sin() * 0.46]);\n    }\n    v\n}\n\nfn hair_poly(who: &str) -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\n    let wide = if who == \"Pet Nwosu\" { 0.5 } else { 0.42 };\n    vec![[-wide, -0.05], [-wide * 0.8, 0.35], [0.0, 0.48], [wide * 0.8, 0.35], [wide, -0.05], [0.2, 0.05], [-0.2, 0.05]]\n}\n\nfn cheek_poly() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\n    vec![[-0.12, -0.06], [0.12, -0.02], [0.08, 0.08], [-0.1, 0.06]]\n}\n\nfn mouth_poly(expr: u8) -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\n    match expr % 4 {\n        1 => vec![[-0.12, 0.02], [0.0, -0.08], [0.12, 0.02], [0.0, 0.08]],\n        2 => vec![[-0.14, 0.04], [0.14, 0.04], [0.1, -0.02], [-0.1, -0.02]],\n        3 => vec![[-0.12, -0.02], [0.0, 0.06], [0.12, -0.02], [0.0, -0.06]],\n        _ => vec![[-0.12, 0.0], [0.12, 0.0], [0.08, -0.03], [-0.08, -0.03]],\n    }\n}\n\nfn push_part(data: &mut MeshData, poly: &[[f32; 2]], x: f32, y: f32, color: Vec3, depth: f32) {\n    let smooth = chaikin(poly, 2);\n    if smooth.len() < 3 {\n        return;\n    }\n    let z0 = -3.4;\n    let base = data.vertices.len() as u32;\n    for p in &smooth {\n        data.vertices.push(vert(x + p[0], y + p[1], z0, [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], color));\n    }\n    for p in &smooth {\n        data.vertices.push(vert(x + p[0], y + p[1], z0 - depth, [0.0, 0.0, -1.0], color * 0.72));\n    }\n    let n = smooth.len() as u32;\n    let tris = triangulate(&smooth);\n    for (a, b, c) in tris {\n        data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[base + a, base + b, base + c]);\n        data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[base + n + a, base + n + c, base + n + b]);\n    }\n    for i in 0..n {\n        let j = (i + 1) % n;\n        data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[base + i, base + n + i, base + j, base + j, base + n + i, base + n + j]);\n    }\n}\n\nfn vert(x: f32, y: f32, z: f32, n: [f32; 3], color: Vec3) -> Vertex {\n    Vertex { pos: [x, y, z], normal: n, uv: [0.5, 0.5], color: [color.x, color.y, color.z, 1.0] }\n}\n\nfn chaikin(pts: &[[f32; 2]], n: usize) -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\n    let mut p = pts.to_vec();\n    for _ in 0..n {\n        if p.len() < 3 {\n            break;\n        }\n        let mut q = Vec::with_capacity(p.len() * 2);\n        for i in 0..p.len() {\n            let a = p[i];\n            let b = p[(i + 1) % p.len()];\n            q.push([a[0] * 0.75 + b[0] * 0.25, a[1] * 0.75 + b[1] * 0.25]);\n            q.push([a[0] * 0.25 + b[0] * 0.75, a[1] * 0.25 + b[1] * 0.75]);\n        }\n        p = q;\n    }\n    p\n}\n\nfn triangulate(poly: &[[f32; 2]]) -> Vec<(u32, u32, u32)> {\n    let mut idx: Vec<u32> = (0..poly.len() as u32).collect();\n    let mut out = Vec::new();\n    let mut guard = 0;\n    while idx.len() > 3 && guard < 64 {\n        guard += 1;\n        let mut clipped = false;\n        let n = idx.len();\n        for i in 0..n {\n            let a = idx[(i + n - 1) % n] as usize;\n            let b = idx[i] as usize;\n            let c = idx[(i + 1) % n] as usize;\n            if ear(poly, a, b, c, &idx) {\n                out.push((a as u32, b as u32, c as u32));\n                idx.remove(i);\n                clipped = true;\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n        if !clipped {\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    if idx.len() == 3 {\n        out.push((idx[0], idx[1], idx[2]));\n    }\n    out\n}\n\nfn ear(poly: &[[f32; 2]], a: usize, b: usize, c: usize, rest: &[u32]) -> bool {\n    let (pa, pb, pc) = (poly[a], poly[b], poly[c]);\n    let cross = (pb[0] - pa[0]) * (pc[1] - pa[1]) - (pb[1] - pa[1]) * (pc[0] - pa[0]);\n    if cross <= 0.0 {\n        return false;\n    }\n    for &i in rest {\n        let i = i as usize;\n        if i == a || i == b || i == c {\n            continue;\n        }\n        if inside(poly[i], pa, pb, pc) {\n            return false;\n        }\n    }\n    true\n}\n\nfn inside(p: [f32; 2], a: [f32; 2], b: [f32; 2], c: [f32; 2]) -> bool {\n    let s = |u: [f32; 2], v: [f32; 2]| (p[0] - u[0]) * (v[1] - u[1]) - (p[1] - u[1]) * (v[0] - u[0]);\n    let d1 = s(a, b);\n    let d2 = s(b, c);\n    let d3 = s(c, a);\n    (d1 >= 0.0 && d2 >= 0.0 && d3 >= 0.0) || (d1 <= 0.0 && d2 <= 0.0 && d3 <= 0.0)\n}\n","old_string":""}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b20c0fe-4396-4c68-b90a-4c8980b027f5-161","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/lib.rs","old_string":"pub mod arpg;\npub mod assets;\npub mod build;\npub mod camera;\npub mod creatures;\npub mod fx;\npub mod look;\npub mod materials;\npub mod vehicles;\npub mod water;","new_string":"pub mod arpg;\npub mod assets;\npub mod build;\npub mod camera;\npub mod creatures;\npub mod fx;\npub mod look;\npub mod materials;\npub mod surgery;\npub mod vehicles;\npub mod water;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b20c0fe-4396-4c68-b90a-4c8980b027f5-162","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/build.rs","old_string":"        lock(&self.materials).attach(&mut scene);\n        scene\n    }\n}","new_string":"        lock(&self.materials).attach(&mut scene);\n        if let Some(op) = curr.surgery.as_deref() {\n            crate::surgery::emit(&mut scene, op);\n            crate::surgery::apply_look(&mut scene, rig, aspect, &op.camera);\n        }\n        scene\n    }\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":998,"output_tokens":7857,"cache_read_input_tokens":184064,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"5f202763-664d-49b8-8b70-948cdae9d840"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4b20c0fe-4396-4c68-b90a-4c8980b027f5-160","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"//! Overhead operative field, instruments, and paper-theatre cards.\\n//! One dynamic mesh paints the plate. Lights and the camera are applied last so view settings cannot override them.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\nuse pav_core::games::surgery::frame::{CameraShot, SurgeryFrame};\\nuse pav_core::games::surgery::kinds::*;\\nuse pav_render::mesh::{MeshData, Vertex};\\nuse pav_render::scene::{self as rs, DynamicMesh, Scene, SdfInstance, Style};\\n\\nconst NX: usize = 420;\\nconst NZ: usize = 240;\\n\\npub fn emit(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\\n    scene.dynamic.push(plate(op));\\n    instruments(scene, op);\\n    hazards(scene, op);\\n    if op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 1 || op.mode == 4 || op.mode == 6 {\\n        paper(scene, op);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn apply_look(scene: &mut Scene, rig: &crate::camera::CameraRig, aspect: f32, shot: &CameraShot) {\\n    let mut rig = rig.clone();\\n    rig.params.tilt = shot.tilt;\\n    rig.params.yaw = shot.yaw;\\n    rig.params.distance = shot.distance;\\n    rig.params.fov = shot.fov_deg;\\n    rig.params.ortho = false;\\n    rig.params.follow_lag = shot.follow_lag;\\n    rig.params.height_offset = shot.height_offset;\\n    rig.blend = None;\\n    rig.snap(shot.target);\\n    scene.camera = rig.data(aspect);\\n    scene.sun.direction = Vec3::new(-0.25, -1.0, -0.35).normalize();\\n    scene.sun.color = Vec3::new(1.0, 0.97, 0.90) * 0.42;\\n    scene.sun.shadows = true;\\n    scene.sun.shadow_center = shot.target;\\n    scene.sun.shadow_radius = 16.0;\\n    scene.ambient.sky = Vec3::new(0.50, 0.50, 0.54);\\n    scene.ambient.ground = Vec3::new(0.30, 0.22, 0.22);\\n    scene.point_lights.clear();\\n    scene.point_lights.push(rs::PointLight {\\n        position: Vec3::new(-1.0, 7.0, -1.0),\\n        color: Vec3::new(1.0, 0.97, 0.9) * 0.9,\\n        radius: 16.0,\\n        shadows: true,\\n    });\\n    scene.clear_color = rs::srgb(16, 40, 44);\\n    scene.style.cel_bands = 3.0;\\n    scene.style.rim = 0.12;\\n    scene.post.outline_darken = 0.45;\\n    scene.post.outlines = true;\\n    scene.post.bloom = 0.35;\\n    scene.post.bloom_threshold = 1.15;\\n    scene.post.gi = 0.6;\\n    scene.filter.vignette = 0.35;\\n}\\n\\nfn plate(op: &SurgeryFrame) -> DynamicMesh {\\n    let mut data = MeshData::default();\\n    let nx = NX;\\n    let nz = NZ;\\n    data.vertices.reserve(nx * nz);\\n    let pulse = if op.flat { 0.0 } else { (op.phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin() * 0.012 * (0.4 + op.vitals / 160.0) };\\n    let mut hgt = vec![0.0f32; nx * nz];\\n    for j in 0..nz {\\n        for i in 0..nx {\\n            let x = -11.0 + i as f32 / (nx - 1) as f32 * 22.0;\\n            let z = -6.3 + j as f32 / (nz - 1) as f32 * 12.6;\\n            let (elev, color) = vertex_paint(op, x, z, pulse);\\n            hgt[j * nx + i] = elev;\\n            data.vertices.push(Vertex {\\n                pos: [x, elev, z],\\n                normal: [0.0, 1.0, 0.0],\\n                uv: [i as f32 / (nx - 1) as f32, j as f32 / (nz - 1) as f32],\\n                color: [color.x, color.y, color.z, 1.0],\\n            });\\n        }\\n    }\\n    for j in 0..nz {\\n        for i in 0..nx {\\n            let h = |a: usize, b: usize| hgt[b.min(nz - 1) * nx + a.min(nx - 1)];\\n            let dx = (h(i + 1, j) - h(i.saturating_sub(1), j)) / 0.11;\\n            let dz = (h(i, j + 1) - h(i, j.saturating_sub(1))) / 0.11;\\n            let n = Vec3::new(-dx, 1.0, -dz).normalize_or_zero();\\n            let n = if n.length_squared() > 0.5 { n } else { Vec3::Y };\\n            let idx = j * nx + i;\\n            data.vertices[idx].normal = [n.x, n.y, n.z];\\n            if n.y > 0.92 && hgt[idx] > 0.15 {\\n                let c = &mut data.vertices[idx].color;\\n                c[0] = (c[0] + 0.18).min(1.0);\\n                c[1] = (c[1] + 0.12).min(1.0);\\n                c[2] = (c[2] + 0.10).min(1.0);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    for j in 0..nz - 1 {\\n        for i in 0..nx - 1 {\\n            let i00 = (j * nx + i) as u32;\\n            let i10 = i00 + 1;\\n            let i01 = i00 + nx as u32;\\n            let i11 = i01 + 1;\\n            data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[i00, i01, i10, i10, i01, i11]);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    debug_assert!(data.vertices.iter().all(|v| v.pos.iter().all(|c| c.is_finite())));\\n    DynamicMesh {\\n        data,\\n        color: Vec3::ONE,\\n        emissive: 0.0,\\n        style: Style::Cel,\\n        flags: 0,\\n        group: 2,\\n        material: 0,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn vertex_paint(op: &SurgeryFrame, x: f32, z: f32, pulse: f32) -> (f32, Vec3) {\\n    let bed = rs::srgb(74, 22, 30);\\n    let flesh = rs::srgb(214, 92, 84);\\n    let top = rs::srgb(246, 150, 128);\\n    let vein = rs::srgb(150, 40, 60);\\n    let cut = rs::srgb(44, 8, 14);\\n    let pool = rs::srgb(120, 6, 16);\\n    let drape = rs::srgb(34, 112, 116);\\n    let dx = x;\\n    let dz = z - 0.15;\\n    let lobe = 1.0 - dx * dx / 22.0 - dz * dz / 9.0;\\n    let n = hash(x, z);\\n    let n2 = hash(x * 1.7 + 4.0, z * 1.3 - 2.0);\\n    let elev = if lobe > 0.0 {\\n        1.25 * lobe.powf(0.55) + (n - 0.5) * 0.045 + pulse\\n    } else {\\n        (n - 0.5) * 0.01\\n    };\\n    let mut elev = elev.max(0.0);\\n    let mut color = if lobe <= 0.02 {\\n        drape\\n    } else {\\n        let t = (elev / 1.15).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        let mid = flesh.lerp(top, (t - 0.35).clamp(0.0, 1.0));\\n        bed.lerp(mid, (t * 1.4).clamp(0.0, 1.0))\\n    };\\n    if lobe > 0.05 && n2 > 0.78 {\\n        color = color.lerp(vein, 0.65);\\n        elev += 0.01;\\n    }\\n    if lobe > 0.08 && n > 0.93 && n2 < 0.4 {\\n        color = color.lerp(pool, 0.8);\\n        elev = (elev - 0.03).max(0.02);\\n    }\\n    for h in &op.hazards {\\n        if !h.alive {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let d = ((x - h.x).powi(2) + (z - h.z).powi(2)).sqrt();\\n        if d < h.radius + 0.15 {\\n            let k = (1.0 - d / (h.radius + 0.15)).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n            match h.kind {\\n                K_POOL | K_BLEEDER => {\\n                    color = color.lerp(pool, 0.75 * k);\\n                    elev = (elev - 0.04 * k).max(0.0);\\n                }\\n                K_LACERATION | K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n                    color = color.lerp(cut, 0.85 * k);\\n                    elev = (elev - 0.05 * k).max(0.0);\\n                }\\n                K_BURN | K_HEAT => {\\n                    color = color.lerp(rs::srgb(90, 30, 24), 0.5 * k);\\n                }\\n                _ => {\\n                    elev += 0.04 * k;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if !elev.is_finite() {\\n        elev = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    (elev, color)\\n}\\n\\nfn hash(x: f32, z: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let xi = (x * 32.0).floor() as i32;\\n    let zi = (z * 32.0).floor() as i32;\\n    let mut n = xi.wrapping_mul(374761393) ^ zi.wrapping_mul(668265263);\\n    n = (n ^ (n >> 13)).wrapping_mul(1274126177);\\n    (n as u32 & 0xffff) as f32 / 65535.0\\n}\\n\\nfn instruments(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\\n    let steel = rs::srgb(186, 196, 204);\\n    let grip = rs::srgb(40, 78, 86);\\n    for (i, c) in op.cursors.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if !c.active && op.mode == 3 && i > 0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if op.mode != 3 && op.mode != 6 && op.mode != 8 && i > 0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let show = c.active || i == 0;\\n        if !show && op.mode != 0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if op.mode == 0 {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        let y = 0.55 + if c.tool == op.cursors[0].tool { 0.12 } else { 0.0 };\\n        let origin = Vec3::new(c.x, y, c.z);\\n        let tint = Vec3::new(c.color[0], c.color[1], c.color[2]);\\n        tool_mesh(scene, c.tool, origin, steel.lerp(tint, 0.25), grip, 40 + i as u32);\\n    }\\n    if op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 6 {\\n        for t in 0..8 {\\n            let x = -3.5 + t as f32 * 1.0;\\n            let z = 5.4;\\n            let lift = op.cursors.first().map(|c| c.tool == t as u8).unwrap_or(false);\\n            let y = if lift { 0.42 } else { 0.22 };\\n            tool_mesh(scene, t as u8, Vec3::new(x, y, z), steel, grip, 20 + t as u32);\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tool_mesh(scene: &mut Scene, tool: u8, at: Vec3, steel: Vec3, grip: Vec3, group: u32) {\\n    let tip = match tool {\\n        FORCEPS => Vec3::new(0.18, 0.05, 0.34),\\n        LASER | CRYO => Vec3::new(0.0, 0.08, 0.42),\\n        DEFIB => Vec3::new(0.22, 0.02, 0.1),\\n        _ => Vec3::new(0.0, 0.02, 0.38),\\n    };\\n    let mut a = SdfInstance::capsule(at, at + tip, 0.035, steel);\\n    a.style = Style::Lit;\\n    a.group = group;\\n    scene.sdfs.push(a);\\n    let mut b = SdfInstance::capsule(at, at + Vec3::new(-0.05, 0.02, -0.28), 0.045, grip);\\n    b.style = Style::Lit;\\n    b.group = group;\\n    scene.sdfs.push(b);\\n    if tool == DEFIB {\\n        let mut pad = SdfInstance::capsule(at + Vec3::new(0.16, 0.04, 0.12), at + Vec3::new(-0.16, 0.04, 0.12), 0.06, steel);\\n        pad.style = Style::Lit;\\n        pad.group = group;\\n        scene.sdfs.push(pad);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn hazards(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\\n    let parasite = rs::srgb(58, 26, 96);\\n    let core = rs::srgb(36, 18, 66);\\n    let eye = rs::srgb(255, 210, 70);\\n    let sac = rs::srgb(120, 255, 170);\\n    let ember = rs::srgb(255, 120, 40);\\n    for h in &op.hazards {\\n        if !h.alive || h.hidden && h.kind != K_FOREIGN {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let p = Vec3::new(h.x, 0.35 + h.work * 0.05, h.z);\\n        match h.kind {\\n            K_SAC => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p, h.radius.max(0.18) * (0.7 + h.aux.min(1.2) * 0.4), sac);\\n                s.emissive = 0.75;\\n                s.style = Style::Unlit;\\n                s.group = 80 + (h.id % 40);\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n            }\\n            K_EYE => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p + Vec3::Y * 0.1, 0.16, eye);\\n                s.emissive = 1.6;\\n                s.style = Style::Unlit;\\n                s.group = 120;\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n                let mut body = SdfInstance::sphere(p, 0.28, parasite);\\n                body.style = Style::Cel;\\n                body.group = 121;\\n                scene.sdfs.push(body);\\n            }\\n            K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_TUMOR | K_TENDRIL => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p, h.radius.max(0.16), parasite);\\n                s.style = Style::Cel;\\n                s.group = 140 + (h.id % 30);\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n                let mut c = SdfInstance::sphere(p + Vec3::Y * 0.08, 0.07, core);\\n                c.emissive = 0.4;\\n                c.style = Style::Unlit;\\n                c.group = 170;\\n                scene.sdfs.push(c);\\n            }\\n            K_EMBER => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p, 0.14, ember);\\n                s.emissive = 1.2;\\n                s.style = Style::Unlit;\\n                s.group = 200 + (h.id % 20);\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n            }\\n            K_FOREIGN => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::capsule(p, p + Vec3::new(0.2, 0.05, 0.05), 0.05, rs::srgb(210, 210, 200));\\n                s.style = Style::Lit;\\n                s.group = 220;\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn paper(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\\n    let who = if op.story_who.is_empty() { \\\"Mara Quill\\\" } else { op.story_who.as_str() };\\n    let expr = (op.elapsed as u32 % 4) as u8;\\n    let left = card_mesh(who, expr, -2.6);\\n    let right_name = match who {\\n        \\\"Mara Quill\\\" => \\\"Pet Nwosu\\\",\\n        \\\"Pet Nwosu\\\" => \\\"Bashir Haddad\\\",\\n        \\\"Bashir Haddad\\\" => \\\"Ottoline Voss\\\",\\n        \\\"Ottoline Voss\\\" => \\\"Teddy Lark\\\",\\n        \\\"Cordelia Vane\\\" => \\\"Mara Quill\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"Ottoline Voss\\\",\\n    };\\n    let right = card_mesh(right_name, (expr + 1) % 4, 2.6);\\n    scene.dynamic.push(left);\\n    scene.dynamic.push(right);\\n    let _ = op;\\n}\\n\\nfn card_mesh(who: &str, expr: u8, x: f32) -> DynamicMesh {\\n    let (skin, shade, hair, cloth) = palette(who);\\n    let mut data = MeshData::default();\\n    push_part(&mut data, &body_poly(), x, 0.15, cloth, 0.06);\\n    push_part(&mut data, &head_poly(), x, 1.55, skin, 0.05);\\n    push_part(&mut data, &hair_poly(who), x, 1.72, hair, 0.04);\\n    push_part(&mut data, &cheek_poly(), x + 0.18, 1.48, shade, 0.02);\\n    push_part(&mut data, &mouth_poly(expr), x, 1.28, shade, 0.015);\\n    if data.vertices.is_empty() {\\n        data.vertices.push(Vertex { pos: [x, 0.2, -3.2], normal: [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], uv: [0.0, 0.0], color: [1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0] });\\n    }\\n    DynamicMesh {\\n        data,\\n        color: Vec3::ONE,\\n        emissive: 0.02,\\n        style: Style::Cel,\\n        flags: rs::flags::NO_SHADOW,\\n        group: 300 + (x.abs() as u32),\\n        material: 0,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn palette(who: &str) -> (Vec3, Vec3, Vec3, Vec3) {\\n    match who {\\n        \\\"Pet Nwosu\\\" => (rs::srgb(122, 80, 58), rs::srgb(92, 58, 44), rs::srgb(226, 226, 232), rs::srgb(98, 70, 136)),\\n        \\\"Bashir Haddad\\\" => (rs::srgb(190, 142, 104), rs::srgb(160, 112, 80), rs::srgb(40, 32, 28), rs::srgb(60, 104, 164)),\\n        \\\"Teddy Lark\\\" => (rs::srgb(232, 196, 170), rs::srgb(200, 150, 130), rs::srgb(180, 90, 40), rs::srgb(70, 120, 110)),\\n        \\\"Ottoline Voss\\\" => (rs::srgb(230, 200, 186), rs::srgb(190, 150, 140), rs::srgb(80, 80, 88), rs::srgb(48, 56, 72)),\\n        \\\"Cordelia Vane\\\" => (rs::srgb(214, 170, 140), rs::srgb(170, 120, 100), rs::srgb(30, 28, 36), rs::srgb(120, 48, 62)),\\n        _ => (rs::srgb(242, 200, 172), rs::srgb(214, 158, 136), rs::srgb(46, 36, 60), rs::srgb(46, 150, 146)),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn body_poly() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    vec![\\n        [-0.7, 0.0],\\n        [-0.85, 0.7],\\n        [-0.45, 1.05],\\n        [0.0, 1.15],\\n        [0.45, 1.05],\\n        [0.85, 0.7],\\n        [0.7, 0.0],\\n    ]\\n}\\n\\nfn head_poly() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    let mut v = Vec::new();\\n    for i in 0..14 {\\n        let a = i as f32 / 14.0 * std::f32::consts::TAU;\\n        v.push([a.cos() * 0.38, a.sin() * 0.46]);\\n    }\\n    v\\n}\\n\\nfn hair_poly(who: &str) -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    let wide = if who == \\\"Pet Nwosu\\\" { 0.5 } else { 0.42 };\\n    vec![[-wide, -0.05], [-wide * 0.8, 0.35], [0.0, 0.48], [wide * 0.8, 0.35], [wide, -0.05], [0.2, 0.05], [-0.2, 0.05]]\\n}\\n\\nfn cheek_poly() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    vec![[-0.12, -0.06], [0.12, -0.02], [0.08, 0.08], [-0.1, 0.06]]\\n}\\n\\nfn mouth_poly(expr: u8) -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    match expr % 4 {\\n        1 => vec![[-0.12, 0.02], [0.0, -0.08], [0.12, 0.02], [0.0, 0.08]],\\n        2 => vec![[-0.14, 0.04], [0.14, 0.04], [0.1, -0.02], [-0.1, -0.02]],\\n        3 => vec![[-0.12, -0.02], [0.0, 0.06], [0.12, -0.02], [0.0, -0.06]],\\n        _ => vec![[-0.12, 0.0], [0.12, 0.0], [0.08, -0.03], [-0.08, -0.03]],\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn push_part(data: &mut MeshData, poly: &[[f32; 2]], x: f32, y: f32, color: Vec3, depth: f32) {\\n    let smooth = chaikin(poly, 2);\\n    if smooth.len() < 3 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let z0 = -3.4;\\n    let base = data.vertices.len() as u32;\\n    for p in &smooth {\\n        data.vertices.push(vert(x + p[0], y + p[1], z0, [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], color));\\n    }\\n    for p in &smooth {\\n        data.vertices.push(vert(x + p[0], y + p[1], z0 - depth, [0.0, 0.0, -1.0], color * 0.72));\\n    }\\n    let n = smooth.len() as u32;\\n    let tris = triangulate(&smooth);\\n    for (a, b, c) in tris {\\n        data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[base + a, base + b, base + c]);\\n        data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[base + n + a, base + n + c, base + n + b]);\\n    }\\n    for i in 0..n {\\n        let j = (i + 1) % n;\\n        data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[base + i, base + n + i, base + j, base + j, base + n + i, base + n + j]);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn vert(x: f32, y: f32, z: f32, n: [f32; 3], color: Vec3) -> Vertex {\\n    Vertex { pos: [x, y, z], normal: n, uv: [0.5, 0.5], color: [color.x, color.y, color.z, 1.0] }\\n}\\n\\nfn chaikin(pts: &[[f32; 2]], n: usize) -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    let mut p = pts.to_vec();\\n    for _ in 0..n {\\n        if p.len() < 3 {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        let mut q = Vec::with_capacity(p.len() * 2);\\n        for i in 0..p.len() {\\n            let a = p[i];\\n            let b = p[(i + 1) % p.len()];\\n            q.push([a[0] * 0.75 + b[0] * 0.25, a[1] * 0.75 + b[1] * 0.25]);\\n            q.push([a[0] * 0.25 + b[0] * 0.75, a[1] * 0.25 + b[1] * 0.75]);\\n        }\\n        p = q;\\n    }\\n    p\\n}\\n\\nfn triangulate(poly: &[[f32; 2]]) -> Vec<(u32, u32, u32)> {\\n    let mut idx: Vec<u32> = (0..poly.len() as u32).collect();\\n    let mut out = Vec::new();\\n    let mut guard = 0;\\n    while idx.len() > 3 && guard < 64 {\\n        guard += 1;\\n        let mut clipped = false;\\n        let n = idx.len();\\n        for i in 0..n {\\n            let a = idx[(i + n - 1) % n] as usize;\\n            let b = idx[i] as usize;\\n            let c = idx[(i + 1) % n] as usize;\\n            if ear(poly, a, b, c, &idx) {\\n                out.push((a as u32, b as u32, c as u32));\\n                idx.remove(i);\\n                clipped = true;\\n                break;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if !clipped {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if idx.len() == 3 {\\n        out.push((idx[0], idx[1], idx[2]));\\n    }\\n    out\\n}\\n\\nfn ear(poly: &[[f32; 2]], a: usize, b: usize, c: usize, rest: &[u32]) -> bool {\\n    let (pa, pb, pc) = (poly[a], poly[b], poly[c]);\\n    let cross = (pb[0] - pa[0]) * (pc[1] - pa[1]) - (pb[1] - pa[1]) * (pc[0] - pa[0]);\\n    if cross <= 0.0 {\\n        return false;\\n    }\\n    for &i in rest {\\n        let i = i as usize;\\n        if i == a || i == b || i == c {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if inside(poly[i], pa, pb, pc) {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    true\\n}\\n\\nfn inside(p: [f32; 2], a: [f32; 2], b: [f32; 2], c: [f32; 2]) -> bool {\\n    let s = |u: [f32; 2], v: [f32; 2]| (p[0] - u[0]) * (v[1] - u[1]) - (p[1] - u[1]) * (v[0] - u[0]);\\n    let d1 = s(a, b);\\n    let d2 = s(b, c);\\n    let d3 = s(c, a);\\n    (d1 >= 0.0 && d2 >= 0.0 && d3 >= 0.0) || (d1 <= 0.0 && d2 <= 0.0 && d3 <= 0.0)\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"//! Overhead operative field, instruments, and paper-theatre cards.\\n//! One dynamic mesh paints the plate. Lights and the camera are applied last so view settings cannot override them.\\n\\nuse glam::Vec3;\\nuse pav_core::games::surgery::frame::{CameraShot, SurgeryFrame};\\nuse pav_core::games::surgery::kinds::*;\\nuse pav_render::mesh::{MeshData, Vertex};\\nuse pav_render::scene::{self as rs, DynamicMesh, Scene, SdfInstance, Style};\\n\\nconst NX: usize = 420;\\nconst NZ: usize = 240;\\n\\npub fn emit(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\\n    scene.dynamic.push(plate(op));\\n    instruments(scene, op);\\n    hazards(scene, op);\\n    if op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 1 || op.mode == 4 || op.mode == 6 {\\n        paper(scene, op);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn apply_look(scene: &mut Scene, rig: &crate::camera::CameraRig, aspect: f32, shot: &CameraShot) {\\n    let mut rig = rig.clone();\\n    rig.params.tilt = shot.tilt;\\n    rig.params.yaw = shot.yaw;\\n    rig.params.distance = shot.distance;\\n    rig.params.fov = shot.fov_deg;\\n    rig.params.ortho = false;\\n    rig.params.follow_lag = shot.follow_lag;\\n    rig.params.height_offset = shot.height_offset;\\n    rig.blend = None;\\n    rig.snap(shot.target);\\n    scene.camera = rig.data(aspect);\\n    scene.sun.direction = Vec3::new(-0.25, -1.0, -0.35).normalize();\\n    scene.sun.color = Vec3::new(1.0, 0.97, 0.90) * 0.42;\\n    scene.sun.shadows = true;\\n    scene.sun.shadow_center = shot.target;\\n    scene.sun.shadow_radius = 16.0;\\n    scene.ambient.sky = Vec3::new(0.50, 0.50, 0.54);\\n    scene.ambient.ground = Vec3::new(0.30, 0.22, 0.22);\\n    scene.point_lights.clear();\\n    scene.point_lights.push(rs::PointLight {\\n        position: Vec3::new(-1.0, 7.0, -1.0),\\n        color: Vec3::new(1.0, 0.97, 0.9) * 0.9,\\n        radius: 16.0,\\n        shadows: true,\\n    });\\n    scene.clear_color = rs::srgb(16, 40, 44);\\n    scene.style.cel_bands = 3.0;\\n    scene.style.rim = 0.12;\\n    scene.post.outline_darken = 0.45;\\n    scene.post.outlines = true;\\n    scene.post.bloom = 0.35;\\n    scene.post.bloom_threshold = 1.15;\\n    scene.post.gi = 0.6;\\n    scene.filter.vignette = 0.35;\\n}\\n\\nfn plate(op: &SurgeryFrame) -> DynamicMesh {\\n    let mut data = MeshData::default();\\n    let nx = NX;\\n    let nz = NZ;\\n    data.vertices.reserve(nx * nz);\\n    let pulse = if op.flat { 0.0 } else { (op.phase * std::f32::consts::TAU).sin() * 0.012 * (0.4 + op.vitals / 160.0) };\\n    let mut hgt = vec![0.0f32; nx * nz];\\n    for j in 0..nz {\\n        for i in 0..nx {\\n            let x = -11.0 + i as f32 / (nx - 1) as f32 * 22.0;\\n            let z = -6.3 + j as f32 / (nz - 1) as f32 * 12.6;\\n            let (elev, color) = vertex_paint(op, x, z, pulse);\\n            hgt[j * nx + i] = elev;\\n            data.vertices.push(Vertex {\\n                pos: [x, elev, z],\\n                normal: [0.0, 1.0, 0.0],\\n                uv: [i as f32 / (nx - 1) as f32, j as f32 / (nz - 1) as f32],\\n                color: [color.x, color.y, color.z, 1.0],\\n            });\\n        }\\n    }\\n    for j in 0..nz {\\n        for i in 0..nx {\\n            let h = |a: usize, b: usize| hgt[b.min(nz - 1) * nx + a.min(nx - 1)];\\n            let dx = (h(i + 1, j) - h(i.saturating_sub(1), j)) / 0.11;\\n            let dz = (h(i, j + 1) - h(i, j.saturating_sub(1))) / 0.11;\\n            let n = Vec3::new(-dx, 1.0, -dz).normalize_or_zero();\\n            let n = if n.length_squared() > 0.5 { n } else { Vec3::Y };\\n            let idx = j * nx + i;\\n            data.vertices[idx].normal = [n.x, n.y, n.z];\\n            if n.y > 0.92 && hgt[idx] > 0.15 {\\n                let c = &mut data.vertices[idx].color;\\n                c[0] = (c[0] + 0.18).min(1.0);\\n                c[1] = (c[1] + 0.12).min(1.0);\\n                c[2] = (c[2] + 0.10).min(1.0);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    for j in 0..nz - 1 {\\n        for i in 0..nx - 1 {\\n            let i00 = (j * nx + i) as u32;\\n            let i10 = i00 + 1;\\n            let i01 = i00 + nx as u32;\\n            let i11 = i01 + 1;\\n            data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[i00, i01, i10, i10, i01, i11]);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    debug_assert!(data.vertices.iter().all(|v| v.pos.iter().all(|c| c.is_finite())));\\n    DynamicMesh {\\n        data,\\n        color: Vec3::ONE,\\n        emissive: 0.0,\\n        style: Style::Cel,\\n        flags: 0,\\n        group: 2,\\n        material: 0,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn vertex_paint(op: &SurgeryFrame, x: f32, z: f32, pulse: f32) -> (f32, Vec3) {\\n    let bed = rs::srgb(74, 22, 30);\\n    let flesh = rs::srgb(214, 92, 84);\\n    let top = rs::srgb(246, 150, 128);\\n    let vein = rs::srgb(150, 40, 60);\\n    let cut = rs::srgb(44, 8, 14);\\n    let pool = rs::srgb(120, 6, 16);\\n    let drape = rs::srgb(34, 112, 116);\\n    let dx = x;\\n    let dz = z - 0.15;\\n    let lobe = 1.0 - dx * dx / 22.0 - dz * dz / 9.0;\\n    let n = hash(x, z);\\n    let n2 = hash(x * 1.7 + 4.0, z * 1.3 - 2.0);\\n    let elev = if lobe > 0.0 {\\n        1.25 * lobe.powf(0.55) + (n - 0.5) * 0.045 + pulse\\n    } else {\\n        (n - 0.5) * 0.01\\n    };\\n    let mut elev = elev.max(0.0);\\n    let mut color = if lobe <= 0.02 {\\n        drape\\n    } else {\\n        let t = (elev / 1.15).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n        let mid = flesh.lerp(top, (t - 0.35).clamp(0.0, 1.0));\\n        bed.lerp(mid, (t * 1.4).clamp(0.0, 1.0))\\n    };\\n    if lobe > 0.05 && n2 > 0.78 {\\n        color = color.lerp(vein, 0.65);\\n        elev += 0.01;\\n    }\\n    if lobe > 0.08 && n > 0.93 && n2 < 0.4 {\\n        color = color.lerp(pool, 0.8);\\n        elev = (elev - 0.03).max(0.02);\\n    }\\n    for h in &op.hazards {\\n        if !h.alive {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let d = ((x - h.x).powi(2) + (z - h.z).powi(2)).sqrt();\\n        if d < h.radius + 0.15 {\\n            let k = (1.0 - d / (h.radius + 0.15)).clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n            match h.kind {\\n                K_POOL | K_BLEEDER => {\\n                    color = color.lerp(pool, 0.75 * k);\\n                    elev = (elev - 0.04 * k).max(0.0);\\n                }\\n                K_LACERATION | K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n                    color = color.lerp(cut, 0.85 * k);\\n                    elev = (elev - 0.05 * k).max(0.0);\\n                }\\n                K_BURN | K_HEAT => {\\n                    color = color.lerp(rs::srgb(90, 30, 24), 0.5 * k);\\n                }\\n                _ => {\\n                    elev += 0.04 * k;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if !elev.is_finite() {\\n        elev = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    (elev, color)\\n}\\n\\nfn hash(x: f32, z: f32) -> f32 {\\n    let xi = (x * 32.0).floor() as i32;\\n    let zi = (z * 32.0).floor() as i32;\\n    let mut n = xi.wrapping_mul(374761393) ^ zi.wrapping_mul(668265263);\\n    n = (n ^ (n >> 13)).wrapping_mul(1274126177);\\n    (n as u32 & 0xffff) as f32 / 65535.0\\n}\\n\\nfn instruments(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\\n    let steel = rs::srgb(186, 196, 204);\\n    let grip = rs::srgb(40, 78, 86);\\n    for (i, c) in op.cursors.iter().enumerate() {\\n        if !c.active && op.mode == 3 && i > 0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if op.mode != 3 && op.mode != 6 && op.mode != 8 && i > 0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let show = c.active || i == 0;\\n        if !show && op.mode != 0 {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if op.mode == 0 {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        let y = 0.55 + if c.tool == op.cursors[0].tool { 0.12 } else { 0.0 };\\n        let origin = Vec3::new(c.x, y, c.z);\\n        let tint = Vec3::new(c.color[0], c.color[1], c.color[2]);\\n        tool_mesh(scene, c.tool, origin, steel.lerp(tint, 0.25), grip, 40 + i as u32);\\n    }\\n    if op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 6 {\\n        for t in 0..8 {\\n            let x = -3.5 + t as f32 * 1.0;\\n            let z = 5.4;\\n            let lift = op.cursors.first().map(|c| c.tool == t as u8).unwrap_or(false);\\n            let y = if lift { 0.42 } else { 0.22 };\\n            tool_mesh(scene, t as u8, Vec3::new(x, y, z), steel, grip, 20 + t as u32);\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn tool_mesh(scene: &mut Scene, tool: u8, at: Vec3, steel: Vec3, grip: Vec3, group: u32) {\\n    let tip = match tool {\\n        FORCEPS => Vec3::new(0.18, 0.05, 0.34),\\n        LASER | CRYO => Vec3::new(0.0, 0.08, 0.42),\\n        DEFIB => Vec3::new(0.22, 0.02, 0.1),\\n        _ => Vec3::new(0.0, 0.02, 0.38),\\n    };\\n    let mut a = SdfInstance::capsule(at, at + tip, 0.035, steel);\\n    a.style = Style::Lit;\\n    a.group = group;\\n    scene.sdfs.push(a);\\n    let mut b = SdfInstance::capsule(at, at + Vec3::new(-0.05, 0.02, -0.28), 0.045, grip);\\n    b.style = Style::Lit;\\n    b.group = group;\\n    scene.sdfs.push(b);\\n    if tool == DEFIB {\\n        let mut pad = SdfInstance::capsule(at + Vec3::new(0.16, 0.04, 0.12), at + Vec3::new(-0.16, 0.04, 0.12), 0.06, steel);\\n        pad.style = Style::Lit;\\n        pad.group = group;\\n        scene.sdfs.push(pad);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn hazards(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\\n    let parasite = rs::srgb(58, 26, 96);\\n    let core = rs::srgb(36, 18, 66);\\n    let eye = rs::srgb(255, 210, 70);\\n    let sac = rs::srgb(120, 255, 170);\\n    let ember = rs::srgb(255, 120, 40);\\n    for h in &op.hazards {\\n        if !h.alive || h.hidden && h.kind != K_FOREIGN {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        let p = Vec3::new(h.x, 0.35 + h.work * 0.05, h.z);\\n        match h.kind {\\n            K_SAC => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p, h.radius.max(0.18) * (0.7 + h.aux.min(1.2) * 0.4), sac);\\n                s.emissive = 0.75;\\n                s.style = Style::Unlit;\\n                s.group = 80 + (h.id % 40);\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n            }\\n            K_EYE => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p + Vec3::Y * 0.1, 0.16, eye);\\n                s.emissive = 1.6;\\n                s.style = Style::Unlit;\\n                s.group = 120;\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n                let mut body = SdfInstance::sphere(p, 0.28, parasite);\\n                body.style = Style::Cel;\\n                body.group = 121;\\n                scene.sdfs.push(body);\\n            }\\n            K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_TUMOR | K_TENDRIL => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p, h.radius.max(0.16), parasite);\\n                s.style = Style::Cel;\\n                s.group = 140 + (h.id % 30);\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n                let mut c = SdfInstance::sphere(p + Vec3::Y * 0.08, 0.07, core);\\n                c.emissive = 0.4;\\n                c.style = Style::Unlit;\\n                c.group = 170;\\n                scene.sdfs.push(c);\\n            }\\n            K_EMBER => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::sphere(p, 0.14, ember);\\n                s.emissive = 1.2;\\n                s.style = Style::Unlit;\\n                s.group = 200 + (h.id % 20);\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n            }\\n            K_FOREIGN => {\\n                let mut s = SdfInstance::capsule(p, p + Vec3::new(0.2, 0.05, 0.05), 0.05, rs::srgb(210, 210, 200));\\n                s.style = Style::Lit;\\n                s.group = 220;\\n                scene.sdfs.push(s);\\n            }\\n            _ => {}\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn paper(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\\n    let who = if op.story_who.is_empty() { \\\"Mara Quill\\\" } else { op.story_who.as_str() };\\n    let expr = (op.elapsed as u32 % 4) as u8;\\n    let left = card_mesh(who, expr, -2.6);\\n    let right_name = match who {\\n        \\\"Mara Quill\\\" => \\\"Pet Nwosu\\\",\\n        \\\"Pet Nwosu\\\" => \\\"Bashir Haddad\\\",\\n        \\\"Bashir Haddad\\\" => \\\"Ottoline Voss\\\",\\n        \\\"Ottoline Voss\\\" => \\\"Teddy Lark\\\",\\n        \\\"Cordelia Vane\\\" => \\\"Mara Quill\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"Ottoline Voss\\\",\\n    };\\n    let right = card_mesh(right_name, (expr + 1) % 4, 2.6);\\n    scene.dynamic.push(left);\\n    scene.dynamic.push(right);\\n    let _ = op;\\n}\\n\\nfn card_mesh(who: &str, expr: u8, x: f32) -> DynamicMesh {\\n    let (skin, shade, hair, cloth) = palette(who);\\n    let mut data = MeshData::default();\\n    push_part(&mut data, &body_poly(), x, 0.15, cloth, 0.06);\\n    push_part(&mut data, &head_poly(), x, 1.55, skin, 0.05);\\n    push_part(&mut data, &hair_poly(who), x, 1.72, hair, 0.04);\\n    push_part(&mut data, &cheek_poly(), x + 0.18, 1.48, shade, 0.02);\\n    push_part(&mut data, &mouth_poly(expr), x, 1.28, shade, 0.015);\\n    if data.vertices.is_empty() {\\n        data.vertices.push(Vertex { pos: [x, 0.2, -3.2], normal: [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], uv: [0.0, 0.0], color: [1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0] });\\n    }\\n    DynamicMesh {\\n        data,\\n        color: Vec3::ONE,\\n        emissive: 0.02,\\n        style: Style::Cel,\\n        flags: rs::flags::NO_SHADOW,\\n        group: 300 + (x.abs() as u32),\\n        material: 0,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn palette(who: &str) -> (Vec3, Vec3, Vec3, Vec3) {\\n    match who {\\n        \\\"Pet Nwosu\\\" => (rs::srgb(122, 80, 58), rs::srgb(92, 58, 44), rs::srgb(226, 226, 232), rs::srgb(98, 70, 136)),\\n        \\\"Bashir Haddad\\\" => (rs::srgb(190, 142, 104), rs::srgb(160, 112, 80), rs::srgb(40, 32, 28), rs::srgb(60, 104, 164)),\\n        \\\"Teddy Lark\\\" => (rs::srgb(232, 196, 170), rs::srgb(200, 150, 130), rs::srgb(180, 90, 40), rs::srgb(70, 120, 110)),\\n        \\\"Ottoline Voss\\\" => (rs::srgb(230, 200, 186), rs::srgb(190, 150, 140), rs::srgb(80, 80, 88), rs::srgb(48, 56, 72)),\\n        \\\"Cordelia Vane\\\" => (rs::srgb(214, 170, 140), rs::srgb(170, 120, 100), rs::srgb(30, 28, 36), rs::srgb(120, 48, 62)),\\n        _ => (rs::srgb(242, 200, 172), rs::srgb(214, 158, 136), rs::srgb(46, 36, 60), rs::srgb(46, 150, 146)),\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn body_poly() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    vec![\\n        [-0.7, 0.0],\\n        [-0.85, 0.7],\\n        [-0.45, 1.05],\\n        [0.0, 1.15],\\n        [0.45, 1.05],\\n        [0.85, 0.7],\\n        [0.7, 0.0],\\n    ]\\n}\\n\\nfn head_poly() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    let mut v = Vec::new();\\n    for i in 0..14 {\\n        let a = i as f32 / 14.0 * std::f32::consts::TAU;\\n        v.push([a.cos() * 0.38, a.sin() * 0.46]);\\n    }\\n    v\\n}\\n\\nfn hair_poly(who: &str) -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    let wide = if who == \\\"Pet Nwosu\\\" { 0.5 } else { 0.42 };\\n    vec![[-wide, -0.05], [-wide * 0.8, 0.35], [0.0, 0.48], [wide * 0.8, 0.35], [wide, -0.05], [0.2, 0.05], [-0.2, 0.05]]\\n}\\n\\nfn cheek_poly() -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    vec![[-0.12, -0.06], [0.12, -0.02], [0.08, 0.08], [-0.1, 0.06]]\\n}\\n\\nfn mouth_poly(expr: u8) -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    match expr % 4 {\\n        1 => vec![[-0.12, 0.02], [0.0, -0.08], [0.12, 0.02], [0.0, 0.08]],\\n        2 => vec![[-0.14, 0.04], [0.14, 0.04], [0.1, -0.02], [-0.1, -0.02]],\\n        3 => vec![[-0.12, -0.02], [0.0, 0.06], [0.12, -0.02], [0.0, -0.06]],\\n        _ => vec![[-0.12, 0.0], [0.12, 0.0], [0.08, -0.03], [-0.08, -0.03]],\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn push_part(data: &mut MeshData, poly: &[[f32; 2]], x: f32, y: f32, color: Vec3, depth: f32) {\\n    let smooth = chaikin(poly, 2);\\n    if smooth.len() < 3 {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let z0 = -3.4;\\n    let base = data.vertices.len() as u32;\\n    for p in &smooth {\\n        data.vertices.push(vert(x + p[0], y + p[1], z0, [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], color));\\n    }\\n    for p in &smooth {\\n        data.vertices.push(vert(x + p[0], y + p[1], z0 - depth, [0.0, 0.0, -1.0], color * 0.72));\\n    }\\n    let n = smooth.len() as u32;\\n    let tris = triangulate(&smooth);\\n    for (a, b, c) in tris {\\n        data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[base + a, base + b, base + c]);\\n        data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[base + n + a, base + n + c, base + n + b]);\\n    }\\n    for i in 0..n {\\n        let j = (i + 1) % n;\\n        data.indices.extend_from_slice(&[base + i, base + n + i, base + j, base + j, base + n + i, base + n + j]);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn vert(x: f32, y: f32, z: f32, n: [f32; 3], color: Vec3) -> Vertex {\\n    Vertex { pos: [x, y, z], normal: n, uv: [0.5, 0.5], color: [color.x, color.y, color.z, 1.0] }\\n}\\n\\nfn chaikin(pts: &[[f32; 2]], n: usize) -> Vec<[f32; 2]> {\\n    let mut p = pts.to_vec();\\n    for _ in 0..n {\\n        if p.len() < 3 {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n        let mut q = Vec::with_capacity(p.len() * 2);\\n        for i in 0..p.len() {\\n            let a = p[i];\\n            let b = p[(i + 1) % p.len()];\\n            q.push([a[0] * 0.75 + b[0] * 0.25, a[1] * 0.75 + b[1] * 0.25]);\\n            q.push([a[0] * 0.25 + b[0] * 0.75, a[1] * 0.25 + b[1] * 0.75]);\\n        }\\n        p = q;\\n    }\\n    p\\n}\\n\\nfn triangulate(poly: &[[f32; 2]]) -> Vec<(u32, u32, u32)> {\\n    let mut idx: Vec<u32> = (0..poly.len() as u32).collect();\\n    let mut out = Vec::new();\\n    let mut guard = 0;\\n    while idx.len() > 3 && guard < 64 {\\n        guard += 1;\\n        let mut clipped = false;\\n        let n = idx.len();\\n        for i in 0..n {\\n            let a = idx[(i + n - 1) % n] as usize;\\n            let b = idx[i] as usize;\\n            let c = idx[(i + 1) % n] as usize;\\n            if ear(poly, a, b, c, &idx) {\\n                out.push((a as u32, b as u32, c as u32));\\n                idx.remove(i);\\n                clipped = true;\\n                break;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if !clipped {\\n            break;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    if idx.len() == 3 {\\n        out.push((idx[0], idx[1], idx[2]));\\n    }\\n    out\\n}\\n\\nfn ear(poly: &[[f32; 2]], a: usize, b: usize, c: usize, rest: &[u32]) -> bool {\\n    let (pa, pb, pc) = (poly[a], poly[b], poly[c]);\\n    let cross = (pb[0] - pa[0]) * (pc[1] - pa[1]) - (pb[1] - pa[1]) * (pc[0] - pa[0]);\\n    if cross <= 0.0 {\\n        return false;\\n    }\\n    for &i in rest {\\n        let i = i as usize;\\n        if i == a || i == b || i == c {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if inside(poly[i], pa, pb, pc) {\\n            return false;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    true\\n}\\n\\nfn inside(p: [f32; 2], a: [f32; 2], b: [f32; 2], c: [f32; 2]) -> bool {\\n    let s = |u: [f32; 2], v: [f32; 2]| (p[0] - u[0]) * (v[1] - u[1]) - (p[1] - u[1]) * (v[0] - u[0]);\\n    let d1 = s(a, b);\\n    let d2 = s(b, c);\\n    let d3 = s(c, a);\\n    (d1 >= 0.0 && d2 >= 0.0 && d3 >= 0.0) || (d1 <= 0.0 && d2 <= 0.0 && d3 <= 0.0)\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4b20c0fe-4396-4c68-b90a-4c8980b027f5-161","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"pub mod arpg;\\npub mod assets;\\npub mod build;\\npub mod camera;\\npub mod creatures;\\npub mod fx;\\npub mod look;\\npub mod materials;\\npub mod vehicles;\\npub mod water;\",\"new_string\":\"pub mod arpg;\\npub mod assets;\\npub mod build;\\npub mod camera;\\npub mod creatures;\\npub mod fx;\\npub mod look;\\npub mod materials;\\npub mod surgery;\\npub mod vehicles;\\npub mod water;\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/lib.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/lib.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/lib.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"pub mod arpg;\\npub mod assets;\\npub mod build;\\npub mod camera;\\npub mod creatures;\\npub mod fx;\\npub mod look;\\npub mod materials;\\npub mod vehicles;\\npub mod water;\",\"old_line\":3,\"new_string\":\"pub mod arpg;\\npub mod assets;\\npub mod build;\\npub mod camera;\\npub mod creatures;\\npub mod fx;\\npub mod look;\\npub mod materials;\\npub mod surgery;\\npub mod vehicles;\\npub mod water;\",\"new_line\":3,\"context_before\":\"//! Turns simulation frames into render scenes: camera rig, interpolation, style setting