{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_215","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"CameraRig.blend is private. I set the rig.\n\nI need to clear the rig's blend before overwriting parameters. I'm checking whether private fields in CameraRig are visible to the surgery submodule.\n\nPrivate fields are not visible to the sibling module. I will build a fresh CameraRig directly from the shot parameters instead of cloning the existing rig.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b9797ec5-c54e-4965-835e-68bcdfe0a208-163","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"pub fn apply_look(scene: &mut Scene, rig: &crate::camera::CameraRig, aspect: f32, shot: &CameraShot) {\n    let mut rig = rig.clone();\n    rig.params.tilt = shot.tilt;\n    rig.params.yaw = shot.yaw;\n    rig.params.distance = shot.distance;\n    rig.params.fov = shot.fov_deg;\n    rig.params.ortho = false;\n    rig.params.follow_lag = shot.follow_lag;\n    rig.params.height_offset = shot.height_offset;\n    rig.blend = None;\n    rig.snap(shot.target);\n    scene.camera = rig.data(aspect);","new_string":"pub fn apply_look(scene: &mut Scene, _rig: &crate::camera::CameraRig, aspect: f32, shot: &CameraShot) {\n    let mut rig = crate::camera::CameraRig::new(crate::camera::CameraParams {\n        tilt: shot.tilt,\n        yaw: shot.yaw,\n        distance: shot.distance,\n        fov: shot.fov_deg,\n        ortho: false,\n        follow_lag: shot.follow_lag,\n        height_offset: shot.height_offset,\n    });\n    rig.snap(shot.target);\n    scene.camera = rig.data(aspect);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8157,"output_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":184960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717