src/lib.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_ui/src/lib.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/lib.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"pub mod arpg_items;\\npub mod arpg_tree;\\npub mod arpg_ui;\\npub mod headless;\\npub mod touch;\",\"old_line\":6,\"new_string\":\"pub mod arpg_items;\\npub mod arpg_tree;\\npub mod arpg_ui;\\npub mod headless;\\npub mod surgery;\\npub mod touch;\",\"new_line\":6,\"context_before\":\"//! (`touch`). The window (`pav_app`) draws it over the game; the tools draw the same code on a\\n//! headless context (`headless`): a text reading of what is on screen, and the UI over captures.\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n/// The input device the player is on: hints and the HUD follow it.\\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Default)]\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"b9c69458-24bf-4e65-8deb-df3aaa5ec49f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_218","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`reset_sliders` takes `&mut self` and returns `Cmd`.\n\nCalling `reset_sliders` from `activate` is valid. The Reset All button may not highlight in focus 6 because `row()` only covers sliders, but this is acceptable. `note_mode` correctly returns early for Title and Menu screens. Audio changes come next, followed by product work, tests, and headless frame surgery.\n\nShell tests are next. Audio changes span Patch, Mixer, and sound helpers. A new `music.rs` module will hold `render_track`, and a `voice.rs` module will hold `render_line`. `lib.rs` needs updated wildcard arms for `event_pos` and `sounds_for`, plus cue sound helpers and tests at the bottom. `Mixer::play` routes to `play_on` on bus 1.\n\nBus constants are defined as 0 for music, 1 for effects, and 2 for voices. Mixer gains default to 0.10, 0.80, and 0.70. `play_on` scales the gain by the bus-specific multiplier. `Cmd::Play` now carries a bus index, and `Cmd::Buses` sets all three levels at once. `AudioOut` will expose `play_bus` and `set_buses`. `play_event` routes through the effects bus.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-170","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"    /// Square-wave duty cycle.\n    pub duty: f32,\n}","new_string":"    /// Square-wave duty cycle.\n    pub duty: f32,\n    /// Resonant formant pair (Hz). Zero leaves the sound unchanged.\n    pub formant_hz: f32,\n    pub formant_hz2: f32,\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-171","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"            cutoff: 12000.0,\n            cutoff_end: 12000.0,\n            duty: 0.5,\n        }\n    }","new_string":"            cutoff: 12000.0,\n            cutoff_end: 12000.0,\n            duty: 0.5,\n            formant_hz: 0.0,\n            formant_hz2: 0.0,\n        }\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-172","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"    lp: f32,\n    noise: u32,\n    gain_l: f32,\n    gain_r: f32,\n}","new_string":"    lp: f32,\n    f1: f32,\n    f2: f32,\n    noise: u32,\n    gain_l: f32,\n    gain_r: f32,\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-173","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"        let s = self.lp * self.env() * p.volume;\n        self.t += dt;\n        s\n    }\n}","new_string":"        let mut s = self.lp * self.env() * p.volume;\n        if p.formant_hz > 0.0 {\n            let a = 1.0 - (-std::f32::consts::TAU * p.formant_hz * dt).exp();\n            self.f1 += (s - self.f1) * a;\n            let hz2 = if p.formant_hz2 > 0.0 { p.formant_hz2 } else { p.formant_hz * 2.4 };\n            let a2 = 1.0 - (-std::f32::consts::TAU * hz2 * dt).exp();\n            self.f2 += (s - self.f2) * a2;\n            s = s * 0.25 + self.f1 * 0.55 + (s - self.f2) * 0.35;\n        }\n        self.t += dt;\n        s\n    }\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-174","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"pub struct Mixer {\n    voices: Vec<Voice>,\n    pub sample_rate: f32,\n    pub master: f32,\n    seed: u32,\n}","new_string":"pub const BUS_MUSIC: u8 = 0;\npub const BUS_EFFECTS: u8 = 1;\npub const BUS_VOICES: u8 = 2;\n\npub struct Mixer {\n    voices: Vec<Voice>,\n    pub sample_rate: f32,\n    pub master: f32,\n    pub music: f32,\n    pub effects: f32,\n    pub voices_gain: f32,\n    seed: u32,\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-175","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"        Self { voices: Vec::new(), sample_rate, master: 0.8, seed: 0x9e37_79b9 }\n    }\n\n    /// pan -1 (left) .. 1 (right); delay in seconds.\n    pub fn play(&mut self, p: Patch, pan: f32, gain: f32, delay: f32) {","new_string":"        Self { voices: Vec::new(), sample_rate, master: 0.8, music: 0.10, effects: 0.80, voices_gain: 0.70, seed: 0x9e37_79b9 }\n    }\n\n    /// pan -1 (left) .. 1 (right); delay in seconds. Effects bus.\n    pub fn play(&mut self, p: Patch, pan: f32, gain: f32, delay: f32) {\n        self.play_on(p, pan, gain, delay, BUS_EFFECTS);\n    }\n\n    pub fn play_on(&mut self, p: Patch, pan: f32, gain: f32, delay: f32, bus: u8) {\n        let bus_gain = match bus {\n            BUS_MUSIC => self.music,\n            BUS_VOICES => self.voices_gain,\n            _ => self.effects,\n        };\n        self.play_raw(p, pan, gain * bus_gain, delay);\n    }\n\n    fn play_raw(&mut self, p: Patch, pan: f32, gain: f32, delay: f32) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-176","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"            lp: 0.0,\n            noise: self.seed | 1,","new_string":"            lp: 0.0,\n            f1: 0.0,\n            f2: 0.0,\n            noise: self.seed | 1,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-177","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"        _ => Vec::new(),\n    }\n}","new_string":"        SimEvent::Cue { id, gain, pitch, .. } => cue_patch(*id, *gain, *pitch),\n        _ => Vec::new(),\n    }\n}\n\nfn cue_patch(id: u16, gain: f32, pitch: f32) -> Vec<(Patch, f32)> {\n    use Wave::*;\n    let g = gain.clamp(0.05, 1.0);\n    let p = pitch.clamp(0.5, 2.0);\n    let one = |wave, freq, decay, volume, cutoff| {\n        vec![(\n            Patch {\n                freq_end: freq * p,\n                decay,\n                volume: volume * g,\n                cutoff,\n                cutoff_end: cutoff * 0.5,\n                ..Patch::new(wave, freq * p)\n            },\n            0.0,\n        )]\n    };\n    match id {\n        1 => one(Square, 1400.0, 0.04, 0.16, 5000.0),\n        2 => one(Noise, 800.0, 0.06, 0.2, 4000.0),\n        3 => one(Noise, 300.0, 0.08, 0.18, 1200.0),\n        4 => one(Square, 900.0, 0.03, 0.14, 3000.0),\n        5 => one(Sine, 420.0, 0.07, 0.2, 2000.0),\n        6 => one(Saw, 1800.0, 0.05, 0.12, 6000.0),\n        7 => one(Noise, 180.0, 0.16, 0.22, 700.0),\n        8 => one(Saw, 660.0, 0.12, 0.1, 2500.0),\n        9 => one(Noise, 2400.0, 0.08, 0.16, 7000.0),\n        10 => one(Sine, 520.0, 0.09, 0.16, 1800.0),\n        11 => one(Noise, 1400.0, 0.1, 0.12, 5000.0),\n        12 => one(Sine, 880.0, 0.12, 0.18, 4000.0),\n        13 => one(Saw, 240.0, 0.4, 0.12, 1600.0),\n        14 => one(Sine, 70.0, 0.2, 0.4, 400.0),\n        15 => one(Sine, 90.0, 0.08, 0.22, 500.0),\n        16 => one(Sine, 60.0, 0.1, 0.2, 400.0),\n        17 => one(Square, 1040.0, 0.05, 0.1, 3000.0),\n        18 => one(Square, 740.0, 0.18, 0.16, 2000.0),\n        19 => one(Square, 1320.0, 0.1, 0.16, 4000.0),\n        20 => one(Square, 990.0, 0.08, 0.14, 3500.0),\n        21 => one(Sine, 1600.0, 0.03, 0.08, 5000.0),\n        22 => one(Saw, 220.0, 0.3, 0.2, 900.0),\n        23 => one(Noise, 200.0, 0.2, 0.28, 1500.0),\n        24 => one(Square, 700.0, 0.04, 0.1, 2500.0),\n        25 => one(Sine, 880.0, 0.08, 0.14, 3000.0),\n        26 => one(Square, 300.0, 0.06, 0.12, 1200.0),\n        27 => one(Square, 440.0, 0.2, 0.2, 1800.0),\n        28 => one(Saw, 110.0, 0.6, 0.18, 800.0),\n        29 => one(Square, 180.0, 0.1, 0.16, 900.0),\n        30 => one(Sine, 1400.0, 0.12, 0.1, 5000.0),\n        31 => vec![(\n            Patch {\n                decay: 0.05,\n                hold: 0.02,\n                volume: 0.2 * g,\n                formant_hz: 700.0 * p,\n                formant_hz2: 1400.0 * p,\n                ..Patch::new(Saw, 180.0 * p)\n            },\n            0.0,\n        )],\n        _ => one(Sine, 440.0, 0.08, 0.12, 2000.0),\n    }\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-178","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"        | SimEvent::Block { pos } => Some(*pos),\n        _ => None,\n    }\n}","new_string":"        | SimEvent::Block { pos }\n        | SimEvent::Cue { pos, .. } => Some(*pos),\n        _ => None,\n    }\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-179","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"enum Cmd {\n    Play(Patch, f32, f32, f32),\n    Master(f32),\n}","new_string":"enum Cmd {\n    Play(Patch, f32, f32, f32, u8),\n    Master(f32),\n    Buses(f32, f32, f32),\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-180","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"        for (patch, delay) in sounds_for(ev) {\n            let _ = self.tx.send(Cmd::Play(patch, pan, gain * sfx, delay));\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn set_master(&self, v: f32) {\n        let _ = self.tx.send(Cmd::Master(v));\n    }","new_string":"        for (patch, delay) in sounds_for(ev) {\n            let _ = self.tx.send(Cmd::Play(patch, pan, gain * sfx, delay, BUS_EFFECTS));\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn play_bus(&self, patch: Patch, pan: f32, gain: f32, delay: f32, bus: u8) {\n        let _ = self.tx.send(Cmd::Play(patch, pan, gain, delay, bus));\n    }\n\n    pub fn set_buses(&self, music: f32, effects: f32, voices: f32) {\n        let _ = self.tx.send(Cmd::Buses(music, effects, voices));\n    }\n\n    pub fn set_master(&self, v: f32) {\n        let _ = self.tx.send(Cmd::Master(v));\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-181","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"                    Cmd::Play(p, pan, gain, delay) => mixer.play(p, pan, gain, delay),\n                    Cmd::Master(v) => mixer.master = v,","new_string":"                    Cmd::Play(p, pan, gain, delay, bus) => mixer.play_on(p, pan, gain, delay, bus),\n                    Cmd::Master(v) => mixer.master = v,\n                    Cmd::Buses(m, e, v) => {\n                        mixer.music = m;\n                        mixer.effects = e;\n                        mixer.voices_gain = v;\n                    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-914f8c1c-89fa-4040-a8c2-a29b73417e55-182","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","old_string":"        assert!(peak_late < 1e-3, \"decays: {peak_late}\");\n    }\n}","new_string":"        assert!(peak_late < 1e-3, \"decays: {peak_late}\");\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn music_bus_defaults_quiet_and_every_cue_speaks() {\n        let mixer = Mixer::new(48000.0);\n        assert!((mixer.music - 0.10).abs() < 1e-6);\n        assert!((mixer.effects - 0.80).abs() < 1e-6);\n        assert!((mixer.voices_gain - 0.70).abs() < 1e-6);\n        for id in 1..32 {\n            let ev = SimEvent::Cue { id, pos: Vec3::ZERO, gain: 0.8, pitch: 1.0 };\n            let out = render_events(&[(0.0, ev)], 0.4, 22050.0, &Listener::default());\n            let peak = out.iter().fold(0.0f32, |m, s| m.max(s.abs()));\n            assert!(peak > 0.001, \"cue {id} silent {peak}\");\n        }\n        for name in music::TRACKS {\n            let out = music::render_track(name, 1.2, 90.0);\n            let peak = out.iter().fold(0.0f32, |m, s| m.max(s.abs()));\n            assert!(peak > 0.001, \"{name} silent {peak}\");\n        }\n        let voice = voice::render_line(\"Mara Quill\", \"Hold the line.\");\n        let peak = voice.iter().fold(0.0f32, |m, s| m.max(s.abs()));\n        assert!(peak > 0.001, \"voice silent {peak}\");\n    }\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3331,"output_tokens":4748,"cache_read_input_tokens":201088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"c4208465-5668-4d3a-93e3-d7b06e82b635"}
