{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_221","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to write music.rs and voice.rs and declare them in lib.rs.\n\nI'll make the modules public so the test in lib.rs can access them. I'm mapping out the track names from PLAN.md: title, story_a, story_b, or, crisis, four strain meters, hush, and results.\n\nI'll add \"results\" and \"code\" to the track list. The music module will expose `render_track(name, seconds, bpm)` returning a `Vec<f32>`. The voice module will expose `render_line(who, text)` for ~70ms syllables. Music will route through `BUS_MUSIC` at 0.10 gain and voices through `BUS_VOICES` at 0.70 gain. Peak levels should satisfy the test requirements.\n\nBus gain is baked into each voice at play time, so offline render is unaffected by later mixer changes. The module declarations will go after the imports in lib.rs.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The audio test calls music and voice modules that are not in the crate yet. I’ll add those, then check the view and shell against the real scene and egui types before compiling."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd8d6e09-45e6-4e0a-a058-2a86f804e4e6-8","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub struct (Sun|PointLight|Post|StyleSettings)|NO_SHADOW|enum Style|fn capsule|pub fn sphere|shadow_center|shadow_radius|cel_bands|pub outlines|pub gi","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_render/src","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd8d6e09-45e6-4e0a-a058-2a86f804e4e6-9","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"FontData|fn set_fonts|struct FontDefinitions|font_data","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_ui","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd8d6e09-45e6-4e0a-a058-2a86f804e4e6-10","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"serde_json","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_ui/Cargo.toml"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd8d6e09-45e6-4e0a-a058-2a86f804e4e6-11","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5990,"output_tokens":1015,"cache_read_input_tokens":41600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"0f59288a-34d5-406f-a0aa-9d106a04594d"}
