{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_228","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing music.rs and voice.rs. Adding serde_json to pav_ui. Compiling pav_audio, pav_ui, and pav_view together.\n\nBackgrounding the cargo compile so I can write product.rs while it runs.\n\nChecking shell step() for bugs before compiling. Drafting the music module with 12 track names and a render_track function using a 22050 Hz mixer.\n\nFleshing out the render_track loop with beat timing and step scheduling. Each track gets a distinct character: hush is quiet and slow, code is urgent with square bass, and the introit, lacrimosa, and dies tracks use 3/4, 6/8, and 5/4 meters.\n\nDrafting voice.rs with a render_line function that syllabifies text and schedules each syllable as a sawtooth patch with formant filters, attack-decay-hold-release envelopes, and 0.07 second durations.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e84114c7-c68e-4945-a633-672d55bf57c9-36","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"FIELDS|fn get|fn set","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/tune.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e84114c7-c68e-4945-a633-672d55bf57c9-37","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_ui/src/surgery/mod.rs","offset":90,"limit":280}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1789,"output_tokens":1061,"cache_read_input_tokens":67328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"5becc0c6-d1e9-4a97-a83d-ee87e8008869"}
