{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_239","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking audio event playback around frame 1210 and how ViewBuilder::build places the surgery frame in curr.\n\nPlanning the product.rs module. It will use a Harbor struct to hold UI shell, input state, and audio fields. Also reviewing gilrs API for multi-pad polling and input.rs gamepad logic.\n\nThe product.rs module will expose `is_surgery`, a `Harbor` struct, and a `surgery_frame` function. Because it is a child module of `app.rs`, it can access the parent's private fields and methods directly.\n\n`surgery_frame` will replicate a slim present path rather than call `frame()`. The window title should be set at initialization if the scene starts with \"surgery\".\n\nThe window title will be set to the surgery game title or \"Shardfall\" at initialization. The same title will be used for fail messages. Adding js-sys to workspace and wasm dependencies for window.__game access. Reviewing gilrs button enum mapping in input.rs, CameraRig::ground_point signature, and a minimal audio event playback path. Music scheduling will use tune.music.\n\nProduct will set buses each frame and schedule a looping bed. AudioOut::play_bus takes a Patch, not a buffer, so the product must schedule patches directly. I am deciding whether to add a scheduler helper in music.rs or duplicate a simple loop scheduler.\n\nA `notes` helper in music.rs will generate patches for a track. Product will schedule two bars of music each frame via `play_bus` when no voice is active. Track selection depends on the current sim mode from `SurgeryFrame`. I need to read `SurgeryFrame` and `to_frame` to find the exact track names.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f5e6d3-c13e-4973-899d-2089b09fe367-73","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/frame.rs","offset":110,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f5e6d3-c13e-4973-899d-2089b09fe367-74","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":750,"limit":140}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f5e6d3-c13e-4973-899d-2089b09fe367-75","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","offset":1180,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f5e6d3-c13e-4973-899d-2089b09fe367-76","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/input.rs","offset":400,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95f5e6d3-c13e-4973-899d-2089b09fe367-77","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/lib.rs","offset":680,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3281,"output_tokens":1414,"cache_read_input_tokens":104960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"7346626a-65e9-414b-ad6a-fa87ceb95658"}
