op) -> Result<()> {\"},{\"line_number\":363,\"content\":\"                use winit::platform::web::WindowAttributesExtWebSys;\"},{\"line_number\":778,\"content\":\"    fn handle_key(&mut self, code: KeyCode) {\"},{\"line_number\":783,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F6 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"playing\\\": !p.playing})),\"},{\"line_number\":784,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F7 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"step\\\": 1})),\"},{\"line_number\":785,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F8 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"speed\\\": (p.speed * 0.5).max(0.05)})),\"},{\"line_number\":786,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F9 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"speed\\\": (p.speed * 2.0).min(8.0)})),\"},{\"line_number\":801,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F6 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"playing\\\": !p.playing})),\"},{\"line_number\":802,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F7 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"playing\\\": false, \\\"time\\\": p.time + 1.0 / 60.0})),\"},{\"line_number\":803,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F8 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"speed\\\": (p.speed * 0.5).max(0.05)})),\"},{\"line_number\":804,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F9 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"speed\\\": (p.speed * 2.0).min(8.0)})),\"},{\"line_number\":819,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F6 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"playing\\\": !p.playing})),\"},{\"line_number\":820,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F7 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"step\\\": 1})),\"},{\"line_number\":821,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F8 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"speed\\\": (p.speed * 0.5).max(0.05)})),\"},{\"line_number\":822,\"content\":\"                    KeyCode::F9 => Some(serde_json::json!({\\\"speed\\\": (p.speed * 2.0).min(8.0)})),\"},{\"line_number\":838,\"content\":\"                KeyCode::KeyI | KeyCode::Tab => {\"},{\"line_number\":842,\"content\":\"                KeyCode::KeyC => {\"},{\"line_number\":846,\"content\":\"                KeyCode::KeyK => {\"},{\"line_number\":850,\"content\":\"                KeyCode::KeyP => {\"},{\"line_number\":854,\"content\":\"                KeyCode::KeyM => {\"},{\"line_number\":858,\"content\":\"                KeyCode::KeyT => {\"},{\"line_number\":865,\"content\":\"                KeyCode::Escape if ui.any_open() => {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"6361196b-d58b-46da-ae02-f2ac401089d6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_249","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking if a child product module can use the parent app.rs imports.\n\nChild modules cannot inherit parent `use` statements. product.rs must import winit types directly. App fields remain accessible. The ViewBuilder::build signature is already known.\n\nFocus will be (0,0,0.2). The product module must be declared at the top of app.rs before the struct that uses it. App::new needs a new `harbor: product::Harbor` field and a call to `Harbor::new()`. Audio listener comes from rig. Events come from shared.events. I will write product.rs to compile and fix errors afterward.\n\nThe touch-only flag will be set on the public `shell.touch_only` field. Font installation will use a `harbor.fonted` guard and call `install_font` once. Drawing will route through `pav_ui::surgery::draw`. The step method needs a mutable shell reference. A chart screen will be added. Dev menu rows are confirmed: 9 items total with focus at row 8 for Reset All, and settings has 3 items.\n\nShell tests will be added to the surgery module under `cfg(test)` once product.rs compiles. SurgeonInput and surgery_cmd are Copy types. InputFrame writes surgeons each frame and clears surgery_cmd to None so commands flow through exec. Pressed bits are set for the current frame and cleared by the clock after one tick. If pump runs zero ticks, the pressed state persists until the next thread tick.\n\nProduct will track previous held keys to detect key transitions and only set pressed bits on edges, not every frame while a key is held. The Harbor struct will store down, just, mouse coordinates, mouse button states, and an any flag.\n\nThe Harbor struct will also store four PadHand controllers. Key presses append to just and down sets and set any. Releases remove from down. Mouse movement updates coordinates and flags mouse_moved when delta exceeds two pixels. Left button press sets mouse_just and mouse_down and any. Release clears mouse_down. surgery_frame consumes just and mouse_just and mouse_moved into shell input and surgeon pressed then clears the edge lists. Pad buttons are polled each frame against previous states. Start acts as pause or back. The pad reader is being written next.\n\nRight trigger 2 analog value will be read from the pad. The previous left-stick octant is stored in harbor.prev_octant[4]. Strain will be added to the frame. apply_cmd needs to be public. The HUD needs fixing. Exports need updating. The ops attract bot needs wiring. Clock clearing needs fixing. The title needs setting. The surgery branch should come first in frame() so it also handles the gfx none case. In window_event, the surgery branch goes first but egui still needs events for hover.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-64fc11c9-0a2b-45c3-928d-6a4d742c3a28-106","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn touch_screen","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/platform.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-64fc11c9-0a2b-45c3-928d-6a4d742c3a28-107","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/frame.rs","offset":180,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3962,"output_tokens":1309,"cache_read_input_tokens":135296,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"b89c5900-53a2-4d9d-a273-b91b20fa6fa5"}
