creen::Menu) {\\n                        continue;\\n                    }\\n                    let y_focus = line.starts_with('>');\\n                    let color = if y_focus {\\n                        egui::Color32::from_rgb(255, 214, 120)\\n                    } else {\\n                        egui::Color32::from_rgb(220, 226, 230)\\n                    };\\n                    ui.horizontal(|ui| {\\n                        ui.add_space(220.0);\\n                        ui.label(egui::RichText::new(line).size(if y_focus { 48.0 } else { 40.0 }).color(color));\\n                    });\\n                    ui.add_space(8.0);\\n                }\\n                if shell.screen == Screen::Attract {\\n                    ui.label(egui::RichText::new(\\\"DEMO\\\").size(64.0).strong().color(egui::Color32::from_rgb(255, 80, 70)));\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    });\\n}\\n\\nfn draw_hud(ui: &egui::Ui, op: Option<&SurgeryFrame>) {\\n    let Some(op) = op else { return };\\n    let ctx = ui.ctx();\\n    egui::Area::new(egui::Id::new(\\\"harbor_hud\\\")).anchor(egui::Align2::LEFT_TOP, egui::vec2(36.0, 24.0)).show(ctx, |ui| {\\n        let beat = if op.on_beat { \\\"♥\\\" } else { \\\"♡\\\" };\\n        ui.label(\\n            egui::RichText::new(format!(\\\"{beat}  {:.0}\\\", op.vitals)).size(64.0).strong().color(egui::Color32::from_rgb(230, 70, 70)),\\n        );\\n        ui.label(egui::RichText::new(format!(\\\"BPM {:.0}\\\", op.bpm)).size(32.0));\\n    });\\n    egui::Area::new(egui::Id::new(\\\"harbor_time\\\")).anchor(egui::Align2::RIGHT_TOP, egui::vec2(-36.0, 24.0)).show(ctx, |ui| {\\n        let t = op.timer.max(0.0) as i32;\\n        ui.label(egui::RichText::new(format!(\\\"{:02}:{:02}\\\", t / 60, t % 60)).size(64.0).strong());\\n    });\\n    if !op.callout.is_empty() {\\n        egui::Area::new(egui::Id::new(\\\"harbor_now\\\")).anchor(egui::Align2::CENTER_TOP, egui::vec2(0.0, 28.0)).show(ctx, |ui| {\\n            ui.label(egui::RichText::new(format!(\\\"NOW  {}\\\", op.callout)).size(32.0).color(egui::Color32::from_rgb(230, 220, 180)));\\n        });\\n    }\\n    if !op.banner.is_empty() {\\n        egui::Area::new(egui::Id::new(\\\"harbor_banner\\\")).anchor(egui::Align2::CENTER_CENTER, egui::vec2(0.0, -80.0)).show(ctx, |ui| {\\n            ui.label(egui::RichText::new(&op.banner).size(54.0).strong().color(egui::Color32::from_rgb(255, 230, 180)));\\n        });\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Dev Reset All is a labelled row the step() path also exposes.\\npub fn dev_reset(shell: &mut Shell) -> Cmd {\\n    shell.reset_sliders()\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":763}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"a7bb386f-e082-4f4d-abf8-44b9c6b18d03"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_252","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The draw function uses Area inside a Ui callback.\n\nArea nesting is valid. The 1920-point width matches the viewport. Chart will be added to note_mode, screen_name, and activate.\n\nChart will use a Story-like layout in draw, showing patient info and operation name. It needs to be added to the Screen enum and every match block.\n\nAdding Chart will break exhaustiveness checks in screen_name, lines, back, activate, and draw. The skip list in note_mode does not need updating.\n\nA `phrase` function will be added to `music.rs` to return note sequences for a given tempo. `render_track` will be refactored to reuse it. The shell and product files will be updated next.\n\nApp::frame needs a careful early return. Surgery_frame must use self.host.as_ref().\n\nA local window_title helper will return the surgery title for surgery scenes and \"Shardfall\" otherwise.\n\nThe fail() error box title should not use the game title.\n\nThe fail() heading will use the surgery title when the scene starts with \"surgery\", otherwise \"Shardfall could not start\". main.rs may also need a similar update if it handles panics before the scene is known.\n\nThe packer replaces the HTML title automatically. I will edit the simulation shell and session modules first, then write product.rs and wire it into the app, then add shell tests, and finally compile. A headless frame function for the surgery shell is also needed to satisfy verification.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c04bfe87-9cf1-49d9-b9d0-301a662bb614-111","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/tune.rs","offset":1,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3089,"output_tokens":1190,"cache_read_input_tokens":141184,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"e5a034be-0801-4afd-8a5a-f70739f99474"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c04bfe87-9cf1-49d9-b9d0-301a662bb614-111","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→//! Live balance sliders. Defaults are what a fresh game and Reset All restore.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(default)]\\npub struct Tune {\\n    pub drain: f32,\\n    pub timer: f32,\\n10→    pub tool_power: f32,\\n    pub iv_heal: f32,\\n    pub strain_speed: f32,\\n    pub strain_tough: f32,\\n    pub heart_coupling: f32,\\n    pub beat_window_ms: f32,\\n    pub cursor_speed: f32,\\n    pub aim_assist: f32,\\n    pub gift_gain: f32,\\n    pub gift_duration: f32,\\n20→    pub hush_scale: f32,\\n    pub echo_duration: f32,\\n    pub chain_window: f32,\\n    pub rating_strict: f32,\\n    pub wrong_penalty: f32,\\n    pub code_window: f32,\\n    pub score_mul: f32,\\n    pub tremor: f32,\\n    pub music: f32,\\n    pub effects: f32,\\n30→    pub voices: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Tune {\\n    fn default() -> Self {\\n        Self {\\n            drain: 1.0,\\n            timer: 1.0,\\n            tool_power: 1.0,\\n            iv_heal: 1.0,\\n40→            strain_speed: 1.0,\\n            strain_tough: 1.0,\\n            heart_coupling: 1.0,\\n            beat_window_ms: 110.0,\\n            cursor_speed: 15.0,\\n            aim_assist: 1.0,\\n            gift_gain: 1.0,\\n            gift_duration: 1.0,\\n            hush_scale: 0.30,\\n            echo_duration: 10.0,\\n50→            chain_window: 8.0,\\n            rating_strict: 1.0,\\n            wrong_penalty: 1.0,\\n            code_window: 5.0,\\n            score_mul: 1.0,\\n            tremor: 1.0,\\n            music: 0.10,\\n            effects: 0.80,\\n            voices: 0.70,\\n        }\\n60→    }\\n}\\n\\nimpl Tune {\\n    pub const FIELDS: &'static [(&'static str, f32, f32, f32)] = &[\\n        (\\\"vitals drain\\\", 1.0, 0.0, 3.0),\\n        (\\\"timer\\\", 1.0, 0.2, 3.0),\\n        (\\\"tool power\\\", 1.0, 0.2, 3.0),\\n        (\\\"IV heal\\\", 1.0, 0.0, 3.0),\\n        (\\\"strain speed\\\", 1.0, 0.2, 2.5),\\n70→        (\\\"strain toughness\\\", 1.0, 0.2, 3.0),\\n        (\\\"heart coupling\\\", 1.0, 0.25, 2.0),\\n        (\\\"on-beat window ms\\\", 110.0, 20.0, 250.0),\\n        (\\\"cursor speed\\\", 15.0, 4.0, 30.0),\\n        (\\\"aim assist\\\", 1.0, 0.0, 2.0),\\n        (\\\"gift gain\\\", 1.0, 0.0, 4.0),\\n        (\\\"gift duration\\\", 1.0, 0.2, 3.0),\\n        (\\\"Hush time scale\\\", 0.30, 0.05, 1.0),\\n        (\\\"Echo duration\\\", 10.0, 1.0, 30.0),\\n        (\\\"chain window\\\", 8.0, 1.0, 20.0),\\n80→        (\\\"rating strictness\\\", 1.0, 0.4, 2.0),\\n        (\\\"wrong-tool penalty\\\", 1.0, 0.0, 3.0),\\n        (\\\"Code window s\\\", 5.0, 1.0, 12.0),\\n        (\\\"score\\\", 1.0, 0.2, 3.0),\\n    ];\\n\\n    pub fn get(&self, id: u8) -> f32 {\\n        let v = [\\n            self.drain,\\n            self.timer,\\n90→            self.tool_power,\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! Live balance sliders. Defaults are what a fresh game and Reset All restore.\\n\\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\\n\\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]\\n#[serde(default)]\\npub struct Tune {\\n    pub drain: f32,\\n    pub timer: f32,\\n10→    pub tool_power: f32,\\n    pub iv_heal: f32,\\n    pub strain_speed: f32,\\n    pub strain_tough: f32,\\n    pub heart_coupling: f32,\\n    pub beat_window_ms: f32,\\n    pub cursor_speed: f32,\\n    pub aim_assist: f32,\\n    pub gift_gain: f32,\\n    pub gift_duration: f32,\\n20→    pub hush_scale: f32,\\n    pub echo_duration: f32,\\n    pub chain_window: f32,\\n    pub rating_strict: f32,\\n    pub wrong_penalty: f32,\\n    pub code_window: f32,\\n    pub score_mul: f32,\\n    pub tremor: f32,\\n    pub music: f32,\\n    pub effects: f32,\\n30→    pub voices: f32,\\n}\\n\\nimpl Default for Tune {\\n    fn default() -> S