        aim_toward(game, me, slot, skill, tick, me.x, me.z, &mut inp);\"},{\"line_number\":49,\"content\":\"    let (mut tx, mut tz) = aim_for(h, tick, side);\"},{\"line_number\":59,\"content\":\"    aim_toward(game, me, slot, skill, tick, tx, tz, &mut inp);\"},{\"line_number\":138,\"content\":\"fn aim_for(h: &Hazard, tick: u64, side: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\"},{\"line_number\":145,\"content\":\"    aim_point(h, side)\"},{\"line_number\":177,\"content\":\"fn aim_toward(game: &Surgery, me: &Surgeon, slot: usize, skill: f32, tick: u64, mut tx: f32, mut tz: f32, inp: &mut SurgeonInput) {\"},{\"line_number\":184,\"content\":\"    let step = (3.0 + 12.0 * skill) * DT;\"},{\"line_number\":188,\"content\":\"    if dist > step && dist > 0.0001 {\"},{\"line_number\":189,\"content\":\"        tx = me.x + dx / dist * step;\"},{\"line_number\":190,\"content\":\"        tz = me.z + dz / dist * step;\"},{\"line_number\":194,\"content\":\"    inp.aim = glam::Vec2::new(tx, tz);\"},{\"line_number\":195,\"content\":\"    inp.held |= surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE;\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"04858a3e-0622-4cfe-b2d4-23c96a9f30e0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_267","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bot uses AIM_ABSOLUTE without SNAP. It slews at cursor_speed toward the target point.\n\nAim assist will be added to the relative steering branch for keyboard and pad input. It will pull the cursor toward the nearest hazard within 1.2 units when aim length is nonzero, slowing speed. The absolute slew path is excluded because it would affect the bot.\n\nThe assist will be added in `hands()` before `steer`, gated by the absence of `AIM_ABSOLUTE`. Precision mode scales aim by 0.35. The pull vector is computed from the nearest accepting hazard within 1.2 units.\n\nThe assist scales stick speed by up to 50% and pulls the cursor toward the hazard at up to 3 units per second. Closeness is computed from normalized pull distance and capped at assist 2.0.\n\nThe assist will be applied by adding a unit-per-second pull vector to the aim, scaled by closeness and divided by cursor speed. The local `inp` variable in `hands()` will be made mutable so the adjusted aim can be written back before `steer`.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-06a3f15c-4dd6-4ad4-863f-ed3b5caf7f3b-131","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"CHART|GIFT|DEFIB|CANCEL","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":793,"output_tokens":948,"cache_read_input_tokens":161920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"bc448e1e-f14d-4ca2-af08-b23d632940c6"}
