2],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":2,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/bot.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\"            inp.held |= surg::GIFT;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":495,\"content\":\"    let held = inp.held & surg::GIFT != 0;\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"83ee650c-db57-49a0-b7cb-ed4d256bd7d6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_269","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"CHART and CANCEL are not read in ops.\n\nCANCEL may not be implemented. Chart overlay might be UI-only, but the bit will still be sent. The gift function release behavior is confirmed. Aim assist will be added to hands for relative input only. A `paused` method will be added. Shell Screen::Chart matches will be updated. All files will be written next.\n\nThe `assist_aim` function will be placed near the steer logic. It scales aim by `g.tune.aim_assist` clamped between 0 and 2.\n\nThe `assist_aim` function returns the aim unchanged if the scale is zero or the input is nearly still. It scans for alive, non-heat hazards that accept the current tool and selects the nearest one within 1.2 units. If that hazard is closer than 0.02 units, it weakens the aim by up to half of the assist scale.\n\nThe `assist_aim` function now pulls the aim toward the nearest hazard. Closeness is scaled by `scale.min(1.0)`. The aim is weakened by half of that closeness. A pull vector is computed from the hazard direction and added to the aim, using cursor speed and delta time. `Hazard::accepts` must be public for ops access. `Vec2` is imported via `glam::Vec3`.\n\n`glam::Vec2` will be used directly in the new function. The bot will not trigger this logic because it sets `AIM_ABSOLUTE`. `Hazard::accepts` is confirmed public for ops access. The large `product.rs` will be written carefully in one pass. A `burst` method is being added to `SimHost` for WASM.\n\nThe `burst` method will step the simulation up to 240 times, applying the same input each tick and publishing results. The copied input's `pressed` flag will be cleared after the first burst tick so it does not repeat across subsequent ticks.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d7914377-5664-4859-8969-ef2b4364093f-133","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"ls -la \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_ui/fonts\" | head","description":"Confirm the UI font file exists"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":436,"output_tokens":1346,"cache_read_input_tokens":163840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"5345fb42-9624-4fcf-bb68-e5a156c5ee1b"}
