{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_270","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Starting to write the code. Many edits will be needed.\n\nAdding a `phrase()` helper to music.rs. It will extract the recipe and timing logic from `render_track` into a reusable function.\n\n`phrase()` returns a duration and a vector of notes. `render_track` will call it and schedule only notes that start before the requested seconds, since a two-bar phrase may exceed the 1.2-second test window.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The music test passed. Next I’ll wire the shell to the sim and the product frame so a surgery scene never falls through into the demo loop."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-134","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_audio/src/music.rs","old_string":"/// Offline stereo render. `seconds` is how long to hear the bed; `bpm` sets the pulse.\npub fn render_track(name: &str, seconds: f32, bpm: f32) -> Vec<f32> {\n    let sr = 22050.0;\n    let mut mixer = Mixer::new(sr);\n    let (steps, scale, lead, bass_hz) = recipe(name);\n    let beat = 60.0 / bpm.max(40.0);\n    let step = beat * if steps >= 6 { 0.5 } else { 1.0 };\n    let mut t = 0.0;\n    let mut i = 0usize;\n    while t < seconds + step {\n        let degree = scale[i % scale.len()];\n        let freq = 220.0 * 2.0_f32.powf(degree as f32 / 12.0);\n        let accent = if i % steps == 0 { 1.0 } else { 0.55 };\n        mixer.play_on(\n            Patch {\n                attack: 0.01,\n                decay: step * 0.7,\n                sustain: 0.2,\n                volume: 0.55 * accent,\n                cutoff: 1800.0,\n                cutoff_end: 900.0,\n                ..Patch::new(lead, freq)\n            },\n            0.15,\n            1.0,\n            t,\n            BUS_MUSIC,\n        );\n        if i % steps == 0 {\n            mixer.play_on(\n                Patch {\n                    attack: 0.005,\n                    decay: step * steps as f32 * 0.8,\n                    volume: 0.7,\n                    ..Patch::new(Wave::Sine, bass_hz)\n                },\n                -0.2,\n                1.0,\n                t,\n                BUS_MUSIC,\n            );\n        }\n        t += step;\n        i += 1;\n        if i > 512 {\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    let frames = (seconds.max(0.05) * sr) as usize;\n    let mut out = vec![0.0; frames * 2];\n    mixer.render(&mut out);\n    out\n}","new_string":"pub struct Note {\n    pub patch: Patch,\n    pub pan: f32,\n    pub gain: f32,\n    pub delay: f32,\n}\n\n/// Two bars of a bed, and how long they last. The product schedules this on the music bus.\npub fn phrase(name: &str, bpm: f32) -> (f32, Vec<Note>) {\n    let (steps, scale, lead, bass_hz) = recipe(name);\n    let beat = 60.0 / bpm.max(40.0);\n    let step = beat * if steps >= 6 { 0.5 } else { 1.0 };\n    let count = steps * 2;\n    let mut notes = Vec::new();\n    for i in 0..count {\n        let t = i as f32 * step;\n        let degree = scale[i % scale.len()];\n        let freq = 220.0 * 2.0_f32.powf(degree as f32 / 12.0);\n        let accent = if i % steps == 0 { 1.0 } else { 0.55 };\n        notes.push(Note {\n            patch: Patch {\n                attack: 0.01,\n                decay: step * 0.7,\n                sustain: 0.2,\n                volume: 0.55 * accent,\n                cutoff: 1800.0,\n                cutoff_end: 900.0,\n                ..Patch::new(lead, freq)\n            },\n            pan: 0.15,\n            gain: 1.0,\n            delay: t,\n        });\n        if i % steps == 0 {\n            notes.push(Note {\n                patch: Patch {\n                    attack: 0.005,\n                    decay: step * steps as f32 * 0.8,\n                    volume: 0.7,\n                    ..Patch::new(Wave::Sine, bass_hz)\n                },\n                pan: -0.2,\n                gain: 1.0,\n                delay: t,\n            });\n        }\n    }\n    (count as f32 * step, notes)\n}\n\n/// Offline stereo render. `seconds` is how long to hear the bed; `bpm` sets the pulse.\npub fn render_track(name: &str, seconds: f32, bpm: f32) -> Vec<f32> {\n    let sr = 22050.0;\n    let mut mixer = Mixer::new(sr);\n    let (_dur, notes) = phrase(name, bpm);\n    for n in notes {\n        if n.delay > seconds {\n            continue;\n        }\n        mixer.play_on(n.patch, n.pan, n.gain, n.delay, BUS_MUSIC);\n    }\n    let frames = (seconds.max(0.05) * sr) as usize;\n    let mut out = vec![0.0; frames * 2];\n    mixer.render(&mut out);\n    out\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-135","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/input.rs","old_string":"    /// 0 immortal, 1 freeze timer, 2 full gift, 3 one-hit, 4 force code, 5 kill, 6 win, 7 jump phase.\n    Dev { what: u8, extra: u8 },\n    SpawnHazard(u8),\n}","new_string":"    /// 0 immortal, 1 freeze timer, 2 full gift, 3 one-hit, 4 force code, 5 kill, 6 win, 7 jump phase.\n    Dev { what: u8, extra: u8 },\n    SpawnHazard(u8),\n    LoadAttract,\n    ToTitle,\n    /// 0 music, 1 effects, 2 voices. These sit beside the numbered sliders.\n    SetBus { which: u8, value: f32 },\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-136","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"pub use content::{case_def, CASES};\npub use frame::SurgeryFrame;\npub use hazard::Hazard;\npub use heart::Heart;\npub use kinds::*;\npub use tune::Tune;","new_string":"pub use content::{case_def, CASES, SURGEON_NAMES};\npub use frame::SurgeryFrame;\npub use hazard::Hazard;\npub use heart::Heart;\npub use kinds::*;\npub use story::{all_lines, callout_who};\npub use tune::Tune;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-137","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"    fn command(&mut self, cmd: SurgeryCmd) {","new_string":"    pub fn apply_cmd(&mut self, cmd: SurgeryCmd) {\n        self.command(cmd);\n    }\n\n    fn command(&mut self, cmd: SurgeryCmd) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-138","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"            SurgeryCmd::SpawnHazard(k) => {\n                let n = self.spawn_n;\n                self.spawn_n = self.spawn_n.wrapping_add(1);\n                let ang = n as f32 * 0.9;\n                self.spawn_kind_at(k.min(K_BURN), ang.cos() * 1.2, ang.sin() * 0.8, -1.0);\n            }\n        }\n    }","new_string":"            SurgeryCmd::SpawnHazard(k) => {\n                let n = self.spawn_n;\n                self.spawn_n = self.spawn_n.wrapping_add(1);\n                let ang = n as f32 * 0.9;\n                self.spawn_kind_at(k.min(K_BURN), ang.cos() * 1.2, ang.sin() * 0.8, -1.0);\n            }\n            SurgeryCmd::LoadAttract => self.boot_attract(),\n            SurgeryCmd::ToTitle => {\n                self.mode = M_TITLE;\n                self.outcome = Outcome::Playing;\n                self.hazards.clear();\n                self.code_t = -1.0;\n                self.heart.flat = false;\n            }\n            SurgeryCmd::SetBus { which, value } => {\n                let v = value.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\n                match which {\n                    0 => self.tune.music = v,\n                    1 => self.tune.effects = v,\n                    2 => self.tune.voices = v,\n                    _ => {}\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-139","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\n        let clock = clock(self.timer);\n        let rank = if self.rank == 0 { \"\" } else { rank_name(self.rank) };\n        vec![\n            format!(\"{}  {}\", self.to_frame().patient, self.to_frame().op_name),\n            format!(\"Vitals {:.0}   BPM {:.0}\", self.heart.vitals, self.heart.bpm),\n            format!(\"Score {}  {}\", self.total_score(), rank),\n            format!(\"Time {clock}\"),\n        ]\n    }","new_string":"    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\n        Vec::new()\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-140","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"            \"title\": TITLE,\n        })\n    }","new_string":"            \"title\": TITLE,\n            \"cursors\": self.surgeons.iter().map(|s| json!({\n                \"x\": s.x, \"z\": s.z, \"tool\": s.tool, \"active\": s.active\n            })).collect::<Vec<_>>(),\n        })\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-141","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"        fr.heat_on = self.heat_on;\n        fr.heat_angle = self.heat_angle;","new_string":"        fr.heat_on = self.heat_on;\n        fr.heat_angle = self.heat_angle;\n        fr.strain = self.strain_phase;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-142","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/frame.rs","old_string":"    pub heat_on: bool,\n    pub heat_angle: f32,","new_string":"    pub heat_on: bool,\n    pub heat_angle: f32,\n    pub strain: u8,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-143","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/frame.rs","old_string":"            heat_on: false,\n            heat_angle: 0.0,","new_string":"            heat_on: false,\n            heat_angle: 0.0,\n            strain: 255,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-144","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","old_string":"    let mut slots = input.surgeons;\n    if g.case_id == 7 && !slots[1].active {\n        slots[1] = bot::decide(g, sim.state.tick, 1);\n    }","new_string":"    let mut slots = input.surgeons;\n    if g.mode == M_ATTRACT {\n        slots[0] = bot::decide(g, sim.state.tick, 0);\n        slots[0].active = true;\n    }\n    if g.case_id == 7 && !slots[1].active {\n        slots[1] = bot::decide(g, sim.state.tick, 1);\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-145","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","old_string":"        let inp = slots[i];\n        let lead = i == 0;","new_string":"        let mut inp = slots[i];\n        if inp.held & surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE == 0 {\n            if inp.held & surg::PRECISION != 0 {\n                inp.aim *= 0.35;\n            }\n            inp.aim = assist_aim(g, g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z, g.surgeons[i].tool, inp.aim, dt);\n        }\n        let lead = i == 0;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-146","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","old_string":"fn steer(s: &mut Surgeon, inp: SurgeonInput, dt: f32, speed: f32) {","new_string":"fn assist_aim(g: &Surgery, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, aim: glam::Vec2, dt: f32) -> glam::Vec2 {\n    let scale = g.tune.aim_assist.clamp(0.0, 2.0);\n    if scale <= 0.0 || aim.length_squared() < 0.0004 {\n        return aim;\n    }\n    let mut best: Option<(f32, f32, f32)> = None;\n    for h in &g.hazards {\n        if !h.alive || h.kind == K_HEAT || !h.accepts(tool) {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let dx = h.x - x;\n        let dz = h.z - z;\n        let d = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt();\n        if d < 1.2 && best.map(|(bd, _, _)| d < bd).unwrap_or(true) {\n            best = Some((d, dx, dz));\n        }\n    }\n    let Some((d, dx, dz)) = best else { return aim };\n    let closeness = (1.0 - d / 1.2).clamp(0.0, 1.0) * scale.min(1.0);\n    let mut aim = aim * (1.0 - 0.5 * closeness);\n    if d > 0.02 {\n        let inv = 1.0 / d;\n        let pull = 3.0 * dt * closeness;\n        let extra = pull / (g.tune.cursor_speed.max(1.0) * dt.max(1e-4));\n        aim.x += dx * inv * extra;\n        aim.y += dz * inv * extra;\n    }\n    aim\n}\n\nfn steer(s: &mut Surgeon, inp: SurgeonInput, dt: f32, speed: f32) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-147","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/simhost.rs","old_string":"                let mut i = sh.input.lock().unwrap();\n                let mut frame = *i;\n                i.pressed = 0;\n                frame.cmd = sh.cmds.lock().unwrap().pop_front();\n                frame","new_string":"                let mut i = sh.input.lock().unwrap();\n                let mut frame = *i;\n                i.pressed = 0;\n                i.surgery_cmd = None;\n                for s in &mut i.surgeons {\n                    s.pressed = 0;\n                }\n                frame.cmd = sh.cmds.lock().unwrap().pop_front();\n                frame"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-148","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/simhost.rs","old_string":"    /// Runs the ticks that are due (called once per frame).\n    pub fn pump(&self) {","new_string":"    /// Runs `n` ticks immediately. The first keeps button edges; the rest see holds only.\n    pub fn burst(&self, n: u32) {\n        let mut sim = self.sim.borrow_mut();\n        let mut input = *self.shared.input.lock().unwrap();\n        for i in 0..n.min(240) {\n            sim.step(&input);\n            if i == 0 {\n                input.pressed = 0;\n                input.surgery_cmd = None;\n                for s in &mut input.surgeons {\n                    s.pressed = 0;\n                }\n            }\n            let dt = sim.dt();\n            publish(&mut sim, &self.shared, dt, Instant::now());\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// Runs the ticks that are due (called once per frame).\n    pub fn pump(&self) {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-149","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_tools/src/session.rs","old_string":"    pub fn sync_camera(&mut self) {\n        use pav_core::params::{ParamValue, apply_map};\n        if self.live || self.sim.studio_active() {\n            return;\n        }","new_string":"    pub fn sync_camera(&mut self) {\n        use pav_core::params::{ParamValue, apply_map};\n        if self.sim.play().is_some_and(|g| g.key() == \"surgery\") {\n            self.camera.params.tilt = 73.0;\n            self.camera.params.yaw = 0.0;\n            self.camera.params.distance = 19.9;\n            self.camera.params.fov = 36.0;\n            self.camera.params.ortho = false;\n            self.camera.params.follow_lag = 0.0;\n            self.camera.params.height_offset = 0.0;\n            self.camera.snap(glam::Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2));\n            return;\n        }\n        if self.live || self.sim.studio_active() {\n            return;\n        }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-150","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_tools/src/session.rs","old_string":"pub fn has_ui(frame: &RenderFrame) -> bool {\n    frame.game.is_some() || !frame.hud.lines.is_empty()\n}","new_string":"pub fn has_ui(frame: &RenderFrame) -> bool {\n    frame.game.is_some() || frame.surgery.is_some() || !frame.hud.lines.is_empty()\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a45d33cb-0ae8-4d90-8a64-e45706a174ee-151","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"    scene.post.gi = 0.6;\n    scene.filter.vignette = 0.35;\n}","new_string":"    scene.post.gi = 0.6;\n    scene.filter.vignette = 0.35;\n    scene.fog.enabled = false;\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":155613,"output_tokens":5462,"cache_read_input_tokens":10112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-