{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_331","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pool requires 0.7 seconds of suction.\n\nFive pools can be spawned within the 8-second chain window. Each takes 0.7 seconds to suction, totaling 3.5 seconds. The existing case 0 drain adds to this. Chain 5 yields a 1.25 multiplier.\n\nA concrete implementation is drafted. It spawns five pools and suction-holds each for 90 frames until dead, then asserts the chain reaches 5 and the multiplier is 1.25.\n\nSpawnHazard and suction can be combined into a single input step because commands execute before the tick. The newest alive pool is the target. Case 0 wounds might be closer to spawn positions, so cursor placement matters. Spawn angles are spaced by 0.9 radians with offsets (cos*1.2, sin*0.8).","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92eb7ffb-01f5-4d8b-a16c-e94d112c913d-112","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content.rs","offset":160,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92eb7ffb-01f5-4d8b-a16c-e94d112c913d-113","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub const K_POOL|pub const SUCTION|pub const K_POLYP","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/kinds.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":501,"output_tokens":819,"cache_read_input_tokens":125696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"681c2496-e5f3-4d4b-97c0-817f2c54b233"}
