{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_383","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The View component should compile. The Product component may have issues.\n\nWaiting for cargo check to finish. I'll read the hub protocol files and PLAN appendix C while waiting so I can write the shim immediately after compilation succeeds. I'm also pre-scanning Product for common type mismatches.\n\nI checked the Product code for specific API compatibility. `as_deref` on `Option<Arc<T>>` yields `Option<&T>`. `track_name` takes `&SurgeryFrame`. `KeyCode` is hashable. `app.harbor.shell` and `note_mode` are public. `set_zoom_factor` exists. `scene.fog` is available. Camera rig methods and fields match. `ViewSettings::default` exists.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9787634-270e-43da-9138-3fc30e588605-190","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^## |Appendix C|__hub|session.js|apply_mirror","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9787634-270e-43da-9138-3fc30e588605-191","name":"get_command_or_subagent_output","input":{"task_ids":["d2d776a9-408d-48b9-84b7-fa7ad0e7705f"],"timeout_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":681,"output_tokens":582,"cache_read_input_tokens":185856,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"f5236676-9dfa-4972-beac-c9ce457897af"}
