 Screens and UX\"},{\"line_number\":372,\"content\":\"## 6. Art direction\"},{\"line_number\":436,\"content\":\"## 7. Animation\"},{\"line_number\":449,\"content\":\"## 8. Audio\"},{\"line_number\":474,\"content\":\"## 9. Multiplayer\"},{\"line_number\":477,\"content\":\"harness and helpers are beside it (`session.js`, `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js`).\"},{\"line_number\":485,\"content\":\"- **Client:** `session.js` pasted unmodified as the first script, right after `<meta charset>`. Do this in\"},{\"line_number\":512,\"content\":\"## 10. Building it on the engine\"},{\"line_number\":541,\"content\":\"engine/web/                                 index.html, session.js, hub_shim.js\"},{\"line_number\":613,\"content\":\"## 11. Testing\"},{\"line_number\":654,\"content\":\"`document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'`, then require `window.__hubCheck.pass`, for each query:\"},{\"line_number\":661,\"content\":\"## 12. Build order\"},{\"line_number\":679,\"content\":\"## 13. Finish line\"},{\"line_number\":719,\"content\":\"## Appendix A: paper cards ✔\"},{\"line_number\":749,\"content\":\"## Appendix B: a hub shim skeleton ✔ (the protocol calls are tested)\"},{\"line_number\":754,\"content\":\"  const H = window.__hub = { active: !!(window.AIHub && AIHub.active), info: null, events: [], last: null };\"},{\"line_number\":778,\"content\":\"## Appendix C: the fragment for the page ✔\"},{\"line_number\":785,\"content\":\"`client` is `session.js`, byte for byte (its `/*! aihub-session` banner lets the hub replace it). The packer already refuses JS glue holding `<script`, `</script` or `<!--`; apply the same check to the client and the shim. ✔ `session.js` holds none.\"},{\"line_number\":787,\"content\":\"## Appendix D: browser stand-ins ✔\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f9787634-270e-43da-9138-3fc30e588605-191","content":"{\"type\":\"TaskOutput\",\"Result\":{\"task_id\":\"d2d776a9-408d-48b9-84b7-fa7ad0e7705f\",\"command\":\"cd /home/m