{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_404","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"About_to_wait requests a redraw if graphics exist.\n\nFrame loop and mirror redraw logic are confirmed. Next I will check boot_code and ops::tick to understand pause and player joining. Then I will implement the hub. I also drafted an apply_mirror function in surgery/mod.rs.\n\nops::tick will skip simulation when mode is M_MIRROR. Surgery will store hub_role, hub_slot, and hub_names. Adding these fields requires serde defaults because Surgery is serialized.\n\nNew fields can be added without serde defaults because tests create fresh simulations and the same binary handles checkpoints. Hub state will live in Harbor rather than Surgery, with Surgery only receiving visual updates through apply_mirror. The product layer will inject host input frames directly into the simulation.\n\nServer mode uses all network slots. Host mode uses one local slot and the rest from network.\n\nIn mirror mode, ops::tick will only move the local cursor from input and skip hazards. Snapshot vitals remain intact because apply_mirror overwrites world state before the local input step applies prediction.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-82b2a3d9-9e12-4cf7-9496-d25bc88bcdb3-50","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":360,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-82b2a3d9-9e12-4cf7-9496-d25bc88bcdb3-51","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn tick\\(","glob":"**/games/surgery/ops.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-82b2a3d9-9e12-4cf7-9496-d25bc88bcdb3-52","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/terminal/call-42ed6545-5732-41d9-a9ca-5f5c814946f7-10.log","offset":1,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2245,"output_tokens":888,"cache_read_input_tokens":122112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"f250553e-28aa-4c3b-bf86-94beb1862c0b"}
