{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_409","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wasm execution publishes a frame before the pump.\n\nPump ticks overwrite cursors via prediction while preserving vitals. Surgeon input composition must not zero out remote slots. The hub host currently sets all four surgeons during operation.\n\nThe local slot is the harbor hand. Remote inputs fill the other active player slots. The server has no local input and receives all data from remote sources.\n\nIn mirror mode, the client sends its input over the network and applies it locally for prediction. Only the local cursor updates during the simulation tick.\n\nThe mirror tick must not reset other cursors. Snapshot vitals are preserved.\n\nThe host boot sequence seeds the RNG, runs `boot_code` to set mode to OP and activate slot 0, then marks the specified slots as active. The client mirror boot path is next.\n\n`boot_mirror` sets the client to mirror mode with a blue case, playing outcome, and default heart. `apply_mirror` restores hazards, vitals, and non-local cursors from a compact snapshot. A `NetHazard` struct is being defined to carry hazard data over the network.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-138b1751-504d-4bf7-9b55-cf8a506bfbc9-59","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn make\\(","glob":"**/games/surgery/hazard.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-138b1751-504d-4bf7-9b55-cf8a506bfbc9-60","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":1,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-138b1751-504d-4bf7-9b55-cf8a506bfbc9-61","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub use|pub mod surgery","glob":"**/pav_core/src/lib.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1906,"output_tokens":873,"cache_read_input_tokens":133376,"cache_creation_input_tokens":