{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_438","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"SurgeonInput is already imported in product.rs.\n\nBoot and Snap implement Clone, so they can be cloned and moved into closures without moving the hub. The hub remains available for later send operations. The paused control logic will set paused or ended after the operation is ready.\n\nA one-frame delay in screen detection means surgeons are not composed as op hands on the first play frame. The compose logic checks the shell screen before note_mode updates it to OP or MIRROR.\n\nBoot sets the mode to OP before pump runs. Note_mode updates the shell to the HUD screen after pump reads the new frame. The card screen is not OP, so surgeons stay inactive during that phase. Overlay logic depends on hub.active rather than op status.\n\nThe send_input call should run every frame during play, using the local hand. After pump, the code will send input for the local surgeon, then conditionally send a snap and publish standings only when the host is active and playing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca6de576-98bd-4e6e-a9ce-7ad35767c8c1-119","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs","old_string":"    let paused = app.harbor.shell.paused();\n    host.set_control(|c| c.paused = paused);","new_string":"    let paused = app.harbor.shell.paused();\n    let hold = paused || hub.ended;\n    host.set_control(|c| c.paused = hold);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca6de576-98bd-4e6e-a9ce-7ad35767c8c1-120","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs","old_string":"    let events: Vec<_> = std::mem::take(&mut *host.shared.events.lock().unwrap());\n    let music = op.as_ref().map(|o| o.music).unwrap_or(0.10);","new_string":"    let events: Vec<_> = std::mem::take(&mut *host.shared.events.lock().unwrap());\n    if hub.active {\n        if !hub.server {\n            let me = hub.slot as usize;\n            if me < 4 {\n                app.harbor.link.send_input(&surgeons[me]);\n            }\n        }\n        if hub.host {\n            if let Some(op) = op.as_ref() {\n                app.harbor.link.send_snap(&snap_json(op, &events));\n                if hub.play {\n                    app.harbor.link.publish(&standings_json(&hub.present, op));\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    let music = if hub.server || hub.ended { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.music).unwrap_or(0.10) };"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1344,"output_tokens":1216,"cache_read_input_tokens":187008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"867fde22-f871-4f96-8cef-93b70e0f1eed"}
