{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-44232ee3-a6d2-467f-883d-651c9dfb1b6f-127","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"590→    let voices = if quiet_audio { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.voices).unwrap_or(0.70) };\\n    let name = op.as_ref().map(|o| track_name(o)).unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\");\\n    if app.harbor.music_name != name {\\n        app.harbor.music_name = name.to_string();\\n        app.harbor.music_left = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    app.harbor.music_left -= dt;\\n    let schedule = if quiet_audio {\\n        None\\n    } else if app.harbor.music_left <= 0.0 {\\n600→        let bpm = op.as_ref().map(|o| o.bpm).unwrap_or(72.0).clamp(60.0, 140.0);\\n        let (dur, notes) = pav_audio::music::phrase(name, bpm);\\n        app.harbor.music_left = dur.max(0.5);\\n        Some(notes)\\n    } else {\\n        None\\n    };\\n    if let Some(a) = &app.audio {\\n        a.set_buses(music, effects, voices);\\n        let l = pav_audio::Listener { pos: Vec3::new(0.0, 8.0, 12.0), right: Vec3::X };\\n610→        for e in &events {\\n            a.play_event(e, &l, effects);\\n        }\\n        if let Some(notes) = schedule {\\n            for n in notes {\\n                a.play_bus(n.patch, n.pan, n.gain, n.delay, pav_audio::BUS_MUSIC);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    app.builder.add_events(&events);\",\"content_concise\":\"590→    let voices = if quiet_audio { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.voices).unwrap_or(0.70) };\\n    let name = op.as_ref().map(|o| track_name(o)).unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\");\\n    if app.harbor.music_name != name {\\n        app.harbor.music_name = name.to_string();\\n        app.harbor.music_left = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    app.harbor.music_left -= dt;\\n    let schedule = if quiet_audio {\\n        None\\n    } else if app.harbor.music_left <= 0.0 {\\n600→        let bpm = op.as_ref().map(|o| o.bpm).unwrap_or(72.0).clamp(60.0, 140.0);\\n        let (dur, notes) = pav_audio::music::phrase(name, bpm);\\n        app.harbor.music_left = dur.max(0.5);\\n        Some(notes)\\n    } else {\\n        None\\n    };\\n    if let Some(a) = &app.audio {\\n        a.set_buses(music, effects, voices);\\n        let l = pav_audio::Listener { pos: Vec3::new(0.0, 8.0, 12.0), right: Vec3::X };\\n610→        for e in &events {\\n            a.play_event(e, &l, effects);\\n        }\\n        if let Some(notes) = schedule {\\n            for n in notes {\\n                a.play_bus(n.patch, n.pan, n.gain, n.delay, pav_audio::BUS_MUSIC);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    app.builder.add_events(&events);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs\",\"offset\":590,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"    let voices = if quiet_audio { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.voices).unwrap_or(0.70) };\\n    let name = op.as_ref().map(|o| track_name(o)).unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\");\\n    if app.harbor.music_name != name {\\n        app.harbor.music_name = name.to_string();\\n        app.harbor.music_left = 0.0;\\n    }\\n    app.harbor.music_left -= dt;\\n    let schedule = if quiet_audio {\\n        None\\n    } else if app.harbor.music_left <= 0.0 {\\n        let bpm = op.as_ref().map(|o| o.bpm).unwrap_or(72.0).clamp(60.0, 140.0);\\n        let (dur, notes) = pav_audio::music::phrase(name, bpm);\\n        app.harbor.music_left = dur.max(0.5);\\n        Some(notes)\\n    } else {\\n        None\\n    };\\n    if let Some(a) = &app.audio {\\n        a.set_buses(music, effects, voices);\\n        let l = pav_audio::Listener { pos: Vec3::new(0.0, 8.0, 12.0), right: Vec3::X };\\n        for e in &events {\\n            a.play_event(e, &l, effects);\\n        }\\n        if let Some(notes) = schedule {\\n            for n in notes {\\n                a.play_bus(n.patch, n.pan, n.gain, n.delay, pav_audio::BUS_MUSIC);\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    app.builder.add_events(&events);\\n\",\"total_lines\":882}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"64173f91-4465-446b-9df5-e075e871d788"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_442","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Schedule looks fine. Now running cargo check.\n\nShell test compiles. Default derive is manual. Surgery fresh uses hub_quiet. TOOL_KEEP is in scope. Product schedule else-if is valid. js_sys push may take JsValue by value. Operator precedence on owns needs parentheses.\n\nRunning cargo check with incremental compilation. Tests for pav_ui and pav_core will follow if the check passes. Shell Screen::Card clones every call, which is acceptable. Mode 8 correctly routes to Hud. A potential bug was spotted: in the first frame, exec sets mode to 7, then pump ticks card and note_mode(7) sets Card.\n\nsaw_card only triggers on the first hub frame. Native solo mode keeps hub.active false and skips exec. get_mut requires Surgery. Need to verify if boot_hub_round can access the private rng module.\n\nPrivate modules are visible throughout the crate, so `crate::rng::Rng` is accessible from `boot_hub_round`. `K_BURN` is already in scope via `pub use kinds::*`. A quick Python syntax check on the packer will be done after the Rust check.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d6e1933e-4b0f-41ff-a5b9-811ee6441bcc-128","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link && CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=6 cargo check -p pav_app -p pav_view -p pav_ui -p pav_core --tests 2>&1","description":"Typecheck game crates and their tests","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":510,"output_tokens":839,"cache_read_input_tokens":195968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"8688db6c-2afa-42ec-825b-d950fec3da18"}
