{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_443","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code compiles. I will write run_all.py, download bridge.js and round.js, and create the hub test script and balance test.\n\nI will not edit Rust files during compilation. I will draft the mirror test after the check to avoid races. I will fetch bridge.js and round.js from GitHub raw into the dev tests/hub folder alongside a scratch harness copy. I will also verify about.json is valid JSON, check session.js for </script tags, and run Python checks on the shim and session.\n\nI will check the exact charset in index.html. The run_all.py script will live in dev/tests/ and invoke cargo from the engine-link symlink, setting CARGO_TARGET_DIR.\n\nThe run_all.py script is being drafted. It sets CARGO_TARGET_DIR and CARGO_BUILD_JOBS, then defines cargo test commands for the surgery suites in pav_core, pav_ui, and pav_audio.\n\nThe run_all.py script will parse cargo test output to count passed and failed tests. It will suppress compilation noise and print only failures plus a summary line.\n\nThe script will parse `test result:` lines and print any FAILED test blocks. Compile errors will be treated as failures. The `surgery::tests` filter covers all UI tests, and the audio test name is exact.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-82b304d2-e454-41d7-920a-5ef340cc98bc-129","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nimport pathlib, re\nroot = pathlib.Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/web\")\nfor name in [\"session.js\", \"hub_shim.js\"]:\n    t = (root/name).read_text()\n    bad = re.search(r\"(?i)</script|<script|<!--\", t)\n    print(name, \"len\", len(t), \"bad\", bool(bad), \"banner\", t.splitlines()[0][:80])\nPY\nmkdir -p \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub\"\ncp \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/harness.html\" \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub/harness.html\"\ncurl -fsSL -o \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub/bridge.js\" \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/bridge.js\"\ncurl -fsSL -o \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub/round.js\" \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/round.js\"\nwc -c \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub/\"*","description":"Copy harness and download hub bridge scripts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1241,"output_tokens":1528,"cache_read_input_tokens":196352,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"2f2f40d5-7cec-46ef-a6bf-6f838b210bf5"}
