{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_445","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fixing a borrow checker conflict in `boot_hub_round` where `sim` and `g` are borrowed together.\n\nThe `pav_core::rng` module is private, so setting the RNG from `pav_app` won't work. I'll change the method signature to avoid the borrow conflict instead.\n\nA standalone `reseed` helper won't work because `Rng` isn't public outside `pav_core`. I'll keep the RNG setup inside `Surgery::boot_hub_round` and split the borrows so `sim` and `g` are not borrowed together.\n\nThe fix is to turn `boot_hub_round` into an associated function that takes `sim: &mut Sim` as its first parameter. This avoids the overlapping borrow with `&mut self` and lets the RNG be set before borrowing the `Surgery` component.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5657454d-484d-4e67-a474-d72dd2b95055-132","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/hub.rs","old_string":"use pav_core::input::{surg, SurgeonInput};","new_string":"use pav_core::input::SurgeonInput;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5657454d-484d-4e67-a474-d72dd2b95055-133","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"    /// Host or dedicated server: one Code Blue, seeded, with the given player slots active.\n    pub fn boot_hub_round(&mut self, sim: &mut Sim, seed: u64, slots: &[u8], quiet: bool) {\n        sim.state.rng = crate::rng::Rng::new(seed);\n        self.boot_code();\n        for s in &mut self.surgeons {\n            s.active = false;\n        }\n        for &id in slots {\n            let i = id as usize;\n            if i < 4 {\n                self.surgeons[i].active = true;\n            }\n        }\n        self.players = slots.len().clamp(1, 4) as u8;\n        self.hub_quiet = quiet;\n        self.mode = M_OP;\n    }","new_string":"    /// Host or dedicated server: one Code Blue, seeded, with the given player slots active.\n    pub fn boot_hub_round(sim: &mut Sim, seed: u64, slots: &[u8], quiet: bool) {\n        sim.state.rng = crate::rng::Rng::new(seed);\n        let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) else { return };\n        g.boot_code();\n        for s in &mut g.surgeons {\n            s.active = false;\n        }\n        for &id in slots {\n            let i = id as usize;\n            if i < 4 {\n                g.surgeons[i].active = true;\n            }\n        }\n        g.players = slots.len().clamp(1, 4) as u8;\n        g.hub_quiet = quiet;\n        g.mode = M_OP;\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5657454d-484d-4e67-a474-d72dd2b95055-134","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs","old_string":"                    if boot.mirror {\n                        g.boot_mirror();\n                    } else {\n                        g.boot_hub_round(sim, boot.seed as u64, &boot.slots, boot.server);\n                    }","new_string":"                    if boot.mirror {\n                        g.boot_mirror();\n                    } else {\n                        drop(g);\n                        Surgery::boot_hub_round(sim, boot.seed as u64, &boot.slots, boot.server);\n                    }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3105,"output_tokens":1429,"cache_read_input_tokens":199424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"cbc50b6c-2793-4e12-8e55-f0a0e983d5dc"}
