{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_462","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in the `send_json` function.\n\nThe `send_json` bug is harmless. The JavaScript shim passes `to: undefined`, but the session code ignores undefined values, so the message broadcasts correctly. `reliable: false` is also correct for lossy delivery.\n\n15Hz over several seconds should be reliable enough. The next step is to check round.js finish validation to ensure standings cover every present player exactly once.\n\nGone players may be omitted from standings. The host's own ID is correctly excluded from the present list. One edge case remains: whether a send counts when no other players are present.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-21db87aa-7b02-4051-9cce-dc409938b4eb-32","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"stats\\.sent|type === 'send'|case 'send'","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub/bridge.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-21db87aa-7b02-4051-9cce-dc409938b4eb-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function finish|standings|validResult|played","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub/round.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3878,"output_tokens":673,"cache_read_input_tokens":69632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"fd62ffb3-34af-4740-8dee-7ac7144f28eb"}
