{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_466","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The welcome message sets the hub's isHost flag to true when the local user matches the host.\n\ninfo() copies hub fields while excluding KEEP and functions. take_info parses these correctly. JSON serialization of info appears safe since all values are plain objects. A bug was spotted: connect().then sets H.info, but if WASM polls before that promise resolves, the state remains null.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-40d04fe6-5b32-44bb-9bd5-8627c5cafb53-42","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"violation|console|dialog|popup|socket","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub/harness.html"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-40d04fe6-5b32-44bb-9bd5-8627c5cafb53-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub/round.js","offset":270,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1416,"output_tokens":422,"cache_read_input_tokens":80128,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"5f2fec3e-d7af-445f-bf5c-009cf40d8a8b"}
