{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_497","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Port 39337 is ready. The next step is writing the Playwright hub script and running a smoke test with one player.\n\nThe script is being written in scratch. It will record the server PID for targeted cleanup. The Playwright harness is configured with WebGPU and Vulkan flags.\n\nThe script now defines a `run_one` helper that launches Chromium with the configured flags, captures console errors and warnings, and navigates to the harness URL with the game query parameters.\n\nThe script now waits for the game to finish and returns the report and logs. A 150-second timeout will cover all four players. The browsers will be closed between runs to free memory. Failures will be collected rather than stopping execution. Failed check details will be logged. Two-page and solo tests may follow if conformance passes.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The packed page is in place and the hub server is up. I’ll run the one-player harness first to see whether the session actually starts."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ceb396b5-f9a2-4475-a706-a31fdca70392-94","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub_one.py","content":"import json\nimport os\nfrom urllib.parse import quote\n\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\nPORT = 39337\nGAME = \"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\"\nARGS = [\n    \"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\",\n    \"--enable-features=Vulkan\",\n    \"--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader\",\n    \"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\",\n    \"--use-angle=swiftshader\",\n]\n\ndef main():\n    query = \"players=1&auto=1&limit=20\"\n    url = f\"http://127.0.0.1:{PORT}/harness.html?game={quote(GAME)}&{query}\"\n    os.environ.setdefault(\"PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE\", \"ubuntu24.04-x64\")\n    with sync_playwright() as p:\n        browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=False, args=ARGS)\n        page = browser.new_page(viewport={\"width\": 1100, \"height\": 700})\n        logs = []\n        page.on(\"console\", lambda m: logs.append(f\"{m.type}: {m.text[:300]}\") if m.type in (\"error\", \"warning\") else None)\n        page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda e: logs.append(f\"pageerror: {e}\"))\n        page.goto(url, wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\", timeout=60000)\n        try:\n            page.wait_for_function(\"document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'\", timeout=90000)\n        except Exception as e:\n            logs.append(f\"wait: {e}\")\n        report = page.evaluate(\"() => window.__hubCheck || null\")\n        text = page.locator(\"#log\").inner_text() if page.locator(\"#log\").count() else \"\"\n        checks = page.locator(\"#checklist\").inner_text() if page.locator(\"#checklist\").count() else \"\"\n        browser.close()\n    print(\"REPORT\")\n    print(json.dumps(report, indent=2)[:8000] if report else \"none\")\n    print(\"CHECKS\")\n    print(checks[:4000])\n    print(\"LOG\")\n    print(text[:4000])\n    print(\"CONSOLE\")\n    print(\"\\n\".join(logs[:40]))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":496,"output_tokens":1241,"cache_read_input_tokens":157312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"da1f4764-3ab6-419c-af59-ee0c4b842493"}
