{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_499","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The socket path is too long because TMPDIR or the user-data-dir is under a very long path.\n\nThe exact error is a 108-byte Unix socket path limit. Playwright's user-data-dir is nested too deep under the long temp path. The instructions restrict scratch to captured output and forbid setting HOME to scratch, so /tmp is the only viable alternative.\n\nThe harness likely set TMPDIR to the long run directory. I will override it to `/tmp/hbr-pw` for the Chromium launch only. This keeps scratch artifacts out of shared /tmp while fitting the 108-byte socket limit.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-66e05ff0-0889-4e1b-83c8-634f2c54c2b7-96","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"mkdir -p /tmp/hbr-pw\nexport TMPDIR=/tmp/hbr-pw\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nxvfb-run -a python3 /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub_one.py","description":"Retry one-player hub with short TMPDIR","block_until_ms":120000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2338,"output_tokens":640,"cache_read_input_tokens":159104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"7fbdbba7-45fe-43fa-8cb9-c904c7c743e4"}
