{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_514","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The loop stopped at 42 instead of 70. I need to figure out why.\n\nThe loop broke because the page evaluated `dataset.complete` as true. It printed COMPLETE False and FAILS, confirming the completion condition was met.\n\nThe round ended after only one rust frame. The iframe's wasm is stuck inside the first op frame's draw, which began after publish. The time-up event likely fired while draw was still running, so the iframe never processed it.\n\nThe round finished, so the iframe's JS time-up handler must have run. This means the iframe's event loop was not blocked by the stuck draw. The draw is likely asynchronous and does not block JavaScript execution.\n\nThe frame loop likely stopped because the browser throttled requestAnimationFrame after the first heavy frame. Chrome may throttle background iframes even when visible. The time-up handler still ran while JavaScript was free.\n\nThe frame loop might be dying because `App::frame` returns early and never requests another redraw. Card frames ran for 15 seconds, so the redraw path works during card turns. The op frame must have something that breaks it.\n\nAn uncaught exception in `gfx.draw` after publish could be silently stopping the loop. The engine might also be pausing incorrectly on the op frame, which would prevent redraws. The paused flag is a global boolean rather than tied to the current screen.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-49331ec6-d6f3-4c79-8f46-7de32e2abe0a-113","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn about_to_wait|request_redraw|surgery_frame|ControlFlow","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src","glob":"*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3427,"output_tokens":1027,"cache_read_input_tokens":192384,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"68c7638f-4cb4-4a5a-b456-d21ad2e0bca1"}
