{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_526","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plate mesh contains 100,800 quads or vertices.\n\nSkipping the heavy plate geometry should help. The simulation step is likely the real bottleneck, but since JavaScript evaluation returned quickly, the browser simply stopped scheduling frames rather than hanging.\n\nThe iframe JavaScript thread was not blocked. The winit loop likely stopped because the redraw handler panicked after the first op frame, or because an exception in that frame aborted the event loop.\n\nThe first op frame's redraw might be asynchronous, yet the iframe should still schedule subsequent frames. A new suspect is pointer lock or cursor visibility in op mode, which could cause the canvas to drop animation frames inside an iframe.\n\nHiding the cursor in op mode may trigger pointer lock or a style change that aborts the event loop inside an iframe. The winit web implementation of set_cursor_visible needs inspection. If this is the cause, hub_quiet will not help; the fix should either avoid hiding the cursor in hub mode or correct the underlying winit behavior.\n\nThe two-page test does not need cursor hiding. I will inspect the winit web implementation of set_cursor_visible while the build continues. Editing now risks the in-flight build picking up changes if Cargo snapshots the file before compilation begins.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2b7e6a9d-1a5f-4fae-87d4-d0164a22ef82-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn set_cursor_visible|cursor_visible|requestPointerLock","glob":"**/*.{rs,js}","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2b7e6a9d-1a5f-4fae-87d4-d0164a22ef82-19","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/terminal/call-09ddd6e5-063c-4c1e-91d1-9b9b06d587bc-124.log","offset":1,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1534,"output_tokens":931,"cache_read_input_tokens":51328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"db944a58-8fc8-463d-bdb4-4f74e7d04f98"}
