v/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer\\\"; xvfb-run -a python3 \\\"$SCRATCH/hub_one.py\\\" 'players=2&auto=1&limit=20' > \\\"$SCRATCH/hub-p2.txt\\\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$?; tail -c 6000 \\\"$SCRATCH/hub-p2.txt\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Run two-player hub harness against packed HTML\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/terminal/call-dd2219b2-8d0b-4b09-8958-fa3fa56f7e78-23.log\",\"total_bytes\":5187}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"2e01dbd8-d1e1-422c-85e7-5ee308de3795"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_529","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The two-player test passed. Traffic flows bidirectionally between both players.\n\nThe loop is still stalled. Only two messages arrived in four seconds, far below the expected 70 at 15 Hz. The traffic check passes with zero frames, but the cursor and vitals test requires continuous frame updates.\n\nOnly two messages arrived, likely the first frame plus one more. The loop probably died after two frames, so the cursor test will fail. The rate limit is 15 Hz, but even a slow loop should produce more than two messages in four seconds. The first frame sends immediately because did_snap is false.\n\nThe hub_quiet fix did not fully unstick the loop. The second message likely came from a delayed frame that exceeded the 1/15 rate limit. The time-up event sets ended, which should stop polling.\n\nThe two messages arrived during play, before time-up set ended. The loop dies after roughly two frames.\n\nhub_quiet may not actually skip expensive work. Even if the view emits nothing, the simulation might still build the plate into the world state. An empty scene should draw quickly, so the cause of the stall remains unclear.\n\nSeveral possible causes for the stall are being considered: cursor visibility, audio startup, a heavy egui HUD, slow op tick logic, or WebGPU device loss. The quiet flag is confirmed to be set before the op mode and copied into each frame, so the first op frame should indeed skip expensive work. The remaining suspicion is that the plate mesh might still be built during simulation rather than in the view.\n\nThe stall might be in the simulation step rather than mesh building. Two frames followed by death could be a caught panic or an infinite loop on a later tick. The harness completed in about fourteen seconds, so the iframe was not stuck in an infinite loop at the end. The hang may be intermittent, or the main page may not have entered the iframe.\n\nThe harness does not evaluate inside the iframe continuously. It only watches bridge statistics and hub messages. A wasm infinite loop would therefore look exactly like this: a couple of messages followed by silence, with the harness completing on time-up because the JavaScript shim handles that event outside the blocked wasm thread.\n\nThe time-up log proves the iframe JavaScript thread was not blocked. The host finished fifty milliseconds after the hub sent time-up, so the Rust loop is not stuck in an infinite loop. The page stays responsive while frames stop being requested. The real puzzle is why redraw stops after entering op mode.\n\nThe loop likely died because the animation frame callback threw a JavaScript exception after a couple of successful frames. That would stop all subsequent redraws while message events still worked, which matches the observed stall. The harness only checks the parent page for errors, not the iframe console, so the exception went undetected. I need to capture iframe console output to find it.\n\nI will write a probe to listen to the iframe console and sample status() during play. It will report mode, vitals, timer, and any errors. I also need to check hub_probe.py and the winit canvas event loop for exception handling.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-682661f3-68a5-4540-9195-b04b7dc2ce24-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub_probe.py","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-682661f3-68a5-4540-9195-b04b7dc2ce24-25","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"iframe|contentWindow|__game","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/hub/harness.html"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3862,"output_tokens":1625,"cache_read_input_tokens":57216,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"3af569dd-c9ae-4333-b916-bab466ea7330"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-682661f3-68a5-4540-9195-b04b7dc2ce24-24","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import os\\nfrom urllib.parse import quote\\n\\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\n\\nPORT = 39337\\nGAME = \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\\\"\\nARGS = [\\n    \\\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\\\",\\n10→    \\\"--enable-features=Vulkan\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-angle=swiftshader\\\",\\n]\\n\\nDUMP = \\\"\\\"\\\"() => {\\n  const frames = [...document.querySelectorAll('iframe')];\\n  return frames.map((f) => {\\n    try {\\n20→      const w = f.contentWindow;\\n      let st = null;\\n      try { st = w.__game && w.__game.status && JSON.parse(w.__game.status()); } catch (e) { st = { err: String(e) }; }\\n      return {\\n        t: w.AIHub ? Math.round(w.AIHub.time()) : null,\\n        me: w.AIHub ? w.AIHub.me : null,\\n        host: w.AIHub ? w.AIHub.isHost : null,\\n        last: !!(w.__hub && w.__hub.last),\\n        sentN: w.__hub && w.__hub.sentN,\\n        pubN: w.__hub && w.__hub.pubN,\\n30→        sentLen: w.__hub && w.__hub.sentLen,\\n        sendErr: w.__hub && w.__hub.sendErr,\\n        mode: st && st.mode,\\n        screen: st && st.screen,\\n        vitals: st && st.vitals,\\n        timer: st && (st.timer == null ? null : Math.round(st.timer)),\\n        x0: st && st.cursors && st.cursors[0] && st.cursors[0].x,\\n        x1: st && st.cursors && st.cursors[1] && st.cursors[1].x,\\n      };\\n    } catch (e) { return { err: String(e) }; }\\n40→  });\\n}\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\ndef main():\\n    os.environ.setdefault(\\\"PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE\\\", \\\"ubuntu24.04-x64\\\")\\n    url = f\\\"http://127.0.0.1:{PORT}/harness.html?game={quote(GAME)}&players=2&latency=20&jitter=0&loss=0&auto=1&limit=20&play=8000\\\"\\n    with sync_playwright() as p:\\n        browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=False, args=ARGS)\\n        page = browser.new_page(viewport={\\\"width\\\": 1200, \\\"height\\\": 800})\\n        page.goto(url, wait_until=\\\"domcontentloaded\\\", timeout=60000)\\n50→        for i in range(70):\\n            page.wait_for_timeout(500)\\n            info = page.evaluate(DUMP)\\n            interesting = any(isinstance(x, dict) and (x.get(\\\"mode\\\") in (3, 8) or x.get(\\\"sentN\\\") or x.get(\\\"pubN\\\")) for x in info)\\n            if interesting or i % 8 == 0:\\n                print(f\\\"--- {i} ---\\\")\\n                print(info)\\n            if page.evaluate(\\\"() => document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'\\\"):\\n                print(\\\"COMPLETE\\\", page.evaluate(\\\"() => window.__hubCheck.pass\\\"))\\n                checks = page.evaluate(\\\"() => window.__hubCheck.checks.filter(c => !c.pass)\\\")\\n60→                print(\\\"FAILS\\\", checks)\\n                break\\n        else:\\n            print(\\\"not complete\\\", page.locator(\\\"#log\\\").inner_text()[-1500:])\\n        browser.close()\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    main()\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import os\\nfrom urllib.parse import quote\\n\\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\n\\nPORT = 39337\\nGAME = \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\\\"\\nARGS = [\\n    \\\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\\\",\\n10→    \\\"--enable-features=Vulkan\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-angle=swiftshader\\\",\\n]\\n\\nDUMP = \\\"\\\"\\\"() => {\\n  const frames = [...document.querySelectorAll('iframe')];\\n  return frames.map((f) => {\\n    try {\\n20→      const w = f.contentWindow;\\n      let st = null;\\n      try { st = w.__game && w.__game.status && JSON.parse(w.__game.status()); } catch (e) { st = { err: String(e) }; }\\n      return {\\n        t: w.AIHub ? Math.round(w.AIHub.time()) : null,\\n        me: w.AIHub ? w.AIHub.me : null,\\n        host: w.AIHub ? w.AIHub.isHost : null,\\n        last: !!(w.__hub && w.__hub.last),\\n        sentN: w.__hub && w.__hub.sentN,\\n        pubN: w.__hub && w.__hub.pubN,\\n30→        sentLen: w.__hub && w.__hub.sentLen,\\n        sendErr: w.__hub && w.__hub.sendErr,\\n        mode: st && st.mode,\\n        screen: st && st.screen,\\n        vitals: st && st.vitals,\\n        timer: st && (st.timer == null ? null : Math.round(st.timer)),\\n        x0: st && st.cursors && st.cursors[0] && st.cursors[0].x,\\n        x1: st && st.cursors && st.cursors[1] && st.cursors[1].x,\\n      };\\n    } catch (e) { return { err: String(e) }; }\\n40→  });\\n}\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\ndef main():\\n    os.environ.setdefault(\\\"PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE\\\", \\\"ubuntu24.04-x64\\\")\\n    url = f\\\"http://127.0.0.1:{PORT}/harness.html?game={quote(GAME)}&players=2&latency=20&jitter=0&loss=0&auto=1&limit=20&play=8000\\\"\\n    with sync_playwright() as p:\\n        browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=False, args=ARGS)\\n        page = browser.new_page(viewport={\\\"width\\\": 1200, \\\"height\\\": 800})\\n        page.goto(url, wait_until=\\\"domcontentloaded\\\", timeout=60000)\\n50→        for i in range(70):\\n            page.wait_for_timeout(500)\\n            info = page.evaluate(DUMP)\\n            interesting = any(isinstance(x, dict) and (x.get(\\\"mode\\\") in (3, 8) or x.get(\\\"sentN\\\") or x.get(\\\"pubN\\\")) for x in info)\\n            if interesting or i % 8 == 0:\\n                print(f\\\"--- {i} ---\\\")\\n                print(info)\\n            if page.evaluate(\\\"() => document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'\\\"):\\n                print(\\\"COMPLETE\\\", page.evaluate(\\\"() => window.__hubCheck.pass\\\"))\\n                checks = page.evaluate(\\\"() => window.__hubCheck.checks.filter(c => !c.pass)\\\")\\n60→                print(\\\"FAILS\\\", checks)\\n                break\\n        else:\\n            print(\\\"not complete\\\", page.locator(\\\"#log\\\").inner_text()[-1500:])\\n        browser.close()\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    main()\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub_probe.py\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":120,\"raw_output\":\"import os\\nfrom urllib.parse import quote\\n\\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\n\\nPORT = 39337\\nGAME = \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\\\"\\nARGS = [\\n    \\\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\\\",\\n    \\\"--enable-features=Vulkan\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-angle=swiftshader\\\",\\n]\\n\\nDUMP = \\\"\\\"\\\"() => {\\n  const frames = [...document.querySelectorAll('iframe')];\\n  return frames.map((f) => {\\n    try {\\n      const w = f.contentWindow;\\n      let st = null;\\n      try { st = w.__game && w.__game.status && JSON.parse(w.__game.status()); } catch (e) { st = { err: String(e) }; }\\n      return {\\n        t: w.AIHub ? Math.round(w.AIHub.time()) : null,\\n        me: w.AIHub ? w.AIHub.me : null,\\n        host: w.AIHub ? w.AIHub.isHost : null,\\n        last: !!(w.__hub && w.__hub.last),\\n        sentN: w.__hub && w.__hub.sentN,\\n        pubN: w.__hub && w.__hub.pubN,\\n        sentLen: w.__hub && w.__hub.sentLen,\\n        sendErr: w.__hub && w.__hub.sendErr,\\n        mode: st && st.mode,\\n        screen: st && st.screen,\\n        vitals: st && st.vitals,\\n        timer: st && (st.timer == null ? null : Math.round(st.timer)),\\n        x0: st && st.cursors && st.cursors[0] && st.cursors[0].x,\\n        x1: st && st.cursors && st.cursors[1] && st.cursors[1].x,\\n      };\\n    } catch (e) { return { err: String(e) }; }\\n  });\\n}\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\