a/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/terminal/call-b63b7e1d-379d-4dc9-ae56-6f010d96ff28-47.log\",\"total_bytes\":2317}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"33896958-49cc-4adb-86b0-00dea7be4be7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_541","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A critical clue has been found.\n\nrequestAnimationFrame fires hundreds of thousands of times, yet the game loop callbacks execute only a handful of times. The harness never reached op mode; it remained stuck in mode 7 for over two seconds. This explains why the run stalled.\n\nBoot logic only runs inside redraw callbacks. With redraws almost never firing, boot is skipped entirely. The previous run reached mode 3 because a callback happened to land during play.\n\nThe root cause is a known winit/web issue. Calling requestAnimationFrame in an infinite synchronous loop prevents the browser from ever returning to the event loop, so queued callbacks never execute. The probe's page.evaluate calls did yield the JavaScript thread between samples.\n\nThe run count remained stuck at 10. This rules out the theory that callbacks were queued and simply delayed. The browser is likely cancelling most of the requestAnimationFrame calls. Winit may be scheduling and cancelling frames in rapid succession, leaving only a handful to execute.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1d5192c8-c603-4a87-81ad-541d06081c09-48","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"requestAnimationFrame|request_animation_frame|ControlFlow::Poll|fn run_until_cleared","path":"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src","glob":"**/winit-0.30.13/**/*.rs","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1720,"output_tokens":730,"cache_read_input_tokens":89088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"d79b552a-44b4-46ac-b68f-6a6104743907"}
