{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_552","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Preparing the two-page test script and reviewing TASK.md for remaining deliverables to execute after the hub tests pass.\n\nChecking whether set_control_flow on ActiveEventLoop compiles. Reading TASK.md, the plan checklist, and balance command details while waiting for the build to finish.\n\nWriting the cursor test script now. The two-page test uses iframe copies in a single harness rather than separate browser tabs. Client aim will come from held keydown state inside each iframe.\n\nThe test will dispatch a held ArrowRight keydown on the client iframe and verify that the host cursor moves by sampling cursors[1].x.\n\nVitals should match within snap tolerance. The test script will wait for both modes to reach 3 and 8, record host vitals and cursor position, dispatch a held ArrowRight keydown on the client iframe, wait one second, and verify the host cursor moved right.\n\nThe test will verify that vitals diverge from the frozen 69.3 value to prove the tick loop is running, and that the host-client gap stays below 1.0. With speed 15 and a one-second hold, the cursor should shift well past the field edges unless clamped. The held key dispatches directly to the iframe window so Playwright can use frame.evaluate. Player one is confirmed as the client slot.\n\nThe host cursor at index 1 is the client's surgeon. One second of held input should be enough to catch remote hand latency at 15Hz, with extra samples for safety.\n\nThe four harness queries will run sequentially after the cursor probe if the frame loop is fixed. A four-player run may need a lower limit to avoid OOM; hub_quiet should help.\n\nThe host-leave scenario is safe because the shim only finishes on time-up.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37965e3a-f440-4319-b7af-4587f24da181-69","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hand in|exit-interview|HTML|Deliverable|about","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/TASK.md","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37965e3a-f440-4319-b7af-4587f24da181-70","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn balance|pav balance|suggested","glob":"**/*.{rs,py,md}","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1356,"output_tokens":1074,"cache_read_input_tokens":115456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"777f35ed-3ce5-4b8c-829a-540a7bdd21e2"}
