igh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub-raf3.txt\\\").read_text(errors=\\\"replace\\\")\\nlines = [ln for ln in text.splitlines() if ln[:2].isdigit() or ln.startswith(\\\"COMPLETE\\\")]\\n# print every line that mentions mode 3 or the last 6, plus first op-looking\\nshown = 0\\nfor ln in lines:\\n    if \\\"mode': 3\\\" in ln or \\\"mode': 8\\\" in ln or ln.startswith(\\\"COMPLETE\\\"):\\n        print(ln[:700])\\n        shown += 1\\n        if shown > 12:\\n            break\\nprint(\\\"--- last ---\\\")\\nprint(\\\"\\\\n\\\".join(lines[-3:])[:2000])\\nPY\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Probe whether op frames and the sim now tick\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/terminal/call-a83c86ad-bb81-4bba-99e9-4640fc522256-74.log\",\"total_bytes\":3116}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"361e8340-19e8-4261-9615-30f353b9cf8c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_555","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The scheduler storm has disappeared for p0. Schedule values are 11–18 and run values are 10–17.\n\nThe simulation is running at roughly 2–4 fps. Timer and vitals are updating, confirming snaps are being applied. The slowdown is not a complete freeze.\n\nEach frame likely takes 300–500 ms, which explains the low frame rate. p1 is still lagging: scheduled 177 times but run only 12, suggesting it remains in Poll mode.\n\np1 may be counting cancelled winit frames in its schedule total. During play it scheduled roughly 90 times but ran only about 7, suggesting cancellation is still occurring there. p0 shows almost no cancellation during play.\n\nTraffic and cursor movement both work at 2 fps. Vitals match closely. The bottleneck is likely the heavy simulation tick or egui, not the vertex mesh.\n\nGPU shader compilation in the first frames could explain the initial slowdown. Even a quiet scene should not take 400 ms per frame. Chrome may throttle visible iframes to one frame per second when request_redraw cancels frames, or cross-origin restrictions might be involved.\n\nThe iframes are same-origin, so cross-origin throttling is not the cause. The 2–3 fps rate likely comes from requestAnimationFrame nesting: if a frame takes 300 ms, the next callback is delayed until that finishes, producing roughly 16 ms between frames. The expensive step in hub_quiet appears to be the code blue simulation tick, not the vertex mesh.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c79e84cf-e10e-45b9-91aa-e584de1c624d-75","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"surgery::emit|apply_look|fn build","glob":"**/*.{rs}","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1962,"output_tokens":1604,"cache_read_input_tokens":120192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"5cd06aef-2aa2-402d-b350-38057c6a4dc9"}
