, one tool, bot win) that also boots in the packed page with the session client in place.\"},{\"line_number\":38,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add every instrument, hazard, rating, chain, Code, death/retry, and cases 0–2 as data; teach the bot; add the cue table and coverage tests.\"},{\"line_number\":39,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add the 10-foot shell: menus, pause, settings, save, glyphs, attract, touch-only, and dev sliders with reset.\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add paper-theatre story, music buses at music gain 0.10, and gibberish voices through case 7’s script.\"},{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add the four strains, Hush, Echo, tremor, Cryoprobe, Duet, cases 3–7, local 1–4 play, and Code Blue.\"},{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add the hub shim, card, mirror scene, and host snapshots; pass the harness and the two-page cursor/vitals check.\"},{\"line_number\":43,\"content\":\"- [ ] Balance, write `exit-interview.json` and the about block, pack the single HTML to the work root, delete `engine/target`, and save the green suite plus two launch captures under `{SCRATCH}`.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"988989a4-f74d-4a9f-99ce-c39bd966139e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_569","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to read Appendix D to understand the gamepad stub and how to drive the game for screenshots.\n\nI'll examine existing shell tests to learn how they navigate screens via __game.step and commands. The verification plan requires screenshots of title, op, story, results, dev, and about, plus balance, suite, and hub evidence. I also need to check content/README existence.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dddc8144-f563-450a-9c5b-af12a7c4aedb-96","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md","offset":770,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dddc8144-f563-450a-9c5b-af12a7c4aedb-97","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn |KeyCode|About|Dev|screen","glob":"**/pav_ui/src/surgery/tests.rs","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dddc8144-f563-450a-9c5b-af12a7c4aedb-98","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"content/README|README.md","glob":"**/content/**"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2523,"output_tokens":336,"cache_read_input_tokens":141952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"fddec48b-5e5a-4040-b91a-37f7c639a270"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-dddc8144-f563-450a-9c5b-af12a7c4aedb-96","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"770→  H.time = () => AIHub.time();\\n  H.finish = (json) => AIHub.finish(JSON.parse(json));                               // host, at the round's end\\n  H.send = (json, to) => AIHub.send(JSON.parse(json), { reliable: false, to });\\n  H.publish = (json) => { H.last = JSON.parse(json); };                              // Rust, about once a second\\n})();\\n```\\nThe harness pokes `Enter` with a synthetic `KeyboardEvent` inside each frame, so listen in JS, not only through winit.\\n\\n## Appendix C: the fragment for the page ✔\\n\\n780→In `pack_single_html.py`, after loading the page:\\n```python\\npage, n = re.subn(r'<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\\\n',\\n    lambda m: m.group(0) + '<script>\\\\n' + client + '\\\\n</script>\\\\n' + tags + '<script>\\\\n' + shim + '\\\\n</script>\\\\n', page, count=1)\\n```\\n`client` is `session.js`, byte for byte (its `/*! aihub-session` banner lets the hub replace it). The packer already refuses JS glue holding `<script`, `</script` or `<!--`; apply the same check to the client and the shim. ✔ `session.js` holds none.\\n\\n## Appendix D: browser stand-ins ✔\\n\\n```python\\n790→PAD = \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n(() => { const buttons = Array.from({length: 17}, () => ({pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0}));\\n  const pad = {id: 'DualSense Wireless Controller (STANDARD GAMEPAD)', index: 0, connected: true,\\n               mapping: 'standard', timestamp: 0, axes: [0,0,0,0], buttons};\\n  window.__pad = pad; navigator.getGamepads = () => [pad, null, null, null]; })();\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\npage.add_init_script(PAD)                       # then: page.evaluate(\\\"__pad.axes[0]=1; __pad.timestamp++\\\")\\n```\\nStandard mapping: 0 Cross, 1 Circle, 2 Square, 3 Triangle, 4 L1, 5 R1, 6 L2, 7 R2, 8 Create, 9 Options, 10 L3, 11 R3, 12–15 D-pad, 16 PS; axes 0–1 left stick, 2–3 right. Set `value` as well as `pressed` for triggers. Add a second pad at index 1 for co-op.\\n\\n800→```python\\nTAP = \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n(() => { const real = AudioNode.prototype.connect; window.__an = [];\\n  AudioNode.prototype.connect = function (dest, ...rest) { const r = real.call(this, dest, ...rest);\\n    if (dest instanceof AudioDestinationNode) { const c = this.context;\\n      if (!c.__an) { c.__an = c.createAnalyser(); c.__an.fftSize = 2048; window.__an.push(c.__an); } real.call(this, c.__an); }\\n    return r; };\\n  window.__peak = () => { let m = 0; for (const a of window.__an) { const b = new Float32Array(a.fftSize);\\n    a.getFloatTimeDomainData(b); for (const v of b) m = Math.max(m, Math.abs(v)); } return m; }; })();\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n810→```\\n✔ This read a peak of 0.65 from the engine's cpal output during play.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"770→  H.time = () => AIHub.time();\\n  H.finish = (json) => AIHub.finish(JSON.parse(json));                               // host, at the round's end\\n  H.send = (json, to) => AIHub.send(JSON.parse(json), { reliable: false, to });\\n  H.publish = (json) => { H.last = JSON.parse(json); };                              // Rust, about once a second\\n})();\\n```\\nThe harness pokes `Enter` with a synthetic `KeyboardEvent` inside each frame, so listen in JS, not only through winit.\\n\\n## Appendix C: the fragment for the page ✔\\n\\n780→In `pack_single_html.py`, after loading the page:\\n```python\\npage, n = re.subn(r'<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\\\n',\\n    lambda m: m.group(0) + '<script>\\\\n' + client + '\\\\n</script>\\\\n' + tags + '<script>\\\\n' + shim + '\\\\n</script>\\\\n', page, count=1)\\n```\\n`client` is `session.js`, byte for byte (its `/*! aihub-session` banner lets the hub replace it). The packer already refuses JS glue holding `<script`, `</script` or `<!--`; apply the same check to the client and the shim. ✔ `session.js` holds none.\\n\\n## Appendix D: browser stand-ins ✔\\n\\n```python\\n790→PAD = \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n(() => { const buttons = Array.from({length: 17}, () => ({pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0}));\\n  const pad = {id: 'DualSense Wireless Controller (STANDARD GAMEPAD)', index: 0, connected: true,\\n               mapping: 'standard', timestamp: 0, axes: [0,0,0,0], buttons};\\n  window.__pad = pad; navigator.getGamepads = () => [pad, null, null, null]; })();\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\npage.add_init_script(PAD)                       # then: page.evaluate(\\\"__pad.axes[0]=1; __pad.timestamp++\\\")\\n```\\nStandard mapping: 0 Cross, 1 Circle, 2 Square, 3 Triangle, 4 L1, 5 R1, 6 L2, 7 R2, 8 Create, 9 Options, 10 L3, 11 R3, 12–15 D-pad, 16 PS; axes 0–1 left stick, 2–3 right. Set `value` as well as `pressed` for triggers. Add a second pad at index 1 for co-op.\\n\\n800→```python\\nTAP = \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n(() => { const real = AudioNode.prototype.connect; window.__an = [];\\n  AudioNode.prototype.connect = function (dest, ...rest) { const r = real.call(this, dest, ...rest);\\n    if (dest instanceof AudioDestinationNode) { const c = this.context;\\n      if (!c.__an) { c.__an = c.createAnalyser(); c.__an.fftSize = 2048; window.__an.push(c.__an); } real.call(this, c.__an); }\\n    return r; };\\n  window.__peak = () => { let m = 0; for (const a of window.__an) { const b = new Float32Array(a.fftSize);\\n    a.getFloatTimeDomainData(b); for (const v of b) m = Math.max(m, Math.abs(v)); } return m; }; })();\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n810→```\\n✔ This read a peak of 0.65 from the engine's cpal output during play.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md\",\"offset\":770,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"  H.time = () => AIHub.time();\\n  H.finish = (json) => AIHub.finish(JSON.parse(json));                               // host, at the round's end\\n  H.send = (json, to) => AIHub.send(JSON.parse(json), { reliable: false, to });\\n  H.publish = (json) => { H.last = JSON.parse(json); };                              // Rust, about once a second\\n})();\\n```\\nThe harness pokes `Enter` with a synthetic `KeyboardEvent` inside each frame, so listen in JS, not only through winit.\\n\\n## Appendix C: the fragment for the page ✔\\n\\nIn `pack_single_html.py`, after loading the page:\\n```python\\npage, n = re.subn(r'<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\\\n',\\n    lambda m: m.group(0) + '<script>\\\\n' + client + '\\\\n</script>\\\\n' + tags + '<script>\\\\n' + shim + '\\\\n</script>\\\\n', page, count=1)\\n```\\n`client` is `session.js`, byte for byte (its `/*! aihub-session` banner lets the hub replace it). The packer already refuses JS glue holding `<script`, `</script` or `<!--`; apply the same check to the client and the shim. ✔ `session.js` holds none.\\n\\n## Appendix D: browser stand-ins ✔\\n\\n```python\\nPAD = \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n(() => { const buttons = Array.from({length: 17}, () => ({pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0}));\\n  const pad = {id: 'DualSense Wireless Controller (STANDARD GAMEPAD)', index: 0, connected: true,\\n               mapping: 'standard', timestamp: 0, axes: [0,0,0,0], buttons};\\n  window.__pad = pad; navigator.getGamepads = () => [pad, null, null, null]; })();\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\npage.add_init_script(PAD)                       # then: page.evaluate(\\\"__pad.axes[0]=1; __pad.timestamp++\\\")\\n```\\nStandard mapping: 0 Cross, 1 Circle, 2 Square, 3 Triangle, 4 L1, 5 R1, 6 L2, 7 R2, 8 Create, 9 Options, 10 L3, 11 R3, 12–15 D-pad, 16 PS; axes 0–1 left stick, 2–3 right. Set `value` as well as `pressed` for triggers. Add a second pad at index 1 for co-op.\\n\\n```python\\nTAP = \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n(() => { const real = AudioNode.prototype.connect; window.__an = [];\\n  AudioNode.prototype.connect = function (dest, ...rest) { const r = real.call(this, dest, ...rest);\\n    if (dest instanceof AudioDestinationNode) { const c = this.context;\\n      if (!c.__an) { c.__an = c.createAnalyser(); c.__an.fftSize = 2048; window.__an.push(c.__an); } real.call(this, c.__an); }\\n    return r; };\\n  window.__peak = () => { let m = 0; for (const a of window.__an) { const b = new Float32Array(a.fftSize);\\n    a.getFloatTimeDomainData(b); for (const v of b) m = Math.max(m, Math.abs(v)); } return m; }; })();\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n```\\n✔ This read a peak of 0.65 from the engine's cpal output during play.\\n\",\"total_lines\":811}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-dddc8144-f563-450a-9c5b-af12a7c4aedb-97","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,48,49,53,95,95,120,52,50,54,55,55,97,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-dddc8144-f563-450a-9c5b-af12a7c4aedb-98","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,48,49,53,95,95,120,52,50,54,55,55,97,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717