{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_572","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking how keyboard keys map.\n\nWinit needs real key events on the canvas. Playwright sends keys to the focused element. The canvas must be focused for keyboard input.\n\nThe file:// launch plan is:\n- Inject a pad script before loading\n- Navigate to the file URL\n- Wait for game status\n- Verify title, music, and canvas state\n- Take a screenshot\n- Press a key or move the pad to confirm status changes match both launches\n\nThe plan now includes recording game status before and after the same input on both launches to confirm identical state changes. The viewport will be set to 1920x1080, though xvfb may render at a 1x device pixel ratio.\n\nCanvas dimensions will be checked via attributes. Pixel variance in screenshots will confirm the canvas is painted rather than blank.\n\nThe file:// launch serves as the solo page without a hub session, so the title should appear. The HTTP server will also be tested directly to verify the title outside the harness.\n\nA launch.py script will be written to automate both launches.\n\nA shots.py script will navigate the menu to test multiple game states. It will reach About, Story, and Operation from the title screen using arrow keys and Enter. Reaching Results may require burst ticks to finish a case.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7bbeb713-7810-4008-8a1f-39f89bf94448-102","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"bot::|fn bot|skill","glob":"**/games/surgery/ops.rs","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7bbeb713-7810-4008-8a1f-39f89bf94448-103","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"bot::","glob":"**/*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":901,"output_tokens":699,"cache_read_input_tokens":146816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"49525431-fd92-4c3f-a79f-5b6271acc00b"}
