{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_575","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The simulation step takes input passed in directly rather than using the bot automatically.\n\nAttract mode runs the bot automatically after ten seconds of idle time. This could provide the operation screenshot without manual input. The plan requires screenshots of title, operation, story, results, dev, and about.\n\nI will navigate the UI directly to capture the required screenshots. Driving the operation manually or adding debug commands would expand scope beyond what is needed.\n\nThe operation screenshot can be taken immediately after loading case 0, even if the patient is dying. The results screen is difficult to capture because a dead case shows the Dead screen instead of Results. Winning manually would require precise tool placement, which is unreliable without knowing exact positions.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a94e9972-eaba-4286-a6eb-0afdf0a920b1-107","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"decide|bot","glob":"**/pav_app/src/product.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a94e9972-eaba-4286-a6eb-0afdf0a920b1-108","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn compose","glob":"**/pav_app/**/*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":856,"output_tokens":554,"cache_read_input_tokens":150528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"049cde89-277c-490d-8961-85b8b6b45992"}
