{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_588","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Testing feedback indicates three issues.\n\nHub frame starvation is a critical multiplayer bug. The about screen must be updated to reflect the true interview results. A WASM rebuild is required before the file:// launch so the packed page shows the final text.\n\nTesting feedback now lists five issues. The hub freeze and ControlFlow::Poll freeze are critical multiplayer bugs. The suture, nearest-hazard, and sac bugs are critical gameplay bugs.\n\nThe about screen will list five critical bugs. The most helpful feedback will mention the hub harness traffic check and the bot. The least helpful remains the print probe.\n\nThe engine feedback answer will be appended to mention the ControlFlow::Poll fix. The packed HTML must be rebuilt before the file:// launches.\n\nThe engine feedback answer is finalized. The JSON source will be copied to exit-interview.json after the rebuild. Content README updates can proceed without another WASM build. Balance tests can be added and run with cargo afterward, since the existing WASM rebuild already compiles pav_ui.\n\nThe balance test will be added only after the WASM rebuild starts, so it cannot affect the in-flight pack. The about.json edit and launch script and README will all proceed in parallel.\n\nThe balance test can be edited while the WASM build compiles pav_ui, since tests are not part of the binary. The Deviations section in PLAN.md needs a colon target directory and a Rust story. PROGRESS.md will be updated at the end. Plan checkboxes will be checked only after launch evidence appears. A short README page and rank_of for suggested par are also needed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a8e9a0e0-aed4-4e1e-99e4-2a7b817ac856-123","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/surgery/about.json","old_string":"  \"testingFeedback\": [\n    \"Testing caught three rule bugs: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, and a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter.\",\n    \"3\",\n    \"The most helpful test was a skill-1.0 bot playing every case, Code Blue, and the campaign from a fresh scene.\",\n    \"The least helpful test was a temporary print probe that only dumped stuck hazards and was removed once the selection bug was fixed.\"\n  ],","new_string":"  \"testingFeedback\": [\n    \"Testing caught five issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, and ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame so an operation froze after one tick.\",\n    \"5\",\n    \"The most helpful checks were a skill-1.0 bot on every case from a fresh scene, and the hub harness traffic counters once the frame loop actually ticked.\",\n    \"The least helpful test was a temporary print probe that only dumped stuck hazards and was removed once the selection bug was fixed.\"\n  ],"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a8e9a0e0-aed4-4e1e-99e4-2a7b817ac856-124","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/surgery/about.json","old_string":"    \"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\",","new_string":"    \"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a8e9a0e0-aed4-4e1e-99e4-2a7b817ac856-125","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"## Deviations","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3121,"output_tokens":1547,"cache_read_input_tokens":162688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"46f56e59-505b-4131-9ff4-a37b399a4ff6"}
