{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_591","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The S rank is 100% of par, equivalent to rank 4.\n\nENCORE is 115% (rank 5). The test requires rank >= 4 for skill 1.0. Suggested par equals the mean score rounded to the nearest integer so a skill-1.0 run lands on S. I will print current par, mean score, mean time, mean vitals, wins, and suggested par. The simulation runs 20 seeds across 8 cases and 4 skills with a 25200 tick cap. Skill 1 finishes quickly. Skill 0 should lose fast.\n\nSkill 0.4 could hit the tick cap on hard cases and run very slowly. I will use 5 seeds instead of 20 to keep the test under a minute. The output will note this compromise. Cases 0 through 7 plus code are included.\n\nThe test will be appended to surgery.rs. A README will be placed at dev folder content/README.md explaining the Rust tables. I need to verify the module path for cases.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f3b7a7c8-a549-4485-858d-7b4f693f2774-130","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub const CASES|pub struct CaseDef|fn lines_for","glob":"**/games/surgery/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f3b7a7c8-a549-4485-858d-7b4f693f2774-131","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md","limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":590,"output_tokens":801,"cache_read_input_tokens":168192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"38ef1006-0e3f-4184-9e6d-24927c4063d5"}
