{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_603","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The screenshot timed out after fonts loaded. The page may be stuck painting.\n\nThe game loop is likely spinning the CPU at 100%. The solo page rebuilds a full 100k-vertex plate mesh every frame plus shadows, which keeps the page busy and prevents Playwright from completing the screenshot.\n\nSwiftshader may freeze the page so hard that screenshot CDP times out. The real game file:// launch should still show the plate. If one frame takes seconds, the page becomes unresponsive. Options include disabling animations, raising the timeout, or capturing via canvas.toDataURL from inside the page. On solo, ControlFlow becomes Wait once graphics exist.\n\nThe 30-second timeout is likely too short for SwiftShader's first shader compilation. That initial compile can block the JavaScript thread for minutes, preventing the screenshot from completing.\n\nThe first frame completed before the screenshot began. The 30-second hang means the thread was blocked for 30 seconds straight, or Playwright is waiting for paint stability. By default, Playwright waits for fonts and two animation frames.\n\nThe GPU is likely wedged by the full plate and shadows on SwiftShader, so the compositor never produces a frame. I will raise the screenshot timeout to 60 seconds and disable animations to see if the page can still capture.\n\nI will save the game status before attempting the screenshot so the log shows boot confirmation even if the shot hangs. The traceback confirms status() returned successfully, meaning the game booted. The screenshot command is simply hanging.\n\nThe title and opening sequence screenshots will likely hit the same hang. Disabling animations may be the key fix, since it skips waiting for animation frames entirely.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a43f750d-e054-4bc3-bad8-c468ffde48a8-154","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/launch.py","old_string":"def shot(page, path):\n    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    page.screenshot(path=str(path))","new_string":"def shot(page, path):\n    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    page.screenshot(path=str(path), animations=\"disabled\", timeout=20000)"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a43f750d-e054-4bc3-bad8-c468ffde48a8-155","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/launch.py","old_string":"    st = status(page)\n    box = page.evaluate(","new_string":"    st = status(page)\n    print(f\"LAUNCH {n} status\", st.get(\"screen\"), st.get(\"title\"), st.get(\"music\"))\n    box = page.evaluate("}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a43f750d-e054-4bc3-bad8-c468ffde48a8-156","name":"get_command_or_subagent_output","input":{"task_ids":["fbf77f96-c816-4cc3-a2a5-4dcdb16ffedf"],"timeout_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2085,"output_tokens":1296,"cache_read_input_tokens":183296,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"25710ed4-e8c5-4ebe-bb1b-114941939f78"}
