y/case/6 5/5 5.8 64.9 4967 1100 4967\\n1.0 surgery/case/7 5/5 10.9 29.7 11997 1400 11997\\n1.0 surgery/code 5/5 240.0 56.1 13061 1600 13061\\n0.7 surgery/case/0 5/5 2.5 73.3 3622 900 900\\n0.7 surgery/case/1 5/5 2.8 69.4 3594 900 900\\n0.7 surgery/case/2 5/5 4.6 30.0 3482 900 900\\n0.7 surgery/case/3 5/5 19.8 65.9 12135 1100 1100\\n0.7 surgery/case/4 5/5 13.7 59.5 13520 1200 1200\\n0.7 surgery/case/5 0/5 22.6 0.0 9518 1200 1200\\n0.7 surgery/case/6 5/5 6.0 64.8 4965 1100 1100\\n0.7 surgery/case/7 5/5 11.7 29.8 10514 1400 1400\\n0.7 surgery/code 5/5 240.0 50.0 12840 1600 1600\\n0.4 surgery/case/0 5/5 3.6 72.5 3601 900 900\\n0.4 surgery/case/1 5/5 3.7 68.7 3085 900 900\\n0.4 surgery/case/2 5/5 4.9 30.0 3481 900 900\\n0.4 surgery/case/3 5/5 48.8 46.2 1498 1100 1100\\n0.4 surgery/case/4 4/5 38.9 8.0 1623 1200 1200\\n0.4 surgery/case/5 0/5 23.6 0.0 431 1200 1200\\n0.4 surgery/case/6 5/5 7.0 63.7 4938 1100 1100\\n0.4 surgery/case/7 5/5 18.9 28.6 3616 1400 1400\\n0.4 surgery/code 5/5 240.0 35.4 4738 1600 1600\\n0.0 surgery/case/0 5/5 32.5 16.3 -461 900 900\\n0.0 surgery/case/1 5/5 34.0 30.0 -1530 900 900\\n0.0 surgery/case/2 0/5 51.5 0.0 -3706 900 900\\n0.0 surgery/case/3 0/5 44.9 0.0 -4283 1100 1100\\n0.0 surgery/case/4 0/5 25.3 0.0 -1485 1200 1200\\n0.0 surgery/case/5 0/5 21.5 0.0 -1786 1200 1200\\n0.0 surgery/case/6 0/5 36.6 0.0 -2871 1100 1100\\n0.0 surgery/case/7 0/5 23.8 0.0 -3668 1400 1400\\n0.0 surgery/code 0/5 91.7 0.0 -1237 1600 1600\\ntest balance_sheet ... ok\\n\\ntest result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 6 filtered out; finished in 1.49s\\n\\n\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/terminal/call-1f52ffc0-7695-48cb-ae82-f44d004158c6-152.log\",\"truncated\":false,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":2185}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool