{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_607","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Reviewing the balance results for Skill 1.\n\nSkill 1.0 wins all five cases including code with scores far above par, so it easily qualifies for ENCORE. The plan's claim that 1.0 always wins at S or above is accurate with the current par. Skill 0.7 wins most cases but loses case five. Skill 0.4 loses later cases, though case five is the only loss. The assumption that skill 0 always loses is incorrect because it wins cases zero and one.\n\nSkill 0 is not idle. It still aims and treats despite the low skill threshold. The plan targets a different behavior. Balance tuning should replace feel-based adjustments.\n\nThe skill 0 branch in bot.rs needs inspection. Skill 0 is a bad bot rather than an idle one, so the \"always loses\" target is not met. This is a design target that may require fixing.\n\nSkill 0 winning cases zero and one is a miss. I will inspect the bot's skill < 0.2 branch to make it fail without retuning suture, sticky select, or sac aux2. The suite already asserts that skill 1 wins at rank four or above.\n\nI will inspect the bot code and apply a small change to make skill 0 fail without hurting skill 1. The suite does not test skill 0, so I can rerun it safely. I am considering increasing miss amplitude or requiring the correct tool at skill 0.15. Skill 1 must remain unaffected.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e18fffd5-11de-469c-ba6a-bdd65c56b7e9-160","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/bot.rs","offset":1,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2904,"output_tokens":977,"cache_read_input_tokens":189312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"41313acc-8bfa-42c8-b1cf-74e762646eb0"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e18fffd5-11de-469c-ba6a-bdd65c56b7e9-160","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→//! A stateless good hand. Noise and release timing come from skill, not from `sim.rng`.\\n\\nuse super::content::G_DUET;\\nuse super::hazard::aim_point;\\nuse super::kinds::*;\\nuse super::*;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, SurgeonInput};\\n\\nconst DT: f32 = 1.0 / 60.0;\\n10→\\npub fn decide(game: &Surgery, tick: u64, slot: usize) -> SurgeonInput {\\n    let mut inp = SurgeonInput { active: true, pressure: 1.0, tool: TOOL_KEEP, ..Default::default() };\\n    let skill = game.skill.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    if matches!(game.mode, M_STORY | M_CHART | M_RESULTS) {\\n        inp.held = surg::CONFIRM;\\n        inp.pressed = surg::CONFIRM;\\n        inp.tool = TOOL_KEEP;\\n        return inp;\\n    }\\n20→    if game.mode != M_OP && game.mode != M_ATTRACT {\\n        inp.active = false;\\n        return inp;\\n    }\\n    let me = &game.surgeons[slot.min(3)];\\n    if game.heart.flat {\\n        return defib(game, me, skill, inp);\\n    }\\n    if skill >= 0.5 {\\n        inp.held |= surg::PRECISION;\\n30→    }\\n    if want_gift(game, skill) {\\n        let on = game.heart.on_beat(game.tune.beat_window_ms);\\n        if !on || !me.was_gift {\\n            inp.held |= surg::GIFT;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let avoid = if slot == 0 { None } else { game.surgeons[0].focus };\\n    let Some(h) = pick(game, avoid) else {\\n        aim_toward(game, me, slot, skill, tick, me.x, me.z, &mut inp);\\n40→        inp.tool = me.tool;\\n        return inp;\\n    };\\n    let mut tool = if h.hidden && h.revealed <= 0.0 { SCANNER } else { h.tool };\\n    if skill < 0.2 {\\n        tool = (tick % 11) as u8;\\n    }\\n    inp.tool = tool;\\n    let side = if (tick / 8) % 2 == 0 { 1.0 } else { -1.0 };\\n    let (mut tx, mut tz) = aim_for(h, tick, side);\\n50→    if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !game.heart.diastole() {\\n        tx = h.x;\\n        tz = h.z;\\n    }\\n    if me.focus == Some(h.id) && me.focus_t > 2.2 && skill > 0.3 {\\n        let a = me.focus_t * 2.4;\\n        tx += a.cos() * 0.42;\\n        tz += a.sin() * 0.42;\\n    }\\n    aim_toward(game, me, slot, skill, tick, tx, tz, &mut inp);\\n60→    let dx = tx - me.x;\\n    let dz = tz - me.z;\\n    let dist = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt();\\n    let near = dist < (h.radius + 0.28).max(0.45);\\n    let release_at = release_at(skill, h.kind);\\n    let charging = is_charge(h);\\n    let heat = heat_danger(game, me.x, me.z);\\n    let hold = if heat {\\n        false\\n    } else if charging && h.aux >= release_at {\\n70→        false\\n    } else if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !game.heart.diastole() {\\n        h.grabbed || dist < h.radius\\n    } else if h.kind == K_BONE && h.stage == 0 && h.aux.abs() >= 12.0 {\\n        false\\n    } else if h.grabbed {\\n        true\\n    } else if tool == SCANNER {\\n        dist < h.radius + 0.4\\n    } else if tool == IV {\\n80→        true\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! A stateless good hand. Noise and release timing come from skill, not from `sim.rng`.\\n\\nuse super::content::G_DUET;\\nuse super::hazard::aim_point;\\nuse super::kinds::*;\\nuse super::*;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, SurgeonInput};\\n\\nconst DT: f32 = 1.0 / 60.0;\\n10→\\npub fn decide(game: &Surgery, tick: u64, slot: usize) -> SurgeonInput {\\n    let mut inp = SurgeonInput { active: true, pressure: 1.0, tool: TOOL_KEEP, ..Default::default() };\\n    let skill = game.skill.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    if matches!(game.mode, M_STORY | M_CHART | M_RESULTS) {\\n        inp.held = surg::CONFIRM;\\n        inp.pressed = surg::CONFIRM;\\n        inp.tool = TOOL_KEEP;\\n        return inp;\\n    }\\n20→    if game.mode != M_OP && game.mode != M_ATTRACT {\\n        inp.active = false;\\n        return inp;\\n    }\\n    let me = &game.surgeons[slot.min(3)];\\n    if game.heart.flat {\\n        return defib(game, me, skill, inp);\\n    }\\n    if skill >= 0.5 {\\n        inp.held |= surg::PRECISION;\\n30→    }\\n    if want_gift(game, skill) {\\n        let on = game.heart.on_beat(game.tune.beat_window_ms);\\n        if !on || !me.was_gift {\\n            inp.held |= surg::GIFT;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let avoid = if slot == 0 { None } else { game.surgeons[0].focus };\\n    let Some(h) = pick(game, avoid) else {\\n        aim_toward(game, me, slot, skill, tick, me.x, me.z, &mut inp);\\n40→        inp.tool = me.tool;\\n        return inp;\\n    };\\n    let mut tool = if h.hidden && h.revealed <= 0.0 { SCANNER } else { h.tool };\\n    if skill < 0.2 {\\n        tool = (tick % 11) as u8;\\n    }\\n    inp.tool = tool;\\n    let side = if (tick / 8) % 2 == 0 { 1.0 } else { -1.0 };\\n    let (mut tx, mut tz) = aim_for(h, tick, side);\\n50→    if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !game.heart.diastole() {\\n        tx = h.x;\\n        tz = h.z;\\n    }\\n    if me.focus == Some(h.id) && me.focus_t > 2.2 && skill > 0.3 {\\n        let a = me.focus_t * 2.4;\\n        tx += a.cos() * 0.42;\\n        tz += a.sin() * 0.42;\\n    }\\n    aim_toward(game, me, slot, skill, tick, tx, tz, &mut inp);\\n60→    let dx = tx - me.x;\\n    let dz = tz - me.z;\\n    let dist = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt();\\n    let near = dist < (h.radius + 0.28).max(0.45);\\n    let release_at = release_at(skill, h.kind);\\n    let charging = is_charge(h);\\n    let heat = heat_danger(game, me.x, me.z);\\n    let hold = if heat {\\n        false\\n    } else if charging && h.aux >= release_at {\\n70→        false\\n    } else if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !game.heart.diastole() {\\n        h.grabbed || dist < h.radius\\n    } else if h.kind == K_BONE && h.stage == 0 && h.aux.abs() >= 12.0 {\\n        false\\n    } else if h.grabbed {\\n        true\\n    } else if tool == SCANNER {\\n        dist < h.radius + 0.4\\n    } else if tool == IV {\\n80→        true\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/bot.rs\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"//! A stateless good hand. Noise and release timing come from skill, not from `sim.rng`.\\n\\nuse super::content::G_DUET;\\nuse super::hazard::aim_point;\\nuse super::kinds::*;\\nuse super::*;\\nuse crate::input::{surg, SurgeonInput};\\n\\nconst DT: f32 = 1.0 / 60.0;\\n\\npub fn decide(game: &Surgery, tick: u64, slot: usize) -> SurgeonInput {\\n    let mut inp = SurgeonInput { active: true, pressure: 1.0, tool: TOOL_KEEP, ..Default::default() };\\n    let skill = game.skill.clamp(0.0, 1.0);\\n    if matches!(game.mode, M_STORY | M_CHART | M_RESULTS) {\\n        inp.held = surg::CONFIRM;\\n        inp.pressed = surg::CONFIRM;\\n        inp.tool = TOOL_KEEP;\\n        return inp;\\n    }\\n    if game.mode != M_OP && game.mode != M_ATTRACT {\\n        inp.active = false;\\n        return inp;\\n    }\\n    let me = &game.surgeons[slot.min(3)];\\n    if game.heart.flat {\\n        return defib(game, me, skill, inp);\\n    }\\n    if skill >= 0.5 {\\n        inp.held |= surg::PRECISION;\\n    }\\n    if want_gift(game, skill) {\\n        let on = game.heart.on_beat(game.tune.beat_window_ms);\\n        if !on || !me.was_gift {\\n            inp.held |= surg::GIFT;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let avoid = if slot == 0 { None } else { game.surgeons[0].focus };\\n    let Some(h) = pick(game, avoid) else {\\n        aim_toward(game, me, slot, skill, tick, me.x, me.z, &mut inp);\\n        inp.tool = me.tool;\\n        return inp;\\n    };\\n    let mut tool = if h.hidden && h.revealed <= 0.0 { SCANNER } else { h.tool };\\n    if skill < 0.2 {\\n        tool = (tick % 11) as u8;\\n    }\\n    inp.tool = tool;\\n    let side = if (tick / 8) % 2 == 0 { 1.0 } else { -1.0 };\\n    let (mut tx, mut tz) = aim_for(h, tick, side);\\n    if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !game.heart.diastole() {\\n        tx = h.x;\\n        tz = h.z;\\n    }\\n    if me.focus == Some(h.id) && me.focus_t > 2.2 && skill > 0.3 {\\n        let a = me.focus_t * 2.4;\\n        tx += a.cos() * 0.42;\\n        tz += a.sin() * 0.42;\\n    }\\n    aim_toward(game, me, slot, skill, tick, tx, tz, &mut inp);\\n    let dx = tx - me.x;\\n    let dz = tz - me.z;\\n    let dist = (dx * dx + dz * dz).sqrt();\\n    let near = dist < (h.radius + 0.28).max(0.45);\\n    let release_at = release_at(skill, h.kind);\\n    let charging = is_charge(h);\\n    let heat = heat_danger(game, me.x, me.z);\\n    let hold = if heat {\\n        false\\n    } else if charging && h.aux >= release_at {\\n        false\\n    } else if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !game.heart.diastole() {\\n        h.grabbed || dist < h.radius\\n    } else if h.kind == K_BONE && h.stage == 0 && h.aux.abs() >= 12.0 {\\n        false\\n    } else if h.grabbed {\\n        true\\n    } else if tool == SCANNER {\\n        dist < h.radius + 0.4\\n    } else if tool == IV {\\n        true\\n\",\"total_lines\":209}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"6aa8e42e-81cc-4631-949a-3811ee0da357"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_608","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Skill below 0.2 triggers a random tool selection based on tick modulo 11.\n\nRandom tool spam loses because it aims in circles instead of at the hazard. Skill 0 still wins on easy cases by holding use while aimed at the target. The random-tool test loses because it never targets the hazard.\n\nThe fix is to make skill below 0.15 wander and use random tools instead of aiming at the hazard. Skill 0.4 will still target the wound.\n\nSkill 0 will now miss all cases. Only the balance suite needs rerunning, which should take about 1.5 seconds. The skill 1 tests are unaffected because they do not enter the new branch.\n\nSkill 0 wins on easy cases because random tool selection occasionally hits the right tool while perfectly aimed, and the 32-second timers let it luck through. Wandering fixes this by breaking that lucky streak.\n\nThe suggested balance par of 3624 would push skill 1 into ENCORE rather than S. The plan only requires an S or above, so ENCORE is acceptable. The current par of 900 is intentionally easy to guarantee skill 1 always clears S. It will remain unchanged.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-86ba1c18-8af2-45e8-bdf0-2b6b003c685b-161","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/bot.rs","old_string":"    let (mut tx, mut tz) = aim_for(h, tick, side);","new_string":"    let (mut tx, mut tz) = aim_for(h, tick, side);\n    // A skill of 0 still knew where the wound was, so the easy cases lived.\n    // Below 0.15 the hand wanders and the case should be lost.\n    if skill < 0.15 {\n        tx = (tick as f32 * 0.07).sin() * 3.2;\n        tz = (tick as f32 * 0.05).cos() * 2.2;\n    }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2007,"output_tokens":1268,"cache_read_input_tokens":192128,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"e0d37991-a90f-49d7-bce1-53ba0799e0ff"}
