{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_612","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"ImageMagick is installed. xwd and scrot are missing, likely because Python exited with code 1.\n\nSwitching to ImageMagick's `import -window root` for screenshots. The xvfb display will be set to 1920x1080. Status JSON will be saved before the shot in a finally block so it persists even if the capture fails.\n\nA 300ms delay will be added before the screenshot so the window is fully mapped. The xvfb-run command will include `-silent` if available. After capture, the PNG will be read back to verify it was painted.\n\nThe Enter comparison will run before the screenshot and before killing the animation loop. This ensures both launches record the state change even if the capture freezes the page. The screenshot will be taken first to capture the title image, while Enter is pressed afterward on a still-running page.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-704fcd8a-c495-424a-9f81-e266f759cb2d-165","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/launch.py","old_string":"def shot(page, path):\n    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    # The operation redraws forever. A capture waits on that paint unless the\n    # next animation frame is not requested.\n    page.evaluate(\n        \"\"\"() => {\n          window.requestAnimationFrame = () => 0;\n        }\"\"\"\n    )\n    page.wait_for_timeout(300)\n    page.screenshot(path=str(path), animations=\"disabled\", timeout=15000)","new_string":"def shot(page, path):\n    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    # Chrome's own screenshot waits on the WebGPU swapchain and times out.\n    # The X framebuffer already has the presented frame.\n    page.wait_for_timeout(400)\n    proc = subprocess.run(\n        [\"import\", \"-window\", \"root\", str(path)],\n        env=os.environ.copy(),\n        capture_output=True,\n        text=True,\n        timeout=20,\n    )\n    if proc.returncode != 0:\n        raise RuntimeError(proc.stderr[-500:] or f\"import exit {proc.returncode}\")"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-704fcd8a-c495-424a-9f81-e266f759cb2d-166","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/launch.py","old_string":"import json\nimport os\nimport traceback\nfrom pathlib import Path","new_string":"import json\nimport os\nimport subprocess\nimport traceback\nfrom pathlib import Path"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":793,"output_tokens":917,"cache_read_input_tokens":198144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"1dd5f0cf-8a92-4552-9123-4288012431e1"}
