{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_619","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Pressing Enter failed to change the screen.\n\nEnter opened the menu from title, but further navigation stayed trapped inside it. The keyboard may not have reached the game, or the frame loop missed the key.\n\nArrowDown may not be mapped. The rapid key presses might arrive between frames and get lost before winit processes them.\n\nThe `just` list accumulates key events, but `ate()` only consumes one per frame. Rapid presses can pile up and be lost.\n\nIf no down arrows registered, the second Enter activated Continue and should have opened the Story screen. The notes still show \"menu\", so the navigation may have failed to leave the menu entirely.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aa9f41ca-06c0-4259-8e7e-4cb98f3dae35-174","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"just\\.","glob":"**/pav_app/src/product.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1242,"output_tokens":715,"cache_read_input_tokens":203136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"a71a8f75-4560-4406-ba7e-dc2497f647c0"}
