{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_624","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The title screen shows BPM, vitals, timer, and mode.\n\nThe shoot() path successfully navigated to the menu screen. The one_launch test likely failed because it only waited 400ms.\n\nThe first Enter reached the menu. The ArrowDowns and second Enter were dropped because the key buffer clears every frame. Five downs at 180ms likely span only one or two frames.\n\nThe result remained \"menu\" rather than \"difficulty\", confirming no ArrowDown was processed. The fix is to poll status after Enter until the screen changes, waiting up to roughly 15 seconds instead of 400ms.\n\nNavigation should press one key, wait for a focus or screen change, then press the next. On the title screen, Enter alone changes the screen. From the menu, About is index 5, so five ArrowDowns are needed to reach it before pressing Enter.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b94eb7b3-fbe2-4bbd-9319-33a915aa06b6-13","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_ui/src/surgery/mod.rs","offset":129,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b94eb7b3-fbe2-4bbd-9319-33a915aa06b6-14","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_ui/src/surgery/mod.rs","offset":250,"limit":110}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b94eb7b3-fbe2-4bbd-9319-33a915aa06b6-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs","offset":800,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b94eb7b3-fbe2-4bbd-9319-33a915aa06b6-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_a