{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_625","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to identify the event handler for the surgery product.\n\nChecking whether the app routes to `surgery_event` or if both handlers fire. The product's `consumed` flag is discarded, so keys still reach it. The 400ms Enter delay likely stems from frame timing.\n\nThe shoot path already reached the menu after waiting up to ten seconds, confirming Enter works but slowly. The launch.py plan will poll status with a long timeout after each key press and record before/after states. Both launches should show title-to-menu transitions. Shots will navigate one key at a time. A mouse click at (200, 200) might be problematic.\n\nThe verification requires a stick, button, or mouse input to change focus, screen, or cursor. Enter changing title to menu satisfies this if it works both times. The pad stub sets navigator.getGamepads, but gilrs on WASM may not detect it; status shows a keyboard device instead. The requirement asks for a driven pad or mouse input, so I need to re-read the exact wording.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-29f504d5-3238-49b9-959b-2bb8b5362975-17","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"getGamepads|gamepad|gilrs","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link","glob":"*.{rs,js}","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-29f504d5-3238-49b9-959b-2bb8b5362975-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"surgery_event|Harbor::","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src","glob":"*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4240,"output_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":48384,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"c726d980-cd6d-4c5f-a909-f36a27fd38ee"}
