{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_628","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bot_plays flag does not actually drive the simulation bot.\n\nThe results screen requires a real-time win, which is too slow and unreliable to reach. I will skip it if it cannot be accessed quickly.\n\nI checked for existing JavaScript debug commands to reach the results screen. Only status and step are available, and step only bursts simulation ticks. A dev command exists but is not bound to a key.\n\nAttract mode runs the bot but does not reach the results screen. Scripting a mouse to play manually would be too slow and redundant. I will check if `__game` or the page exposes any hidden command.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c35005d0-8d9c-4115-b757-3a3929216e1b-26","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs","offset":2080,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c35005d0-8d9c-4115-b757-3a3929216e1b-27","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn handle_key|KeyCode::F3|studio|Dev \\{","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/app.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c35005d0-8d9c-4115-b757-3a3929216e1b-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub-leave.txt","limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c35005d0-8d9c-4115-b757-3a3929216e1b-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub-server.txt","limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c35005d0-8d9c-4115-b757-3a3929216e1b-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-