d HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n10→\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n\\n## Now\\n\\n- Surgical sim: slots, heartbeat, tools, strains, cases 0–7, Code Blue, bot, shell, audio, hub, pack.\\n\\n## Notes for the exit interview\\n20→\\n- Tests and engine changes get logged here as they happen.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\n\\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\\n\\nDev folder and HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n10→\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n\\n## Now\\n\\n- Surgical sim: slots, heartbeat, tools, strains, cases 0–7, Code Blue, bot, shell, audio, hub, pack.\\n\\n## Notes for the exit interview\\n20→\\n- Tests and engine changes get logged here as they happen.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\n\\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\\n\\nDev folder and HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n\\n## Now\\n\\n- Surgical sim: slots, heartbeat, tools, strains, cases 0–7, Code Blue, bot, shell, audio, hub, pack.\\n\\n## Notes for the exit interview\\n\\n- Tests and engine changes get logged here as they happen.\\n\",\"total_