yed (finished), host 2, server sent 55\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"the round ends with a valid result\\\",\\n      \\\"pass\\\": true,\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"played (finished)\\\"\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub-server.txt\",\"offset\":50,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"the round starts when the card ends\\\",\\n      \\\"pass\\\": true,\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"countdown\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"game traffic flows both ways\\\",\\n      \\\"pass\\\": true,\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"p0 \\\\u219154 \\\\u2193106 p1 \\\\u219154 \\\\u2193106 server \\\\u219154 \\\\u2193106\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"a copy with no player of its own runs the world (as a server would)\\\",\\n      \\\"pass\\\": true,\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"played (finished), host 2, server sent 55\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"the round ends with a valid result\\\",\\n      \\\"pass\\\": true,\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"played (finished)\\\"\\n\",\"total_lines\":192}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"10e9cdca-f036-4a92-bd63-bc80b94862dc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_631","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing hub.txt with the four required queries and cursor evidence.\n\nRewriting launch.py to wait for state changes. Recording p3 traffic from the truncated JSON detail. Cursor evidence shows host seat-1 x moving from 0 to 3.42 and client local x moving from 2 to 7.42.\n\nChecking if the solo launch page should appear in hub.txt. The two-page cursor test is already in hub-cursor2.txt. The solo file:// launch shows the title and can be noted as the one page outside a session. Verifying whether the vitals difference of 61.68 versus 62.40 satisfies the \"vitals match\" requirement.\n\nVitals are close but not bitwise equal, so hub.txt will record the actual numbers honestly. Drafting a `wait_change` helper for launch.py that polls page status until a state change occurs.\n\nDrafted `key_until` for launch.py. It presses a key and polls page status until a predicate matches, retrying if the key is dropped.\n\nRetry logic will only repress a key if the page status has not changed, preventing double-activation. A new `tap_until` helper is being drafted for launch.py that repeatedly presses a key and waits briefly for a frame.\n\nRealized that pressing ArrowDown twice in the same frame is harmless. ate() collapses duplicate keys within a single frame, so the focus still advances correctly.\n\nReconsidering the tap strategy. Repeatedly pressing a key risks skipping focus steps if the first press queues and the second lands in the same frame. The safer approach is to press once and poll for up to 20 seconds, retrying only if no state change occurs.\n\nA 20-second timeout per key is acceptable even if it takes two minutes total. Frame counters cannot detect a lost key because vitals and timers stay static on the title screen. The launch script will capture the title page and click the canvas to start.\n\nThe launch script will wait for the screen to change after clicking the canvas. It will not click during boot. After the first click focuses the canvas, keyboard Enter will navigate to the story menu and launch. A mouse click alone satisfies the pad-or-mouse criterion.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca3a986b-cf76-4b28-b256-bd211bae9919-42","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"getGamepads|navigator","path":"/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src","glob":"**/gilrs*/**/*.rs","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca3a986b-cf76-4b28-b256-bd211bae9919-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content.rs","offset":170,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca3a986b-cf76-4b28-b256-bd211bae9919-44","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_app/src/simhost.rs","offset":170,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2440,"output_tokens":1588,"cache_read_input_tokens":73344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"e65319f8-f9c1-4376-9ad1-61f8873fdbcd"}
