{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_644","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Launching the browser in the background. Running parallel checks for exit-interview matches, engine/target existence, and about.json feedback.\n\nAvoiding a second heavy process. The xvfb command may take over five minutes, so it will run in the background with output captured to a file. A wrapper script will print one DONE or FAILED line when finished. Other file reads will proceed in parallel.\n\nThe xvfb command will start with block_until_ms 0. The same turn will read about.json and check files. Then get_command_or_subagent_output will wait for the process with a timeout of roughly 400 seconds.\n\nThe xvfb-run command will use a 1920x1080 screen and log output to SCRATCH/launch.txt via tee. It will run with TMPDIR set to /tmp/hbr-pw and PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c02fd047-a7d9-4870-9e30-2c7e8cd0ff11-64","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"mkdir -p /tmp/hbr-pw && export TMPDIR=/tmp/hbr-pw PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64 && SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer\" && xvfb-run -a -s \"-screen 0 1920x1080x24\" python3 \"$SCRATCH/launch.py\" > \"$SCRATCH/launch.txt\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \"$SCRATCH/launch.txt\"; echo EXIT:$?","description":"Rerun file:// launches and menu shots","block_until_ms":0}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c02fd047-a7d9-4870-9e30-2c7e8cd0ff11-65","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_ui/src/surgery/about.json","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1892,"output_tokens":772,"cache_read_input_tokens":102144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,