{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_696","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A focused test will be added after the main test, or inside it once dev is open.\n\nThe test can access the private `bot_plays` field because it is defined in a child module.\n\nThe test will be inserted after the dev screen assertion and before note_mode(4). The focus change does not affect the following note_mode(4) call because the screen remains on dev.\n\nA simulation test is being drafted to verify bot drive finishes case zero from empty hands. It will step the dev command and assert `bot_drive` is true.\n\nThe simulation test will use `play_until` to run the case and assert a win with mode 4. A timing concern remains: whether the Dev command step runs before or after the bot drive is enabled.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-943f120d-bbec-46b8-81ca-73599b9bae0f-163","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":980,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":932,"output_tokens":920,"cache_read_input_tokens":181120,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"aa2be7f5-000c-4931-96c7-62f6dfcd9f55"}
