{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_701","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The doc comment on the match likely does not exist in mod.rs. It appears only on the enum in input.rs.\n\nThe code change is in place. No \"0 immortal\" comment exists in mod.rs. I will run the targeted test next. The serde attribute should be in scope since the struct derives Serialize. The target directory was deleted so compilation may take a while. I will also check the balance test function name.\n\nI will write a results capture script while compiling. The test should finish in seconds, but compilation may take one to two minutes. I am preparing the exact cargo command and checking whether to use --locked.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9dec907f-0448-482c-b193-e40b7a78b353-178","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn balance_sheet","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9dec907f-0448-482c-b193-e40b7a78b353-179","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link\" && CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target\" CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=6 cargo test -p pav_core --test surgery bot_drive_finishes_case_zero_from_empty_hands -- --test-threads=1","description":"Run bot-drive case 0 win test","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":655,"output_tokens":633,"cache_read_input_tokens":188416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"b17944a0-708a-4613-a363-7b553584d2c7"}
