{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_704","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bot drive test passed.\n\nCase 0 finished instantly. Now running the full test suite and balance sheet tests sequentially in one shell to avoid conflicts.\n\nWASM compilation is deferred until the suite and balance tests finish, since they share the target directory. The suite output will be captured to suite.txt, and balance output to balance.txt.\n\nThe previous balance.txt included cargo compile noise. I will redirect the balance command's stdout to keep only the table. Cargo mixes compile and test output, so --quiet may be needed.\n\nThe balance command needs `--nocapture` to show the printed table. It will run with `-q -p pav_core --test surgery balance_sheet -- --ignored --nocapture --test-threads=1`. The suite is compiling pav_ui and will take a while.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c00590ac-42c7-4af5-bd55-d5256681bc9e-182","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer\"\nDEV=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015\"\nENG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link\"\nTARGET=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target\"\ncd \"$DEV\" && python3 tests/run_all.py > \"$SCRATCH/suite.txt\" 2>&1\necho SUITE:$?\ncd \"$ENG\" && CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"$TARGET\" CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=6 cargo test -q -p pav_core --test surgery balance_sheet -- --ignored --nocapture --test-threads=1 > \"$SCRATCH/balance.txt\" 2>&1\necho BALANCE:$?\ntail -20 \"$SCRATCH/suite.txt\"\necho '---'\ntail -20 \"$SCRATCH/balance.txt\"","description":"Re-run suite and balance she