{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_716","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Evidence looks complete. I will verify it.\n\nThe system reports the goal is not complete. The previous segment ran verification steps, but a successor claiming completion must include four about sections. Potential gaps remain.\n\nHub vitals are one snapshot behind. This was accepted as matching. The packed HTML includes bot_drive because results.png was captured after the pack. The suite ran before the pack. It tested native code rather than the packed HTML.\n\nTimestamps confirm the correct sequence: suite at 02:39, pack at 02:40, results.png at 02:42. The about-data match was already verified.\n\nI will verify about-data, screenshot dimensions, launch statuses, and results.png. I also need to check PROGRESS.md and read about.json verbatim. I must scan the work PLAN.md for unchecked verification items.\n\nThe suite output shows 14 passed and 0 failed. This matches the plan's expected format. The system message does not list specific verifier gaps beyond the goal being incomplete.\n\nI will finish todo 8 and add the four feedback sections to complete the goal. I also need to update PROGRESS.md since STAGE.md requires keeping progress there, and I will grep PLAN.md for any remaining open items.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-34266340-ceac-446c-aa64-5104543f4ef7-5","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer\"\nWORK=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work\"\nHTML=\"$WORK/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\"\npython3 - << 'PY'\nimport json, pathlib, re\nwork = pathlib.Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work\")\nhtml = (work / \"