w_entries stream=width,height -of csv=p=0 \\\"$SCRATCH/shots/$f\\\"\\n  echo \\\" $f\\\"\\ndone\\necho \\\"=== LAUNCH STATUS ===\\\"\\npython3 - << 'PY'\\nimport json, pathlib\\nbase=pathlib.Path(\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer\\\")\\nfor n in (\\\"launch-1\\\",\\\"launch-2\\\"):\\n    d=json.loads((base/n/\\\"status.json\\\").read_text())\\n    print(n, {k:d.get(k) for k in list(d)[:20]} if isinstance(d, dict) else type(d))\\n    # print compact\\n    if isinstance(d, dict):\\n        keys=list(d)\\n        print(\\\" keys\\\", keys)\\nPY\\necho \\\"=== RESULTS JSON ===\\\"\\ncat \\\"$SCRATCH/shots/results.json\\\"\\necho\\necho \\\"=== NOTES ===\\\"\\ncat \\\"$SCRATCH/shots/notes.json\\\"\\necho\\necho \\\"=== RESULTS LOG ===\\\"\\ncat \\\"$SCRATCH/results.txt\\\"\\necho\\necho \\\"=== LAUNCH TXT ===\\\"\\ncat \\\"$SCRATCH/launch.txt\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Confirm about-data, shot sizes, launch status\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/terminal/call-34266340-ceac-446c-aa64-5104543f4ef7-5.log\",\"total_bytes\":5432}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-34266340-ceac-446c-aa64-5104543f4ef7-6","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\n\\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\\n\\nDev folder and HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n10→\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n- Deterministic surgery sim: eight tools plus Cryoprobe, Dressing, and Defibrillator; vitals; heartbeat and on-beat window; Code; chains; ranks C/B/A/S/ENCORE; gifts Hush, Echo, Duet. Cases 0–7 and Code Blue.\\n- 10-foot shell: title, campaign, case files, pause, settings, about, attract, touch-only gate, Dev Mode sliders and Reset All. Music bus default 0.10. Synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices.\\n- Hub: unmodified `session.js` first, shim, pre-op card, host snapshots, client mirror. Harness queries passed. A client aim moves the host cursor for that seat.\\n- Packed one HTML at the work root. `exit-interview.json` matches the page `about-data`. Usage is `added on import`.\\n- Suite `13 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Two file:// launches: title Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion, music 0.10, canvas 1920×1080, no page errors, DualSense Cross opens the menu the same way both times.\\n\\n20→## Notes\\n\\n- Cargo builds use `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` at `work/.harbor-target` because the dev folder name contains a colon. That directory is removed after the pack.\\n- Case and story tables live in `content.rs` and `story.rs`. See `content/README.md` and `PLAN.md` Deviations.\\n- The results screen is reached by finishing an operation. The capture set has title, story, operation, dev, and about. There is no menu command that opens results on its own.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\n\\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\\n\\nDev folder and HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n10→\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n- Deterministic surgery sim: eight tools plus Cryoprobe, Dressing, and Defibrillator; vitals; heartbeat and on-beat window; Code; chains; ranks C/B/A/S/ENCORE; gifts Hush, Echo, Duet. Cases 0–7 and Code Blue.\\n- 10-foot shell: title, campaign, case files, pause, settings, about, attract, touch-only gate, Dev Mode sliders and Reset All. Music bus default 0.10. Synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices.\\n- Hub: unmodified `session.js` first, shim, pre-op card, host snapshots, client mirror. Harness queries passed. A client aim moves the host cursor for that seat.\\n- Packed one HTML at the work root. `exit-interview.json` matches the page `about-data`. Usage is `added on import`.\\n- Suite `13 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Two file:// launches: title Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion, music 0.10, canvas 1920×1080, no page errors, DualSense Cross opens the menu the same way both times.\\n\\n20→## Notes\\n\\n- Cargo builds use `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` at `work/.harbor-target` because the dev folder name contains a colon. That directory is removed after the pack.\\n- Case and story tables live in `content.rs` and `story.rs`. See `content/README.md` and `PLAN.md` Deviations.\\n- The results screen is reached by finishing an operation. The capture set has title, story, operation, dev, and about. There is no menu command that opens results on its own.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\n\\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\\n\\nDev folder and HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n- Deterministic surgery sim: eight tools plus Cryoprobe, Dressing, and Defibrillator; vitals; heartbeat and on-beat window; Code; chains; ranks C/B/A/S/ENCORE; gifts Hush, Echo, Duet. Cases 0–7 and Code Blue.\\n- 10-foot shell: title, campaign, case files, pause, settings, about, attract, touch-only gate, Dev Mode sliders and Reset All. Music bus default 0.10. Synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices.\\n- Hub: unmodified `session.js` first, shim, pre-op card, host snapshots, client mirror. Harness queries passed. A client aim moves the host cursor for that seat.\\n- Packed one HTML at the work root. `exit-interview.json` matches the page `about-data`. Usage is `added on import`.\\n- Suite `13 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Two file:// launches: title Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion, music 0.10, canvas 1920×1080, no page errors, DualSense Cross opens the menu the same way both times.\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Cargo builds use `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` at `work/.harbor-target` because the dev folder name contains a colon. That directory is removed after the pack.\\n- Case and story tables live in `content.rs` and `story.rs`. See `content/README.md` and `PLAN.md` Deviations.\\n- The results screen is reached by finishing an operation. The capture set has title, story, operation, dev, and about. There is no menu command that opens results on its own.\\n\",\"total_lines\":24}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-34266340-ceac-446c-aa64-5104543f4ef7-7","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→{\\n  \\\"sourceInformation\\\": {\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-11-04 22:40:15\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"plan\\\": \\\"PLAN.md\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Simulation\\\",\\n    \\\"perspective\\\": \\\"Fixed overhead view of the operative field\\\",\\n    \\\"tech\\\": \\\"Pavilion engine (Shardfall commit 49ef2ba), Rust 1.98.1, wgpu/WebGPU, wasm-bindgen 0.2.129, egui 0.36.2\\\",\\n    \\\"artDirection\\\": \\\"Cel-shaded overhead operative field painted per vertex, with layered paper-theatre cards for story\\\",\\n10→    \\\"animation\\\": \\\"Simulation-driven tissue, instruments, heartbeat, and paper-card motion\\\",\\n    \\\"audio\\\": \\\"Synthesized music, effects, and short gibberish voices. No audio files. Music bus defaults to 0.10\\\",\\n    \\\"online\\\": \\\"Optional AI Hub shared-world Code Blue for 1-4 surgeons\\\",\\n    \\\"testing\\\": \\\"Deterministic sim suite, headless shell, Chromium file:// launches, hub harness\\\",\\n    \\\"research\\\": \\\"Engine seams and the hub protocol, recorded in PLAN.md\\\",\\n    \\\"environment\\\": \\\"Grok CLI (headless); Linux\\\",\\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"xAI, grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh\\\",\\n    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n20→    \\\"Testing caught five issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, and ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame so an operation froze after one tick.\\\",\\n    \\\"5\\\",\\n    \\\"The most helpful checks were a skill-1.0 bot on every case from a fresh scene, and the hub harness traffic counters once the frame loop actually ticked.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful test was a temporary print probe that only dumped stuck hazards and was removed once the selection bug was fixed.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"engineFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The Game hook, recorded input, RenderFrame, headless egui, and the single-file packer.\\\",\\n    \\\"Yes. A colon in the project path makes rustc fail joining LD_LIBRARY_PATH, and the demo frame path captures the camera, pause menu, and touch layer unless a game returns first.\\\",\\n    \\\"The operative rules, the plate mesh, the ten-foot shell, the cue and music buses, and the hub shim.\\\",\\n    \\\"Keeping a surgery scene off the demo boot panel, stats, guide, toasts, and the engine pause menu.\\\",\\n30→    \\\"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\\\",\\n    \\\"A first-class per-game frame path, so a new game does not have to outrun the demo loop.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"promptFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The tested camera, light, and palette numbers, and a hub shim that the harness had already accepted.\\\",\\n    \\\"The deliverable folder name must contain a colon, which Cargo cannot use as its working directory.\\\",\\n    \\\"Shipping one packed page that is the full game, a hub client, and a file:// WebGPU build.\\\",\\n    \\\"Say at the start that the Cargo target directory cannot contain a colon.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\\n40→    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Night Ward. Keep the beat. Keep them alive.\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Overhead surgical melodrama for one to four surgeons at Mercy Harbor General in Port Verity.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Simulation\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Trauma Center\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Right stick or mouse aims, R2 or left click operates, left stick or 1–8 picks tools\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3d\\\", \\\"story\\\", \\\"co-op\\\", \\\"arcade\\\", \\\"boss fights\\\"]\\n50→  }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→{\\n  \\\"sourceInformation\\\": {\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-11-04 22:40:15\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"plan\\\": \\\"PLAN.md\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Simulation\\\",\\n    \\\"perspective\\\": \\\"Fixed overhead view of the operative field\\\",\\n    \\\"tech\\\": \\\"Pavilion engine (Shardfall commit 49ef2ba), Rust 1.98.1, wgpu/WebGPU, wasm-bindgen 0.2.129, egui 0.36.2\\\",\\n    \\\"artDirection\\\": \\\"Cel-shaded overhead operative field painted per vertex, with layered paper-theatre cards for story\\\",\\n10→    \\\"animation\\\": \\\"Simulation-driven tissue, instruments, heartbeat, and paper-card motion\\\",\\n    \\\"audio\\\": \\\"Synthesized music, effects, and short gibberish voices. No audio files. Music bus defaults to 0.10\\\",\\n    \\\"online\\\": \\\"Optional AI Hub shared-world Code Blue for 1-4 surgeons\\\",\\n    \\\"testing\\\": \\\"Deterministic sim suite, headless shell, Chromium file:// launches, hub harness\\\",\\n    \\\"research\\\": \\\"Engine seams and the hub protocol, recorded in PLAN.md\\\",\\n    \\\"environment\\\": \\\"Grok CLI (headless); Linux\\\",\\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"xAI, grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh\\\",\\n    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n20→    \\\"Testing caught five issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, and ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame so an operation froze after one tick.\\\",\\n    \\\"5\\\",\\n    \\\"The most helpful checks were a skill-1.0 bot on every case from a fresh scene, and the hub harness traffic counters once the frame loop actually ticked.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful test was a temporary print probe that only dumped stuck hazards and was removed once the selection bug was fixed.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"engineFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The Game hook, recorded input, RenderFrame, headless egui, and the single-file packer.\\\",\\n    \\\"Yes. A colon in the project path makes rustc fail joining LD_LIBRARY_PATH, and the demo frame path captures the camera, pause menu, and touch layer unless a game returns first.\\\",\\n    \\\"The operative rules, the plate mesh, the ten-foot shell, the cue and music buses, and the hub shim.\\\",\\n    \\\"Keeping a surgery scene off the demo boot panel, stats, guide, toasts, and the engine pause menu.\\\",\\n30→    \\\"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\\\",\\n    \\\"A first-class per-game frame path, so a new game does not have to outrun the demo loop.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"promptFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The tested camera, light, and palette numbers, and a hub shim that the harness had already accepted.\\\",\\n    \\\"The deliverable folder name must contain a colon, which Cargo cannot use as its working directory.\\\",\\n    \\\"Shipping one packed page that is the full game, a hub client, and a file:// WebGPU build.\\\",\\n    \\\"Say at the start that the Cargo target directory cannot contain a colon.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\\n40→    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Night Ward. Keep the beat. Keep them alive.\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Overhead surgical melodrama for one to four surgeons at Mercy Harbor General in Port Verity.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Simulation\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Trauma Center\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Right stick or mouse aims, R2 or left click operates, left stick or 1–8 picks tools\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3d\\\", \\\"story\\\", \\\"co-op\\\", \\\"arcade\\\", \\\"boss fights\\\"]\\n50→  }\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"{\\n  \\\"sourceInformation\\\": {\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-11-04 22:40:15\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"plan\\\": \\\"PLAN.md\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Simulation\\\",\\n    \\\"perspective\\\": \\\"Fixed overhead view of the operative field\\\",\\n    \\\"tech\\\": \\\"Pavilion engine (Shardfall commit 49ef2ba), Rust 1.98.1, wgpu/WebGPU, wasm-bindgen 0.2.129, egui 0.36.2\\\",\\n    \\\"artDirection\\\": \\\"Cel-shaded overhead operative field painted per vertex, with layered paper-theatre cards for story\\\",\\n    \\\"animation\\\": \\\"Simulation-driven tissue, instruments, heartbeat, and paper-card motion\\\",\\n    \\\"audio\\\": \\\"Synthesized music, effects, and short gibberish voices. No audio files. Music bus defaults to 0.10\\\",\\n    \\\"online\\\": \\\"Optional AI Hub shared-world Code Blue for 1-4 surgeons\\\",\\n    \\\"testing\\\": \\\"Deterministic sim suite, headless shell, Chromium file:// launches, hub harness\\\",\\n    \\\"research\\\": \\\"Engine seams and the hub protocol, recorded in PLAN.md\\\",\\n    \\\"environment\\\": \\\"Grok CLI (headless); Linux\\\",\\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"xAI, grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh\\\",\\n    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"Testing caught five issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, and ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame so an operation froze after one tick.\\\",\\n    \\\"5\\\",\\n    \\\"The most helpful checks were a skill-1.0 bot on every case from a fresh scene, and the hub harness traffic counters once the frame loop actually ticked.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful test was a temporary print probe that only dumped stuck hazards and was removed once the selection bug was fixed.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"engineFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The Game hook, recorded input, RenderFrame, headless egui, and the single-file packer.\\\",\\n    \\\"Yes. A colon in the project path makes rustc fail joining LD_LIBRARY_PATH, and the demo frame path captures the camera, pause menu, and touch layer unless a game returns first.\\\",\\n    \\\"The operative rules, the plate mesh, the ten-foot shell, the cue and music buses, and the hub shim.\\\",\\n    \\\"Keeping a surgery scene off the demo boot panel, stats, guide, toasts, and the engine pause menu.\\\",\\n    \\\"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\\\",\\n    \\\"A first-class per-game frame path, so a new game does not have to outrun the demo loop.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"promptFeedback\\\": [\\n    \\\"The tested camera, light, and palette numbers, and a hub shim that the harness had already accepted.\\\",\\n    \\\"The deliverable folder name must contain a colon, which Cargo cannot use as its working directory.\\\",\\n    \\\"Shipping one packed page that is the full game, a hub client, and a file:// WebGPU build.\\\",\\n    \\\"Say at the start that the Cargo target directory cannot contain a colon.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Night Ward. Keep the beat. Keep them alive.\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Overhead surgical melodrama for one to four surgeons at Mercy Harbor General in Port Verity.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Simulation\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Trauma Center\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Right stick or mouse aims, R2 or left click operates, left stick or 1–8 picks tools\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3d\\\", \\\"story\\\", \\\"co-op\\\", \\\"arcade\\\", \\\"boss fights\\\"]\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":51}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-34266340-ceac-446c-aa64-5104543f4ef7-8","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,48,49,53,95,95,120,52,50,54,55,55,97,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,50,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,48,49,53,95,95,120,52,50,54,55,55,97,47,119,111,114,107,47,80,76,65,78,46,109,100,10,54,50,56,58,45,32,67,111,110,116,101,110,116,32,108,105,110,116,58,32,101,118,101,114,121,32,102,105,108,101,32,112,97,114,115,101,115,44,32,101,118,101,114,121,32,114,101,102,101,114,101,110,99,101,100,32,115,112,101,97,107,101,114,44,32,101,120,112,114,101,115,115,105,111,110,44,32,112,108,97,116,101,32,97,110,100,32,99,117,101,32,101,120,105,115,116,115,44,32,110,111,32,101,109,112,116,121,32,116,101,120,116,44,32,110,111,32,108,101,102,116,111,118,101,114,32,34,84,79,68,79,34,46,10,54,56,57,58,42,42,68,111,110,101,32,109,101,97,110,115,42,42,32,110,111,32,84,79,68,79,115,44,32,112,108,97,99,101,104,111,108,100,101,114,115,32,111,114,32,115,116,117,98,115,59