":\"        // The renderer's own shapes are symmetric in x: a mirror copy draws the same.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/assets.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\"use pav_core::prop_instance::{validate_roles, validate_scale};\"},{\"line_number\":27,\"content\":\"use crate::build::{GeneratedMeshes, StyleOverride, Surfaces, emit_prim, part_color, role_hex};\"},{\"line_number\":30,\"content\":\"/// Colours for the theme roles an asset's parts name (`\\\"$wall\\\"` → `\\\"#5a6b7c\\\"`). Roles left out\"},{\"line_number\":106,\"content\":\"/// seeds compiled, so use a few, e.g. `id % 8`). `palette` colours its `$roles`. Particles\"},{\"line_number\":116,\"content\":\"    validate_roles(palette)?;\"},{\"line_number\":124,\"content\":\"            color: role_hex(&light.color, palette).to_owned(),\"},{\"line_number\":189,\"content\":\"            Some(table) => Surfaces { table, library: &library, owner: asset, roles: palette }\"},{\"line_number\":278,\"content\":\"                roles: palette.clone(),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"09976636-401c-44b9-970d-1345ba5cdf68"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_723","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking product.rs lines 450-700 to verify the order of poll, step sim, send snap, and apply snap.\n\nThe timing bug likely stems from a race condition between snapshot generation and simulation stepping. The host may read live vitals after the snapshot is built, or the snapshot may be captured before the step. Rounding differences are unlikely because the observed values differ by more than one unit.\n\nThe evaluator requires identical vitals at the comparison point. The host should report the last sent snapshot's vitals as the authoritative published state. The client should apply that snapshot and report those same values. The host must not advance vitals between snapshot construction and client application.\n\nA snapshot sequence number could synchronize the host and client. The host would freeze its vitals to the last sent snapshot until the next send, and the test would wait for both sides to reach the same sequence. If the host reports live vitals instead, it must stop simulating between snapshot construction and the status read.\n\nThe snapshot is captured after the host simulates, so status() reads post-step vitals. The client applies that snapshot before its own status read. The 2500ms wait is not the issue. The mismatch happens within one frame: poll applies an old snapshot on the client, step advances the host, the host builds a snapshot from the post-step state and sends it, and status() reads that post-step state.\n\nThe host and client are always one snapshot apart when sampled at the same wall time because the message has not yet been delivered. The harness relay delivers it asynchronously on the next tick even without configured latency.\n\nSampling both iframes in one evaluate() call means the client may not have polled the new message yet, so it is always behind by zero or one snapshots. The evaluator wants the test to wait until the client's applied snapshot matches the host's last published snapshot rather than sampling mid-flight. The phrase \"fix snapshot timing\" suggests a product code change is required, not just a test adjustment.\n\nThe host should report the last published snapshot's exact vitals in status() until the next snapshot is sent. The client should report the applied snapshot it received. The test must wait for both sides to converge on the same values. Currently the host reports unrounded live vitals while the client reports rounded snapshot values, so they never match.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f2d5f94-8fad-4ec8-a1e3-0dcb3286e877-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs","offset":450,"limit":350}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f2d5f94-8fad-4ec8-a1e3-0dcb3286e877-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":300,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f2d5f94-8fad-4ec8-a1e3-0dcb3286e877-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":500,"limit":160}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f2d5f94-8fad-4ec8-a1e3-0dcb3286e877-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":1000,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12179,"output_tokens":1328,"cache_read_input_tokens":61312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"97d0b1a4-2082-46a8-94ec-b71444bec0e5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3f2d5f94-8fad-4ec8-a1e3-0dcb3286e877-21","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"450→pub fn surgery_frame(app: &mut App) {\\n    if app.gfx.is_none() || app.host.is_none() {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let now = web_time::Instant::now();\\n    let dt = (now - app.last).as_secs_f32().min(0.1);\\n    app.last = now;\\n\\n    #[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\n    drain_hook(app);\\n460→\\n    app.harbor.poll_pads(app.input.gilrs.as_mut());\\n    let hub = app.harbor.link.poll(dt);\\n    aim_rig(app);\\n    let (w, h) = app.gfx.as_ref().unwrap().size();\\n    let size = Vec2::new(w as f32, h as f32);\\n    let hit = app.rig.ground_point(app.harbor.mouse, size, 0.0).map(|p| [p.x, p.z]);\\n    if app.harbor.mouse_click {\\n        if let Some(p) = hit {\\n            if let Some(tool) = tray_tool(p[0], p[1]) {\\n470→                let me = if hub.active { hub.slot as usize } else { 0 };\\n                app.harbor.tool[me.min(3)] = tool;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let local = if hub.active && !hub.server { Some(hub.slot) } else { None };\\n    let (cmds, mut surgeons, _) = app.harbor.compose(dt, hit, local, hub.active);\\n    if hub.active {\\n        app.harbor.shell.card_lines = hub.card_lines.clone();\\n        if !app.harbor.saw_card {\\n480→            app.harbor.saw_card = true;\\n            let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n            host.exec(|sim| {\\n                if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n                    if g.mode == 0 || g.mode == 6 {\\n                        g.mode = 7;\\n                        g.case_id = -1;\\n                    }\\n                    // Skip the operative mesh from the first hub frame. Building it\\n                    // stalls the iframe before the round is allowed to start.\\n490→                    g.hub_quiet = true;\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n        if let Some(boot) = hub.boot.clone() {\\n            let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n            host.exec(move |sim| {\\n                if boot.mirror {\\n                    if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n                        g.boot_mirror();\\n500→                    }\\n                } else {\\n                    Surgery::boot_hub_round(sim, boot.seed as u64, &boot.slots, true);\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n        if let Some(snap) = hub.snap.clone() {\\n            let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n            host.exec(move |sim| {\\n                if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n510→                    g.apply_mirror(snap.vitals, snap.bpm, snap.phase, snap.flat, snap.timer, snap.code_t, &snap.hazards, &snap.cursors);\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n        if !hub.server {\\n            let me = hub.slot as usize;\\n            if me < 4 {\\n                if let Some(dom) = hub.dom {\\n                    if dom.x != 0.0 || dom.y != 0.0 {\\n                        surgeons[me].active = true;\\n520→                        surgeons[me].aim = shape_stick(Vec2::new(dom.x, -dom.y));\\n                        surgeons[me].held &= !(surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE | surg::SNAP);\\n                    }\\n                    if dom.use_on {\\n                        surgeons[me].held |= surg::USE;\\n                        surgeons[me].pressure = 1.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n530→            for s in &mut surgeons {\\n                *s = SurgeonInput { tool: TOOL_KEEP, ..SurgeonInput::default() };\\n            }\\n        }\\n        for (i, remote) in hub.remote.iter().enumerate() {\\n            if hub.server || i != hub.slot as usize {\\n                if let Some(hand) = remote {\\n                    surgeons[i] = *hand;\\n                }\\n            }\\n540→        }\\n    }\\n    let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n    let paused = app.harbor.shell.paused();\\n    let hold = paused || hub.ended;\\n    host.set_control(|c| c.paused = hold);\\n    for cmd in cmds {\\n        if let Some(sim_cmd) = to_sim(cmd) {\\n            host.exec(move |sim| {\\n                if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n550→                    g.apply_cmd(sim_cmd);\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n    }\\n    {\\n        let mut input = host.shared.input.lock().unwrap();\\n        *input = InputFrame::default();\\n        input.surgeons = surgeons;\\n    }\\n560→    host.pump();\\n\\n    let (prev, curr, curr_at, tick_wall) = host.frames();\\n    let _ = (curr_at, tick_wall);\\n    let op = curr.surgery.clone();\\n    if let Some(op) = &op {\\n        app.harbor.shell.note_mode(op.mode);\\n        if op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 8 {\\n            app.gfx.as_ref().unwrap().window.set_cursor_visible(false);\\n        } else {\\n570→            app.gfx.as_ref().unwrap().window.set_cursor_visible(true);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let events: Vec<_> = std::mem::take(&mut *host.shared.events.lock().unwrap());\\n    if hub.active {\\n        // One stream per copy. Host and server send snapshots; clients send a hand.\\n        // Sending both blows the hub's 20 messages/second cap.\\n        if hub.host {\\n            if let Some(op) = op.as_ref() {\\n                app.harbor.link.send_snap(&snap_json(op, &events));\\n580→                if hub.play {\\n                    app.harbor.link.publish(&standings_json(&hub.present, op));\\n                }\\n            }\\n        } else if !hub.server {\\n            let me = hub.slot as usize;\\n            if me < 4 {\\n                app.harbor.link.send_input(&surgeons[me]);\\n            }\\n        }\\n590→    }\\n    let quiet_audio = hub.server || hub.ended;\\n    let music = if quiet_audio { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.music).unwrap_or(0.10) };\\n    let effects = if quiet_audio { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.effects).unwrap_or(0.80) };\\n    let voices = if quiet_audio { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.voices).unwrap_or(0.70) };\\n    let name = op.as_ref().map(|o| track_name(o)).unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\");\\n    if app.harbor.music_name != name {\\n        app.harbor.music_name = name.to_string();\\n        app.harbor.music_left = 0.0;\\n    }\\n600→    app.harbor.music_left -= dt;\\n    let schedule = if quiet_audio {\\n        None\\n    } else if app.harbor.music_left <= 0.0 {\\n        let bpm = op.as_ref().map(|o| o.bpm).unwrap_or(72.0).clamp(60.0, 140.0);\\n        let (dur, notes) = pav_audio::music::phrase(name, bpm);\\n        app.harbor.music_left = dur.max(0.5);\\n        Some(notes)\\n    } else {\\n        None\\n610→    };\\n    if let Some(a) = &app.audio {\\n        a.set_buses(music, effects, voices);\\n        let l = pav_audio::Listener { pos: Vec3::new(0.0, 8.0, 12.0), right: Vec3::X };\\n        for e in &events {\\n            a.play_event(e, &l, effects);\\n        }\\n        if let Some(notes) = schedule {\\n            for n in notes {\\n                a.play_bus(n.patch, n.pan, n.gain, n.delay, pav_audio::BUS_MUSIC);\\n620→            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    app.builder.add_events(&events);\\n    app.builder.now = app.started.elapsed().as_secs_f64();\\n    let view = ViewSettings::default();\\n    let focus = curr.focus;\\n    let mut scene = app.builder.build(&prev, &curr, 1.0, &app.rig, w as f32 / h.max(1) as f32, &view, focus);\\n\\n    let gfx = app.gfx.as_mut().unwrap();\\n630→    let native = gfx.window.scale_factor() as f32;\\n    let zoom = (h as f32 / 1080.0) / native.max(0.25);\\n    app.egui_ctx.set_zoom_factor(zoom);\\n    if !app.harbor.font {\\n        pav_ui::surgery::install_font(&app.egui_ctx);\\n        app.harbor.font = true;\\n    }\\n    let state = app.egui_state.as_mut().unwrap();\\n    let raw = state.take(&gfx.window);\\n    let shell = &app.harbor.shell;\\n640→    let op_ref = op.as_deref();\\n    let out = app.egui_ctx.run_ui(raw, |ui| {\\n        pav_ui::surgery::draw(ui, shell, op_ref);\\n    });\\n    state.platform_output(&gfx.window, out.platform_output);\\n    let ppp = out.pixels_per_point;\\n    let prims = app.egui_ctx.tessellate(out.shapes, ppp);\\n    let mut textures = out.textures_delta;\\n    gfx.draw(&scene, Some((&prims, &mut textures, ppp)));\\n    let _ = &mut scene;\\n650→\\n    let status = status_json(&app.harbor.shell, op.as_deref());\\n    app.harbor.status = status.clone();\\n    publish_status(&status);\\n    #[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\n    install_hook(app);\\n}\\n\\nfn aim_rig(app: &mut App) {\\n    app.rig.params = CameraParams {\\n660→        tilt: 73.0,\\n        yaw: 0.0,\\n        distance: 19.9,\\n        fov: 36.0,\\n        ortho: false,\\n        follow_lag: 0.0,\\n        height_offset: 0.0,\\n    };\\n    app.rig.snap(Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2));\\n}\\n670→\\nfn tray_tool(x: f32, z: f32) -> Option<u8> {\\n    if (z - 5.4).abs() > 0.7 {\\n        return None;\\n    }\\n    for t in 0..8 {\\n        let tx = -3.5 + t as f32;\\n        if (x - tx).abs() < 0.45 {\\n            return Some(t as u8);\\n        }\\n680→    }\\n    None\\n}\\n\\nfn snap_json(op: &SurgeryFrame, events: &[pav_core::SimEvent]) -> String {\\n    let mut hazards = Vec::new();\\n    for h in op.hazards.iter().filter(|h| h.alive).take(12) {\\n        hazards.push(serde_json::json!([\\n            h.id,\\n            h.kind,\\n690→            (h.x * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n            (h.z * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n            1,\\n            h.stage,\\n            (h.work * 100.0).round() / 100.0\\n        ]));\\n    }\\n    let mut cursors = Vec::new();\\n    for (i, c) in op.cursors.iter().enumerate() {\\n        cursors.push(serde_json::json!([\\n700→            i,\\n            (c.x * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n            (c.z * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n            c.tool,\\n            if c.active { 1 } else { 0 },\\n            c.score\\n        ]));\\n    }\\n    let mut cues = Vec::new();\\n    for e in events.iter().rev().take(8) {\\n710→        if let pav_core::SimEvent::Cue { id, .. } = e {\\n            cues.push(*id);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    serde_json::json!({\\n        \\\"k\\\": \\\"s\\\",\\n        \\\"v\\\": (op.vitals * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\\n        \\\"b\\\": op.bpm.round(),\\n        \\\"p\\\": (op.phase * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n        \\\"f\\\": if op.flat { 1 } else { 0 },\\n720→        \\\"tm\\\": (op.timer * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\\n        \\\"cd\\\": (op.code_t * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\\n        \\\"h\\\": hazards,\\n        \\\"u\\\": cursors,\\n        \\\"q\\\": cues,\\n    })\\n    .to_string()\\n}\\n\\nfn standings_json(present: &[u8], op: &SurgeryFrame) -> String {\\n730→    let ids: Vec<u8> = if present.is_empty() { vec![0] } else { present.to_vec() };\\n    let mut scores = serde_json::Map::new();\\n    for id in &ids {\\n        let score = op.cursors.get(*id as usize).map(|c| c.score).unwrap_or(0);\\n        scores.insert(id.to_string(), serde_json::json!(score));\\n    }\\n    serde_json::json!({\\n        \\\"standings\\\": [ids],\\n        \\\"won\\\": op.vitals > 0.0,\\n        \\\"scores\\\": scores,\\n740→    })\\n    .to_string()\\n}\\n\\nfn status_json(shell: &Shell, op: Option<&SurgeryFrame>) -> String {\\n    let music = op.map(|o| o.music).unwrap_or(0.10);\\n    let cursors: Vec<serde_json::Value> = op\\n        .map(|o| {\\n            o.cursors\\n                .iter()\\n750→                .map(|c| serde_json::json!({ \\\"x\\\": c.x, \\\"z\\\": c.z, \\\"tool\\\": c.tool, \\\"active\\\": c.active }))\\n                .collect()\\n        })\\n        .unwrap_or_default();\\n    serde_json::json!({\\n        \\\"screen\\\": shell.screen_name(),\\n        \\\"focus\\\": shell.focus(),\\n        \\\"device\\\": if shell.device == DeviceKind::Gamepad { \\\"gamepad\\\" } else { \\\"keyboard\\\" },\\n        \\\"xbox\\\": shell.xbox,\\n        \\\"music\\\": format!(\\\"{music:.2}\\\"),\\n760→        \\\"title\\\": TITLE,\\n        \\\"cursors\\\": cursors,\\n        \\\"vitals\\\": op.map(|o| o.vitals),\\n        \\\"bpm\\\": op.map(|o| o.bpm),\\n        \\\"timer\\\": op.map(|o| o.timer),\\n        \\\"mode\\\": op.map(|o| o.mode),\\n    })\\n    .to_string()\\n}\\n\\n770→fn publish_status(s: &str) {\\n    STATUS.with(|c| *c.borrow_mut() = s.to_string());\\n}\\n\\nthread_local! {\\n    static STATUS: RefCell<String> = const { RefCell::new(String::new()) };\\n    static BURST: Cell<u32> = const { Cell::new(0) };\\n    static HOOKED: Cell<bool> = const { Cell::new(false) };\\n}\\n\\n780→#[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\nfn drain_hook(app: &mut App) {\\n    let n = BURST.with(|b| b.replace(0));\\n    if n > 0 {\\n        if let Some(host) = &app.host {\\n            host.burst(n);\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n790→#[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\nfn install_hook(app: &App) {\\n    if HOOKED.with(|h| h.get()) {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    use wasm_bindgen::JsCast;\\n    let Some(win) = web_sys::window() else { return };\\n    let obj = js_sys::Object::new();\\n    let status = wasm_bindgen::closure::Closure::wrap(Box::new(|| {\\n        STATUS.with(|s| wasm_bindgen::JsValue::from_str(&s.borrow()))\",\"content_concise\":\"450→pub fn surgery_frame(app: &mut App) {\\n    if app.gfx.is_none() || app.host.is_none() {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let now = web_time::Instant::now();\\n    let dt = (now - app.last).as_secs_f32().min(0.1);\\n    app.last = now;\\n\\n    #[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\n    drain_hook(app);\\n460→\\n    app.harbor.poll_pads(app.input.gilrs.as_mut());\\n    let hub = app.harbor.link.poll(dt);\\n    aim_rig(app);\\n    let (w, h) = app.gfx.as_ref().unwrap().size();\\n    let size = Vec2::new(w as f32, h as f32);\\n    let hit = app.rig.ground_point(app.harbor.mouse, size, 0.0).map(|p| [p.x, p.z]);\\n    if app.harbor.mouse_click {\\n        if let Some(p) = hit {\\n            if let Some(tool) = tray_tool(p[0], p[1]) {\\n470→                let me = if hub.active { hub.slot as usize } else { 0 };\\n                app.harbor.tool[me.min(3)] = tool;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let local = if hub.active && !hub.server { Some(hub.slot) } else { None };\\n    let (cmds, mut surgeons, _) = app.harbor.compose(dt, hit, local, hub.active);\\n    if hub.active {\\n        app.harbor.shell.card_lines = hub.card_lines.clone();\\n        if !app.harbor.saw_card {\\n480→            app.harbor.saw_card = true;\\n            let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n            host.exec(|sim| {\\n                if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n                    if g.mode == 0 || g.mode == 6 {\\n                        g.mode = 7;\\n                        g.case_id = -1;\\n                    }\\n                    // Skip the operative mesh from the first hub frame. Building it\\n                    // stalls the iframe before the round is allowed to start.\\n490→                    g.hub_quiet = true;\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n        if let Some(boot) = hub.boot.clone() {\\n            let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n            host.exec(move |sim| {\\n                if boot.mirror {\\n                    if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n                        g.boot_mirror();\\n500→                    }\\n                } else {\\n                    Surgery::boot_hub_round(sim, boot.seed as u64, &boot.slots, true);\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n        if let Some(snap) = hub.snap.clone() {\\n            let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n            host.exec(move |sim| {\\n                if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n510→                    g.apply_mirror(snap.vitals, snap.bpm, snap.phase, snap.flat, snap.timer, snap.code_t, &snap.hazards, &snap.cursors);\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n        if !hub.server {\\n            let me = hub.slot as usize;\\n            if me < 4 {\\n                if let Some(dom) = hub.dom {\\n                    if dom.x != 0.0 || dom.y != 0.0 {\\n                        surgeons[me].active = true;\\n520→                        surgeons[me].aim = shape_stick(Vec2::new(dom.x, -dom.y));\\n                        surgeons[me].held &= !(surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE | surg::SNAP);\\n                    }\\n                    if dom.use_on {\\n                        surgeons[me].held |= surg::USE;\\n                        surgeons[me].pressure = 1.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n530→            for s in &mut surgeons {\\n                *s = SurgeonInput { tool: TOOL_KEEP, ..SurgeonInput::default() };\\n            }\\n        }\\n        for (i, remote) in hub.remote.iter().enumerate() {\\n            if hub.server || i != hub.slot as usize {\\n                if let Some(hand) = remote {\\n                    surgeons[i] = *hand;\\n                }\\n            }\\n540→        }\\n    }\\n    let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n    let paused = app.harbor.shell.paused();\\n    let hold = paused || hub.ended;\\n    host.set_control(|c| c.paused = hold);\\n    for cmd in cmds {\\n        if let Some(sim_cmd) = to_sim(cmd) {\\n            host.exec(move |sim| {\\n                if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n550→                    g.apply_cmd(sim_cmd);\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n    }\\n    {\\n        let mut input = host.shared.input.lock().unwrap();\\n        *input = InputFrame::default();\\n        input.surgeons = surgeons;\\n    }\\n560→    host.pump();\\n\\n    let (prev, curr, curr_at, tick_wall) = host.frames();\\n    let _ = (curr_at, tick_wall);\\n    let op = curr.surgery.clone();\\n    if let Some(op) = &op {\\n        app.harbor.shell.note_mode(op.mode);\\n        if op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 8 {\\n            app.gfx.as_ref().unwrap().window.set_cursor_visible(false);\\n        } else {\\n570→            app.gfx.as_ref().unwrap().window.set_cursor_visible(true);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let events: Vec<_> = std::mem::take(&mut *host.shared.events.lock().unwrap());\\n    if hub.active {\\n        // One stream per copy. Host and server send snapshots; clients send a hand.\\n        // Sending both blows the hub's 20 messages/second cap.\\n        if hub.host {\\n            if let Some(op) = op.as_ref() {\\n                app.harbor.link.send_snap(&snap_json(op, &events));\\n580→                if hub.play {\\n                    app.harbor.link.publish(&standings_json(&hub.present, op));\\n                }\\n            }\\n        } else if !hub.server {\\n            let me = hub.slot as usize;\\n            if me < 4 {\\n                app.harbor.link.send_input(&surgeons[me]);\\n            }\\n        }\\n590→    }\\n    let quiet_audio = hub.server || hub.ended;\\n    let music = if quiet_audio { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.music).unwrap_or(0.10) };\\n    let effects = if quiet_audio { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.effects).unwrap_or(0.80) };\\n    let voices = if quiet_audio { 0.0 } else { op.as_ref().map(|o| o.voices).unwrap_or(0.70) };\\n    let name = op.as_ref().map(|o| track_name(o)).unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\");\\n    if app.harbor.music_name != name {\\n        app.harbor.music_name = name.to_string();\\n        app.harbor.music_left = 0.0;\\n    }\\n600→    app.harbor.music_left -= dt;\\n    let schedule = if quiet_audio {\\n        None\\n    } else if app.harbor.music_left <= 0.0 {\\n        let bpm = op.as_ref().map(|o| o.bpm).unwrap_or(72.0).clamp(60.0, 140.0);\\n        let (dur, notes) = pav_audio::music::phrase(name, bpm);\\n        app.harbor.music_left = dur.max(0.5);\\n        Some(notes)\\n    } else {\\n        None\\n610→    };\\n    if let Some(a) = &app.audio {\\n        a.set_buses(music, effects, voices);\\n        let l = pav_audio::Listener { pos: Vec3::new(0.0, 8.0, 12.0), right: Vec3::X };\\n        for e in &events {\\n            a.play_event(e, &l, effects);\\n        }\\n        if let Some(notes) = schedule {\\n            for n in notes {\\n                a.play_bus(n.patch, n.pan, n.gain, n.delay, pav_audio::BUS_MUSIC);\\n620→            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    app.builder.add_events(&events);\\n    app.builder.now = app.started.elapsed().as_secs_f64();\\n    let view = ViewSettings::default();\\n    let focus = curr.focus;\\n    let mut scene = app.builder.build(&prev, &curr, 1.0, &app.rig, w as f32 / h.max(1) as f32, &view, focus);\\n\\n    let gfx = app.gfx.as_mut().unwrap();\\n630→    let native = gfx.window.scale_factor() as f32;\\n    let zoom = (h as f32 / 1080.0) / native.max(0.25);\\n    app.egui_ctx.set_zoom_factor(zoom);\\n    if !app.harbor.font {\\n        pav_ui::surgery::install_font(&app.egui_ctx);\\n        app.harbor.font = true;\\n    }\\n    let state = app.egui_state.as_mut().unwrap();\\n    let raw = state.take(&gfx.window);\\n    let shell = &app.harbor.shell;\\n640→    let op_ref = op.as_deref();\\n    let out = app.egui_ctx.run_ui(raw, |ui| {\\n        pav_ui::surgery::draw(ui, shell, op_ref);\\n    });\\n    state.platform_output(&gfx.window, out.platform_output);\\n    let ppp = out.pixels_per_point;\\n    let prims = app.egui_ctx.tessellate(out.shapes, ppp);\\n    let mut textures = out.textures_delta;\\n    gfx.draw(&scene, Some((&prims, &mut textures, ppp)));\\n    let _ = &mut scene;\\n650→\\n    let status = status_json(&app.harbor.shell, op.as_deref());\\n    app.harbor.status = status.clone();\\n    publish_status(&status);\\n    #[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\n    install_hook(app);\\n}\\n\\nfn aim_rig(app: &mut App) {\\n    app.rig.params = CameraParams {\\n660→        tilt: 73.0,\\n        yaw: 0.0,\\n        distance: 19.9,\\n        fov: 36.0,\\n        ortho: false,\\n        follow_lag: 0.0,\\n        height_offset: 0.0,\\n    };\\n    app.rig.snap(Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2));\\n}\\n670→\\nfn tray_tool(x: f32, z: f32) -> Option<u8> {\\n    if (z - 5.4).abs() > 0.7 {\\n        return None;\\n    }\\n    for t in 0..8 {\\n        let tx = -3.5 + t as f32;\\n        if (x - tx).abs() < 0.45 {\\n            return Some(t as u8);\\n        }\\n680→    }\\n    None\\n}\\n\\nfn snap_json(op: &SurgeryFrame, events: &[pav_core::SimEvent]) -> String {\\n    let mut hazards = Vec::new();\\n    for h in op.hazards.iter().filter(|h| h.alive).take(12) {\\n        hazards.push(serde_json::json!([\\n            h.id,\\n            h.kind,\\n690→            (h.x * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n            (h.z * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n            1,\\n            h.stage,\\n            (h.work * 100.0).round() / 100.0\\n        ]));\\n    }\\n    let mut cursors = Vec::new();\\n    for (i, c) in op.cursors.iter().enumerate() {\\n        cursors.push(serde_json::json!([\\n700→            i,\\n            (c.x * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n            (c.z * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n            c.tool,\\n            if c.active { 1 } else { 0 },\\n            c.score\\n        ]));\\n    }\\n    let mut cues = Vec::new();\\n    for e in events.iter().rev().take(8) {\\n710→        if let pav_core::SimEvent::Cue { id, .. } = e {\\n            cues.push(*id);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    serde_json::json!({\\n        \\\"k\\\": \\\"s\\\",\\n        \\\"v\\\": (op.vitals * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\\n        \\\"b\\\": op.bpm.round(),\\n        \\\"p\\\": (op.phase * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n        \\\"f\\\": if op.flat { 1 } else { 0 },\\n720→        \\\"tm\\\": (op.timer * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\\n        \\\"cd\\\": (op.code_t * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\\n        \\\"h\\\": hazards,\\n        \\\"u\\\": cursors,\\n        \\\"q\\\": cues,\\n    })\\n    .to_string()\\n}\\n\\nfn standings_json(present: &[u8], op: &SurgeryFrame) -> String {\\n730→    let ids: Vec<u8> = if present.is_empty() { vec![0] } else { present.to_vec() };\\n    let mut scores = serde_json::Map::new();\\n    for id in &ids {\\n        let score = op.cursors.get(*id as usize).map(|c| c.score).unwrap_or(0);\\n        scores.insert(id.to_string(), serde_json::json!(score));\\n    }\\n    serde_json::json!({\\n        \\\"standings\\\": [ids],\\n        \\\"won\\\": op.vitals > 0.0,\\n        \\\"scores\\\": scores,\\n740→    })\\n    .to_string()\\n}\\n\\nfn status_json(shell: &Shell, op: Option<&SurgeryFrame>) -> String {\\n    let music = op.map(|o| o.music).unwrap_or(0.10);\\n    let cursors: Vec<serde_json::Value> = op\\n        .map(|o| {\\n            o.cursors\\n                .iter()\\n750→                .map(|c| serde_json::json!({ \\\"x\\\": c.x, \\\"z\\\": c.z, \\\"tool\\\": c.tool, \\\"active\\\": c.active }))\\n                .collect()\\n        })\\n        .unwrap_or_default();\\n    serde_json::json!({\\n        \\\"screen\\\": shell.screen_name(),\\n        \\\"focus\\\": shell.focus(),\\n        \\\"device\\\": if shell.device == DeviceKind::Gamepad { \\\"gamepad\\\" } else { \\\"keyboard\\\" },\\n        \\\"xbox\\\": shell.xbox,\\n        \\\"music\\\": format!(\\\"{music:.2}\\\"),\\n760→        \\\"title\\\": TITLE,\\n        \\\"cursors\\\": cursors,\\n        \\\"vitals\\\": op.map(|o| o.vitals),\\n        \\\"bpm\\\": op.map(|o| o.bpm),\\n        \\\"timer\\\": op.map(|o| o.timer),\\n        \\\"mode\\\": op.map(|o| o.mode),\\n    })\\n    .to_string()\\n}\\n\\n770→fn publish_status(s: &str) {\\n    STATUS.with(|c| *c.borrow_mut() = s.to_string());\\n}\\n\\nthread_local! {\\n    static STATUS: RefCell<String> = const { RefCell::new(String::new()) };\\n    static BURST: Cell<u32> = const { Cell::new(0) };\\n    static HOOKED: Cell<bool> = const { Cell::new(false) };\\n}\\n\\n780→#[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\nfn drain_hook(app: &mut App) {\\n    let n = BURST.with(|b| b.replace(0));\\n    if n > 0 {\\n        if let Some(host) = &app.host {\\n            host.burst(n);\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n790→#[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\nfn install_hook(app: &App) {\\n    if HOOKED.with(|h| h.get()) {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    use wasm_bindgen::JsCast;\\n    let Some(win) = web_sys::window() else { return };\\n    let obj = js_sys::Object::new();\\n    let status = wasm_bindgen::closure::Closure::wrap(Box::new(|| {\\n        STATUS.with(|s| wasm_bindgen::JsValue::from_str(&s.borrow()))\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs\",\"offset\":450,\"limit\":350,\"raw_output\":\"pub fn surgery_frame(app: &mut App) {\\n    if app.gfx.is_none() || app.host.is_none() {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let now = web_time::Instant::now();\\n    let dt = (now - app.last).as_secs_f32().min(0.1);\\n    app.last = now;\\n\\n    #[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\n    drain_hook(app);\\n\\n    app.harbor.poll_pads(app.input.gilrs.as_mut());\\n    let hub = app.harbor.link.poll(dt);\\n    aim_rig(app);\\n    let (w, h) = app.gfx.as_ref().unwrap().size();\\n    let size = Vec2::new(w as f32, h as f32);\\n    let hit = app.rig.ground_point(app.harbor.mouse, size, 0.0).map(|p| [p.x, p.z]);\\n    if app.harbor.mouse_click {\\n        if let Some(p) = hit {\\n            if let Some(tool) = tray_tool(p[0], p[1]) {\\n                let me = if hub.active { hub.slot as usize } else { 0 };\\n                app.harbor.tool[me.min(3)] = tool;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let local = if hub.active && !hub.server { Some(hub.slot) } else { None };\\n    let (cmds, mut surgeons, _) = app.harbor.compose(dt, hit, local, hub.active);\\n    if hub.active {\\n        app.harbor.shell.card_lines = hub.card_lines.clone();\\n        if !app.harbor.saw_card {\\n            app.harbor.saw_card = true;\\n            let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n            host.exec(|sim| {\\n                if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n                    if g.mode == 0 || g.mode == 6 {\\n                        g.mode = 7;\\n                        g.case_id = -1;\\n                    }\\n                    // Skip the operative mesh from the first hub frame. Building it\\n                    // stalls the iframe before the round is allowed to start.\\n                    g.hub_quiet = true;\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n        if let Some(boot) = hub.boot.clone() {\\n            let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n            host.exec(move |sim| {\\n                if boot.mirror {\\n                    if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n                        g.boot_mirror();\\n                    }\\n                } else {\\n                    Surgery::boot_hub_round(sim, boot.seed as u64, &boot.slots, true);\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n        if let Some(snap) = hub.snap.clone() {\\n            let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n            host.exec(move |sim| {\\n                if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n                    g.apply_mirror(snap.vitals, snap.bpm, snap.phase, snap.flat, snap.timer, snap.code_t, &snap.hazards, &snap.cursors);\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n        if !hub.server {\\n            let me = hub.slot as usize;\\n            if me < 4 {\\n                if let Some(dom) = hub.dom {\\n                    if dom.x != 0.0 || dom.y != 0.0 {\\n                        surgeons[me].active = true;\\n                        surgeons[me].aim = shape_stick(Vec2::new(dom.x, -dom.y));\\n                        surgeons[me].held &= !(surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE | surg::SNAP);\\n                    }\\n                    if dom.use_on {\\n                        surgeons[me].held |= surg::USE;\\n                        surgeons[me].pressure = 1.0;\\n                    }\\n                }\\n            }\\n        } else {\\n            for s in &mut surgeons {\\n                *s = SurgeonInput { tool: TOOL_KEEP, ..SurgeonInput::default() };\\n            }\\n        }\\n        for (i, remote) in hub.remote.iter().enumerate() {\\n            if hub.server || i != hub.slot as usize {\\n                if let Some(hand) = remote {\\n                    surgeons[i] = *hand;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let host = app.host.as_ref().unwrap();\\n    let paused = app.harbor.shell.paused();\\n    let hold = paused || hub.ended;\\n    host.set_control(|c| c.paused = hold);\\n    for cmd in cmds {\\n        if let Some(sim_cmd) = to_sim(cmd) {\\n            host.exec(move |sim| {\\n                if let Some(g) = sim.state.play.as_mut().and_then(|p| p.get_mut::<Surgery>()) {\\n                    g.apply_cmd(sim_cmd);\\n                }\\n            });\\n        }\\n    }\\n    {\\n        let mut input = host.shared.input.lock().unwrap();\\n        *input = InputFrame::default();\\n        input.surgeons = surgeons;\\n    }\\n    host.pump();\\n\\n    let (prev, curr, curr_at, tick_wall) = host.frames();\\n    let _ = (curr_at, tick_wall);\\n    let op = curr.surgery.clone();\\n    if let Some(op) = &op {\\n        app.harbor.shell.note_mode(op.mode);\\n        if op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 8 {\\n            app.gfx.as_ref().unwrap().window.set_cursor_visible(false);\\n        } else {\\n            app.gfx.as_ref().unwrap().window.set_cursor_visible(true);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    let events: Vec<_> = std::mem::