{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_726","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"SurgeryFrame is the single source of all drawn content. It is built on the host from the simulation and decoded from JSON on the client.\n\nHost and client vitals diverge because the host continues simulating after sending a snapshot. The fix is to quantize host vitals to the same 0.1 grid and stamp snapshots with a sequence number. After sending, the host status should reflect the quantized snapshot value.\n\nPolling every 100ms still misses the exact moment of equality because the host drifts ahead before the client catches up. The test likely succeeds when a simultaneous read shows both sides aligned on the same quantized value. With a 7/sec drain and 0.1 quantization, vitals change roughly every 14ms.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-69aba544-7e92-4d25-9950-e36880f19fba-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","offset":100,"limit":100}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-69aba544-7e92-4d25-9950-e36880f19fba-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":610,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-69aba544-7e92-4d25-9950-e36880f19fba-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn boot_code|spawn_set|drain","glob":"**/surgery/**/*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2835,"output_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":87936,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"7cd90ce4-4207-4a28-903a-9351b46fb47e"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-69aba544-7e92-4d25-9950-e36880f19fba-32","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"100→        p.1 = (p.1 - dt).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    if g.plate_blend < 1.0 {\\n        g.plate_blend = (g.plate_blend + dt / 0.8).min(1.0);\\n        if g.plate_blend >= 1.0 {\\n            g.plate = g.plate_next;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if !g.phase_ready && !g.code_blue {\\n110→        enter_phase(g, sim, events);\\n    }\\n    if g.outcome != Outcome::Playing {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n\\n    swell_and_wander(g, rules, events);\\n    if g.heat_on {\\n        g.heat_angle += rules * 2.8;\\n        if g.heat_angle > std::f32::consts::TAU {\\n120→            g.heat_on = false;\\n            note_kind(g, K_HEAT);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.heart.flat {\\n        g.code_t -= dt;\\n        defib_only(g, &slots, dt, events);\\n        if g.code_t <= 0.0 && g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\\n            g.die();\\n130→        }\\n    } else {\\n        hands(g, &slots, rules, dt, sim.state.tick, events);\\n        echo_copy(g, events);\\n        if !g.immortal {\\n            let mut drain = 0.0;\\n            for h in &g.hazards {\\n                if h.alive && h.kind != K_HEAT {\\n                    drain += h.drain;\\n                }\\n140→            }\\n            let mul = content::diff_drain(g.difficulty) * g.tune.drain;\\n            g.heart.vitals -= drain * mul * rules;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    g.heart.vitals = g.heart.vitals.clamp(0.0, 100.0);\\n    if g.immortal && g.heart.vitals < 20.0 {\\n        g.heart.vitals = 55.0;\\n        g.heart.flat = false;\\n150→        g.code_t = -1.0;\\n    }\\n    if g.heart.vitals < 40.0 && !g.warned_40 && !g.heart.flat {\\n        g.warned_40 = true;\\n        g.callout_i = 2;\\n        g.callout_t = 2.2;\\n    }\\n    if g.pending_script && !g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\\n        g.pending_script = false;\\n        g.begin_code(true);\\n160→    } else if g.heart.vitals <= 0.0 && !g.heart.flat && g.mode != M_DEAD {\\n        g.begin_code(false);\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.mode != M_OP && g.mode != M_ATTRACT {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    if !g.freeze && !g.heart.flat {\\n        let speed = 1.0 / g.tune.timer.max(0.2);\\n        if g.code_blue {\\n170→            g.timer -= dt * speed;\\n        } else {\\n            g.timer -= rules * speed;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    g.elapsed += dt;\\n\\n    if !g.code_blue && !g.heart.flat && phase_clear(g) {\\n        g.phase_i = g.phase_i.saturating_add(1);\\n        g.phase_ready = false;\\n180→        g.heat_on = false;\\n        if case_def(g.case_id.max(0) as u8).is_some_and(|c| g.phase_i as usize >= c.phases.len()) {\\n            g.finish_op();\\n            return;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.code_blue && g.mode == M_OP {\\n        tick_blue(g, sim, dt);\\n    }\\n190→    if g.timer <= 0.0 && (g.mode == M_OP || g.mode == M_ATTRACT) {\\n        if g.code_blue && g.heart.vitals > 0.0 && !g.heart.flat {\\n            g.finish_op();\\n        } else if !g.code_blue {\\n            g.die();\\n        } else if g.heart.flat || g.heart.vitals <= 0.0 {\\n            g.die();\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\",\"content_concise\":\"100→        p.1 = (p.1 - dt).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n    if g.plate_blend < 1.0 {\\n        g.plate_blend = (g.plate_blend + dt / 0.8).min(1.0);\\n        if g.plate_blend >= 1.0 {\\n            g.plate = g.plate_next;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if !g.phase_ready && !g.code_blue {\\n110→        enter_phase(g, sim, events);\\n    }\\n    if g.outcome != Outcome::Playing {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n\\n    swell_and_wander(g, rules, events);\\n    if g.heat_on {\\n        g.heat_angle += rules * 2.8;\\n        if g.heat_angle > std::f32::consts::TAU {\\n120→            g.heat_on = false;\\n            note_kind(g, K_HEAT);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if g.heart.flat {\\n        g.code_t -= dt;\\n     