{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_736","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Beginning implementation of all edits.\n\nF32 bucketing uses `time_ms / 500.0` floored to i32. The client will track `applied_bucket` on Harbor to ignore stale snapshots. The host keeps this value at -1 since it never receives snaps. Snapshots will include a JSON field `bb` for the bucket.\n\nStatus JSON will prefer explicit `vitals` and `timer` arguments over the surgery frame's live values. The host sends `None` before the first successful network send, then uses `Some(net_vitals)` after each send so clients see the last applied snapshot values.\n\nA deviation line will be added. A test script and runner will be created. The server will use Python's built-in HTTP server so the harness and HTML share the same origin.\n\nThe test harness and game HTML are in different directories. The server must be rooted at a shared parent so both files are reachable.\n\nThe game URL is relative to the harness page, so both files must reside in the same directory. The server should be rooted at the work root and the harness copied or symlinked there rather than polluting the source tree.\n\nThe server will be rooted at the work root. The harness will be served from `tests/hub/harness.html` inside the dev folder. The game HTML will be reached via a relative path like `../../Hands of Harbor....html`. This avoids copying or symlinking files into the work tree.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1c69835b-fd1d-475f-b046-b6fe2909666d-49","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"http.server|39337|harness.html","glob":"**/*.{py,txt,md,sh}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1246,"output_tokens":1134,"cache_read_input_tokens":123520,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"83b139db-a74b-4f8e-af41-d1f0a4e96009"}
