f32, bucket: i32) -> String {\",\"new_line\":705,\"context_before\":\"    None\\n}\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    let mut hazards = Vec::new();\\n    for h in op.hazards.iter().filter(|h| h.alive).take(12) {\\n        hazards.push(serde_json::json!([\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e50029d3-bece-4fbb-b359-7c007804818e-70","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"        \\\"k\\\": \\\"s\\\",\\n        \\\"v\\\": (op.vitals * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\\n        \\\"b\\\": op.bpm.round(),\\n        \\\"p\\\": (op.phase * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n        \\\"f\\\": if op.flat { 1 } else { 0 },\\n        \\\"tm\\\": (op.timer * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\",\"new_string\":\"        \\\"k\\\": \\\"s\\\",\\n        \\\"v\\\": vitals,\\n        \\\"b\\\": op.bpm.round(),\\n        \\\"p\\\": (op.phase * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n        \\\"f\\\": if op.flat { 1 } else { 0 },\\n        \\\"tm\\\": timer,\\n        \\\"bb\\\": bucket,\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"        \\\"k\\\": \\\"s\\\",\\n        \\\"v\\\": (op.vitals * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\\n        \\\"b\\\": op.bpm.round(),\\n        \\\"p\\\": (op.phase * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n        \\\"f\\\": if op.flat { 1 } else { 0 },\\n        \\\"tm\\\": (op.timer * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\",\"old_line\":757,\"new_string\":\"        \\\"k\\\": \\\"s\\\",\\n        \\\"v\\\": vitals,\\n        \\\"b\\\": op.bpm.round(),\\n        \\\"p\\\": (op.phase * 100.0).round() / 100.0,\\n        \\\"f\\\": if op.flat { 1 } else { 0 },\\n        \\\"tm\\\": timer,\\n        \\\"bb\\\": bucket,\",\"new_line\":757,\"context_before\":\"        }\\n    }\\n    serde_json::json!({\\n\",\"context_after\":\"        \\\"cd\\\": (op.code_t * 10.0).round() / 10.0,\\n        \\\"h\\\": hazards,\\n        \\\"u\\\": cursors,\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e50029d3-bece-4fbb-b359-7c007804818e-71","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"fn status_json(shell: &Shell, op: Option<&SurgeryFrame>) -> String {\",\"new_string\":\"fn status_json(shell: &Shell, op: Option<&SurgeryFrame>, vitals: Option<f32>, timer: Option<f32>) -> String {\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"fn status_json(shell: &Shell, op: Option<&SurgeryFrame>) -> String {\",\"old_line\"