{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_744","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Other cargo processes are running in separate directories.\n\nThe pack build will use CARGO_TARGET_DIR set to .harbor-target. I'll limit parallel jobs to 4 or 6 to avoid memory pressure from other cargo processes. The build is starting in the engine-link directory.\n\nThe build command is set with CARGO_TARGET_DIR and CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4. It targets the surgery/title scene and outputs a single-file HTML pack. The engine-link directory is a symlink, so logical path resolution is needed to avoid colon issues.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Other builds are using their own target directories, so this pack can use `.harbor-target`. A clean wasm build will take a few minutes."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0ab12128-456a-470c-8c6c-7749fd67bc6b-78","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link && CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 bash scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene surgery/title --title \"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\" --description \"Night Ward. Keep the beat. Keep them alive.\" --theme-color \"#10282c\" --out \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\" > /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack.txt 2>&1; echo PACK:$? >> /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack.txt","description":"Pack surgery HTML into the work-root file","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4855