ript.\\n- Suite `14 passed, 0 failed`, including a skill-1.0 bot that finishes case 0 from empty hands into the results mode. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Balance for skills 1.0, 0.7, 0.4, and 0 is in the scratch `balance.txt`.\\n- Two file:// launches: title Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion, music 0.10, canvas 1920×1080, no page errors, DualSense Cross opens the menu the same way both times.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8f8d36c7-50db-49f7-9c8a-e3da63d89b7c-89","content":"{\"type\":\"Todo\",\"TodosUpdated\":{\"summary_for_prompt\":\"- [completed] 1: Clone engine, confirm commit, read docs, RNG title, start PROGRESS.md\\n- [completed] 2: Fix InputFrame compile break; get pav_app/pav_view/pav_tools checking\\n- [completed] 3: All instruments, hazards, ratings, chains, Code, cases 0-2, bot, cues, tests\\n- [completed] 4: 10-foot shell: menus, pause, settings, save, glyphs, attract, touch-only, dev sliders\\n- [completed] 5: Paper theatre, music buses at 0.10, gibberish voices through case 7\\n- [completed] 6: Strains, gifts, tremor, Cryoprobe, Duet, cases 3-7, local 1-4, Code Blue\\n- [completed] 7: Hub shim proof: hub.txt written from the four PASS logs and cursor numbers\\n- [completed] 8: Capture results.png from a skill-1.0 bot win, refresh balance.txt and the suite log\\n- [completed] 9: Fix hub snapshot timing so host and client vitals match, re-run the two-page check, overwrite hub.txt\\n\",\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Clone engine, confirm commit, read docs, RNG title, start PROGRESS.md\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Fix InputFrame compile break; get pav_app/pav_view/pav_tools checking\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"All instruments, hazards, ratings, chains, Code, cases 0-2, bot, cues, tests\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"10-foot shell: menus, pause, settings,