{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1895e254-fb59-4511-87a5-87da9f4ac153-91","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"Hub harness against the packed HTML. Two-page recheck server 127.0.0.1:41171. One browser. TMPDIR=/tmp/hbr-pw.\",\"new_string\":\"Hub harness against the packed HTML. TMPDIR=/tmp/hbr-pw.\\nThe four queries below are the passing runs in hub-p4.txt, hub-leave.txt, hub-server.txt, and hub-one.txt (server 127.0.0.1:39337).\\nThe two-page vitals check was re-run on this pack at 127.0.0.1:41171. That server is stopped.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub.txt has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub.txt has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub.txt\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"Hub harness against the packed HTML. Two-page recheck server 127.0.0.1:41171. One browser. TMPDIR=/tmp/hbr-pw.\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"Hub harness against the packed HTML. TMPDIR=/tmp/hbr-pw.\\nThe four queries below are the passing runs in hub-p4.txt, hub-leave.txt, hub-server.txt, and hub-one.txt (server 127.0.0.1:39337).\\nThe two-page vitals check was re-run on this pack at 127.0.0.1:41171. That server is stopped.\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\\nplayers=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1&limit=20 PASS\\n  traffic: p0 ↑38 ↓77 p1 ↑38 ↓78 p2 ↑38 ↓76\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"d965feca-5cf5-4b32-aafb-9491c16e6cd7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_755","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and complete the tasks in PLAN.md and TASK.md.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The two-page hub check now reports the same vitals on both pages. At the comparison point the host and the client both showed vitals **65.5999984741211** and timer **239.1999969482422**. The client’s aim moved that surgeon’s cursor on the host from 0 to 9. `hub.txt` has that result.\n\nVitals and the timer in a snapshot stay on the value from the start of a 500 ms hub-clock bucket. The host’s status switches to that value only after the snapshot is sent, and a client ignores an older bucket. Cursors still update on every snapshot. The check used the harness default of 60 ms latency, held the match across a second read 200 ms later, and the server on port 41171 is stopped.\n\n## Source Information\n\n- Date: 2026-11-04 22:40:15\n- Source: Trauma Center: Second Opinion\n- Plan: PLAN.md\n- Genre: Simulation\n- Perspective: Fixed overhead view of the operative field\n- Tech: Pavilion engine (Shardfall commit 49ef2ba), Rust 1.98.1, wgpu/WebGPU, wasm-bindgen 0.2.129, egui 0.36.2\n- Art Direction: Cel-shaded overhead operative field painted per vertex, with layered paper-theatre cards for story\n- Animation: Simulation-driven tissue, instruments, heartbeat, and paper-card motion\n- Audio: Synthesized music, effects, and short gibberish voices. No audio files. Music bus defaults to 0.10\n- Online: Optional AI Hub shared-world Code Blue for 1-4 surgeons\n- Testing: Deterministic sim suite, headless shell, Chromium file:// launches, hub harness\n- Research: Engine seams and the hub protocol, recorded in PLAN.md\n- Environment: Grok CLI (headless); Linux\n- Model: xAI, grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh\n- Usage: added on import\n\n## Testing Feedback\n\n- Testing caught five issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, and ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame so an operation froze after one tick.\n- 5\n- The most helpful checks were a skill-1.0 bot on every case from a fresh scene, and the hub harness traffic counters once the frame loop actually ticked.\n- The least helpful test was a temporary print probe that only dumped stuck hazards and was removed once the selection bug was fixed.\n\n## Engine Feedback\n\n- The Game hook, recorded input, RenderFrame, headless egui, and the single-file packer.\n- Yes. A colon in the project path makes rustc fail joining LD_LIBRARY_PATH, and the demo frame path captures the camera, pause menu, and touch layer unless a game returns first.\n- The operative rules, the plate mesh, the ten-foot shell, the cue and music buses, and the hub shim.\n- Keeping a surgery scene off the demo boot panel, stats, guide, toasts, and the engine pause menu.\n- Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\n- A first-class per-game frame path, so a new game does not have to outrun the demo loop.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n\n- The tested camera, light, and palette numbers, and a hub shim that the harness had already accepted.\n- The deliverable folder name must contain a colon, which Cargo cannot use as its working directory.\n- Shipping one packed page that is the full game, a hub client, and a file:// WebGPU build.\n- Say at the start that the Cargo target directory cannot contain a colon."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":548,"output_tokens":982,"cache_read_input_tokens":155008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"2089da4c-35f4-4a4e-a662-d82b82e81c9c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_756","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions to complete the remaining tasks.\n\nI will re-run the four hub harness queries against the packed HTML and verify `__hubCheck.pass` and `dataset.complete`. Then I will run the simulation suite to confirm all tests pass.\n\nThe packed HTML was rebuilt with the snapshot timing fix. The simulation suite must be rebuilt from engine-link because the target directory was deleted after packing. Cargo jobs will not overlap, and CARGO_TARGET_DIR will be set to work/.harbor-target.\n\nI will keep TMPDIR=/tmp/hbr-pw for Chromium socket paths. I will not kill processes or use subagents. Only one browser runs at a time. The server binds to 127.0.0.1 with an OS-selected port.\n\nI will run the hub harness tests and the simulation suite sequentially to avoid memory pressure. The suite requires cargo to compile native tests, while the hub harness uses the packed HTML directly via playwright.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The new pack still needs the four hub harness queries and a fresh sim suite. I’ll run those against the shipped HTML and the sim, one at a time."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd203012-cde5-4b94-8a90-1d6f7550601a-92","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"10","content":"Re-run four hub harness queries on the new pack and confirm __hubCheck.pass","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"11","content":"Re-run the sim suite so it prints N passed, 0 failed","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd203012-cde5-4b94-8a90-1d6f7550601a-93","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__hubCheck|dataset.complete|hub-p4|players=4","glob":"**/*.{py,js,html,md}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd203012-cde5-4b94-8a90-1d6f7550601a-94","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__hubCheck|def run|players=","glob":"**/*.py","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":126968,"output_tokens":961,"cache_read_input_tokens":29568,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"4281381c-0eca-47b1-b14e-c600c739b257"}
