{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_766","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All four tests passed on the new pack.\n\nHost-leave traffic is lower because the round voids quickly after leave. The harness still passes both-way traffic and host-leave rules. Next steps are updating hub.txt with fresh numbers, running the sim suite, and leaving the server running until the suite starts.\n\nStopping the server before the suite to free the port and memory. The sim suite will run from the dev folder via python3 tests/run_all.py. Compiling from a clean target will take several minutes, so I'll limit build jobs to four to avoid stampeding.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"All four harness queries passed on this pack, with `__hubCheck.pass` true. Next I’ll record that and re-run the sim suite."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9a54a3f7-fc67-43fd-9c94-7954b9fe3a8a-106","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub.txt","old_string":"","new_string":"Hub harness against the packed HTML on this pack. Server 127.0.0.1:43467. One browser at a time. TMPDIR=/tmp/hbr-pw.\nEach query waited for document.body.dataset.complete === 'true' and window.__hubCheck.pass.\n\nplayers=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1&limit=20 PASS\n  dataset.complete true, __hubCheck.pass true\n  traffic: p0 ↑18 ↓30 p1 ↑17 ↓33 p2 ↑17 ↓29\n  round: played (finished). Source: hub-p4.txt\n\nplayers=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave&auto=1&limit=20 PASS\n  dataset.complete true, __hubCheck.pass true\n  traffic after leave: p1 ↑1 ↓3 p2 ↑1 ↓3 p3 ↑1 ↓3\n  round: void (host-left). Did not finish on leave. Source: hub-leave.txt\n\nplayers=2&scenario=server&auto=1&limit=20 PASS\n  dataset.complete true, __hubCheck.pass true\n  traffic: p0 ↑35 ↓70 p1 ↑35 ↓70 server ↑35 ↓70\n  server sent 36, host slot 2, played (fi