{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_777","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The test suite runs only three cargo test filters.\n\nThe three filters are `pav_core --test surgery`, `pav_ui --lib surgery::tests`, and `pav_audio --lib music_bus_defaults_quiet_and_every_cue_speaks`. Fourteen tests passed. I need to read the actual surgery tests to verify they cover all required behaviors.\n\nThe verification plan requires bot wins on 10 seed campaigns at skill 1.0, idle and random-tool losses, matching snapshot hashes, coverage counters for every tool and phase, clean content lint, music gain of 0.10, and non-silent offline rendering. Gating 2 demands pad, keyboard, and mouse input across every screen from the title state. The current suite only runs Rust tests, not browser tests.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-41cd2fd6-6225-429e-9d5d-80b6756a4577-15","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"#\\[test\\]|fn ","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests","glob":"*surgery*"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-41cd2fd6-6225-429e-9d5d-80b6756a4577-16","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-41cd2fd6-6225-429e-9d5d-80b6756a4577-17","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"#\\[test\\]|fn test_","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/surgery"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-41cd2fd6-6225-429e-9d5d-80b6756a4577-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern