{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-389edf22-69b6-4d88-94a5-faf41c284f50-54","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"680→    app.rig.params = CameraParams {\\n        tilt: 73.0,\\n        yaw: 0.0,\\n        distance: 19.9,\\n        fov: 36.0,\\n        ortho: false,\\n        follow_lag: 0.0,\\n        height_offset: 0.0,\\n    };\\n    app.rig.snap(Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2));\\n690→}\\n\\nfn tray_tool(x: f32, z: f32) -> Option<u8> {\\n    if (z - 5.4).abs() > 0.7 {\\n        return None;\\n    }\\n    for t in 0..8 {\\n        let tx = -3.5 + t as f32;\\n        if (x - tx).abs() < 0.45 {\\n            return Some(t as u8);\\n700→        }\\n    }\\n    None\\n}\\n\\n/// Tenth-of-a-unit grid used on the wire. Both pages report this same f32.\\nfn tenth(v: f32) -> f32 {\\n    (v * 10.0).round() / 10.0\\n}\\n\\n710→/// Vitals stay on one value for a 500 ms hub-clock bucket. The bucket advances\\n/// in the body only; the harbor latch updates after the send succeeds.\\nfn latched_vitals(harbor: &Harbor, op: &SurgeryFrame, time_ms: f32) -> (f32, f32, i32) {\\n    if time_ms >= 0.0 {\\n        let bucket = (time_ms / 500.0).floor() as i32;\\n        if harbor.net_vitals.is_none() || bucket != harbor.net_bucket {\\n            return (tenth(op.vitals), tenth(op.timer), bucket);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    (\\n720→        harbor.net_vitals.unwrap_or_else(|| tenth(op.vitals)),\\n        harbor.net_timer.unwrap_or_else(|| tenth(op.timer)),\\n        harbor.net_bucket,\\n    )\\n}\\n\\nfn snap_json(op: &SurgeryFrame, events: &[pav_core::SimEvent], vitals: f32, timer: f32, bucket: i32) -> String {\\n    let mut hazards = Vec::new();\\n    for h in op.hazards.iter().filter(|h| h.alive).take(12) {\\n        hazards.push(serde_json::json!([\",\"content_concise\":\"680→    app.rig.params = CameraParams {\\n        tilt: 73.0,\\n        yaw: 0.0,\\n        distance: 19.9,\\n        fov: 36.0,\\n        ortho: false,\\n        follow_lag: 0.0,\\n        height_offset: 0.0,\\n    };\\n    app.rig.snap(Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2));\\n690→}\\n\\nfn tray_tool(x: f32, z: f32) -> Option<u8> {\\n    if (z - 5.4).abs() > 0.7 {\\n        return None;\\n    }\\n    for t in 0..8 {\\n        let tx = -3.5 + t as f32;\\n        if (x - tx).abs() < 0.45 {\\n            return Some(t as u8);\\n700→        }\\n    }\\n    None\\n}\\n\\n/// Tenth-of-a-unit grid used on the wire. Both pages report this same f32.\\nfn tenth(v: f32) -> f32 {\\n    (v * 10.0).round() / 10.0\\n}\\n\\n710→/// Vitals stay on one value for a 500 ms hub-clock bucket. The bucket advances\\n/// in the body only; the harbor latch updates after the send succeeds.\\nfn latched_vitals(harbor: &Harbor, op: &SurgeryFrame, time_ms: f32) -> (f32, f32, i32) {\\n    if time_ms >= 0.0 {\\n        let bucket = (time_ms / 500.0).floor() as i32;\\n        if harbor.net_vitals.is_none() || bucket != harbor.net_bucket {\\n            return (tenth(op.vitals), tenth(op.timer), bucket);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    (\\n720→        harbor.net_vitals.unwrap_or_else(|| tenth(op.vitals)),\\n        harbor.net_timer.unwrap_or_else(|| tenth(op.timer)),\\n        harbor.net_bucket,\\n    )\\n}\\n\\nfn snap_json(op: &SurgeryFrame, events: &[pav_core::SimEvent], vitals: f32, timer: f32, bucket: i32) -> String {\\n    let mut hazards = Vec::new();\\n    for h in op.hazards.iter().filter(|h| h.alive).take(12) {\\n        hazards.push(serde_json::json!([\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs\",\"offset\":680,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"    app.rig.params = CameraParams {\\n        tilt: 73.0,\\n        yaw: 0.0,\\n        distance: 19.9,\\n        fov: 36.0,\\n        ortho: false,\\n        follow_lag: 0.0,\\n        height_offset: 0.0,\\n    };\\n    app.rig.snap(Vec3::new(0.0, 0.0, 0.2));\\n}\\n\\nfn tray_tool(x: f32, z: f32) -> Option<u8> {\\n    if (z - 5.4).abs() > 0.7 {\\n        return None;\\n    }\\n    for t in 0..8 {\\n        let tx = -3.5 + t as f32;\\n        if (x - tx).abs() < 0.45 {\\n            return Some(t as u8);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    None\\n}\\n\\n/// Tenth-of-a-unit grid used on the wire. Both pages report this same f32.\\nfn tenth(v: f32) -> f32 {\\n    (v * 10.0).round() / 10.0\\n}\\n\\n/// Vitals stay on one value for a 500 ms hub-clock bucket. The bucket advances\\n/// in the body only; the harbor latch updates after the send succeeds.\\nfn latched_vitals(harbor: &Harbor, op: &SurgeryFrame, time_ms: f32) -> (f32, f32, i32) {\\n    if time_ms >= 0.0 {\\n        let bucket = (time_ms / 500.0).floor() as i32;\\n        if harbor.net_vitals.is_none() || bucket != harbor.net_bucket {\\n            return (tenth(op.vitals), tenth(op.timer), bucket);\\n        }\\n    }\\n    (\\n        harbor.net_vitals.unwrap_or_else(|| tenth(op.vitals)),\\n        harbor.net_timer.unwrap_or_else(|| tenth(op.timer)),\\n        harbor.net_bucket,\\n    )\\n}\\n\\nfn snap_json(op: &SurgeryFrame, events: &[pav_core::SimEvent], vitals: f32, timer: f32, bucket: i32) -> String {\\n    let mut hazards = Vec::new();\\n    for h in op.hazards.iter().filter(|h| h.alive).take(12) {\\n        hazards.push(serde_json::json!([\\n\",\"total_lines\":929}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-389edf22-69b6-4d88-94a5-faf41c284f50-55","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"280→pub fn apply(\\n    h: &mut Hazard,\\n    x: f32,\\n    z: f32,\\n    tool: u8,\\n    use_held: bool,\\n    just_release: bool,\\n    pressure: f32,\\n    rot: i32,\\n    dt: f32,\\n290→    power: f32,\\n    diastole: bool,\\n    strict: f32,\\n) -> Hit {\\n    let mut hit = Hit::default();\\n    if !h.alive {\\n        return hit;\\n    }\\n    let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n    let near = d <= h.radius + 0.08;\\n300→    let p = pressure.clamp(0.15, 1.0) * power.max(0.2);\\n\\n    if tool == SCANNER && use_held && d < h.radius + 0.35 {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_PING;\\n        h.revealed = 8.0;\\n        h.hidden = false;\\n        if h.kind == K_FOREIGN || h.kind == K_NODULE {\\n            return hit;\\n        }\\n310→    }\\n\\n    if h.hidden && h.revealed <= 0.0 {\\n        return hit;\\n    }\\n\\n    match h.kind {\\n        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n            if tool != SCALPEL || !use_held {\\n                return hit;\\n320→            }\\n            let (along, side) = side_of(h, x, z);\\n            if side.abs() < 0.5 && along >= h.work - 0.15 && along <= h.work + 0.55 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.quality += side.abs() * dt;\\n                h.work = h.work.max(along);\\n                if side.abs() > 0.62 {\\n                    hit.misuse = 1;\\n                }\\n330→            }\\n            if h.work >= h.need {\\n                finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.3), strict);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_TUMOR if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            if tool != SCALPEL || !use_held {\\n                return hit;\\n            }\\n            let ang = h.work;\\n340→            let px = h.x + ang.cos() * (h.radius * 0.75);\\n            let pz = h.z + ang.sin() * (h.radius * 0.75);\\n            let dd = ((x - px).powi(2) + (z - pz).powi(2)).sqrt();\\n            if dd < 0.48 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * 2.4 * p;\\n                h.quality += dd * dt;\\n            }\\n            if h.work >= std::f32::consts::TAU {\\n350→                finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / 2.0, strict);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_TUMOR if h.tool == FORCEPS => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, diastole);\\n        }\\n        K_NODULE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n360→            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        // The guard binds the whole or-pattern, so a stage check cannot share this arm\\n        // with wounds that suture on stage 0.\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n370→        K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage < 2 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                h.quality += d * dt;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n380→                    finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.2), strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_POOL => {\\n            if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n390→                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_SAC => {\\n            if tool == LASER && (use_held || just_release) {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, CUE_LASER, 2);\\n            } else if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n400→                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * 0.45 * p;\\n                if h.work >= 1.3 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n410→        K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_EMBER if h.stage == 0 && (h.kind != K_EMBER || h.tool == CRYO) => {\\n            let cue = if h.tool == CRYO { CUE_FROST } else { CUE_LASER };\\n            let misuse = if h.tool == CRYO { 4 } else { 2 };\\n            if tool == h.tool {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, cue, misuse);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage == 1 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n420→                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, 0.1, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_INFLAM | K_BURN | K_DRESSING | K_TUMOR if h.tool == GEL || h.tool == DRESSING => {\\n            paint(h, x, z, tool, use_held, d, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n430→        K_BONE if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            if rot > 0 {\\n                h.aux -= dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            if rot < 0 {\\n                h.aux += dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            h.aux = h.aux.clamp(-80.0, 80.0);\\n            if tool == FORCEPS && use_held && d < 0.55 && h.aux.abs() < 12.0 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n440→                hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n                h.work += dt;\\n                if h.work > 0.25 {\\n                    let err = (h.aux.abs() / 40.0) + (d * 0.4);\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, err, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_IV => {\\n            if tool != IV {\\n450→                return hit;\\n            }\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            if use_held {\\n                h.aux += dt / 1.65 * p;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                if h.aux > 1.12 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n                    hit.heal = -8.0;\\n460→                    hit.misuse = 3;\\n                    h.aux = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n                if (0.75..1.05).contains(&h.aux) {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.9).abs() * 1.4, strict);\\n                    hit.heal = 18.0;\\n                    hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                }\\n470→                h.aux = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {}\\n    }\\n    hit\\n}\\n\\nfn finish(h: &mut Hazard, hit: &mut Hit, err: f32, strict: f32) {\\n    hit.done = true;\\n480→    hit.rating = rate_error(err, strict);\\n    hit.engaged = true;\\n    let cleared = h.advance_stage();\\n    if !cleared {\\n        hit.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn forceps(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32, allow: bool) {\\n    if tool != FORCEPS {\\n490→        return;\\n    }\\n    let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n    if use_held && !h.grabbed && d <= h.radius {\\n        h.grabbed = true;\\n        h.grab_x = x;\\n        h.grab_z = z;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n    }\\n500→    if h.grabbed && use_held {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        let dx = x - h.grab_x;\\n        let dz = z - h.grab_z;\\n        let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n        let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n        let along = dx * dirx + dz * dirz;\\n        let lat = (-dx * dirz + dz * dirx).abs();\\n        if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !allow {\\n            h.work = (h.work - dt * 0.9).max(0.0);\\n510→            h.quality += 0.02;\\n        } else {\\n            h.work = h.work.max(along);\\n            h.quality += lat * dt;\\n            if lat > 0.6 && along > 0.25 {\\n                hit.misuse = 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if h.work >= h.need {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.3), strict);\\n520→            hit.cue = CUE_POP;\\n        }\\n    } else if !use_held {\\n        h.grabbed = false;\\n        if h.work < h.need {\\n            h.work = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n530→fn suture(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != SUTURE || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let (along, side) = side_of(h, x, z);\\n    let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n    let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n    let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n    if side.abs() > 0.06 {\\n        let prev = h.aux2;\\n540→        if prev.abs() > 0.06 && prev.signum() != side.signum() && (along - needle).abs() < 0.55 && side.abs() < 0.9 {\\n            h.samples = h.samples.saturating_add(1);\\n            h.quality += (h.aux - 0.28).abs() * 0.35;\\n            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.cue = CUE_ZIP;\\n            if h.samples >= h.samples_need {\\n                let err = h.quality / h.samples.max(1) as f32;\\n                finish(h, hit, err, strict);\\n            }\\n550→        } else if side.abs() < 0.95 && (along - needle).abs() < 0.75 {\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n        }\\n        h.aux2 = side;\\n    } else if (along - needle).abs() < 0.75 {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n    h.aux += dt;\\n}\\n\\n560→fn heat_tool(h: &mut Hazard, near: bool, use_held: bool, just_release: bool, dt: f32, p: f32, strict: f32, hit: &mut Hit, cue: u16, misuse: u8) {\\n    let fill = h.need.max(0.35);\\n    if use_held && near {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = cue;\\n        h.aux += dt / fill * p;\\n        if h.aux > 1.08 {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n            hit.misuse = misuse;\\n570→            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            h.alive = false;\\n        }\\n    } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n        if (0.80..1.06).contains(&h.aux) {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.92).abs() * 1.6, strict);\\n            hit.cue = CUE_SIZZLE;\\n            let _ = h.advance_stage();\\n580→        }\\n        h.aux = 0.0;\\n    } else if !near {\\n        h.aux = (h.aux - dt * 0.35).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn paint(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, d: f32, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != h.tool || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n590→    }\\n    if d <= h.radius {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_GEL;\\n        let ang = (z - h.z).atan2(x - h.x);\\n        let q = ((ang + std::f32::consts::PI) / (std::f32::consts::FRAC_PI_2)).floor() as u8 % 4;\\n        h.bits |= 1 << q;\\n        h.work += dt;\\n        if h.bits.count_ones() >= 4 && h.work >= h.need * 0.55 {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality * 0.5, strict);\\n600→        }\\n    } else if d < h.radius * 2.1 {\\n        h.quality += dt;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Where the bot should put the cursor to continue this gesture.\\npub fn aim_point(h: &Hazard, cursor_side: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    match h.kind {\\n610→        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n            let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n            let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n            let along = (h.work + 0.22).min(h.need);\\n            (h.x + dirx * along, h.z + dirz * along)\\n        }\\n        K_TUMOR if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            let ang = h.work + 0.28;\\n            (h.x + ang.cos() * (h.radius * 0.75), h.z + ang.sin() * (h.radius * 0.75))\\n        }\\n620→        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER | K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 || h.kind != K_BONE => {\\n            let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n            let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n            let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n            let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n            let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n            let across_x = -dirz;\\n            let across_z = dirx;\\n            let sign = if cursor_side >= 0.0 { -1.0 } else { 1.0 };\\n            (h.x + dirx * needle + across_x * 0.5 * sign, h.z + dirz * needle + across_z * 0.5 * sign)\\n630→        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_NODULE | K_EYE | K_EMBER | K_TUMOR if h.grabbed || h.tool == FORCEPS && h.kind != K_TUMOR => {\\n            if h.grabbed || h.work > 0.05 {\\n                let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n                let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n                (h.grab_x + dirx * (h.need + 0.15), h.grab_z + dirz * (h.need + 0.15))\\n            } else {\\n                (h.x, h.z)\\n            }\\n        }\\n640→        _ => (h.x, h.z),\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"280→pub fn apply(\\n    h: &mut Hazard,\\n    x: f32,\\n    z: f32,\\n    tool: u8,\\n    use_held: bool,\\n    just_release: bool,\\n    pressure: f32,\\n    rot: i32,\\n    dt: f32,\\n290→    power: f32,\\n    diastole: bool,\\n    strict: f32,\\n) -> Hit {\\n    let mut hit = Hit::default();\\n    if !h.alive {\\n        return hit;\\n    }\\n    let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n    let near = d <= h.radius + 0.08;\\n300→    let p = pressure.clamp(0.15, 1.0) * power.max(0.2);\\n\\n    if tool == SCANNER && use_held && d < h.radius + 0.35 {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_PING;\\n        h.revealed = 8.0;\\n        h.hidden = false;\\n        if h.kind == K_FOREIGN || h.kind == K_NODULE {\\n            return hit;\\n        }\\n310→    }\\n\\n    if h.hidden && h.revealed <= 0.0 {\\n        return hit;\\n    }\\n\\n    match h.kind {\\n        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n            if tool != SCALPEL || !use_held {\\n                return hit;\\n320→            }\\n            let (along, side) = side_of(h, x, z);\\n            if side.abs() < 0.5 && along >= h.work - 0.15 && along <= h.work + 0.55 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.quality += side.abs() * dt;\\n                h.work = h.work.max(along);\\n                if side.abs() > 0.62 {\\n                    hit.misuse = 1;\\n                }\\n330→            }\\n            if h.work >= h.need {\\n                finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.3), strict);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_TUMOR if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            if tool != SCALPEL || !use_held {\\n                return hit;\\n            }\\n            let ang = h.work;\\n340→            let px = h.x + ang.cos() * (h.radius * 0.75);\\n            let pz = h.z + ang.sin() * (h.radius * 0.75);\\n            let dd = ((x - px).powi(2) + (z - pz).powi(2)).sqrt();\\n            if dd < 0.48 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * 2.4 * p;\\n                h.quality += dd * dt;\\n            }\\n            if h.work >= std::f32::consts::TAU {\\n350→                finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / 2.0, strict);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_TUMOR if h.tool == FORCEPS => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, diastole);\\n        }\\n        K_NODULE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n360→            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        // The guard binds the whole or-pattern, so a stage check cannot share this arm\\n        // with wounds that suture on stage 0.\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n370→        K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage < 2 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                h.quality += d * dt;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n380→                    finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.2), strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_POOL => {\\n            if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n390→                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_SAC => {\\n            if tool == LASER && (use_held || just_release) {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, CUE_LASER, 2);\\n            } else if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n400→                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * 0.45 * p;\\n                if h.work >= 1.3 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n410→        K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_EMBER if h.stage == 0 && (h.kind != K_EMBER || h.tool == CRYO) => {\\n            let cue = if h.tool == CRYO { CUE_FROST } else { CUE_LASER };\\n            let misuse = if h.tool == CRYO { 4 } else { 2 };\\n            if tool == h.tool {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, cue, misuse);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage == 1 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n420→                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, 0.1, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_INFLAM | K_BURN | K_DRESSING | K_TUMOR if h.tool == GEL || h.tool == DRESSING => {\\n            paint(h, x, z, tool, use_held, d, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n430→        K_BONE if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            if rot > 0 {\\n                h.aux -= dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            if rot < 0 {\\n                h.aux += dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            h.aux = h.aux.clamp(-80.0, 80.0);\\n            if tool == FORCEPS && use_held && d < 0.55 && h.aux.abs() < 12.0 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n440→                hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n                h.work += dt;\\n                if h.work > 0.25 {\\n                    let err = (h.aux.abs() / 40.0) + (d * 0.4);\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, err, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_IV => {\\n            if tool != IV {\\n450→                return hit;\\n            }\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            if use_held {\\n                h.aux += dt / 1.65 * p;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                if h.aux > 1.12 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n                    hit.heal = -8.0;\\n460→                    hit.misuse = 3;\\n                    h.aux = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n                if (0.75..1.05).contains(&h.aux) {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.9).abs() * 1.4, strict);\\n                    hit.heal = 18.0;\\n                    hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                }\\n470→                h.aux = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {}\\n    }\\n    hit\\n}\\n\\nfn finish(h: &mut Hazard, hit: &mut Hit, err: f32, strict: f32) {\\n    hit.done = true;\\n480→    hit.rating = rate_error(err, strict);\\n    hit.engaged = true;\\n    let cleared = h.advance_stage();\\n    if !cleared {\\n        hit.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn forceps(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32, allow: bool) {\\n    if tool != FORCEPS {\\n490→        return;\\n    }\\n    let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n    if use_held && !h.grabbed && d <= h.radius {\\n        h.grabbed = true;\\n        h.grab_x = x;\\n        h.grab_z = z;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n    }\\n500→    if h.grabbed && use_held {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        let dx = x - h.grab_x;\\n        let dz = z - h.grab_z;\\n        let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n        let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n        let along = dx * dirx + dz * dirz;\\n        let lat = (-dx * dirz + dz * dirx).abs();\\n        if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !allow {\\n            h.work = (h.work - dt * 0.9).max(0.0);\\n510→            h.quality += 0.02;\\n        } else {\\n            h.work = h.work.max(along);\\n            h.quality += lat * dt;\\n            if lat > 0.6 && along > 0.25 {\\n                hit.misuse = 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if h.work >= h.need {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.3), strict);\\n520→            hit.cue = CUE_POP;\\n        }\\n    } else if !use_held {\\n        h.grabbed = false;\\n        if h.work < h.need {\\n            h.work = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n530→fn suture(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != SUTURE || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let (along, side) = side_of(h, x, z);\\n    let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n    let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n    let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n    if side.abs() > 0.06 {\\n        let prev = h.aux2;\\n540→        if prev.abs() > 0.06 && prev.signum() != side.signum() && (along - needle).abs() < 0.55 && side.abs() < 0.9 {\\n            h.samples = h.samples.saturating_add(1);\\n            h.quality += (h.aux - 0.28).abs() * 0.35;\\n            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.cue = CUE_ZIP;\\n            if h.samples >= h.samples_need {\\n                let err = h.quality / h.samples.max(1) as f32;\\n                finish(h, hit, err, strict);\\n            }\\n550→        } else if side.abs() < 0.95 && (along - needle).abs() < 0.75 {\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n        }\\n        h.aux2 = side;\\n    } else if (along - needle).abs() < 0.75 {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n    h.aux += dt;\\n}\\n\\n560→fn heat_tool(h: &mut Hazard, near: bool, use_held: bool, just_release: bool, dt: f32, p: f32, strict: f32, hit: &mut Hit, cue: u16, misuse: u8) {\\n    let fill = h.need.max(0.35);\\n    if use_held && near {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = cue;\\n        h.aux += dt / fill * p;\\n        if h.aux > 1.08 {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n            hit.misuse = misuse;\\n570→            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            h.alive = false;\\n        }\\n    } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n        if (0.80..1.06).contains(&h.aux) {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.92).abs() * 1.6, strict);\\n            hit.cue = CUE_SIZZLE;\\n            let _ = h.advance_stage();\\n580→        }\\n        h.aux = 0.0;\\n    } else if !near {\\n        h.aux = (h.aux - dt * 0.35).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn paint(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, d: f32, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != h.tool || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n590→    }\\n    if d <= h.radius {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_GEL;\\n        let ang = (z - h.z).atan2(x - h.x);\\n        let q = ((ang + std::f32::consts::PI) / (std::f32::consts::FRAC_PI_2)).floor() as u8 % 4;\\n        h.bits |= 1 << q;\\n        h.work += dt;\\n        if h.bits.count_ones() >= 4 && h.work >= h.need * 0.55 {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality * 0.5, strict);\\n600→        }\\n    } else if d < h.radius * 2.1 {\\n        h.quality += dt;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Where the bot should put the cursor to continue this gesture.\\npub fn aim_point(h: &Hazard, cursor_side: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    match h.kind {\\n610→        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n            let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n            let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n            let along = (h.work + 0.22).min(h.need);\\n            (h.x + dirx * along, h.z + dirz * along)\\n        }\\n        K_TUMOR if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            let ang = h.work + 0.28;\\n            (h.x + ang.cos() * (h.radius * 0.75), h.z + ang.sin() * (h.radius * 0.75))\\n        }\\n620→        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER | K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 || h.kind != K_BONE => {\\n            let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n            let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n            let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n            let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n            let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n            let across_x = -dirz;\\n            let across_z = dirx;\\n            let sign = if cursor_side >= 0.0 { -1.0 } else { 1.0 };\\n            (h.x + dirx * needle + across_x * 0.5 * sign, h.z + dirz * needle + across_z * 0.5 * sign)\\n630→        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_NODULE | K_EYE | K_EMBER | K_TUMOR if h.grabbed || h.tool == FORCEPS && h.kind != K_TUMOR => {\\n            if h.grabbed || h.work > 0.05 {\\n                let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n                let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n                (h.grab_x + dirx * (h.need + 0.15), h.grab_z + dirz * (h.need + 0.15))\\n            } else {\\n                (h.x, h.z)\\n            }\\n        }\\n640→        _ => (h.x, h.z),\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/hazard.rs\",\"offset\":280,\"limit\":400,\"raw_output\":\"pub fn apply(\\n    h: &mut Hazard,\\n    x: f32,\\n    z: f32,\\n    tool: u8,\\n    use_held: bool,\\n    just_release: bool,\\n    pressure: f32,\\n    rot: i32,\\n    dt: f32,\\n    power: f32,\\n    diastole: bool,\\n    strict: f32,\\n) -> Hit {\\n    let mut hit = Hit::default();\\n    if !h.alive {\\n        return hit;\\n    }\\n    let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n    let near = d <= h.radius + 0.08;\\n    let p = pressure.clamp(0.15, 1.0) * power.max(0.2);\\n\\n    if tool == SCANNER && use_held && d < h.radius + 0.35 {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_PING;\\n        h.revealed = 8.0;\\n        h.hidden = false;\\n        if h.kind == K_FOREIGN || h.kind == K_NODULE {\\n            return hit;\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    if h.hidden && h.revealed <= 0.0 {\\n        return hit;\\n    }\\n\\n    match h.kind {\\n        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n            if tool != SCALPEL || !use_held {\\n                return hit;\\n            }\\n            let (along, side) = side_of(h, x, z);\\n            if side.abs() < 0.5 && along >= h.work - 0.15 && along <= h.work + 0.55 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.quality += side.abs() * dt;\\n                h.work = h.work.max(along);\\n                if side.abs() > 0.62 {\\n                    hit.misuse = 1;\\n                }\\n            }\\n            if h.work >= h.need {\\n                finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.3), strict);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_TUMOR if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            if tool != SCALPEL || !use_held {\\n                return hit;\\n            }\\n            let ang = h.work;\\n            let px = h.x + ang.cos() * (h.radius * 0.75);\\n            let pz = h.z + ang.sin() * (h.radius * 0.75);\\n            let dd = ((x - px).powi(2) + (z - pz).powi(2)).sqrt();\\n            if dd < 0.48 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * 2.4 * p;\\n                h.quality += dd * dt;\\n            }\\n            if h.work >= std::f32::consts::TAU {\\n                finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / 2.0, strict);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_TUMOR if h.tool == FORCEPS => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, diastole);\\n        }\\n        K_NODULE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        // The guard binds the whole or-pattern, so a stage check cannot share this arm\\n        // with wounds that suture on stage 0.\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage < 2 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                h.quality += d * dt;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.2), strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_POOL => {\\n            if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_SAC => {\\n            if tool == LASER && (use_held || just_release) {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, CUE_LASER, 2);\\n            } else if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * 0.45 * p;\\n                if h.work >= 1.3 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_EMBER if h.stage == 0 && (h.kind != K_EMBER || h.tool == CRYO) => {\\n            let cue = if h.tool == CRYO { CUE_FROST } else { CUE_LASER };\\n            let misuse = if h.tool == CRYO { 4 } else { 2 };\\n            if tool == h.tool {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, cue, misuse);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage == 1 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, 0.1, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_INFLAM | K_BURN | K_DRESSING | K_TUMOR if h.tool == GEL || h.tool == DRESSING => {\\n            paint(h, x, z, tool, use_held, d, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_BONE if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            if rot > 0 {\\n                h.aux -= dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            if rot < 0 {\\n                h.aux += dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            h.aux = h.aux.clamp(-80.0, 80.0);\\n            if tool == FORCEPS && use_held && d < 0.55 && h.aux.abs() < 12.0 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n                h.work += dt;\\n                if h.work > 0.25 {\\n                    let err = (h.aux.abs() / 40.0) + (d * 0.4);\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, err, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_IV => {\\n            if tool != IV {\\n                return hit;\\n            }\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            if use_held {\\n                h.aux += dt / 1.65 * p;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                if h.aux > 1.12 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n                    hit.heal = -8.0;\\n                    hit.misuse = 3;\\n                    h.aux = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n                if (0.75..1.05).contains(&h.aux) {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.9).abs() * 1.4, strict);\\n                    hit.heal = 18.0;\\n                    hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                }\\n                h.aux = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {}\\n    }\\n    hit\\n}\\n\\nfn finish(h: &mut Hazard, hit: &mut Hit, err: f32, strict: f32) {\\n    hit.done = true;\\n    hit.rating = rate_error(err, strict);\\n    hit.engaged = true;\\n    let cleared = h.advance_stage();\\n    if !cleared {\\n        hit.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn forceps(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32, allow: bool) {\\n    if tool != FORCEPS {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n    if use_held && !h.grabbed && d <= h.radius {\\n        h.grabbed = true;\\n        h.grab_x = x;\\n        h.grab_z = z;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n    }\\n    if h.grabbed && use_held {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        let dx = x - h.grab_x;\\n        let dz = z - h.grab_z;\\n        let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n        let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n        let along = dx * dirx + dz * dirz;\\n        let lat = (-dx * dirz + dz * dirx).abs();\\n        if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !allow {\\n            h.work = (h.work - dt * 0.9).max(0.0);\\n            h.quality += 0.02;\\n        } else {\\n            h.work = h.work.max(along);\\n            h.quality += lat * dt;\\n            if lat > 0.6 && along > 0.25 {\\n                hit.misuse = 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if h.work >= h.need {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.3), strict);\\n            hit.cue = CUE_POP;\\n        }\\n    } else if !use_held {\\n        h.grabbed = false;\\n        if h.work < h.need {\\n            h.work = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn suture(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != SUTURE || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let (along, side) = side_of(h, x, z);\\n    let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n    let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n    let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n    if side.abs() > 0.06 {\\n        let prev = h.aux2;\\n        if prev.abs() > 0.06 && prev.signum() != side.signum() && (along - needle).abs() < 0.55 && side.abs() < 0.9 {\\n            h.samples = h.samples.saturating_add(1);\\n            h.quality += (h.aux - 0.28).abs() * 0.35;\\n            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.cue = CUE_ZIP;\\n            if h.samples >= h.samples_need {\\n                let err = h.quality / h.samples.max(1) as f32;\\n                finish(h, hit, err, strict);\\n            }\\n        } else if side.abs() < 0.95 && (along - needle).abs() < 0.75 {\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n        }\\n        h.aux2 = side;\\n    } else if (along - needle).abs() < 0.75 {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n    h.aux += dt;\\n}\\n\\nfn heat_tool(h: &mut Hazard, near: bool, use_held: bool, just_release: bool, dt: f32, p: f32, strict: f32, hit: &mut Hit, cue: u16, misuse: u8) {\\n    let fill = h.need.max(0.35);\\n    if use_held && near {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = cue;\\n        h.aux += dt / fill * p;\\n        if h.aux > 1.08 {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n            hit.misuse = misuse;\\n            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            h.alive = false;\\n        }\\n    } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n        if (0.80..1.06).contains(&h.aux) {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.92).abs() * 1.6, strict);\\n            hit.cue = CUE_SIZZLE;\\n            let _ = h.advance_stage();\\n        }\\n        h.aux = 0.0;\\n    } else if !near {\\n        h.aux = (h.aux - dt * 0.35).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn paint(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, d: f32, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != h.tool || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    if d <= h.radius {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_GEL;\\n        let ang = (z - h.z).atan2(x - h.x);\\n        let q = ((ang + std::f32::consts::PI) / (std::f32::consts::FRAC_PI_2)).floor() as u8 % 4;\\n        h.bits |= 1 << q;\\n        h.work += dt;\\n        if h.bits.count_ones() >= 4 && h.work >= h.need * 0.55 {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality * 0.5, strict);\\n        }\\n    } else if d < h.radius * 2.1 {\\n        h.quality += dt;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Where the bot should put the cursor to continue this gesture.\\npub fn aim_point(h: &Hazard, cursor_side: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    match h.kind {\\n        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n            let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n            let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n            let along = (h.work + 0.22).min(h.need);\\n            (h.x + dirx * along, h.z + dirz * along)\\n        }\\n        K_TUMOR if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            let ang = h.work + 0.28;\\n            (h.x + ang.cos() * (h.radius * 0.75), h.z + ang.sin() * (h.radius * 0.75))\\n        }\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER | K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 || h.kind != K_BONE => {\\n            let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n            let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n            let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n            let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n            let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n            let across_x = -dirz;\\n            let across_z = dirx;\\n            let sign = if cursor_side >= 0.0 { -1.0 } else { 1.0 };\\n            (h.x + dirx * needle + across_x * 0.5 * sign, h.z + dirz * needle + across_z * 0.5 * sign)\\n        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_NODULE | K_EYE | K_EMBER | K_TUMOR if h.grabbed || h.tool == FORCEPS && h.kind != K_TUMOR => {\\n            if h.grabbed || h.work > 0.05 {\\n                let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n                let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n                (h.grab_x + dirx * (h.need + 0.15), h.grab_z + dirz * (h.need + 0.15))\\n            } else {\\n                (h.x, h.z)\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => (h.x, h.z),\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":642}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"0afcd9e6-e86e-4c6b-b241-14f14c00f8f9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_793","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A concrete player-path bug has been identified.\n\nCryoprobe and Dressing are mapped to tool digits 8 and 9. The 8-way ring and tray only cycle tools 0 through 7. A human on a pad cannot select these tools at all.\n\nKeyboard input via digits 9 and 0 bypasses the ring control table entirely. Cases 2, 5, and 7 all require Cryoprobe or Dressing to clear phases or kill embers. Without these tools selected, the game cannot progress.\n\nThe bot bypasses this by directly injecting tool IDs into SurgeonInput, which lets tests pass. This contradicts PLAN.md line 689, which requires every case to be finishable with a pad or mouse. Acceptance criterion 2 also mandates eight-way tool selection without menus.\n\nThe word \"contextual\" in the acceptance criteria means these tools should appear automatically when needed. They are implemented as tools but remain hidden from the pad input path. A concrete reproduction is now clear: on a DualSense pad, flicking the stick in all eight directions and cycling L1/R1 during case 5 should make Cryoprobe selectable, yet it is not.\n\nThe simulation hands() function passes the raw input tool index through without remapping it to a contextual tool. This confirms the bug is not a missing auto-swap logic, but a hard boundary where the pad input path cannot reach tools 8 and 9. Defibrillator works because it triggers via L2+R2 rather than direct selection.\n\nThe hush time scale is implemented correctly. The world ticks at 30% speed during hush while the cursor remains real-time.\n\nA secondary co-op gap exists: gift_edge only processes slot 0, so local co-op gifts are ignored for other players.\n\nCase identity is swapped. Dies Irae belongs in case 6. Case 6 is a filler without strain. Echo unlocks in case 4 instead of case 5. Bone appears in case 2. The mechanics exist in the simulation but the campaign structure diverges from PLAN.md.\n\nThe partner bot is correctly spawned in case 7 when the second slot is inactive.\n\nLocal pad support for multiple players is unverified; no evidence of a bug exists yet.\n\nA possible rendering bug was spotted: `hub_quiet` may skip the operative mesh on the first hub frame, which could leave the hub game invisible.\n\nIV cooldown is 8 seconds instead of the planned 4. This is minor and not a core bug.\n\nThe score system makes rank trivial. The par stays at 900 while the balance sheet suggests 3624. The timer bonus is large enough that any quick win yields an ENCORE rank. PLAN 11.2 requires setting par from bot runs, but the suggested value is never applied.\n\nThe unapplied suggested par is not a refutation. The acceptance criterion only requires ranks to exist and for bot skill 1.0 to win at S or above. The evidence step also states that balance issues do not override a green suite.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cb7a57fa-a1bb-4d6f-b0f2-dd38c12f39d0-56","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn octant|tools_from_hands|tray_tool|hub_quiet","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cb7a57fa-a1bb-4d6f-b0f2-dd38c12f39d0-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hush_scale|tremor","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery","glob":"*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4882,"output_tokens":2060,"cache_read_input_tokens":115712,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"6601afeb-b0c4-4fe7-afd8-49514abf5db8"}
