2,97,115,115,101,114,116,95,101,113,33,40,115,46,112,114,111,109,112,116,40,34,117,115,101,34,41,44,32,34,82,50,34,41,59,10,56,50,49,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,97,115,115,101,114,116,95,101,113,33,40,115,46,112,114,111,109,112,116,40,34,99,111,110,102,105,114,109,34,41,44,32,34,65,34,41,59,10,56,50,50,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,97,115,115,101,114,116,95,101,113,33,40,115,46,112,114,111,109,112,116,40,34,98,97,99,107,34,41,44,32,34,66,34,41,59,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":18,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/surgery/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":200,\"content\":\"    pub fn prompt(&self, action: &str) -> &'static str {\"},{\"line_number\":259,\"content\":\"    pub fn lines(&self) -> Vec<String> {\"},{\"line_number\":265,\"content\":\"                v.push(format!(\\\"Press {} \\\", self.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\")));\"},{\"line_number\":311,\"content\":\"                v.push(format!(\\\"Aim   right stick or mouse   {}\\\", self.prompt(\\\"use\\\")));\"},{\"line_number\":313,\"content\":\"                v.push(format!(\\\"Operate   {}\\\", self.prompt(\\\"use\\\")));\"},{\"line_number\":314,\"content\":\"                v.push(format!(\\\"Gift   {}\\\", self.prompt(\\\"gift\\\")));\"},{\"line_number\":315,\"content\":\"                v.push(format!(\\\"Chart   {}\\\", self.prompt(\\\"chart\\\")));\"},{\"line_number\":338,\"content\":\"                v.push(format!(\\\"Press {}\\\", self.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\")));\"},{\"line_number\":350,\"content\":\"                v.push(format!(\\\"{} ready\\\", self.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\")));\"},{\"line_number\":355,\"content\":\"                v.push(format!(\\\"{} begin\\\", self.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\")));\"},{\"line_number\":711,\"content\":\"                    ui.label(egui::RichText::new(format!(\\\"{}  begin\\\", shell.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\"))).size(32.0));\"},{\"line_number\":724,\"content\":\"                ui.label(egui::RichText::new(format!(\\\"{}  advance\\\", shell.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\"))).size(30.0));\"},{\"line_number\":813,\"content\":\"        assert_eq!(s.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\"), \\\"Enter\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":816,\"content\":\"        assert_eq!(s.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\"), \\\"Enter\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":818,\"content\":\"        assert_eq!(s.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\"), \\\"Cross\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":819,\"content\":\"        assert_eq!(s.prompt(\\\"use\\\"), \\\"R2\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":821,\"content\":\"        assert_eq!(s.prompt(\\\"confirm\\\"), \\\"A\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":822,\"content\":\"        assert_eq!(s.prompt(\\\"back\\\"), \\\"B\\\");\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"751fb97f-3a34-4bee-8fcb-933f53486f43"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_797","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The UI contains no references to Cryoprobe or Dressing selection.\n\nThe shell does not instruct the player on how to pick Cryoprobe or Dressing. The hub blank field is a second bug. The operation HUD still shows vitals, but the 3D field is empty. A blind game cannot be aimed. The hub harness passes with synthetic input and status, so the game remains blind.\n\nThe hub's quiet flag also silences the title screen. The pre-op card might still render because it uses egui, but the 3D background disappears. The round itself is blind. The hub visual is a client mirror; its snapshot code drops geometry.\n\nThis is a real defect, not a nit. The static fallback does not excuse a primary flow with no reachable completion. Surgery without a visible field is broken for online mode.\n\n`select()` may pick the nearest hazard even when it does not accept the current tool. `apply()` then no-ops on that mismatched target, leaving focus stuck on the wrong hazard. The wrong-tool check only triggers when `hit.engaged` is false.\n\nSuture on stage 0 bone is a separate issue. Laser overheat kills polyps by setting `h.alive = false`, which clears them as done with a sloppy rating. The plan specifies that overheating creates a burn, not that the polyp vanishes.\n\nThe `overheat_is_sloppy` test only verifies the SLOPPY rating. It does not check that a burn hazard spawns. The plan requires a burn to appear on overheating, so this gap is a missing misuse consequence.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5f700da7-41e9-4c0a-9f46-3cbb950a5266-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"misuse|K_BURN|spawn_kind","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery","glob":"*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2808,"output_tokens":911,"cache_read_input_tokens":126592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"d14134fd-8a04-4e90-950a-d102fbf525ba"}
