me/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1,\"content\":\"# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\"},{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"Title picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\"},{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\"`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\"},{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\"- 10-foot shell: title, campaign, case files, pause, settings, about, attract, touch-only gate, Dev Mode sliders and Reset All. Music bus default 0.10. Synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices.\"},{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\"- Two file:// launches: title Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion, music 0.10, canvas 1920×1080, no page errors, DualSense Cross opens the menu the same way both times.\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"- 1920×1080 shots: title, story, operation, results, dev, about. Results is Anton Deverell, The First Movement, score 3616, rank ENCORE, after Dev Mode “Bot plays” on the packed page.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"90bd2eac-09ab-42ec-9b20-d516aab1d600"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_801","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Title RNG is recorded. Now writing the verdict files.\n\nTwo bugs identified. Cryoprobe and Dressing are unreachable via documented controls. SurgeonInput.tool is set directly in bot tests so they pass. The first-frame hub_quiet flag suppresses all plate, instrument, hazard, and cursor rendering. Online play is blind.\n\nThe findings will be split into three items. Two bugs are at product.rs:269 and tray_tool:692, plus surgery/mod.rs:14 and product.rs:514. A test gap is missing for cryo and dressing input mapping; surgery.rs currently injects tool IDs directly. The hub_quiet flag should keep a reduced mesh, and a headless unit test must assert that emit still pushes plate and hazards when quiet is true.\n\nThe stall is caused by software GPU rendering the full mesh inside an iframe. A reduced mesh is still verifiable in local file:// launches. The quiet path already disables shadows, but emit returns before that state is applied, so the full mesh never exists.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The sim suite stays green because the bot injects tool ids, but the pad and the hub view never reach Cryoprobe, Dressing, or the operative field. I'll record that as a refute."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92c6562c-64d4-4962-8956-1d2d84f7f629-71","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/goal-verdict-907ccca5ce3b-1-0.json","new_string":"{\n  \"refuted\": true,\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"bug\",\n      \"location\": \"engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs:269\",\n      \"detail\": \"8-way stick, L1/R1, wheel, and tray_tool (product.rs:692) only emit tools 0–7. Cryoprobe (8) and Dressing (9) are never selected, and nothing auto-swaps them in. A pad cannot clear case 2’s dressing, case 5’s embers (hazard.rs accepts only CRYO), or case 7’s embers and dressing. Digit9/0 are not on the control table and a pad has no equivalent.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"gap\",\n      \"location\": \"engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs:64\",\n      \"detail\": \"Bot tests write SurgeonInput.tool directly, so they stay green while the player path cannot pick Cryoprobe or Dressing. Add a test that drives the shipped mapping (octant, cycle, tray, and the contextual swap) from a fresh case and asserts an ember and a dressing actually clear.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"bug\",\n      \"location\": \"engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs:14\",\n      \"detail\": \"Hub sets hub_quiet and boot_hub_round(..., true) (product.rs:502 and :514). emit() then returns before plate, instruments, hazards, or cursors, and the egui shell does not draw the field either. Shared Code Blue and the client mirror are a blank scene; status JSON still updates, which is why the harness passed.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": \"product.rs tools stay in 0..8 and tray_tool loops 0..8; hazard.rs ember tool is CRYO and dressing requires DRESSING; emit() returns on op.quiet while boot_hub_round is called with quiet=true. suite.txt is 14 passed but never drives that input path.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"See the skeptic markdown. Two shipped defects: contextual Cryoprobe and Dressing are unreachable on a pad, and hub rounds draw no operative field.\"\n}\n","old_string":""}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92c6562c-64d4-4962-8956-1d2d84f7f629-72","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/goal-classifier-907ccca5ce3b-1-skeptic-0.md","new_string":"# Refuted\n\nThe packed page, exit interview, file:// launches, and the 14-test suite are real. The suite does not catch two defects that make documented play impossible.\n\n## Cryoprobe and Dressing cannot be selected\n\n`tools_from_hands` in `engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs` only cycles and flicks tools `0..8` (`% 8` at lines 269, 272, and 289). `octant` returns `0..8`. `tray_tool` (line 692) only hits slots `0..8`. There is no case-based swap of Laser or Scanner to Cryoprobe, and Dressing is never auto-selected.\n\n`tool_for_kind` assigns ember stage 0 to Cryoprobe (`kinds.rs`) and a closure to Dressing. `Hazard::accepts` requires that exact tool (`hazard.rs`). Cases that need them:\n\n- Case 2 phase B spawns `K_DRESSING` (`content.rs` `C2_B`).\n- Case 5 (Dies Irae) is five embers.\n- Case 7 spawns embers and ends on `K_DRESSING`.\n\nExpected: a pad flick or the contextual rule selects Cryoprobe and Dressing, and those hazards clear. Actual: the tool index stays in `0..8`, `apply` no-ops, and the phase never clears. Defibrillator is fine (L2+R2 sets `surg::DEFIB` without tool 10). Digit `9` / `0` / `-` can set tools 8–10, but those keys are not in the control table and a pad has no equivalent.\n\n`tests/surgery.rs` `skill1_bot_wins_every_case_…` stays green because `bot::decide` writes `SurgeonInput.tool` itself. That is not the player path. Add a test that calls the shipped mapping (octant, L1/R1, tray, and the contextual swap) from a fresh case and asserts an ember and a dressing clear.\n\n## Hub Code Blue draws nothing\n\n`pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs:14` returns immediately when `op.quiet`, so plate, instruments, hazards, and cursors are never emitted. `product.rs:502` sets `hub_quiet = true` on the first hub frame, and `product.rs:514` boots the round with `boot_hub_round(..., true)`. `boot_mirror` also forces `hub_quiet`. The egui shell only draws vitals, timer, and callouts — not the field.\n\nExpected: host and client show the operative field, wounds, and that seat’s cursor. Actual: a blank clear color for the whole shared round. `hub.txt` only checks `__hubCheck.pass`, cursor numbers, and vitals, so a blind round still passes. Shadows are already disabled in `apply_look` when quiet; the mesh must still be drawn (a coarser plate is fine if the 420×240 mesh stalls an iframe). Do not leave `emit` as a no-op.\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":575,"output_tokens":2289,"cache_read_input_tokens":137216,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"c4d0a7de-8a6b-48f5-9c3b-fdbd17f2e9f3"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-92c6562c-64d4-4962-8956-1d2d84f7f629-71","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": true,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs:269\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"8-way stick, L1/R1, wheel, and tray_tool (product.rs:692) only emit tools 0–7. Cryoprobe (8) and Dressing (9) are never selected, and nothing auto-swaps them in. A pad cannot clear case 2’s dressing, case 5’s embers (hazard.rs accepts only CRYO), or case 7’s embers and dressing. Digit9/0 are not on the control table and a pad has no equivalent.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"gap\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs:64\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Bot tests write SurgeonInput.tool directly, so they stay green while the player path cannot pick Cryoprobe or Dressing. Add a test that drives the shipped mapping (octant, cycle, tray, and the contextual swap) from a fresh case and asserts an ember and a dressing actually clear.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs:14\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Hub sets hub_quiet and boot_hub_round(..., true) (product.rs:502 and :514). emit() then returns before plate, instruments, hazards, or cursors, and the egui shell does not draw the field either. Shared Code Blue and the client mirror are a blank scene; status JSON still updates, which is why the harness passed.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"product.rs tools stay in 0..8 and tray_tool loops 0..8; hazard.rs ember tool is CRYO and dressing requires DRESSING; emit() returns on op.quiet while boot_hub_round is called with quiet=true. suite.txt is 14 passed but never drives that input path.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"See the skeptic markdown. Two shipped defects: contextual Cryoprobe and Dressing are unreachable on a pad, and hub rounds draw no operative field.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/goal-verdict-907ccca5ce3b-1-0.json has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/goal-verdict-907ccca5ce3b-1-0.json has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/goal-verdict-907ccca5ce3b-1-0.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": true,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs:269\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"8-way stick, L1/R1, wheel, and tray_tool (product.rs:692) only emit tools 0–7. Cryoprobe (8) and Dressing (9) are never selected, and nothing auto-swaps them in. A pad cannot clear case 2’s dressing, case 5’s embers (hazard.rs accepts only CRYO), or case 7’s embers and dressing. Digit9/0 are not on the control table and a pad has no equivalent.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"gap\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs:64\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Bot tests write SurgeonInput.tool directly, so they stay green while the player path cannot pick Cryoprobe or Dressing. Add a test that drives the shipped mapping (octant, cycle, tray, and the contextual swap) from a fresh case and asserts an ember and a dressing actually clear.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs:14\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Hub sets hub_quiet and boot_hub_round(..., true) (product.rs:502 and :514). emit() then returns before plate, instruments, hazards, or cursors, and the egui shell does not draw the field either. Shared Code Blue and the client mirror are a blank scene; status JSON still updates, which is why the harness passed.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"product.rs tools stay in 0..8 and tray_tool loops 0..8; hazard.rs ember tool is CRYO and dressing requires DRESSING; emit() returns on op.quiet while boot_hub_round is called with quiet=true. suite.txt is 14 passed but never drives that input path.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"See the skeptic markdown. Two shipped defects: contextual Cryoprobe and Dressing are unreachable on a pad, and hub rounds draw no operative field.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-92c6562c-64d4-4962-8956-1d2d84f7f629-72","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"# Refuted\\n\\nThe packed page, exit interview, file:// launches, and the 14-test suite are real. The suite does not catch two defects that make documented play impossible.\\n\\n## Cryoprobe and Dressing cannot be selected\\n\\n`tools_from_hands` in `engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs` only cycles and flicks tools `0..8` (`% 8` at lines 269, 272, and 289). `octant` returns `0..8`. `tray_tool` (line 692) only hits slots `0..8`. There is no case-based swap of Laser or Scanner to Cryoprobe, and Dressing is never auto-selected.\\n\\n`tool_for_kind` assigns ember stage 0 to Cryoprobe (`kinds.rs`) and a closure to Dressing. `Hazard::accepts` requires that exact tool (`hazard.rs`). Cases that need them:\\n\\n- Case 2 phase B spawns `K_DRESSING` (`content.rs` `C2_B`).\\n- Case 5 (Dies Irae) is five embers.\\n- Case 7 spawns embers and ends on `K_DRESSING`.\\n\\nExpected: a pad flick or the contextual rule selects Cryoprobe and Dressing, and those hazards clear. Actual: the tool index stays in `0..8`, `apply` no-ops, and the phase never clears. Defibrillator is fine (L2+R2 sets `surg::DEFIB` without tool 10). Digit `9` / `0` / `-` can set tools 8–10, but those keys are not in the control table and a pad has no equivalent.\\n\\n`tests/surgery.rs` `skill1_bot_wins_every_case_…` stays green because `bot::decide` writes `SurgeonInput.tool` itself. That is not the player path. Add a test that calls the shipped mapping (octant, L1/R1, tray, and the contextual swap) from a fresh case and asserts an ember and a dressing clear.\\n\\n## Hub Code Blue draws nothing\\n\\n`pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs:14` returns immediately when `op.quiet`, so plate, instruments, hazards, and cursors are never emitted. `product.rs:502` sets `hub_quiet = true` on the first hub frame, and `product.rs:514` boots the round with `boot_hub_round(..., true)`. `boot_mirror` also forces `hub_quiet`. The egui shell only draws vitals, timer, and callouts — not the field.\\n\\nExpected: host and client show the operative field, wounds, and that seat’s cursor. Actual: a blank clear color for the whole shared round. `hub.txt` only checks `__hubCheck.pass`, cursor numbers, and vitals, so a blind round still passes. Shadows are already disabled in `apply_look` when quiet; the mesh must still be drawn (a coarser plate is fine if the 420×240 mesh stalls an iframe). Do not leave `emit` as a no-op.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/goal-classifier-907ccca5ce3b-1-skeptic-0.md has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/goal-classifier-907ccca5ce3b-1-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/goal-classifier-907ccca5ce3b-1-skeptic-0.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Refuted\\n\\nThe packed page, exit interview, file:// launches, and the 14-test suite are real. The suite does not catch two defects that make documented play impossible.\\n\\n## Cryoprobe and Dressing cannot be selected\\n\\n`tools_from_hands` in `engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs` only cycles and flicks tools `0..8` (`% 8` at lines 269, 272, and 289). `octant` returns `0..8`. `tray_tool` (line 692) only hits slots `0..8`. There is no case-based swap of Laser or Scanner to Cryoprobe, and Dressing is never auto-selected.\\n\\n`tool_for_kind` assigns ember stage 0 to Cryoprobe (`kinds.rs`) and a closure to Dressing. `Hazard::accepts` requires that exact tool (`hazard.rs`). Cases that need them:\\n\\n- Case 2 phase B spawns `K_DRESSING` (`content.rs` `C2_B`).\\n- Case 5 (Dies Irae) is five embers.\\n- Case 7 spawns embers and ends on `K_DRESSING`.\\n\\nExpected: a pad flick or the contextual rule selects Cryoprobe and Dressing, and those hazards clear. Actual: the tool index stays in `0..8`, `apply` no-ops, and the phase never clears. Defibrillator is fine (L2+R2 sets `surg::DEFIB` without tool 10). Digit `9` / `0` / `-` can set tools 8–10, but those keys are not in the control table and a pad has no equivalent.\\n\\n`tests/surgery.rs` `skill1_bot_wins_every_case_…` stays green because `bot::decide` writes `SurgeonInput.tool` itself. That is not the player path. Add a test that calls the shipped mapping (octant, L1/R1, tray, and the contextual swap) from a fresh case and asserts an ember and a dressing clear.\\n\\n## Hub Code Blue draws nothing\\n\\n`pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs:14` returns immediately when `op.quiet`, so plate, instruments, hazards, and cursors are never emitted. `product.rs:502` sets `hub_quiet = true` on the first hub frame, and `product.rs:514` boots the round with `boot_hub_round(..., true)`. `boot_mirror` also forces `hub_quiet`. The egui shell only draws vitals, timer, and callouts — not the field.\\n\\nExpected: host and client show the operative field, wounds, and that seat’s cursor. Actual: a blank clear color for the whole shared round. `hub.txt` only checks `__hubCheck.pass`, cursor numbers, and vitals, so a blind round still passes. Shadows are already disabled in `apply_look` when quiet; the mesh must still be drawn (a coarser plate is fine if the 420×240 mesh stalls an iframe). Do not leave `emit` as a no-op.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"cc67d86e-7a60-4c6d-9844-342cb3d478bb"}
