{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_803","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions to complete the remaining tasks.\n\nThe evaluator flagged two gaps. Tool selection is limited to 0–7, so Cryoprobe and Dressing are unreachable. Bot tests write SurgeonInput.tool directly, masking this bug.\n\nA new test will verify that the full tool mapping clears both an ember and a dressing from a fresh case.\n\nThe hub also skips drawing the field when `hub_quiet` is set, so the egui shell renders a blank scene. The status JSON still updates, which is why the harness passed despite the empty display.\n\nThe skeptic panel's bug flags take priority over the verification hand-in step. I will fix the tool selection and blank hub rendering issues first.\n\nThe hub_quiet flag skips the plate to prevent iframe stalls. The field must still be drawn without stalling. I will add a contextual swap so pads can select Cryoprobe and Dressing.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The panel rejected the hand-in: a pad cannot select Cryoprobe or Dressing, the tests never drive that mapping, and a hub round draws a blank field. I’ll fix those three on the shipped path."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-016be0ff-6cac-4918-abc7-365115bf2b0c-118","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"12","content":"Let the shipped pad/mouse mapping select Cryoprobe and Dressing and clear an ember and a dressing","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"13","content":"Draw the hub operative field instead of returning before the plate","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-016be0ff-6cac-4918-abc7-365115bf2b0c-119","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tray_tool|octant|CRYO|DRESS|tool.*0\\.\\.7|L1|R1|cycle","glob":"**/*.{rs}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-016be0ff-6cac-4918-abc7-365115bf2b0c-120","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn emit|quiet|hub_quiet","glob":"**/surgery/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-016be0ff-6cac-4918-abc7-365115bf2b0c-121","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"control table|Cryoprobe|Dressing|1–8|octant|L1|R1","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":127236,"output_tokens":1105,"cache_read_input_tokens":50432,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"27c387bf-70fb-4eec-a04d-738ce7816b06"}
