se: hold and draw along the closure | Coverage | None |\"},{\"line_number\":250,\"content\":\"| 0 | Barbs | Mara | Forearm | Cursor, ring, Gel, Forceps, Suction, Suture, Dressing, ratings (guided) | 4:00 | 3 min |\"},{\"line_number\":256,\"content\":\"| 6 | Dies Irae | Pet | Pericardium | Cryoprobe, Fever, heat rings | 7:00 | 6 min |\"},{\"line_number\":280,\"content\":\"the tissue and lose your chain. Count-in and \\\"Lift off!\\\", a rhythm dodge. Cryoprobe an ember, Scalpel to\"},{\"line_number\":288,\"content\":\"the pulse. Close with the Dressing. Teddy and Pet call it, since Bashir is the patient.\"},{\"line_number\":309,\"content\":\"drawn as vector shapes (× ○ □ △ in their colours, L1 R1 L2 R2, Options, sticks, D-pad), or Xbox A B X Y and\"},{\"line_number\":323,\"content\":\"**Settings** (three pages, L1/R1 or tabs, each short).\"},{\"line_number\":670,\"content\":\"5. **Strains and gifts.** Introit and Hush, Lacrimosa, Echo and tremor, bone reassembly, Dies Irae and Cryoprobe, Libera Me and Duet. Cases 3–7 with their stories.\"},{\"line_number\":686,\"content\":\"interview shape exactly and check it parses. Suggested catalogue values (name and tagline are yours): type `Game`; genre `Simulation`; source as your TASK.md's; series `Trauma Center`; players `1–4`; controls such as \\\"Right stick or mouse aims, R2 or left click operates, left stick or 1–8 picks tools\\\"; tags from `3d, story, co-op,\"},{\"line_number\":798,\"content\":\"Standard mapping: 0 Cross, 1 Circle, 2 Square, 3 Triangle, 4 L1, 5 R1, 6 L2, 7 R2, 8 Create, 9 Options, 10 L3, 11 R3, 12–15 D-pad, 16 PS; axes 0–1 left stick, 2–3 right. Set `value` as well as `pressed` for triggers. Add a second pad at index 1 for co-op.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"bae5c3b2-3d04-44ce-a97f-b74daf4e52fa"}
