{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_816","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The PLAN.md file indicates a Laser (Cryoprobe in Case 6) is down.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-38f2b147-94d8-4b9b-becc-3f9d698c86fa-19","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md","offset":230,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-38f2b147-94d8-4b9b-becc-3f9d698c86fa-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","offset":300,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-38f2b147-94d8-4b9b-becc-3f9d698c86fa-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":1,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-38f2b147-94d8-4b9b-becc-3f9d698c86fa-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ROT_L|fn incision|K_TETHER|K_BONE","glob":"**/games/surgery/**/*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6356,"output_tokens":1040,"cache_read_input_tokens":59904,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"945cdba0-00c6-4c75-9d8a-ce84f33f4475"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-38f2b147-94d8-4b9b-becc-3f9d698c86fa-19","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"230→- **The Hush (Mara).** The world runs at 30% for 6 heartbeats while your cursor stays real-time. Sound\\n  falls to one heartbeat and a sustained note; colour drains from everything but the tissue. Each\\n  on-beat action during the Hush adds a heartbeat, so a skilled player can stay in the pocket.\\n- **The Echo (Pet).** For 10 s, a luminous ghost of her younger hands copies your technique: each action\\n  you finish is repeated at once on the next valid target for that tool, at the same rating. It is a\\n  bot-driven surgeon slot restricted to your last tool. Her tremor (a slow cursor wander of about\\n  0.12 u, off in Precision, off during the Echo, and off via a Setting) disappears while it runs, and\\n  a line of dialogue acknowledges that.\\n- **The Duet (Case 7).** A shared meter fires both at once, the game's catharsis. In co-op each player\\n  has their own gift.\\n240→\\n### 3.8 Difficulty\\nResident, Attending, Chief: a set of multipliers on drains, timer and strain speed, plus Code count.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. The cases\\n\\n| # | Case | Surgeon | Plate(s) | New in this case | Timer | Target length |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n250→| 0 | Barbs | Mara | Forearm | Cursor, ring, Gel, Forceps, Suction, Suture, Dressing, ratings (guided) | 4:00 | 3 min |\\n| 1 | Routine | Mara | Abdomen skin → bowel | Scalpel, Laser, IV Push, a complication | 4:30 | 4 min |\\n| 2 | Shrapnel Night | Mara | Chest skin → lung and rib | Scanner, hidden objects, scripted Code | 5:00 | 5 min |\\n| 3 | Something Moved | Mara | Liver | Tumor, Introit, the Hush | 6:00 | 6 min |\\n| 4 | The Night Ward | Mara | Lung | Lacrimosa, no guidance | 6:00 | 6 min |\\n| 5 | Second Opinion | Pet | Femur | Bone reassembly, tremor, the Echo | 6:00 | 5 min |\\n| 6 | Dies Irae | Pet | Pericardium | Cryoprobe, Fever, heat rings | 7:00 | 6 min |\\n| 7 | Libera Me | Mara + Pet | Beating heart | Everything, the partner, the Duet | 9:00 | 8 min |\\n| – | Code Blue | 1–4 surgeons | Torso | Escalating triage, the co-op and hub round | 4:00 | 4 min |\\n\\n260→With story that is about an hour. A test must prove every tool, hazard, strain, gift and the Code are\\nexercised by the campaign (§11.2).\\n\\n**Strain scripts** (each is a state machine in code; its numbers are in the case's data)\\n\\n**Introit, 3/4.** A violet nodule moves under the tissue, seen as a bump. Every 3 beats it steps\\nsomewhere new (a ripple telegraphs on beat 2) and leaves a laceration or pool behind. Scanner lights it\\nup; Laser it at rest until the shell pops; Forceps pull it within 2 beats. First kill: it splits in two\\n(60% heat each). Then four small quick ones on 2-beat steps. Last, an \\\"Amen\\\": they merge into a large\\none held by 3 tethers (Scalpel), then Laser, then Forceps. The Hush wakes when vitals fall under 35 or\\n270→at the second split, whichever is first: the meter fills, Bashir says \\\"Doctor... your hands,\\\" and the\\nprompt appears.\\n\\n**Lacrimosa, 6/8.** A crown on the lung with 6 teardrop sacs on stems. Sacs swell for 8–12 beats and\\nburst at full size into caustic pools (heavy drain, burns). Laser a stem (0.6 s) to drop a sac whole, or\\nSuction it slowly for a lower rating. When a wave is cleared, the crown's eye opens for 4 beats: Scalpel\\nacross it, twice. Three waves, each faster. Last, tear out the eye with Forceps and Gel the bed.\\n\\n**Dies Irae, 5/4.** A Fever meter fills (over 100: −6 vitals/s). Five embers around the pericardium heat\\nthe tissue. Each 5th beat a heat ring sweeps the field: if your trigger is held as it crosses, you scorch\",\"content_concise\":\"230→- **The Hush (Mara).** The world runs at 30% for 6 heartbeats while your cursor stays real-time. Sound\\n  falls to one heartbeat and a sustained note; colour drains from everything but the tissue. Each\\n  on-beat action during the Hush adds a heartbeat, so a skilled player can stay in the pocket.\\n- **The Echo (Pet).** For 10 s, a luminous ghost of her younger hands copies your technique: each action\\n  you finish is repeated at once on the next valid target for that tool, at the same rating. It is a\\n  bot-driven surgeon slot restricted to your last tool. Her tremor (a slow cursor wander of about\\n  0.12 u, off in Precision, off during the Echo, and off via a Setting) disappears while it runs, and\\n  a line of dialogue acknowledges that.\\n- **The Duet (Case 7).** A shared meter fires both at once, the game's catharsis. In co-op each player\\n  has their own gift.\\n240→\\n### 3.8 Difficulty\\nResident, Attending, Chief: a set of multipliers on drains, timer and strain speed, plus Code count.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. The cases\\n\\n| # | Case | Surgeon | Plate(s) | New in this case | Timer | Target length |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n250→| 0 | Barbs | Mara | Forearm | Cursor, ring, Gel, Forceps, Suction, Suture, Dressing, ratings (guided) | 4:00 | 3 min |\\n| 1 | Routine | Mara | Abdomen skin → bowel | Scalpel, Laser, IV Push, a complication | 4:30 | 4 min |\\n| 2 | Shrapnel Night | Mara | Chest skin → lung and rib | Scanner, hidden objects, scripted Code | 5:00 | 5 min |\\n| 3 | Something Moved | Mara | Liver | Tumor, Introit, the Hush | 6:00 | 6 min |\\n| 4 | The Night Ward | Mara | Lung | Lacrimosa, no guidance | 6:00 | 6 min |\\n| 5 | Second Opinion | Pet | Femur | Bone reassembly, tremor, the Echo | 6:00 | 5 min |\\n| 6 | Dies Irae | Pet | Pericardium | Cryoprobe, Fever, heat rings | 7:00 | 6 min |\\n| 7 | Libera Me | Mara + Pet | Beating heart | Everything, the partner, the Duet | 9:00 | 8 min |\\n| – | Code Blue | 1–4 surgeons | Torso | Escalating triage, the co-op and hub round | 4:00 | 4 min |\\n\\n260→With story that is about an hour. A test must prove every tool, hazard, strain, gift and the Code are\\nexercised by the campaign (§11.2).\\n\\n**Strain scripts** (each is a state machine in code; its numbers are in the case's data)\\n\\n**Introit, 3/4.** A violet nodule moves under the tissue, seen as a bump. Every 3 beats it steps\\nsomewhere new (a ripple telegraphs on beat 2) and leaves a laceration or pool behind. Scanner lights it\\nup; Laser it at rest until the shell pops; Forceps pull it within 2 beats. First kill: it splits in two\\n(60% heat each). Then four small quick ones on 2-beat steps. Last, an \\\"Amen\\\": they merge into a large\\none held by 3 tethers (Scalpel), then Laser, then Forceps. The Hush wakes when vitals fall under 35 or\\n270→at the second split, whichever is first: the meter fills, Bashir says \\\"Doctor... your hands,\\\" and the\\nprompt appears.\\n\\n**Lacrimosa, 6/8.** A crown on the lung with 6 teardrop sacs on stems. Sacs swell for 8–12 beats and\\nburst at full size into caustic pools (heavy drain, burns). Laser a stem (0.6 s) to drop a sac whole, or\\nSuction it slowly for a lower rating. When a wave is cleared, the crown's eye opens for 4 beats: Scalpel\\nacross it, twice. Three waves, each faster. Last, tear out the eye with Forceps and Gel the bed.\\n\\n**Dies Irae, 5/4.** A Fever meter fills (over 100: −6 vitals/s). Five embers around the pericardium heat\\nthe tissue. Each 5th beat a heat ring sweeps the field: if your trigger is held as it crosses, you scorch\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md\",\"offset\":230,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"- **The Hush (Mara).** The world runs at 30% for 6 heartbeats while your cursor stays real-time. Sound\\n  falls to one heartbeat and a sustained note; colour drains from everything but the tissue. Each\\n  on-beat action during the Hush adds a heartbeat, so a skilled player can stay in the pocket.\\n- **The Echo (Pet).** For 10 s, a luminous ghost of her younger hands copies your technique: each action\\n  you finish is repeated at once on the next valid target for that tool, at the same rating. It is a\\n  bot-driven surgeon slot restricted to your last tool. Her tremor (a slow cursor wander of about\\n  0.12 u, off in Precision, off during the Echo, and off via a Setting) disappears while it runs, and\\n  a line of dialogue acknowledges that.\\n- **The Duet (Case 7).** A shared meter fires both at once, the game's catharsis. In co-op each player\\n  has their own gift.\\n\\n### 3.8 Difficulty\\nResident, Attending, Chief: a set of multipliers on drains, timer and strain speed, plus Code count.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. The cases\\n\\n| # | Case | Surgeon | Plate(s) | New in this case | Timer | Target length |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| 0 | Barbs | Mara | Forearm | Cursor, ring, Gel, Forceps, Suction, Suture, Dressing, ratings (guided) | 4:00 | 3 min |\\n| 1 | Routine | Mara | Abdomen skin → bowel | Scalpel, Laser, IV Push, a complication | 4:30 | 4 min |\\n| 2 | Shrapnel Night | Mara | Chest skin → lung and rib | Scanner, hidden objects, scripted Code | 5:00 | 5 min |\\n| 3 | Something Moved | Mara | Liver | Tumor, Introit, the Hush | 6:00 | 6 min |\\n| 4 | The Night Ward | Mara | Lung | Lacrimosa, no guidance | 6:00 | 6 min |\\n| 5 | Second Opinion | Pet | Femur | Bone reassembly, tremor, the Echo | 6:00 | 5 min |\\n| 6 | Dies Irae | Pet | Pericardium | Cryoprobe, Fever, heat rings | 7:00 | 6 min |\\n| 7 | Libera Me | Mara + Pet | Beating heart | Everything, the partner, the Duet | 9:00 | 8 min |\\n| – | Code Blue | 1–4 surgeons | Torso | Escalating triage, the co-op and hub round | 4:00 | 4 min |\\n\\nWith story that is about an hour. A test must prove every tool, hazard, strain, gift and the Code are\\nexercised by the campaign (§11.2).\\n\\n**Strain scripts** (each is a state machine in code; its numbers are in the case's data)\\n\\n**Introit, 3/4.** A violet nodule moves under the tissue, seen as a bump. Every 3 beats it steps\\nsomewhere new (a ripple telegraphs on beat 2) and leaves a laceration or pool behind. Scanner lights it\\nup; Laser it at rest until the shell pops; Forceps pull it within 2 beats. First kill: it splits in two\\n(60% heat each). Then four small quick ones on 2-beat steps. Last, an \\\"Amen\\\": they merge into a large\\none held by 3 tethers (Scalpel), then Laser, then Forceps. The Hush wakes when vitals fall under 35 or\\nat the second split, whichever is first: the meter fills, Bashir says \\\"Doctor... your hands,\\\" and the\\nprompt appears.\\n\\n**Lacrimosa, 6/8.** A crown on the lung with 6 teardrop sacs on stems. Sacs swell for 8–12 beats and\\nburst at full size into caustic pools (heavy drain, burns). Laser a stem (0.6 s) to drop a sac whole, or\\nSuction it slowly for a lower rating. When a wave is cleared, the crown's eye opens for 4 beats: Scalpel\\nacross it, twice. Three waves, each faster. Last, tear out the eye with Forceps and Gel the bed.\\n\\n**Dies Irae, 5/4.** A Fever meter fills (over 100: −6 vitals/s). Five embers around the pericardium heat\\nthe tissue. Each 5th beat a heat ring sweeps the field: if your trigger is held as it crosses, you scorch\\n\",\"total_lines\":817}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-38f2b147-94d8-4b9b-becc-3f9d698c86fa-20","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"300→    }\\n}\\n\\nfn hands(g: &mut Surgery, slots: &[SurgeonInput; 4], rules: f32, dt: f32, tick: u64, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    for i in 0..4 {\\n        let mut inp = slots[i];\\n        if inp.held & surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE == 0 {\\n            if inp.held & surg::PRECISION != 0 {\\n                inp.aim *= 0.35;\\n            }\\n310→            inp.aim = assist_aim(g, g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z, g.surgeons[i].tool, inp.aim, dt);\\n        }\\n        let lead = i == 0;\\n        if !inp.active && !lead {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if lead {\\n            g.surgeons[0].active = true;\\n        }\\n        if inp.active {\\n320→            if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP {\\n                g.surgeons[i].tool = inp.tool.min(DEFIB);\\n            }\\n            steer(&mut g.surgeons[i], inp, dt, g.tune.cursor_speed);\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[i].x = g.surgeons[i].x.clamp(X_MIN, X_MAX);\\n        g.surgeons[i].z = g.surgeons[i].z.clamp(Z_MIN, Z_MAX);\\n        g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd = (g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.surgeons[i].iv_cd = (g.surgeons[i].iv_cd - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.surgeons[i].since_chain += dt;\\n330→\\n        let (mut x, mut z) = (g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z);\\n        let precise = inp.held & surg::PRECISION != 0;\\n        let echo = g.echo_left > 0.0;\\n        if i == 0 && !precise && !echo && g.tune.tremor > 0.0 {\\n            let w = 0.12 * g.tune.tremor;\\n            let t = tick as f32;\\n            x += (t * 0.73).sin() * w;\\n            z += (t * 0.51).cos() * w;\\n        }\\n340→        let use_held = inp.held & surg::USE != 0;\\n        let just_release = g.surgeons[i].was_use && !use_held;\\n        let tool = g.surgeons[i].tool;\\n        if g.heat_on && use_held && heat_hit(g.heat_angle, x, z) {\\n            g.heart.vitals = (g.heart.vitals - 8.0).max(0.0);\\n            g.surgeons[i].chain = 0;\\n            g.mistakes = g.mistakes.saturating_add(1);\\n            g.callout_i = 4;\\n            g.callout_t = 1.4;\\n            cue(events, CUE_STING, x, z, 0.7, 1.0);\\n350→        }\\n        let rot = if inp.held & surg::ROT_L != 0 {\\n            1\\n        } else if inp.held & surg::ROT_R != 0 {\\n            -1\\n        } else {\\n            0\\n        };\\n        let focus = g.surgeons[i].focus;\\n        let idx = select(&g.hazards, x, z, tool, focus, just_release, use_held);\\n360→        if let Some(idx) = idx {\\n            let id = g.hazards[idx].id;\\n            let before = g.hazards[idx].work;\\n            let was_hidden = g.hazards[idx].hidden;\\n            let mut hit = hazard::apply(\\n                &mut g.hazards[idx],\\n                x,\\n                z,\\n                tool,\\n                use_held,\\n370→                just_release,\\n                inp.pressure,\\n                rot,\\n                rules,\\n                g.tune.tool_power,\\n                g.heart.diastole() || g.duet_left > 0.0,\\n                g.tune.rating_strict,\\n            );\\n            if g.one_hit && hit.engaged && g.hazards[idx].accepts(tool) && tool != SCANNER {\\n                hit.done = true;\",\"content_concise\":\"300→    }\\n}\\n\\nfn hands(g: &mut Surgery, slots: &[SurgeonInput; 4], rules: f32, dt: f32, tick: u64, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\\n    for i in 0..4 {\\n        let mut inp = slots[i];\\n        if inp.held & surg::AIM_ABSOLUTE == 0 {\\n            if inp.held & surg::PRECISION != 0 {\\n                inp.aim *= 0.35;\\n            }\\n310→            inp.aim = assist_aim(g, g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z, g.surgeons[i].tool, inp.aim, dt);\\n        }\\n        let lead = i == 0;\\n        if !inp.active && !lead {\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        if lead {\\n            g.surgeons[0].active = true;\\n        }\\n        if inp.active {\\n320→            if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP {\\n                g.surgeons[i].tool = inp.tool.min(DEFIB);\\n            }\\n            steer(&mut g.surgeons[i], inp, dt, g.tune.cursor_speed);\\n        }\\n        g.surgeons[i].x = g.surgeons[i].x.clamp(X_MIN, X_MAX);\\n        g.surgeons[i].z = g.surgeons[i].z.clamp(Z_MIN, Z_MAX);\\n        g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd = (g.surgeons[i].wrong_cd - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.surgeons[i].iv_cd = (g.surgeons[i].iv_cd - dt).max(0.0);\\n        g.surgeons[i].since_chain += dt;\\n330→\\n        let (mut x, mut z) = (g.surgeons[i].x, g.surgeons[i].z);\\n        let precise = inp.held & surg::PRECISION != 0;\\n        let echo = g.echo_left > 0.0;\\n        if i == 0 && !precise && !echo && g.tune.tremor > 0.0 {\\n            let w = 0.12 * g