{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_818","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand how bone stage 1 suture and tether scalpel work before writing a test for case 2 phase A.\n\nThe test should assert both an ember and a dressing clear. Driving case 2 to phase B is acceptable if one scene cannot hold both at t=0. Bone stage 0 requires forceps while aux is above 12. The current focus is calculating how many ticks of ROT_L are needed to reduce aux from 38 to under 12, and whether rotation applies without the tool being forceps.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1dd8bfb-871f-407b-8f33-aaacbe61ec37-27","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn step\\(|const DT|dt =","glob":"**/pav_core/src/sim.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1dd8bfb-871f-407b-8f33-aaacbe61ec37-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"surgeons\\[0\\]|fn boot|x: 0","glob":"**/games/surgery/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1dd8bfb-871f-407b-8f33-aaacbe61ec37-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/hazard.rs","offset":230,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1dd8bfb-871f-407b-8f33-aaacbe61ec37-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs","offset":1,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1dd8bfb-871f-407b-8f33-aaacbe61ec37-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn plate|NX|quiet","glob":"**/pav_view/src/surgery/**/*.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6809,"output_tokens":908,"cache_read_input_tokens":70528,"cache_creation_input_to