{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_819","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking tick rate and select behavior to ensure the cursor stays close.\n\nPlanning a single comprehensive test that exercises octant, cycle, tray, and contextual_tool mapping. The test will assert an ember and a dressing clear.\n\nSettled on a three-stage ember sequence: octant down to laser, cycle to scalpel, then tray_tool at forceps. For the dressing clear, playing phase A with the same mapping is the honest path rather than skipping ahead. Now drafting a compact driver to clear bone and tether.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a399318-0b22-4c25-aabd-dd0b1acbbb7a-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/hazard.rs","offset":268,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a399318-0b22-4c25-aabd-dd0b1acbbb7a-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs","offset":1,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a399318-0b22-4c25-aabd-dd0b1acbbb7a-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tick_rate|TickRate|hz\\(","glob":"**/pav_core/src/**/*.rs","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a399318-0b22-4c25-aabd-dd0b1acbbb7a-35","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","offset":680,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":24