{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_827","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A comment claims the dedicated server draws nothing, but hub_quiet is also set on clients and hosts.\n\nThe skeptic wants the field drawn for shared Code Blue and the client mirror. The dedicated server runs the world without a local slot or drawing, so quiet=true may still skip rendering for performance. The skeptic notes that hub_quiet and boot_hub_round(true) cause emit() to return before drawing plates, instruments, hazards, or cursors, leaving those scenes blank.\n\nThe fix is to make emit() draw even when quiet. A cheap plate on the dedicated server is acceptable because it has no visible window, and the scene builder draws internally.\n\nThe server iframe must not stall. A 60 by 34 vertex grid is chosen for the cheap plate, yielding roughly 3900 triangles and keeping shadows off. A smaller flat quad with hazard SDFs is also an option.\n\nThe coarse plate satisfies the skeptic's requirement for a plate, instruments, hazards, and cursors. Comments in boot_mirror and product.rs will be updated to explain that the hub field uses a coarse mesh with no shadows so the iframe still paints. A deviation bullet will note the coarser mesh compared to the full 420-vertex plate. Next is writing the mapping module and a passing test.\n\nA test is being drafted to verify that the mapping clears an ember and a dressing. A helper function `mapped` will build input frames by deriving the tool from ring position, hazards, and contextual logic. The test will clear an ember first, then clear the Case 2 dressing with the same mapping.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fc5dcf0e-a3a8-4f05-a0b9-c572b3292e6e-61","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tool_power","glob":"**/games/surgery/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fc5dcf0e-a3a8-4f05-a0b9-c572b3292e6e-62","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","offset":740,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1503,"output_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":102272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"f1b2f1a6-aa45-4c66-acc9-8dc7e45918f1"}
