{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_837","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The case starts in M_OP. phase_ready remains false until the first tick of enter_phase.\n\nThe test reads hazard positions before stepping. The drive loop spawns hazards on the first step. The test must step once to spawn them.\n\nThe first read is empty because no step has run yet. An initial empty step is required to enter the phase before reading hazards.\n\nSurgeonInput defaults tool to 0, which is SCALPEL rather than TOOL_KEEP.\n\nThe lead surgeon is forced active even when the input is inactive. The tool is not updated and steering is skipped. The existing tool and position are retained.\n\nThe lead surgeon still applies the current tool at its position even when inactive. The default scalpel may therefore strike a bone or tether near the origin. Case 2's bone at 0.15, 0.15 could be targeted with the wrong tool.\n\nA far-away step with TOOL_KEEP and no use will settle the simulation. The lead surgeon stays inactive, so it cannot strike nearby hazards. TOOL_KEEP is 255, which avoids invalid tool values.\n\nThe first step enters the phase. The settle helper will use TOOL_KEEP to avoid tool changes. product.rs will import contextual_tool, cycle, octant, tray_tool, Surgery, SurgeryFrame, TITLE, and TOOL_KEEP from pav_core, and remove local copies of octant and tray_tool. surgery_frame will read current frame hazards before compose and resolve tools after compose.\n\nframes() before pump returns the last published frame. Skip if surgery is None.\n\nStick cursor uses op.cursors[i]. The shell sends ring tool while the cursor moves. The simulation swaps to it when the cursor arrives.\n\nMouse absolute aim uses the world point this frame. The shell swaps immediately. The simulation keeps CRYO.\n\nWhen mouse aim is absolute, contextual_tool uses the aim point instead of the old cursor.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-67b77094-d43b-46aa-8582-a79ca88d00f6-78","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pub surgery","glob":"**/pav_core/src/frame.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3681,"output_tokens":1291,"cache_read_input_tokens":125824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"c7c1fd4b-7ec7-4e62-adf8-a21d63f25508"}
