{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_847","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The mirror_predict code is missing a backtick.\n\nI need to capture the previous tick's frame from `app.host` before the pump step. This frame will be used for `resolve_hands` after hub mutations.\n\nThe `resolve_hands` call belongs after hub overwrites but before input is written and pump. I also need to update the `hub_quiet` comment. To avoid a dangling reference, I will bind the temporary Arc from `host.frames().1` to a local variable first.\n\nThe borrow on `host` is safe because `frames()` returns owned data. I will leave the existing `tool` assignment unchanged and only add the contextual tool resolution.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e61fc4e0-b501-42a8-b9a4-b79cfb625511-100","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","old_string":"        let s = &mut g.surgeons[i];\n        s.active = true;\n        if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP {\n            s.tool = inp.tool;\n        }\n        steer(s, *inp, dt, g.tune.cursor_speed);\n    }\n}","new_string":"        let s = &mut g.surgeons[i];\n        s.active = true;\n        if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP {\n            s.tool = inp.tool;\n        }\n        steer(s, *inp, dt, g.tune.cursor_speed);\n        let (tool, x, z) = (s.tool, s.x, s.z);\n        drop(s);\n        g.surgeons[i].tool = contextual_tool(tool, x, z, &g.hazards);\n    }\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e61fc4e0-b501-42a8-b9a4-b79cfb625511-101","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/