{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_867","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The mapping test passed. Next steps are being determined.\n\nThe plan is to run the hub drawing view test first, then the full suite. Pav_core should compile quickly since its target is warm, but pav_view will need a fresh build. Afterward I will pack the HTML, re-run hub tests and file:// launches, and delete cargo targets.\n\nThe monitor has already exited. I will mark todo 12 as completed and leave todo 13 in progress until the view test passes. Cargo is idle, so I can run the targeted view test now.\n\nI will run the full suite directly instead of a separate view test. The suite includes the hub drawing test, and the pav_core tests are already compiled so they will run quickly. The skill1 test is the main bottleneck at 340 seconds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5d96744b-1a57-465e-b546-3d3751f2132a-133","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"12","content":"Let the shipped pad/mouse mapping select Cryoprobe and Dressing and clear an ember and a dressing","status":"completed"},{"id":"13","content":"Draw the hub operative field instead of returning before the plate","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5d96744b-1a57-465e-b546-3d3751f2132a-134","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link && CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo test -p pav_view --lib surgery::tests::quiet_hub_draws_plate_instruments_hazards_and_cursors -- --test-threads=1 > /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/view-test.txt 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/gr