{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_873","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"View test passed. A warning about dropping a reference was noted.\n\nFixing the drop warning in pav_core ops.rs. Then running the full suite. Todo 13 is marked complete.\n\nThe full suite will run into suite.txt. It should take roughly 340 seconds with a warm target. The browser test will not overlap. Afterward, HTML will be packed, build targets deleted to free memory, and the hub queried four times. Two-page vitals will follow. file:// launches will occur if the pack changed.\n\nThe packed HTML must include the fixed skeptic gaps. Otherwise the panel launches outdated code. The hand-ins are in place. The full suite and fresh-case simulation must pass.\n\nThe hub harness must be re-run because the draw fix could stall the iframe. If the coarse plate stalls, it will be made cheaper. The four hub queries and two-page check must also be re-run on the new packed HTML.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The ember, the dressing, and the hub field all clear in the targeted tests. I’ll drop the reference warning, then run the full suite."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-62d749e2-fabf-4c7c-a60c-02f8c8298e8f-141","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs","old_string":"        let s = &mut g.surgeons[i];\n        s.active = true;\n        if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP {\n            s.tool = inp.tool;\n        }\n        steer(s, *inp, dt, g.tune.cursor_speed);\n        let (tool, x, z) = (s.tool, s.x, s.z);\n        drop(s);\n        g.surgeons[i].tool = contextual_tool(tool, x, z, &g.hazards);","new_string":"        let (tool, x, z) = {\n            let s = &mut g.surgeons[i];\n            s.active = true;\n            if inp.tool != TOOL_KEEP {\n                s.tool = inp.tool;\n            }\n            steer(s, *inp, dt, g.tune.cursor_speed);\n            (s.tool, s.x, s.z)\n        };\n        g.surgeons[i].tool = contextual_tool(tool, x, z, &g.hazards);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-62d749e2-fabf-4c7c-a60c-02f8c8298e8f-142","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"13","content":"Draw the hub operative field instead of returning before the plate","status":"completed"},{"id":"14","content":"Re-run the suite, pack the HTML, and re-check hub and file:// gates","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":590,"output_tokens":1163,"cache_read_input_tokens":187904,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"86a2c67b-6cbc-48c2-87e1-1bd49b74c47c"}
