{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_879","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 16 tests passed. The suite includes 14 original tests plus mapping and hub draw checks.\n\nPacking the HTML build now. Will delete targets before Chromium, then run hub tests and file:// launches. Updating PROGRESS.md next.\n\nThe packed HTML will be named with the scene and build metadata. A full WASM rebuild is expected since pav_core, pav_app, and pav_view changed. The pack command will run in the background and log to pack.txt.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ed75a707-5997-4f71-a147-76ee641aecd3-150","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/scripts/build-web.sh","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ed75a707-5997-4f71-a147-76ee641aecd3-151","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md","old_string":"- Suite re-run after the hub latch: `14 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Balance for skills 1.0, 0.7, 0.4, and 0 is in the scratch `balance.txt`.","new_string":"- Suite after the Cryoprobe, Dressing, and hub-field fixes: `16 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Balance for skills 1.0, 0.7, 0.4, and 0 is in the scratch `balance.txt`."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":254,"output_tokens":691,"cache_read_input_tokens":192896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"512ae258-bb49-49bc-b613-073a4fc5b877"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ed75a707-5997-4f71-a147-76ee641aecd3-150","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# Builds the browser version (WebAssembly + WebGPU). Output: target/web/{index.html,manifest.webmanifest,shardfall.js,shardfall_bg.wasm}\\n# Serve that folder over HTTP (e.g. `python3 -m http.server -d target/web`) and open it in Chrome or Edge.\\n# --single-file writes only target/web/<title>.html (shardfall.html): one page with the glue and gzipped wasm inside\\n#   that runs from file:// or any host (scripts/pack_single_html.py; also --title, --description, --theme-color,\\n#   --scene NAME for the start scene when the address names none, --out PATH).\\n# Needs: rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown\\n#        cargo install wasm-bindgen-cli --version <the wasm-bindgen version in Cargo.lock>\\nset -euo pipefail\\n10→caller=$PWD\\ncd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/..\\\"\\nsingle=false\\npack=()\\nwhile (($#)); do\\n\\tcase $1 in\\n\\t--single-file) single=true ;;\\n\\t--title | --description | --theme-color | --scene | --out)\\n\\t\\t(($# > 1)) || { echo \\\"build-web.sh: $1 needs a value\\\" >&2; exit 2; }\\n\\t\\tvalue=$2\\n20→\\t\\t[[ $1 == --out && $value != /* ]] && value=$caller/$value\\n\\t\\tpack+=(\\\"$1\\\" \\\"$value\\\")\\n\\t\\tshift\\n\\t\\t;;\\n\\t*) echo \\\"build-web.sh: unknown option $1 (options are listed at the top of $0)\\\" >&2; exit 2 ;;\\n\\tesac\\n\\tshift\\ndone\\nif ((${#pack[@]})) && ! $single; then\\n\\techo \\\"build-web.sh: ${pack[0]} needs --single-file\\\" >&2\\n30→\\texit 2\\nfi\\ncargo build --locked --profile dist --target wasm32-unknown-unknown -p pav_app\\nwasm=${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/wasm32-unknown-unknown/dist/shardfall.wasm\\nout=target/web\\nif $single; then\\n\\tbindgen=$(mktemp -d)\\n\\ttrap 'rm -rf \\\"$bindgen\\\"' EXIT\\n\\twasm-bindgen --target web --no-typescript --out-dir \\\"$bindgen\\\" --out-name shardfall \\\"$wasm\\\"\\n\\tpython3 -I scripts/pack_single_html.py \\\"$bindgen\\\" \\\"${pack[@]}\\\"\\n40→\\texit\\nfi\\nrm -rf \\\"$out\\\"\\nmkdir -p \\\"$out\\\"\\nwasm-bindgen --target web --no-typescript --out-dir \\\"$out\\\" --out-name shardfall \\\"$wasm\\\"\\ncp web/index.html web/manifest.webmanifest \\\"$out/\\\"\\nls -la \\\"$out\\\"\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# Builds the browser version (WebAssembly + WebGPU). Output: target/web/{index.html,manifest.webmanifest,shardfall.js,shardfall_bg.wasm}\\n# Serve that folder over HTTP (e.g. `python3 -m http.server -d target/web`) and open it in Chrome or Edge.\\n# --single-file writes only target/web/<title>.html (shardfall.html): one page with the glue and gzipped wasm inside\\n#   that runs from file:// or any host (scripts/pack_single_html.py; also --title, --description, --theme-color,\\n#   --scene NAME for the start scene when the address names none, --out PATH).\\n# Needs: rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown\\n#        cargo install wasm-bindgen-cli --version <the wasm-bindgen version in Cargo.lock>\\nset -euo pipefail\\n10→caller=$PWD\\ncd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/..\\\"\\nsingle=false\\npack=()\\nwhile (($#)); do\\n\\tcase $1 in\\n\\t--single-file) single=true ;;\\n\\t--title | --description | --theme-color | --scene | --out)\\n\\t\\t(($# > 1)) || { echo \\\"build-web.sh: $1 needs a value\\\" >&2; exit 2; }\\n\\t\\tvalue=$2\\n20→\\t\\t[[ $1 == --out && $value != /* ]] && value=$caller/$value\\n\\t\\tpack+=(\\\"$1\\\" \\\"$value\\\")\\n\\t\\tshift\\n\\t\\t;;\\n\\t*) echo \\\"build-web.sh: unknown option $1 (options are listed at the top of $0)\\\" >&2; exit 2 ;;\\n\\tesac\\n\\tshift\\ndone\\nif ((${#pack[@]})) && ! $single; then\\n\\techo \\\"build-web.sh: ${pack[0]} needs --single-file\\\" >&2\\n30→\\texit 2\\nfi\\ncargo build --locked --profile dist --target wasm32-unknown-unknown -p pav_app\\nwasm=${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/wasm32-unknown-unknown/dist/shardfall.wasm\\nout=target/web\\nif $single; then\\n\\tbindgen=$(mktemp -d)\\n\\ttrap 'rm -rf \\\"$bindgen\\\"' EXIT\\n\\twasm-bindgen --target web --no-typescript --out-dir \\\"$bindgen\\\" --out-name shardfall \\\"$wasm\\\"\\n\\tpython3 -I scripts/pack_single_html.py \\\"$bindgen\\\" \\\"${pack[@]}\\\"\\n40→\\texit\\nfi\\nrm -rf \\\"$out\\\"\\nmkdir -p \\\"$out\\\"\\nwasm-bindgen --target web --no-typescript --out-dir \\\"$out\\\" --out-name shardfall \\\"$wasm\\\"\\ncp web/index.html web/manifest.webmanifest \\\"$out/\\\"\\nls -la \\\"$out\\\"\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/scripts/build-web.sh\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# Builds the browser version (WebAssembly + WebGPU). Output: target/web/{index.html,manifest.webmanifest,shardfall.js,shardfall_bg.wasm}\\n# Serve that folder over HTTP (e.g. `python3 -m http.server -d target/web`) and open it in Chrome or Edge.\\n# --single-file writes only target/web/<title>.html (shardfall.html): one page with the glue and gzipped wasm inside\\n#   that runs from file:// or any host (scripts/pack_single_html.py; also --title, --description, --theme-color,\\n#   --scene NAME for the start scene when the address names none, --out PATH).\\n# Needs: rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown\\n#        cargo install wasm-bindgen-cli --version <the wasm-bindgen version in Cargo.lock>\\nset -euo pipefail\\ncaller=$PWD\\ncd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/..\\\"\\nsingle=false\\npack=()\\nwhile (($#)); do\\n\\tcase $1 in\\n\\t--single-file) single=true ;;\\n\\t--title | --description | --theme-color | --scene | --out)\\n\\t\\t(($# > 1)) || { echo \\\"build-web.sh: $1 needs a value\\\" >&2; exit 2; }\\n\\t\\tvalue=$2\\n\\t\\t[[ $1 == --out && $value != /* ]] && value=$caller/$value\\n\\t\\tpack+=(\\\"$1\\\" \\\"$value\\\")\\n\\t\\tshift\\n\\t\\t;;\\n\\t*) echo \\\"build-web.sh: unknown option $1 (options are listed at the top of $0)\\\" >&2; exit 2 ;;\\n\\tesac\\n\\tshift\\ndone\\nif ((${#pack[@]})) && ! $single; then\\n\\techo \\\"build-web.sh: ${pack[0]} needs --single-file\\\" >&2\\n\\texit 2\\nfi\\ncargo build --locked --profile dist --target wasm32-unknown-unknown -p pav_app\\nwasm=${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/wasm32-unknown-unknown/dist/shardfall.wasm\\nout=target/web\\nif $single; then\\n\\tbindgen=$(mktemp -d)\\n\\ttrap 'rm -rf \\\"$bindgen\\\"' EXIT\\n\\twasm-bindgen --target web --no-typescript --out-dir \\\"$bindgen\\\" --out-name shardfall \\\"$wasm\\\"\\n\\tpython3 -I scripts/pack_single_html.py \\\"$bindgen\\\" \\\"${pack[@]}\\\"\\n\\texit\\nfi\\nrm -rf \\\"$out\\\"\\nmkdir -p \\\"$out\\\"\\nwasm-bindgen --target web --no-typescript --out-dir \\\"$out\\\" --out-name shardfall \\\"$wasm\\\"\\ncp web/index.html web/manifest.webmanifest \\\"$out/\\\"\\nls -la \\\"$out\\\"\\n\",\"total_lines\":46}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ed75a707-5997-4f71-a147-76ee641aecd3-151","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- Suite re-run after the hub latch: `14 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Balance for skills 1.0, 0.7, 0.4, and 0 is in the scratch `balance.txt`.\",\"new_string\":\"- Suite after the Cryoprobe, Dressing, and hub-field fixes: `16 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Balance for skills 1.0, 0.7, 0.4, and 0 is in the scratch `balance.txt`.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- Suite re-run after the hub latch: `14 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Balance for skills 1.0, 0.7, 0.4, and 0 is in the scratch `balance.txt`.\",\"old_line\":18,\"new_string\":\"- Suite after the Cryoprobe, Dressing, and hub-field fixes: `16 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Balance for skills 1.0, 0.7, 0.4, and 0 is in the scratch `balance.txt`.\",\"new_line\":18,\"context_before\":\"- 10-foot shell: title, campaign, case files, pause, settings, about, attract, touch-only gate, Dev Mode sliders and Reset All. Music bus default 0.10. Synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices.\\n- Hub: unmodified `session.js` first, shim, pre-op card, host snapshots, client mirror. Harness queries passed. A client aim moves the host cursor for that seat. At the comparison point both pages reported vitals 65.5999984741211 and timer 239.1999969482422.\\n- Packed one HTML at the work root (11,598,415 bytes). `exit-interview.json` matches the page `about-data`. Usage is `added on import`. `session.js` is the first script.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- Two file:// launches: title Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion, music 0.10, canvas 1920×1080, no page errors, DualSense Cross opens the menu the same way both times.\\n- 1920×1080 shots: title, story, operation, results, dev, about. Results is Anton Deverell, The First Movement, score 3616, rank ENCORE, after Dev Mode “Bot plays” on the packed page.\\n- Hub harness: four queries passed. A second page’s aim moves the host cursor. Vitals on that check were one snapshot apart.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"ade30d8b-2734-45f7-8836-3ef00fff6e98"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_880","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The script changes to the parent directory of its own location.\n\nBash `cd` defaults to logical path resolution. The script therefore lands in the engine-link directory regardless of whether it is invoked through a symlink or directly.\n\nThe build script will be invoked from the engine-link directory to avoid colon-path issues. CARGO_TARGET_DIR must point to .harbor-target outside the colon path. The pack log goes to scratch/pack.txt. The WASM dist build is starting. Two cargo processes cannot share .harbor-target. Targets will be deleted after packing but before Chromium. Hub tests are next. The coarse plate may slow the harness. If it fails the grid will be shrunk further. Two file:// launches are required.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2e64cc37-8106-420c-81a4-b01b8e5dd33c-152","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link && CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 bash scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene surgery/title --title \"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\" --description \"Night Ward. Keep the beat. Keep them alive.\" --theme-color \"#10282c\" --out \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\" > /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack.txt 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack.txt","description":"Pack the single-file Hands of Harbor page","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use",