{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_892","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The host-leave scenario failed. Game traffic showed zero flow for all three players.\n\nThe other three scenarios passed quickly. The host-leave failure likely stems from drawing the field stalling iframes, or from coarse plate stalling clients before they exchange traffic.\n\nThe coarse plate may have delayed client boot past the 20-second limit, causing the host to leave before they connected. The monitor showed one client started while the task completed, so the full rerun log needs inspection.\n\nThe p4 scenario passed with the same coarse plate, so traffic itself is fine. The host-leave failure is specific to the early-exit timing: clients booting WebGPU and drawing the plate likely miss the round before the host leaves. The harness check and leave log need inspection.\n\nThe coarse plate is being evaluated as the bottleneck. A single-quad plate or skipping vertex paint loops could make boot as fast as the blank scene. The 48×28 mesh is only about 1,300 vertices and 2,500 triangles, so it should not stall in an optimized WASM build. Re-running the leave scenario once will check if the failure was a flake.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-57fcde7e-5950-4799-914b-9f1665fcbbf1-167","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub-rerun.txt"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-57fcde7e-5950-4799-914b-9f1665fcbbf1-168","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub-leave.txt","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1354,"output_tokens":855,"cache_read_input_tokens":203008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01