→ p2: welcome\\n   1.08  p3 → hub: hello\\n   1.71  hub → p3: welcome\\n   2.48  hub → p0: card\\n   5.33  p0 → hub: ready\\n   5.33  hub → p0: card\\n   6.05  hub → p1: card\\n   6.23  p1 → hub: ready\\n   6.29  hub → p0: card\\n   6.29  hub → p1: card\\n   7.29  hub → p0: card\\n   7.29  hub → p1: card\\n   8.29  hub → p0: card\\n   8.29  hub → p1: card\\n   9.29  hub → p0: card\\n   9.29  hub → p1: card\\n  10.30  hub → p0: card\\n  10.30  hub → p1: card\\n  10.54  hub → p2: card\\n  10.54  hub → p3: card\\n  10.57  p2 → hub: ready\\n  10.59  p3 → hub: ready\\n  10.60  p0 answers ready on the game's card\\n  10.60  hub → p0: card\\n  10.61  hub → p1: card\\n  10.61  hub → p2: card\\n  10.61  hub → p3: card\\n  10.61  p1 answers ready on the game's card\\n  10.61  hub → p0: card\\n  10.61  hub → p1: card\\n  10.61  hub → p2: card\\n  10.61  hub → p3: card\\n  10.61  p2 answers ready on the game's card\\n  10.61  hub → p0: card\\n  10.61  hub → p1: card\\n  10.62  hub → p2: card\\n  10.62  hub → p3: card\\n  10.62  p3 answers ready on the game's card\\n  10.62  hub → p0: card\\n  10.62  hub → p1: card\\n  10.62  hub → p2: card\\n  10.63  hub → p3: card\\n  10.66  hub → p0: card\\n  10.66  hub → p1: card\\n  10.66  hub → p2: card\\n  10.66  hub → p3: card\\n  10.66  splash over: the round starts once every game has loaded\\n  10.81  hub → p2: start in 2854 ms\\n  10.81  hub → p3: start in 2847 ms\\n  10.84  hub → p1: start in 2823 ms\\n  10.84  hub → p0: start in 2818 ms\\n  16.23  p0 left\\n  16.23  round 1 void: host-left\\n  16.44  hub → p2: leave 0 (left)\\n  16.45  hub → p2: end host-left\\n  16.45  hub → p3: leave 0 (left)\\n\",\"total_lines\":84}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"77c86d82-9e45-46e7-a8c1-c1982c6dccdf"}
