eady on the game's card\\n  10.62  hub → p0: card\\n  10.62  hub → p1: card\\n  10.62  hub → p2: card\\n  10.63  hub → p3: card\\n  10.66  hub → p0: card\\n  10.66  hub → p1: card\\n  10.66  hub → p2: card\\n70→  10.66  hub → p3: card\\n  10.66  splash over: the round starts once every game has loaded\\n  10.81  hub → p2: start in 2854 ms\\n  10.81  hub → p3: start in 2847 ms\\n  10.84  hub → p1: start in 2823 ms\\n  10.84  hub → p0: start in 2818 ms\\n  16.23  p0 left\\n  16.23  round 1 void: host-left\\n  16.44  hub → p2: leave 0 (left)\\n  16.45  hub → p2: end host-left\\n80→  16.45  hub → p3: leave 0 (left)\\n  16.45  hub → p3: end host-left\\n  16.45  hub → p1: leave 0 (left)\\n  16.45  hub → p1: end host-left\\n  16.54  conformance: FAIL\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub-leave.txt\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":200,\"raw_output\":\"query players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave&auto=1&limit=20\\ndataset.complete true\\n__hubCheck.pass False\\n  PASS head metas hub:session=1 mode=shared-world\\n  PASS hub:session-players is a range within 1–4 hub:session-players=1-4\\n  PASS hub:session-minutes, when given, is a number hub:session-minutes=4\\n  PASS every copy says hello\\n  PASS hello names protocol 1 and the mode {\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"client\\\":\\\"1.4.0\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"shared-world\\\",\\\"seats\\\":[1,4],\\\"card\\\":true}\\n  PASS hello seats cover this player count [1,4]\\n  PASS ready without a key press (the card asks the players)\\n  PASS its own card: Enter answers Ready\\n  PASS the round starts when the card ends countdown\\n  FAIL game traffic flows both ways p1 ↑0 ↓0 p2 ↑0 ↓0 p3 ↑0 ↓0\\n  PASS host leaving voids the round void (host-left)\\n  PASS every remaining copy is told the round ended\\n  PASS no protocol problems\\n  PASS no errors, dialogs, popups or sockets\\n\\n   0.26  round 1: 4 players, seed 3688539299, limit