core/src/games/surgery/story.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":64,\"content\":\"    \\\"Pet Nwosu\\\", \\\"The last stitch sat down clean. I felt the tremor go quiet for it.\\\";\"},{\"line_number\":112,\"content\":\"    \\\"Teddy Lark\\\", \\\"The choir is in the lobby singing very quietly, which is somehow louder.\\\";\"},{\"line_number\":130,\"content\":\"    \\\"Cordelia Vane\\\", \\\"A word I am not ready to defend. Forget it if tomorrow is quiet.\\\";\"},{\"line_number\":159,\"content\":\"    \\\"Mara Quill\\\", \\\"Because the room was quiet enough to hear yourself. That is the Hush, too.\\\";\"},{\"line_number\":274,\"content\":\"    \\\"Mara Quill\\\", \\\"The tendril let go when both of us pulled on the quiet half of the beat. I will not pretend I understand it.\\\";\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":222,\"content\":\"    pub hub_quiet: bool,\"},{\"line_number\":297,\"content\":\"            hub_quiet: false,\"},{\"line_number\":303,\"content\":\"    pub fn boot_hub_round(sim: &mut Sim, seed: u64, slots: &[u8], quiet: bool) {\"},{\"line_number\":317,\"content\":\"        g.hub_quiet = quiet;\"},{\"line_number\":331,\"content\":\"        self.hub_quiet = true;\"},{\"line_number\":971,\"content\":\"        fr.quiet = self.hub_quiet;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/heart.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":59,\"content\":\"    /// Diastole: the quiet half, when a tendril can be pulled.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: