  let mut sim = quiet_arena(1);\"},{\"line_number\":56,\"content\":\"    let mut sim = quiet_arena(2);\"},{\"line_number\":72,\"content\":\"    let mut sim = quiet_arena(3);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/heroes.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"/// A quiet arena (no waves) with the hero played as `key`.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"84c996e7-3264-48e7-900c-428ae89e00d9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_901","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `quiet` flag is propagated to `fr`.\n\n`hub_quiet` is set true on the first card, so `emit` uses 48×28. The stall during CARD should be fast with few title hazards. The real bottleneck may be shadow maps or other per-frame costs that run before `hub_quiet` reaches the frame.\n\n`host.exec` may be asynchronous. If the simulation runs on another thread, `hub_quiet` could lag behind the first frame snapshot and leave the initial frames fully rendered. The game still accepted input after eight seconds of card frames, so the stall is likely not severe. I will now check whether `send_snap` has a mode restriction.\n\n`send_snap` only runs when `play` is true and a host exists, so it waits until after the countdown. Two and a half seconds should be enough for sixteen-millisecond frames.\n\nI will check p4 log duration to see whether conformance finished early because of extra time, or if traffic arrived quickly. If p4 also had a long gap, the theory holds. If p4 finished fast with traffic, the bug is likely flaky loss, but five percent loss cannot drop every packet unless none were sent.\n\nA zero packet count means nothing was sent or every packet was dropped for another reason. I will read the hub-p4 timestamps and add a debug probe to hub_four.py. Re-running host-leave is too slow, so I will study the code first. The 20 per second rate limit in publish() or send() might be a factor. I also spotted a bug where send_snap returns false after setting did_snap when the body exceeds 1400 bytes.\n\nA code-blue snapshot is estimated at roughly 700–1400 bytes, well under the 1400-byte limit. The 12-hazard cap keeps the payload bounded. If a snapshot were oversized, it would be dropped and retried every 66 milliseconds, but that retry loop should still fit within the two-and-a-half-second window. The size limit is therefore unlikely to be the culprit.\n\nThe snapshot payload is only about 600 bytes, so the 1400-byte limit is not the problem. I am now checking whether `gfx.draw` or `surgery_frame` is skipped on WASM because the harness iframe is hidden. Chromium throttles `requestAnimationFrame` for hidden iframes, but xvfb keeps the page visible, so background-tab throttling is unlikely.\n\nThe host-leave test waits until the phase reaches 'playing' before randomly pausing. That pause occurs after the countdown ends, so play should already be active. The real issue may be that the game's poll has not yet run since time crossed zero.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cf8b942d-9f42-47f1-8192-face11818210-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub-p4.txt","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cf8b942d-9f42-47f1-8192-face11818210-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/hub-rerun.txt","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cf8b942d-9f42-47f1-8192-face11818210-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":280,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cf8b942d-9f42-47f1-8192-face11818210-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/web/session.js","offset":240,"limit":160}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3592,"output_tokens":1552,"cache_read_input_tokens":67456,"cache_creation_input_tokens"