{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_909","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"H.publish does not call AIHub.publish.\n\nH.publish only stores H.last for finish standings. The ~3/s send rate with 4 players likely comes from expensive per-frame work. A bug in H.send was found: when Rust calls it with one argument, `to` is undefined, but session.js treats that as a broadcast.\n\nInitial snapshots are not bloated by cursor data or cues. The first send ignores the accumulator, so frame_dt is zero and the snapshot fires immediately.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb458d47-ff2a-4bfe-bab4-0e4cf6529bf5-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn frame\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src","glob":"*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb458d47-ff2a-4bfe-bab4-0e4cf6529bf5-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/hub.rs","offset":420,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6432,"output_tokens":551,"cache_read_input_tokens":95744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"ca4307f1-2296-41b9-a680-2468e71dff33"}
