{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_920","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Updating the deviation bullet and code.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Host-leave misses its one packet because each hub frame still builds the whole demo world before it can send. Quiet copies will draw only the operative field."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ab099543-d8d1-464d-9dc4-baddacff85fb-59","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/build.rs","old_string":"    ) -> Scene {\n        let alpha =\n            if prev.live_edit_ticket != curr.live_edit_ticket || prev.studio_mode() != curr.studio_mode() { 1.0 } else { alpha };","new_string":"    ) -> Scene {\n        // A hub copy only paints the operative field. Walking the demo world\n        // on a software GPU holds the frame long enough that the host leaves\n        // before the first snapshot.\n        if let Some(op) = curr.surgery.as_deref().filter(|op| op.quiet) {\n            let mut scene = Scene { time: curr.time as f32, ..Default::default() };\n            crate::surgery::emit(&mut scene, op);\n            crate::surgery::apply_look(&mut scene, rig, aspect, &op.camera, true);\n            return scene;\n        }\n        let alpha =\n            if prev.live_edit_ticket != curr.live_edit_ticket || prev.studio_mode() != curr.studio_mode() { 1.0 } else { alpha };"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ab099543-d8d1-464d-9dc4-baddacff85fb-60","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"/// Hub and mirror copies. A 420×240 plate plus shadows stalls a software-GPU iframe.\nconst QUIET_NX: usize = 48;\nconst QUIET_NZ: usize = 28;","new_string":"/// Hub and mirror copies. A 420×240 plate plus the demo world stalls a software-GPU iframe.\nconst QUIET_NX: usize = 16;\nconst QUIET_NZ: usize = 8;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ab099543-d8d1-464d-9dc4-baddacff85fb-61","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs","old_string":"    if op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 6 {\n        for t in 0..8 {","new_string":"    if !op.quiet && (op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 6) {\n        for t in 0..8 {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ab099543-d8d1-464d-9dc4-baddacff85fb-62","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md","old_string":"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. A 420×240 plate stalled the software-GPU iframe. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.","new_string":"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe, and the host-leave check then saw no game traffic. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4302,"output_tokens":1111,"cache_read_input_tokens":125824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"57d6c6e1-8b1d-4264-a1f9-d4066bfb94d4"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ab099543-d8d1-464d-9dc4-baddacff85fb-59","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    ) -> Scene {\\n        let alpha =\\n            if prev.live_edit_ticket != curr.live_edit_ticket || prev.studio_mode() != curr.studio_mode() { 1.0 } else { alpha };\",\"new_string\":\"    ) -> Scene {\\n        // A hub copy only paints the operative field. Walking the demo world\\n        // on a software GPU holds the frame long enough that the host leaves\\n        // before the first snapshot.\\n        if let Some(op) = curr.surgery.as_deref().filter(|op| op.quiet) {\\n            let mut scene = Scene { time: curr.time as f32, ..Default::default() };\\n            crate::surgery::emit(&mut scene, op);\\n            crate::surgery::apply_look(&mut scene, rig, aspect, &op.camera, true);\\n            return scene;\\n        }\\n        let alpha =\\n            if prev.live_edit_ticket != curr.live_edit_ticket || prev.studio_mode() != curr.studio_mode() { 1.0 } else { alpha };\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/build.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/build.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/build.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    ) -> Scene {\\n        let alpha =\\n            if prev.live_edit_ticket != curr.live_edit_ticket || prev.studio_mode() != curr.studio_mode() { 1.0 } else { alpha };\",\"old_line\":989,\"new_string\":\"    ) -> Scene {\\n        // A hub copy only paints the operative field. Walking the demo world\\n        // on a software GPU holds the frame long enough that the host leaves\\n        // before the first snapshot.\\n        if let Some(op) = curr.surgery.as_deref().filter(|op| op.quiet) {\\n            let mut scene = Scene { time: curr.time as f32, ..Default::default() };\\n            crate::surgery::emit(&mut scene, op);\\n            crate::surgery::apply_look(&mut scene, rig, aspect, &op.camera, true);\\n            return scene;\\n        }\\n        let alpha =\\n            if prev.live_edit_ticket != curr.live_edit_ticket || prev.studio_mode() != curr.studio_mode() { 1.0 } else { alpha };\",\"new_line\":989,\"context_before\":\"        aspect: f32,\\n        settings: &ViewSettings,\\n        focus: Vec3,\\n\",\"context_after\":\"        // Interpolated simulation time: animations and particles move smoothly between ticks.\\n        let time = (prev.time + (curr.time - prev.time) * alpha as f64) as f32;\\n        let mut scene = Scene { camera: rig.data(aspect), time, ..Default::default() };\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ab099543-d8d1-464d-9dc4-baddacff85fb-60","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"/// Hub and mirror copies. A 420×240 plate plus shadows stalls a software-GPU iframe.\\nconst QUIET_NX: usize = 48;\\nconst QUIET_NZ: usize = 28;\",\"new_string\":\"/// Hub and mirror copies. A 420×240 plate plus the demo world stalls a software-GPU iframe.\\nconst QUIET_NX: usize = 16;\\nconst QUIET_NZ: usize = 8;\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"/// Hub and mirror copies. A 420×240 plate plus shadows stalls a software-GPU iframe.\\nconst QUIET_NX: usize = 48;\\nconst QUIET_NZ: usize = 28;\",\"old_line\":12,\"new_string\":\"/// Hub and mirror copies. A 420×240 plate plus the demo world stalls a software-GPU iframe.\\nconst QUIET_NX: usize = 16;\\nconst QUIET_NZ: usize = 8;\",\"new_line\":12,\"context_before\":\"\\nconst NX: usize = 420;\\nconst NZ: usize = 240;\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\npub fn emit(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\\n    let (nx, nz) = if op.quiet { (QUIET_NX, QUIET_NZ) } else { (NX, NZ) };\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ab099543-d8d1-464d-9dc4-baddacff85fb-61","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    if op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 6 {\\n        for t in 0..8 {\",\"new_string\":\"    if !op.quiet && (op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 6) {\\n        for t in 0..8 {\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    if op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 6 {\\n        for t in 0..8 {\",\"old_line\":227,\"new_string\":\"    if !op.quiet && (op.mode == 3 || op.mode == 0 || op.mode == 6) {\\n        for t in 0..8 {\",\"new_line\":227,\"context_before\":\"        let tint = Vec3::new(c.color[0], c.color[1], c.color[2]);\\n        tool_mesh(scene, c.tool, origin, steel.lerp(tint, 0.25), grip, 40 + i as u32);\\n    }\\n\",\"context_after\":\"            let x = -3.5 + t as f32 * 1.0;\\n            let z = 5.4;\\n            let lift = op.cursors.first().map(|c| c.tool == t as u8).unwrap_or(false);\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ab099543-d8d1-464d-9dc4-baddacff85fb-62","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. A 420×240 plate stalled the software-GPU iframe. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.\",\"new_string\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe, and the host-leave check then saw no game traffic. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. A 420×240 plate stalled the software-GPU iframe. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.\",\"old_line\":818,\"new_string\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe, and the host-leave check then saw no game traffic. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.\",\"new_line\":818,\"context_before\":\"- Case and story tables live in Rust (`content.rs`, `story.rs`), not toml. The sim reads that one table. A toml loader would be a second copy of the same data.\\n- Cargo cannot put the target directory on a path that contains a colon. The dev folder name has one, so web and test builds set `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` to `work/.harbor-target` and run from the `engine-link` symlink. That directory is deleted after the final pack.\\n- Hub snapshots still go out at about 15 Hz, cursors included. Vitals and the timer in that snapshot stay on the value from the start of a 500 ms hub-clock bucket, and the host's status reports that sent value only after the send succeeds. A client drops a snapshot from an older bucket. That is what makes both pages report the same vitals at a comparison point.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"50b2b109-e526-41de-9c88-2216342522d6"}
