{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_942","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will add an `armed` boolean and set it when time is finite.\n\nThe `armed` flag will gate `send_snap` and `send_input`, replacing the old `play` check. Boot will still use `play` so the operation does not start too early. View does not need this change. I will add comments explaining the logic. This is wasm-only, so native tests will not cover it; the hub harness provides proof. I still need to repack, which takes about 2.5 minutes. During countdown, frames continue running, and the first frame after the start message will set `armed` before sending snapshots.\n\nThe snapshot is sent at the start of the countdown, well before the host leaves. It cannot be missed unless that frame has not started by the time the host exits.\n\nProbe frames took 150 ms. A frame stuck in draw for up to 2 seconds would still send before the host leaves at 4.5 seconds. Only a frame longer than 4.5 seconds would miss the snapshot.\n\nThe failed run missed the snapshot because `armed` was false during both the countdown and the 2.4-second play window. Card logs prove the main thread yields at least once per second, so the frame that processes the start event will send the snapshot. This confirms the fix. I will implement it, repack, and kill the hub monitor if it is still running.\n\nThe `armed` field will be set in `poll` when `t.is_finite()` is true, and `play` will only become true once `armed` is set and the hub clock reaches zero. Both `send_snap` and `send_input` will gate on `!self.armed`. I verified that `is_finite()` correctly handles negative countdown values while rejecting `NaN` and `-Infinity`.\n\nIf time() fails and returns NEG_INFINITY, armed stays false, which is safe. The native suite does not need rerunning because this change is wasm-only. I will update PLAN.md if needed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe66a2c8-4b0b-4272-b007-e40b3709c24f-90","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/hub.rs","old_string":"        pub play: bool,\n        pub ended: bool,","new_string":"        pub play: bool,\n        /// The start message has arrived. Snapshots and hands go out during\n        /// the countdown; the operation still waits until the hub clock is zero.\n        pub armed: bool,\n        pub ended: bool,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe66a2c8-4b0b-4272-b007-e40b3709c24f-91","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/hub.rs","old_string":"                play: false,\n                ended: false,","new_string":"                play: false,\n                armed: false,\n                ended: false,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe66a2c8-4b0b-4272-b007-e40b3709c24f-92","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/hub.rs","old_string":"            let t = call(&hub, \"time\", &[]).and_then(|v| v.as_f64()).unwrap_or(f64::NEG_INFINITY);\n            if self.joined && !self.ended && t >= 0.0 {\n                self.play = true;\n            }","new_string":"            let t = call(&hub, \"time\", &[]).and_then(|v| v.as_f64()).unwrap_or(f64::NEG_INFINITY);\n            // -Infinity before start. A negative finite value is the countdown.\n            if self.joined && !self.ended && t.is_finite() {\n                self.armed = true;\n            }\n            if self.armed && t >= 0.0 {\n                self.play = true;\n            }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe66a2c8-4b0b-4272-b007-e40b3709c24f-93","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/hub.rs","old_string":"            if !self.play || self.ended || self.server || !self.joined {\n                return;\n            }","new_string":"            if !self.armed || self.ended || self.server || !self.joined {\n                return;\n            }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe66a2c8-4b0b-4272-b007-e40b3709c24f-94","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/hub.rs","old_string":"            if !self.play || self.ended || !self.host || !self.joined {\n                return false;\n            }","new_string":"            if !self.armed || self.ended || !self.host || !self.joined {\n                return false;\n            }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5815,"output_tokens":1847,"cache_read_input_tokens":155392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"4870f75f-83cc-4fee-a530-4bd7a4fc88fe"}
