{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_944","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boot still waits for t>=0.","signature":"PvV/XcChU5rxAbbXQrVNQ+Cj9nfLL8cORirJJVz5S/HYJBSO/VjYmAhpH/BLF6dGoRJK3mnkAQj6AbI/2I3qWy9SP8u+WVuc/klHUpVvKvwWxSxRcaWCwBM+pjv5U2vqcjK7idHEa6gWmxCM4G/n/LleeHGoyS+gwKDMvyrU0NKQnELKKeKIQQebrRIaRLEBiZqRmeZm6TOmH3diq5QYZr+IDCwyF4FBn7fnpV7E92zEnuphGqPbwMk"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-57002c7d-77bf-4c1f-8043-1a9f09e74ffa-97","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md","old_string":"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe, and the host-leave check then saw no game traffic. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.","new_string":"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe. Hands and snapshots start when the countdown starts, so a slow first operation frame still produces traffic before a host-leave. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-57002c7d-77bf-4c1f-8043-1a9f09e74ffa-98","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link && CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 bash scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene surgery/title --title \"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\" --description \"Night Ward. Keep the beat. Keep them alive.\" --theme-color \"#10282c\" --out \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\" > /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack3.txt 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack3.txt","description":"Repack HTML with countdown traffic","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":565,"output_tokens":673,"cache_read_input_tokens":163456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"de6b2fd3-269b-4a95-aa0f-3e23407d5389"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-57002c7d-77bf-4c1f-8043-1a9f09e74ffa-97","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe, and the host-leave check then saw no game traffic. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.\",\"new_string\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe. Hands and snapshots start when the countdown starts, so a slow first operation frame still produces traffic before a host-leave. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe, and the host-leave check then saw no game traffic. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.\",\"old_line\":818,\"new_string\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe. Hands and snapshots start when the countdown starts, so a slow first operation frame still produces traffic before a host-leave. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.\",\"new_line\":818,\"context_before\":\"- Case and story tables live in Rust (`content.rs`, `story.rs`), not toml. The sim reads that one table. A toml loader would be a second copy of the same data.\\n- Cargo cannot put the target directory on a path that contains a colon. The dev folder name has one, so web and test builds set `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` to `work/.harbor-target` and run from the `engine-link` symlink. That directory is deleted after the final pack.\\n- Hub snapshots still go out at about 15 Hz, cursors included. Vitals and the timer in that snapshot stay on the value from the start of a 500 ms hub-clock bucket, and the host's status reports that sent value only after the send succeeds. A client drops a snapshot from an older bucket. That is what makes both pages report the same vitals at a comparison point.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-57002c7d-77bf-4c1f-8043-1a9f09e74ffa-98","content":"{\"type\":\"BackgroundTaskStarted\",\"task_id\":\"9b37c859-8fde-461a-b6b7-dbc3743e686d\",\"task_type\":\"bash\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/terminal/call-57002c7d-77bf-4c1f-8043-1a9f09e74ffa-98.log\",\"status\":\"running\",\"command\":\"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/engine-link && CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 bash scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene surgery/title --title \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\\" --description \\\"Night Ward. Keep the beat. Keep them alive.\\\" --theme-color \\\"#10282c\\\" --out \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\\\" > /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack3.txt 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack3.txt\",\"summary\":\"Background task 9b37c859-8fde-461a-b6b7-dbc3743e686d started\",\"retrieval_hint\":\"Use get_command_or_subagent_output with task_ids=[\\\"9b37c859-8fde-461a-b6b7-dbc3743e686d\\\"] when you need the output.\",\"pid\":674102}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"4d510d3d-21cc-49a1-9e82-2ec4f0de0613"}
