{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_952","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Leave failed again in hub_four but passed twice in hub_probe.\n\nThe add_init_script HOOK in hub_probe wraps AIHub.send. The parent-page setInterval should not affect iframe timing, so the pass likely stems from the console listener or another hook effect.\n\nhub_probe passed because its client iframes sent and received messages. hub_four failed with the same query, so the init script is not creating traffic. The suspicion now shifts to Playwright caching an old page version.\n\nPlaywright caching is unlikely across fresh browser launches. The probe passed after the fix while hub_four failed, so the issue is timing flakiness rather than a stale page. Hub_four runs after p4, which opens four WebGPU contexts and closes the browser before launching a new one for leave.\n\nGPU state from p4 may be leaving frames stalled. The probe passed after idle time, but leave fails immediately after p4. I will test leave alone without the hook to isolate the cause.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3dcf9999-60d7-446f-9e18-82e874894c34-106","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"export TMPDIR=/tmp/hbr-pw PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\ncd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer\nxvfb-run -a -s \"-screen 0 1280x800x24\" python3 -u - << 'PY'\nimport os\nfrom urllib.parse import quote\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nPORT=37019\nDEV=\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015\"\nGAME=f\"../../../{DEV}.html\"\nHARNESS=f\"/{DEV}/tests/hub/harness.html\"\nQUERY=\"players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave&auto=1&limit=20\"\nARGS=[\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\",\"--enable-features=Vulkan\",\"--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader\",\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\",\"--use-angle=swiftshader\"]\nos.environ.setdefault(\"PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE\",\"ubuntu24.04-x64\")\nurl=f\"http://127.0.0.1:{PORT}{quote(HARNESS, safe='/')}?game={quote(GAME)}&{QUERY}\"\nprint(\"URL\", url, flush=True)\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser=p.chromium.launch(headless=False, args=ARGS)\n    page=browser.new_page(viewport={\"width\":1100,\"height\":700})\n    page.goto(url, wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\", timeout=60000)\n    try:\n        page.wait_for_function(\"document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'\", timeout=180000)\n    except Exception as exc:\n        print(\"WAIT\", exc, flush=True)\n    report=page.evaluate(\"() => window.__hubCheck || null\")\n    print(\"pass\", None if not report else report.get(\"pass\"), flush=True)\n    if report:\n        for c in report.get(\"checks\") or []:\n            if not c.get(\"pass\"):\n                print(\"FAIL\", c.get(\"name\"), c.get(\"detail\"), flush=True)\n            elif \"traffic\" in (c.get(\"name\") or \"\"):\n                print(\"TRAFFIC\", c.get(\"detail\"), flush=True)\n    browser.close()\nPY","description":"Run host-leave alone without the send hook","block_until_ms":120000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":998,"output_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":171392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"76399be9-2f63-45d2-9e81-1268c899f75e"}
