 it, since Bashir is the patient.\"},{\"line_number\":670,\"content\":\"5. **Strains and gifts.** Introit and Hush, Lacrimosa, Echo and tremor, bone reassembly, Dies Irae and Cryoprobe, Libera Me and Duet. Cases 3–7 with their stories.\"},{\"line_number\":818,\"content\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe. Hands and snapshots start when the countdown starts, so a slow first operation frame still produces traffic before a host-leave. Cryoprobe and Dressing are not ring slots: Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to those tools.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/docs/ASSET_SYSTEM_PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1461,\"content\":\"| Dressing blocks paths or moves mechanics | dressing runs last on its own stream; non-interference, path and campaign tests |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/docs/GAME.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":136,\"content\":\"- **Dressing**: each room gets 3-6 library props (embedded `LIB/core` assets, in the theme's\"},{\"line_number\":138,\"content\":\"  The sets are `game/props.toml`. Dressing runs last, from its own random stream, so editing it\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/docs/ASSET_STUDIO.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":168,\"content\":\"its rooms this way from `game/props.toml` (docs/GAME.md, \\\"Dressing\\\").\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/docs/HISTORY.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1092,\"content\":\"- **Dressing** (`arpg/world/dress.rs`, `game/props.toml`): the six old names are sets, so\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/story.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":202,\"content\":\"    \\\"Mara Quill\\\", \\\"Cryoprobe first. Pet, you have used it on a wart and you will pretend this is a wart.\\\";\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/map.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\"//! Cryoprobe and Dressing are contextual: the ring stays 0–7, and the hazard under the cursor promotes Laser or Scanner to the probe, or any ring tool to a dressing.\"},{\"line_number\":72,\"content\":\"/// L1 / R1 and the mouse wheel. The ring is eight tools; Cryoprobe and Dressing are not stops on it.\"},{\"line_number\":93,\"content\":\"/// Laser and Scanner become the Cryoprobe on an ember that still wants it.\"},{\"line_number\":94,\"content\":\"/// Any ring tool becomes Dressing on a closure, or when every remaining wound is a closure.\"},{\"line_number\":96,\"content\":\"pub fn contextual_tool<T: ToolSite>(ring: u8, x: f32, z: f32, sites: &[T]) -> u8 {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\"use pav_core::games::surgery::{contextual_tool, cycle, octant, tray_tool, Surgery, SurgeryFrame, TITLE, TOOL_KEEP};\"},{\"line_number\":492,\"content\":\"                    g.hub_quiet = true;\"},{\"line_number\":691,\"content\":\"/// Ring tool 0–7, then Cryoprobe or Dressing when the cursor is on that wound.\"},{\"line_number\":702,\"content\":\"        s.tool = contextual_tool(s.tool, x, z, &op.hazards);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\"    all_lines, chain_mul, contextual_tool, cycle, octant, rank_of, tray_tool, Hazard, Heart, Surgery, CASES, CRYO, DRESSING,\"},{\"line_number\":336,\"content\":\"/// Ring tools stay 0–7. Cryoprobe and Dressing are whatever `contextual_tool` returns.\"},{\"line_number\":339,\"content\":\"    let tool = contextual_tool(ring, x, z, &game(sim).hazards);\"},{\"line_number\":367,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(contextual_tool(down, ember.x, ember.z, &game(&sim).hazards), CRYO);\"},{\"line_number\":368,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(contextual_tool(left, ember.x, ember.z, &game(&sim).hazards), CRYO);\"},{\"line_number\":478,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(contextual_tool(gel, dressing.x, dressing.z, &game(&sim).hazards), DRESSING);\"},{\"line_number\":479,\"content\":\"    assert_ne!(contextual_tool(gel, 8.0, 3.0, &game(&sim).hazards), DRESSING);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"pub use map::{contextual_tool, cycle, octant, tray_tool};\"},{\"line_number\":222,\"content\":\"    pub hub_quiet: bool,\"},{\"line_number\":297,\"content\":\"            hub_quiet: false,\"},{\"line_number\":317,\"content\":\"        g.hub_quiet = quiet;\"},{\"line_number\":331,\"content\":\"        self.hub_quiet = true;\"},{\"line_number\":971,\"content\":\"        fr.quiet = self.hub_quiet;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/arpg/world/dress.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"//! Dressing runs last, from a random stream of its own. It keeps clear of everything already\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"b369bd2e-8098-4b77-ac5a-0a81803884a9"}
