4-224015/engine/docs/MAKE_A_GAME.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":167,\"content\":\"- **Browser, one file:** `scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene <key> --title \\\"My Game\\\"\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/docs/ASSET_SYSTEM_PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1428,\"content\":\"| LIB-1 | names, tiers, budgets, packaging | build.rs `ASSET_DATA`; props canonical/resolve_ref/disk_root; `asset_tools.rs`; `arpg/data.rs`; `.gitignore`; `.vercelignore`; `package-studio.py` | budget/validity/refs tests; `scripts/build-web.sh` |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/docs/FEEDBACK.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":38,\"content\":\"| A single-file web build (gzip + inline) | 1 | high | **done**: `scripts/build-web.sh --single-file` |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/docs/PROGRESS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":30,\"content\":\"  builds made here and sent in chat: the self-contained `shardfall.html` (`build-web.sh\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/AGENTS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":141,\"content\":\"scripts/build-web.sh               # browser build -> target/web/ (serve over HTTP; Chrome/Edge)\"},{\"line_number\":142,\"content\":\"scripts/build-web.sh --single-file # -> target/web/shardfall.html: one ~10 MB page, runs from file://\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261