{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_993","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The same title, description, theme-color, and scene will be used when packing.\n\nImplementing the code change and PLAN update, then building. Confirmed that thread-local `*mut App` in closures is safe on WASM. Interval-driven frames won't schedule redraws or receive winit input events.\n\nKey presses will be captured synchronously by winit and held for interval frames. Mouse and gamepad input will be polled during surgery frames. The countdown display will keep its current style to preserve the existing margin. During countdown, the interval no-ops because LAST_MS stays fresh from rAF frames.\n\nThe first rAF frame draws the scene and then dies. The interval timer then fires after 50ms and draws again, producing two frames in quick succession. Subsequent draws should be fast because pipelines are cached.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c04e7215-9048-4d46-918e-90b95227500a-65","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn shape_stick|AIM|stick_speed|0\\.0","glob":"**/pav_app/src/product.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c04e7215-9048-4d46-918e-90b95227500a-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn shape_stick|const SPEED|aim \\*=|move_cursor|stick","glob":"**/pav_core/src/games/surgery/**/*.rs","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1983,"output_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":110080,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"e218d29d-6f8a-4018-bdfd-098fca2619be"}
