{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1019","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The launch script uses x11grab to capture the entire display.\n\nxvfb-run will provide the display for ffmpeg. The run may take 5–15 minutes due to settle delays and multiple boots. Cursor logs will be saved to scratch first. Hub results will be merged into hub-rerun5.txt. Screenshots are written to scratch, not tests/out.\n\nHub visuals changed but title, story, and about did not. The file:// path still needs a solo check because the timer lives in the wasm binary. No browser is running. A proof file will be written before launch.py starts.\n\nThe HTTP server will be stopped before launch.py begins to free memory. The exit interview will be updated after the run.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e22c7c86-fe9b-49a5-b39d-051b227aefd2-108","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/launch.py","offset":115,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1129,"output_tokens":600,"cache_read_input_tokens":150784,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"c655bcbc-804c-4446-a4d7-7af8b83eab2f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e22c7c86-fe9b-49a5-b39d-051b227aefd2-108","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"115→def tap(page, key, pred, timeout_s=18):\\n    focus_canvas(page)\\n    page.keyboard.press(key)\\n    hit = wait_pred(page, pred, timeout_s)\\n    if hit and pred(hit):\\n120→        return hit\\n    page.keyboard.press(key)\\n    return wait_pred(page, pred, timeout_s)\\n\\n\\ndef frames(page):\\n    return page.evaluate(\\\"() => window.__frames || 0\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef settle(page, screen, extra=6):\\n130→    \\\"\\\"\\\"The X grab lags the sim by a few presents. Wait until this screen has been drawn again.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    start = frames(page)\\n    last = None\\n    deadline = time.time() + 25\\n    while time.time() < deadline:\\n        last = status(page)\\n        if last.get(\\\"screen\\\") == screen and frames(page) >= start + extra:\\n            return last\\n        page.wait_for_timeout(200)\\n    return last\\n140→\\n\\ndef luma(path):\\n    proc = subprocess.run(\\n        [\\\"ffmpeg\\\", \\\"-v\\\", \\\"error\\\", \\\"-i\\\", str(path), \\\"-f\\\", \\\"rawvideo\\\", \\\"-pix_fmt\\\", \\\"gray\\\", \\\"-\\\"],\",\"content_concise\":\"115→def tap(page, key, pred, timeout_s=18):\\n    focus_canvas(page)\\n    page.keyboard.press(key)\\n    hit = wait_pred(page, pred, timeout_s)\\n    if hit and pred(hit):\\n120→        return hit\\n    page.keyboard.press(key)\\n    return wait_pred(page, pred, timeout_s)\\n\\n\\ndef frames(page):\\n    return page.evaluate(\\\"() => window.__frames || 0\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef settle(page, screen, extra=6):\\n130→    \\\"\\\"\\\"The X grab lags the sim by a few presents. Wait until this screen has been drawn again.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    start = frames(page)\\n    last = None\\n    deadline = time.time() + 25\\n    while time.time() < deadline:\\n        last = status(page)\\n        if last.get(\\\"screen\\\") == screen and fram