{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1022","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The doc comment on `install_tick` should be updated to mention hub-only.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fb788e34-2107-490d-8db7-124cf3c94908-113","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs","old_string":"/// The software-GPU present cancels the display callback after the first\n/// operation frame. While that callback is quiet, this timer steps the sim,\n/// the hands, and the snapshots. A live callback keeps `LAST_MS` fresh and\n/// the timer does nothing.","new_string":"/// The software-GPU present cancels the display callback after the first\n/// hub operation frame. While that callback is quiet and a hub session is\n/// active, this timer steps the sim, the hands, and the snapshots. Solo play\n/// leaves it idle. A live callback keeps `LAST_MS` fresh and the timer does nothing."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fb788e34-2107-490d-8db7-124cf3c94908-114","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md","old_string":"The first operation present stops the display callback, so a 32 ms timer steps the sim while that callback is quiet.","new_string":"The first operation present stops the display callback, so a 32 ms timer steps the sim while that callback is quiet and a hub session is active. Solo play does not use the timer."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fb788e34-2107-490d-8db7-124cf3c94908-115","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"set -u\ncd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work\nexport CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target\"\nexport CARGO_TERM_COLOR=never\nLOG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack6.txt\"\n{\n  echo \"PACK $(date -Is)\"\n  ./engine-link/scripts/build-web.sh --single-file \\\n    --scene surgery/title \\\n    --title \"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\" \\\n    --description \"Night Ward. Keep the beat. Keep them alive.\" \\\n    --theme-color \"#10282c\" \\\n    --out \"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\"\n  echo \"EXIT:$?\"\n} >\"$LOG\" 2>&1\necho \"wrapper-done\"","description":"Repack the HTML with the hub-only timer","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2754,"output_tokens":927,"cache_read_input_tokens":154752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"3a281320-de72-4fbe-849b-cb586fb67150"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fb788e34-2107-490d-8db7-124cf3c94908-113","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"/// The software-GPU present cancels the display callback after the first\\n/// operation frame. While that callback is quiet, this timer steps the sim,\\n/// the hands, and the snapshots. A live callback keeps `LAST_MS` fresh and\\n/// the timer does nothing.\",\"new_string\":\"/// The software-GPU present cancels the display callback after the first\\n/// hub operation frame. While that callback is quiet and a hub session is\\n/// active, this timer steps the sim, the hands, and the snapshots. Solo play\\n/// leaves it idle. A live callback keeps `LAST_MS` fresh and the timer does nothing.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"/// The software-GPU present cancels the display callback after the first\\n/// operation frame. While that callback is quiet, this timer steps the sim,\\n/// the hands, and the snapshots. A live callback keeps `LAST_MS` fresh and\\n/// the timer does nothing.\",\"old_line\":859,\"new_string\":\"/// The software-GPU present cancels the display callback after the first\\n/// hub operation frame. While that callback is quiet and a hub session is\\n/// active, this timer steps the sim, the hands, and the snapshots. Solo play\\n/// leaves it idle. A live callback keeps `LAST_MS` fresh and the timer does nothing.\",\"new_line\":859,\"context_before\":\"    js_sys::Date::now()\\n}\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"#[cfg(target_arch = \\\"wasm32\\\")]\\nfn install_tick(app: &mut App, hub_active: bool) {\\n    LAST_MS.with(|t| t.set(frame_now_ms()));\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fb788e34-2107-490d-8db7-124cf3c94908-114","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"The first operation present stops the display callback, so a 32 ms timer steps the sim while that callback is quiet.\",\"new_string\":\"The first operation present stops the display callback, so a 32 ms timer steps the sim while that callback is quiet and a hub session is active. Solo play does not use the timer.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PLAN.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"The first operation present stops the display callback, so a 32 ms timer steps the sim while that callback is quiet.\",\"old_line\":818,\"new_string\":\"The first operation present stops the display callback, so a 32 ms timer steps the sim while that callback is quiet and a hub session is active. Solo play does not use the timer.\",\"new_line\":818,\"context_before\":\"- Case and story tables live in Rust (`content.rs`, `story.rs`), not toml. The sim reads that one table. A toml loader would be a second copy of the same data.\\n- Cargo cannot put the target directory on a path that contains a colon. The dev folder name has one, so web and test builds set `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` to `work/.harbor-target` and run from the `engine-link` symlink. That directory is deleted after the final pack.\\n- Hub snapshots still go out at about 15 Hz, cursors included. Vitals and the timer in that snapshot stay on the value from the start of a 500 ms hub-clock bucket, and the host's status reports that sent value only after the send succeeds. A client drops a snapshot from an older bucket. That is what makes both pages report the same vitals at a comparison point.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"- Hub and mirror copies draw the operative field on a coarse plate and leave shadows, bloom, and GI off. They do not draw the demo world. A 420×240 plate on top of that world stalled the software-GPU iframe. Countdown frames skip the present so four iframes can still exchange hands before a host leaves. \"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fb788e34-2107-490d-8db7-124cf3c94908-115","content":"{\"type\":\"BackgroundTaskStarted\",\"task_id\":\"c7f03a7e-353e-4adb-a027-3661b679170b\",\"task_type\":\"bash\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a%2Fwork/01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2/terminal/call-fb788e34-2107-490d-8db7-124cf3c94908-115.log\",\"status\":\"running\",\"command\":\"set -u\\ncd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work\\nexport CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/.harbor-target\\\"\\nexport CARGO_TERM_COLOR=never\\nLOG=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/pack6.txt\\\"\\n{\\n  echo \\\"PACK $(date -Is)\\\"\\n  ./engine-link/scripts/build-web.sh --single-file \\\\\\n    --scene surgery/title \\\\\\n    --title \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\\" \\\\\\n    --description \\\"Night Ward. Keep the beat. Keep them alive.\\\" \\\\\\n    --theme-color \\\"#10282c\\\" \\\\\\n    --out \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html\\\"\\n  echo \\\"EXIT:$?\\\"\\n} >\\\"$LOG\\\" 2>&1\\necho \\\"wrapper-done\\\"\",\"summary\":\"Background task c7f03a7e-353e-4adb-a027-3661b679170b started\",\"retrieval_hint\":\"Use get_command_or_subagent_output with task_ids=[\\\"c7f03a7e-353e-4adb-a027-3661b679170b\\\"] when you need the output.\",\"pid\":772106}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"b8723dc9-f077-4d11-82b1-03ae479152c9"}
