he beat. Keep them alive.\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Overhead surgical melodrama for one to four surgeons at Mercy Harbor General in Port Verity.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Simulation\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Trauma Center\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Right stick or mouse aims, R2 or left click operates, left stick or 1–8 picks tools\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3d\\\", \\\"story\\\", \\\"co-op\\\", \\\"arcade\\\", \\\"boss fights\\\"]\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":51}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"2472ee8d-16a0-4fd3-95d8-955a41c7525f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1031","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The about screen pulls its source text from about.json.\n\nI will correct the testing feedback to reflect later bugs and real engine changes like the hub timer and contextual tools. Next I will parse JSON, stop the server, confirm targets are removed, verify HTML and exit-interview files are present in the work root, and consider adding a small hub proof.\n\nThe harness re-runs plan verification automatically. I will update the exit interview with search_replace and parse the JSON. The HTTP server stops via kill_command_or_subagent. Chromium is dead from the crash. I will mark the todo as completed.\n\nEight critical bugs were found: suture stage guard, forceps selection, shared sac meter, hub snapshots waiting on a 60 Hz accumulator, ControlFlow::Poll freezing operations, Cryoprobe and Dressing never being selected from the pad, a quiet hub field drawing nothing, and a software-GPU stopping the display callback after the first shared operation frame. The sac meter and suture issues are likely critical.\n\nThe exit interview will list 8 caught bugs and 8 critical ones. Every issue breaks a required play path.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b770c420-0271-4318-82ec-cc455ba71dcb-129","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"Testing caught five issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, and ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame so an operation froze after one tick.\",\n    \"5\",","new_string":"    \"Testing caught eight issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame, the pad path never selected Cryoprobe or Dressing, a quiet hub copy drew a blank field, and the first software-GPU present in a shared operation stopped the display callback.\",\n    \"8\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b770c420-0271-4318-82ec-cc455ba71dcb-130","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\",","new_string":"    \"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. Hub copies draw a coarse plate, send during the countdown, skip that present, and a timer steps the sim if the display callback then stops. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b770c420-0271-4318-82ec-cc455ba71dcb-131","name":"kill_command_or_subagent","input":{"task_id":"1e5b7035-df69-4a3d-bd71-781201d82c4b"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2327,"output_tokens":1076,"cache_read_input_tokens":171520,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"226cee84-18e7-4b41-b736-26f34258d4e3"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b770c420-0271-4318-82ec-cc455ba71dcb-129","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Testing caught five issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, and ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame so an operation froze after one tick.\\\",\\n    \\\"5\\\",\",\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Testing caught eight issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame, the pad path never selected Cryoprobe or Dressing, a quiet hub copy drew a blank field, and the first software-GPU present in a shared operation stopped the display callback.\\\",\\n    \\\"8\\\",\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Testing caught five issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, and ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame so an operation froze after one tick.\\\",\\n    \\\"5\\\",\",\"old_line\":20,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Testing caught eight issues: a Rust or-pattern guard skipped stage-0 sutures, nearest-hazard selection stole forceps pulls, a sac's swell shared the laser charge meter, hub snapshots waited on a 60 Hz accumulator that never fired in an iframe, ControlFlow::Poll cancelled the pending animation frame, the pad path never selected Cryoprobe or Dressing, a quiet hub copy drew a blank field, and the first software-GPU present in a shared operation stopped the display callback.\\\",\\n    \\\"8\\\",\",\"new_line\":20,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"The most helpful checks were a skill-1.0 bot on every case from a fresh scene, and the hub harness traffic counters once the frame loop actually ticked.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful test was a temporary print probe that only dumped stuck hazards and was removed once the selection bug was fixed.\\\"\\n  ],\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b770c420-0271-4318-82ec-cc455ba71dcb-130","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\\\",\",\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. Hub copies draw a coarse plate, send during the countdown, skip that present, and a timer steps the sim if the display callback then stops. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\\\",\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\\\",\",\"old_line\":30,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Added the surgery frame, surgeon input, and cue event; a view emit and camera shot; a product frame branch; audio buses and formants; session.js injection in the packer; and js-sys. On the web the surgery loop waits for animation frames, because Poll cancelled the pending frame. Hub copies draw a coarse plate, send during the countdown, skip that present, and a timer steps the sim if the display callback then stops. The hook alone cannot draw, play cues, or join a hub.\\\",\",\"new_line\":30,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"Yes. A colon in the project path makes rustc fail joining LD_LIBRARY_PATH, and the demo frame path captures the camera, pause menu, and touch layer unless a game returns first.\\\",\\n    \\\"The operative rules, the plate mesh, the ten-foot shell, the cue and music buses, and the hub shim.\\\",\\n    \\\"Keeping a surgery scene off the demo boot panel, stats, guide, toasts, and the engine pause menu.\\\",\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"A first-class per-game frame path, so a new game does not have to outrun the demo loop.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"promptFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b770c420-0271-4318-82ec-cc455ba71dcb-131","content":"{\"type\":\"KillTask\",\"Result\":{\"task_id\":\"1e5b7035-df69-4a3d-bd71-781201d82c4b\",\"outcome\":\"killed\",\"message\":\"Task was terminated successfully\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"8486f29e-5bc3-45dd-beef-0166e1c77579"}
