ty\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Re-run file:// launch shots and confirm TASK.md hand-ins\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"state\":{\"todos\":{\"1\":{\"content\":\"Clone engine, confirm commit, read docs, RNG title, start PROGRESS.md\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"2\":{\"content\":\"Fix InputFrame compile break; get pav_app/pav_view/pav_tools checking\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"3\":{\"content\":\"All instruments, hazards, ratings, chains, Code, cases 0-2, bot, cues, tests\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"4\":{\"content\":\"10-foot shell: menus, pause, settings, save, glyphs, attract, touch-only, dev sliders\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"5\":{\"content\":\"Paper theatre, music buses at 0.10, gibberish voices through case 7\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"6\":{\"content\":\"Strains, gifts, tremor, Cryoprobe, Duet, cases 3-7, local 1-4, Code Blue\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"7\":{\"content\":\"Hub shim proof: hub.txt written from the four PASS logs and cursor numbers\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"8\":{\"content\":\"Capture results.png from a skill-1.0 bot win, refresh balance.txt and the suite log\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"9\":{\"content\":\"Fix hub snapshot timing so host and client vitals match, re-run the two-page check, overwrite hub.txt\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"10\":{\"content\":\"Re-run four hub harness queries on the new pack and confirm __hubCheck.pass\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"11\":{\"content\":\"Re-run the sim suite so it prints N passed, 0 failed\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"12\":{\"content\":\"Let the shipped pad/mouse mapping select Cryoprobe and Dressing and clear an ember and a dressing\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"13\":{\"content\":\"Draw the hub operative field instead of returning before the plate\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"14\":{\"content\":\"Pack the HTML, delete the cargo target, rerun hub and cursor checks\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"15\":{\"content\":\"Re-run file:// launch shots and confirm TASK.md hand-ins\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"}}}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"4efbc71d-6d17-4e3f-9112-43b9da578194"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1033","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The work is complete and ready to report.\n\nFixed the shared play freeze after the first operation picture by adding a 32ms timer to step the simulation during hub sessions when the display callback goes quiet. Countdown frames still skip GPU present to keep host-leave traffic high. Packed HTML and deleted cargo targets. All four hub queries pass on this pack, including host-leave with roughly 50 hands each way. Two-page cursor check matches: vitals 67.4 on both pages, client aim moved the host cursor from 0 to 4.08.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Shared play now keeps moving after the first operation picture, and the packed page passes the hub checks.\n\nThe software GPU was stopping the display callback on the first shared operation frame, so vitals and the cursor froze. Countdown frames still skip that picture, which is what leaves time for traffic before a host drops. A 32 ms timer steps the simulation only while a hub session is active and that callback is quiet. Solo play does not use the timer.\n\nOn this pack, all four hub queries passed, including host-leave with players still in the room (`p1 ↑52 ↓144`, `p2 ↑52 ↓147`, `p3 ↑53 ↓145`). The two-page check matched vitals at 67.4 and moved the host cursor from 0 to 4.08. Two `file://` launches showed the title Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion, music at 0.10, and a pad press opening the menu, with no console errors. Title, about, and story shots are on disk. The operation shot was cut off when the browser was killed under memory pressure after the operation had already opened.\n\nThe HTML file and `exit-interview.json` are in this folder. The cargo target is removed, and the local server is stopped."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1061,"output_tokens":537,"cache_read_input_tokens":174976,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"fd152f50-b0ff-4434-ba52-933998d2b157"}
