{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1055","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hub_shim string appears to have a different name, causing session_first to print \"no-shim-name\".\n\nChecking HTML script order to confirm session.js loads first. Will update PROGRESS.md, delete the 2.0GB .harbor-target file, and mark todos complete. Other agents' Python servers will be left untouched.\n\nThe PROGRESS.md update will record the pack size, suite results, and hub query outcomes.\n\nCursor MATCH vitals are 67.4 and timers are 239.5. Two file:// launches ran on this pack: title, music 0.10, canvas 1920×1080, and pad-south opened menu. Shots include title, about, and story. The operation grab crashed the browser from earlyoom; launch-env.txt records this. Older op/dev/results shots belong to an earlier pack and should not be claimed for the current one. The exit-interview matches about.json and page about-data, with usage added on import.\n\nI will grep the 11MB HTML file for script tags to confirm session.js loads first. I also need to check hub.txt and launch status for exact figures, review PLAN deviations, and verify the skeptic fixes remain in the shipped tree.\n\nI will read hub.txt, launch status, and launch-env.txt in one command before writing PROGRESS.md. I am also checking whether to mention scratch paths in the hand-in file, since that folder may be deleted afterward.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92044c13-cf41-475d-8804-5dd9876f31ac-11","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"<script","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html","head_limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-92044c13-cf41-475d-8804-5dd9876f31ac-12","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-g