{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1057","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"session.js is the first script. It is inlined and unmodified from aihub-session 1.\n\nUpdating PROGRESS.md with corrected metrics. Hub vitals are now 67.4 / 239.5. Packed HTML is now 11,611,221 bytes. The suite still shows 16 passed tests after the product.rs timer change. Deleting .harbor-target.\n\nThe current pack lacks operation and dev shots. Those were from an earlier pack. The operation shot crashed on this pack. PROGRESS.md will be rewritten honestly to avoid misleading later agents. Todos 16 and 17 will be marked complete. A decision is needed on whether to retry the operation and dev screenshots.\n\nMemory is tight: 5.9 Gi free with swap full, and the 2 GB target will be deleted. Chromium with SwiftShader for a 11 MB WASM game may need several gigabytes, so the operation shot likely crashed from memory pressure. The operation and dev screenshots are evidence-only and do not gate suite success. Item 3 of the verification plan uses launch-env.txt if the browser is killed.\n\nThe crash happened during the extra shot pass, not the two successful launches. Retrying the operation shot risks another out-of-memory kill and is not required by the evaluator. I will delete the target and leave Chromium stopped. PROGRESS.md will be rewritten next.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-78d25040-c44e-4b32-a129-b321a80884e8-18","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/PROGRESS.md","content":"# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\n\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\n\nDev folder and HTML basename:\n\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\n\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\n\n## Done\n\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\n- Deterministic surgery sim: eight ring tools plus Cryoprobe, Dressing, and Defibrillator. Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to Cryoprobe and Dressing. A shipped mapping test clears a fresh case 5 ember and a fresh case 2 dressing through octant, cycle, tray, and that swap.\n- 10-foot shell: title, campaign, case files, pause, settings, about, attract, touch-only gate, Dev Mode sliders and Reset All. Music bus default 0.10. Synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices.\n- Hub copies draw a coarse plate, instruments, hazards, and cursors. Quiet frames skip the demo world. Countdown frames skip the present. A 32 ms timer steps the sim only while a hub session is active, after the first operation present stops the display callback. Solo play does not use that timer. Hands and snapshots start when the countdown starts.\n- Hub harness on this HTML: four queries passed. players=4 `↑57 ↓145 / ↑55 ↓151 / ↑55 ↓150`. host-leave `p1 ↑52 ↓144 p2 ↑52 ↓147 p3 ↑53 ↓145` and the host-left void. server `p0 ↑76 ↓152 p1 ↑77 ↓150 server ↑75 ↓152`. players=1 `p0 ↑78 ↓0`. Two pages: client aim moved host cursor 0 to 4.082500457763672; both pages vitals 67.4000015258789 and timer 239.5.\n- Packed one HTML at the work root (11,611,221 bytes). `session.js` (AI Hub session 1.4.0) is the first script. `exit-interview.json`, `about.json`, and the page `#about-data` are the same object. Usage is `added on import`.\n- Suite re-run after the last `product.rs` change: `16 passed, 0 failed`, exit 0. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case.\n- Two file:// launches of this HTML: title Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion, music 0.10, canvas 1920×1080, empty console, DualSense Cross opens the menu the same way both times.\n- This pack’s 1920×1080 shots: title, about, story. The operation grab then died with Playwright `Target crashed` while swap was full. That log is in the scratch `launch-env.txt`. The green suite is the bar for that pass. Older operation, results, and dev shots in scratch are from an earlier pack.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Cargo builds use `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` at `work/.harbor-target` because the dev folder name contains a colon. That directory is removed after the suite. `engine/target` is not present.\n- Case and story tables live in `content.rs` and `story.rs`. See `content/README.md` and `PLAN.md` Deviations.\n- Dev Mode “Bot plays” sets `bot_drive`. During an operation the skill-1.0 hand then fills slot 0. Attract still uses the same hand on its own.\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-78d25040-c44e-4b32-a129-b321a80884e8-19","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"16","content":"Re-run tests/run_all.py into suite.txt after the last product.rs change","status":"completed"},{"id":"17","content":"Write launch-env.txt and confirm TASK.md hand-ins","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":691,"output_tokens":1542,"cache_read_input_tokens":49152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"950e3451-df4e-4b07-a580-38772d4b6dcd"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-78d25040-c44e-4b32-a129-b321a80884e8-18","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\n\\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\\n\\nDev folder and HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n- Deterministic surgery sim: eight tools plus Cryoprobe, Dressing, and Defibrillator; vitals; heartbeat and on-beat window; Code; chains; ranks C/B/A/S/ENCORE; gifts Hush, Echo, Duet. Cases 0–7 and Code Blue.\\n- 10-foot shell: title, campaign, case files, pause, settings, about, attract, touch-only gate, Dev Mode sliders and Reset All. Music bus default 0.10. Synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices.\\n- Hub: unmodified `session.js` first, shim, pre-op card, host snapshots, client mirror. Harness queries passed. A client aim moves the host cursor for that seat. At the comparison point both pages reported vitals 65.5999984741211 and timer 239.1999969482422.\\n- Packed one HTML at the work root (11,598,415 bytes). `exit-interview.json` matches the page `about-data`. Usage is `added on import`. `session.js` is the first script.\\n- Suite after the Cryoprobe, Dressing, and hub-field fixes: `16 passed, 0 failed`. Skill 1.0 wins every case and Code Blue. Skill 0 loses every case. Balance for skills 1.0, 0.7, 0.4, and 0 is in the scratch `balance.txt`.\\n- Two file:// launches: title Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion, music 0.10, canvas 1920×1080, no page errors, DualSense Cross opens the menu the same way both times.\\n- 1920×1080 shots: title, story, operation, results, dev, about. Results is Anton Deverell, The First Movement, score 3616, rank ENCORE, after Dev Mode “Bot plays” on the packed page.\\n- Hub harness: four queries passed. A second page’s aim moves the host cursor. Vitals on that check were one snapshot apart.\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Cargo builds use `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` at `work/.harbor-target` because the dev folder name contains a colon. That directory and `engine/target` are removed after the pack.\\n- Case and story tables live in `content.rs` and `story.rs`. See `content/README.md` and `PLAN.md` Deviations.\\n- Dev Mode “Bot plays” sets `bot_drive`. During an operation the skill-1.0 hand then fills slot 0. Attract still uses the same hand on its own.\\n\",\"new_string\":\"# Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\n\\nTitle picked with `secrets.randbelow` from 50 riffs: index 9, **Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion**.\\n\\nDev folder and HTML basename:\\n\\n`Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015`\\n\\nEngine: shardfall `49ef2ba` (ancestor check passed).\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Cloned the engine, read START_HERE and MAKE_A_GAME, confirmed the commit.\\n- Deterministic surgery sim: eight ring tools plus Cryoprobe, Dressing, and Defibrillator. Laser or Scanner on an ember that wants the probe, and any ring tool on a closure, resolve to Cryoprobe and Dressing. A shipped mapping test clears a fresh case 5 ember and a fresh case 2 dressing through octant, cycle, tray, and that swap.\\n- 10-foot shell: title, campaign, case files, pause, settings, about, attract, touch-only gate, Dev Mode sliders and Reset All. Music bus default 0.10. Synthesized music, effects, and gibberish voices.\\n- Hub copies draw a coarse plate, instruments, hazards, and cursors. Quiet frames skip the demo world. Countdown frames skip the present. A 32 ms timer steps the sim only while a hub session is active, after the first operation present stops the display callback. Solo play does not use that timer. Hands and snapshots start when the countdown starts.\\n- Hub harness on this H