cene, frame: &CreatureFrame, style: Style) -> Result<(), String> {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/assets.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":110,\"content\":\"pub fn emit_asset(scene: &mut Scene, name: &str, at: Placement, seed: u32, palette: &Palette) -> Result<(), String> {\"},{\"line_number\":205,\"content\":\"pub fn emit_figure(\"},{\"line_number\":232,\"content\":\"pub fn emit_figure_for(\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/vehicles.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\"pub fn emit_cone(scene: &mut Scene, c: &pav_core::stealth::ConeView, group: u32) {\"},{\"line_number\":52,\"content\":\"pub fn emit_vehicle(scene: &mut Scene, o: &RenderObject, v: &VehicleView, style: Style, particles: bool) {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\"    all_lines, chain_mul, contextual_tool, cycle, octant, rank_of, tray_tool, Hazard, Heart, Surgery, CASES, CRYO, DRESSING,\"},{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\"    FORCEPS, GEL, K_BONE, K_DRESSING, K_EMBER, K_POLYP, K_POOL, K_TETHER, LASER, R_SLOPPY, SCALPEL, SCANNER, SUCTION,\"},{\"line_number\":336,\"content\":\"/// Ring tools stay 0–7. Cryoprobe and Dressing are whatever `contextual_tool` returns.\"},{\"line_number\":339,\"content\":\"    let tool = contextual_tool(ring, x, z, &game(sim).hazards);\"},{\"line_number\":367,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(contextual_tool(down, ember.x, ember.z, &game(&sim).hazards), CRYO);\"},{\"line_number\":368,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(contextual_tool(left, ember.x, ember.z, &game(&sim).hazards), CRYO);\"},{\"line_number\":371,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(game(&sim).surgeons[0].tool, CRYO, \\\"laser on an ember must become the cryoprobe\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":381,\"content\":\"            assert_eq!(sent, CRYO);\"},{\"line_number\":385,\"content\":\"        assert_eq!(sent, CRYO);\"},{\"line_number\":469,\"content\":\"        if alive_kind(&sim, K_DRESSING).is_some() {\"},{\"line_number\":474,\"content\":\"    let dressing = alive_kind(&sim, K_DRESSING).unwrap_or_else(|| panic!(\\\"no dressing {}\\\", status(&sim)));\"},{\"line_number\":478,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(contextual_tool(gel, dressing.x, dressing.z, &game(&sim).hazards), DRESSING);\"},{\"line_number\":479,\"content\":\"    assert_ne!(contextual_tool(gel, 8.0, 3.0, &game(&sim).hazards), DRESSING);\"},{\"line_number\":481,\"content\":\"    assert_eq!(game(&sim).surgeons[0].tool, DRESSING, \\\"a closure must auto-select dressing\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":494,\"content\":\"                assert_eq!(sent, DRESSING);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\"pub fn emit(scene: &mut Scene, op: &SurgeryFrame) {\"},{\"line_number\":241,\"content\":\"        LASER | CRYO => Vec3::new(0.0, 0.08, 0.42),\"},{\"line_number\":536,\"content\":\"            tool: CRYO,\"},{\"line_number\":552,\"content\":\"                tool: CRYO,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/build.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":776,\"content\":\"    fn emit_effects(&mut self, scene: &mut Scene) {\"},{\"line_number\":910,\"content\":\"    pub(crate) fn emit_prop(\"},{\"line_number\":962,\"content\":\"    fn emit_particles(&mut self, scene: &mut Scene, e: &EmitterDef, pos: Vec3, key: (u32, u32), dt: f32) {\"},{\"line_number\":1552,\"content\":\"fn emit_soft(scene: &mut Scene, o: &RenderObject, s: &pav_core::frame::SoftView, ov: StyleOverride) {\"},{\"line_number\":1611,\"content\":\"fn emit_zone(list: &mut Vec<MeshInstance>, z: &Zone, ov: StyleOverride) {\"},{\"line_number\":1657,\"content\":\"fn emit_label(out: &mut Vec<Text3d>, l: &Label, rig: &CameraRig) {\"},{\"line_number\":1685,\"content\":\"fn emit_ladder(list: &mut Vec<MeshInstance>, l: &Ladder, style: Style) {\"},{\"line_number\":1721,\"content\":\"fn emit_puppet(scene: &mut Scene, def: &PuppetDef, o: &RenderObject, p: &PuppetFrame, cam_fwd: Vec3, ov: StyleOverride) {\"},{\"line_number\":1768,\"content\":\"pub fn emit_object(scene: &mut Scene, o: &RenderObject, ov: StyleOverride, now: f32, material: u32) {\"},{\"line_number\":2000,\"content\":\"pub(crate) fn emit_prim(\"},{\"line_number\":2097,\"content\":\"pub fn emit_shape(\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/kinds.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"pub const CRYO: u8 = 8;\"},{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\"pub const DRESSING: u8 = 9;\"},{\"line_number\":39,\"content\":\"pub const K_DRESSING: u8 = 16;\"},{\"line_number\":185,\"content\":\"            0 => CRYO,\"},{\"line_number\":189,\"content\":\"        K_DRESSING => DRESSING,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/bot.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":145,\"content\":\"    let paint = matches!(h.tool, GEL | DRESSING) && matches!(h.kind, K_INFLAM | K_BURN | K_DRESSING | K_TUMOR);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":71,\"content\":\"    s(K_DRESSING, -0.15, -1.45, false, 0.2, 0.0),\"},{\"line_number\":168,\"content\":\"const C7_G: &[SpawnDef] = &[s(K_DRESSING, 0.0, -0.15, false, 0.1, 0.0)];\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/ops.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":343,\"content\":\"        let tool = contextual_tool(ring, x, z, &g.hazards);\"},{\"line_number\":639,\"content\":\"            g.spawn_kind_at(K_DRESSING, 0.6, -1.0, 0.1);\"},{\"line_number\":755,\"content\":\"        g.surgeons[i].tool = contextual_tool(tool, x, z, &g.hazards);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/hazard.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":185,\"content\":\"            K_DRESSING => {\"},{\"line_number\":410,\"content\":\"        K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_EMBER if h.stage == 0 && (h.kind != K_EMBER || h.tool == CRYO) => {\"},{\"line_number\":411,\"content\":\"            let cue = if h.tool == CRYO { CUE_FROST } else { CUE_LASER };\"},{\"line_number\":412,\"content\":\"            let misuse = if h.tool == CRYO { 4 } else { 2 };\"},{\"line_number\":427,\"content\":\"        K_INFLAM | K_BURN | K_DRESSING | K_TUMOR if h.tool == GEL || h.tool == DRESSING => {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/map.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\"//! Cryoprobe and Dressing are contextual: the ring stays 0–7, and the hazard under the cursor promotes Laser or Scanner to the probe, or any ring tool to a dressing.\"},{\"line_number\":64,\"content\":\"pub fn octant(stick: Vec2) -> Option<u8> {\"},{\"line_number\":79,\"content\":\"pub fn tray_tool(x: f32, z: f32) -> Option<u8> {\"},{\"line_number\":96,\"content\":\"pub fn contextual_tool<T: ToolSite>(ring: u8, x: f32, z: f32, sites: &[T]) -> u8 {\"},{\"line_number\":101,\"content\":\"        CRYO => LASER,\"},{\"line_number\":102,\"content\":\"        DRESSING => GEL,\"},{\"line_number\":112,\"content\":\"        if site.site_kind() != K_DRESSING {\"},{\"line_number\":117,\"content\":\"        return DRESSING;\"},{\"line_number\":134,\"content\":\"        if tool == DRESSING {\"},{\"line_number\":135,\"content\":\"            return DRESSING;\"},{\"line_number\":137,\"content\":\"        if tool == CRYO && (ring == LASER || ring == SCANNER) {\"},{\"line_number\":138,\"content\":\"            return CRYO;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"pub use map::{contextual_tool, cycle, octant, tray_tool};\"},{\"line_number\":222,\"content\":\"    pub hub_quiet: bool,\"},{\"line_number\":297,\"content\":\"            hub_quiet: false,\"},{\"line_number\":317,\"content\":\"        g.hub_quiet = quiet;\"},{\"line_number\":331,\"content\":\"        self.hub_quiet = true;\"},{\"line_number\":971,\"content\":\"        fr.quiet = self.hub_quiet;\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-87744d96-cd68-4d68-8420-2b509b79ad41-74