{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1068","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hub quiet path now emits a coarse plate, instruments, and hazards.\n\nThe test suite covers `pav_core` surgery, `pav_ui`, and `pav_audio`. It checks vertex count and SDF positions to validate `emit()`.\n\nThe quiet hub test lives in `pav_view` but is missing from the suite. The suite now reports 16 passed tests, two more than before. The new tests likely come from `shipped_mapping` or another module. This leaves a gap: the test exists but may not be included in `run_all`. The verification plan requires the suite to be green and include specific observations.\n\nThe suite previously had 14 tests: 7 in `pav_core`, 6 in `pav_ui`, and 1 in `pav_audio`. The two new passes are `shipped_mapping` and the missing `pav_view` test. A test that exists but is not run by the suite provides weak evidence.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e14b5bea-7d43-4950-8861-d4839cf0776f-88","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/tests/run_all.py"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e14b5bea-7d43-4950-8861-d4839cf0776f-89","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"#\\[test\\]|#\\[ignore\\]","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e14b5bea-7d43-4950-8861-d4839cf0776f-90","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"#\\[test\\]","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_ui/src/surgery/mod.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id