point. Rewind and replay hashes match.\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"- [x] Add the four strains, Hush, Echo, tremor, Cryoprobe, Duet, cases 3–7, local 1–4 play, and Code Blue.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"fa707c31-b83a-4559-bc25-68b75e79d532"}
