{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1089","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"function.\n\nThe `cycle()` functionThe suite counts individual wraps tool indices modulo 8, so digit 9 Rust tests. would land on an invalid tool. The `DEFIB` and `TOOL_KEEP` constants in `contextual_tool` are unverified. `hands()` clamps input tools with `min(DEFIB)`, which allows CRYO and DRESSING through while keeping ring tools within bounds.\n\nKeyboard digits 9 and 0 map to CRYO and DRESSING in the shell, but the simulation folds them back through","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e5f8ee8-7503-458e-8b9c-b4d67298e7dd-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"#\\[test\\]|#\\[ignore\\]|fn ","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e5f8ee8-7503-458e-8b9c-b4d67298e7dd-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"#\\[test\\]|#\\[ignore\\]","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates","glob":"**/{pav_ui,pav_audio,pav_view}/**/*.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e5f8ee8-7503-458e-8b9c-b4d67298e7dd-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/view-test.txt","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e5f8ee8-7503-458e-8b9c-b4d67298e7dd-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/map-test.txt","limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4632,"output_tokens":452,"cache_read_input_tokens":569