{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1096","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" drawing and rely on vertex paint, which may be invisible on the coarse 16x8 plate grid. Embers render as SDFs. The prior gap is that emit() returns before plate, instruments, hazards, or cursors.\n\nThe fix draws the scene. The test validatesNeed to find M_OP and ember SDFs, cursor SDFs, and plate vertices. A blank scene is no longer possible. The coarse 16x8 plate is an intentional performance M_MIRROR values. The test uses modes 3 and 8. tradeoff that still renders the field. Hazards in the default branch still rely on vertex paint.","signature":"wEzC2m6JnUEFXsyBMDnanqh5Qs7VWiRHYKsLF9hHjn6aQuNY4mAF4GupKs1V2HuXLfhkVSDaAOBHzq2FfrlFNruJUeogXpHM0aR6Zzo0UGvD6zUEkI7nmGfn6b2WcercSx2p2F3+vZpvOywonOnPIaXMIheDex4X/N7FCvznqOmsDWEBYP36MMDbJTppg68Jo9RfPx3xKEdSXIV0"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-beaf559a-19c8-4071-9b3c-545a872cf00c-26","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"M_OP|M_MIRROR|M_TITLE|M_CARD","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/kinds.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-beaf559a-19c8-4071-9b3c-545a872cf00c-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs","offset":540,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5137,"output_tokens":257,"cache_read_input_tokens":67456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"7da9ff04-77b0-4507-881a-55c7d15677c4"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-beaf559a-19c8-4071-9b3c-545a872cf00c-26","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,48,49,53,95,95,120,52,50,54,55,55,97,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-beaf559a-19c8-4071-9b3c-545a872cf00c-27","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"540→\\n    #[test]\\n    fn quiet_hub_draws_plate_instruments_hazards_and_cursors() {\\n        for mode in [3_u8, 8] {\\n            let mut op = SurgeryFrame::empty();\\n            op.quiet = true;\\n            op.mode = mode;\\n            op.hazards.push(hazard(K_EMBER, -1.2, 0.8));\\n            op.cursors[0] = CursorView {\\n                active: true,\\n550→                x: 2.0,\\n                z: -1.0,\\n                tool: CRYO,\\n                score: 0,\\n                chain: 0,\\n                meter: 0.0,\\n                color: [0.9, 0.2, 0.2],\\n            };\\n            let mut scene = Scene::default();\\n            emit(&mut scene, &op);\\n560→            let plate = scene.dynamic.first().expect(\\\"plate\\\");\\n            let n = plate.data.vertices.len();\\n            assert!(n > 100 && n < 8_000, \\\"mode {mode} coarse plate had {n} verts\\\");\\n            assert!(plate.data.vertices.iter().any(|v| v.pos[0] < -10.0), \\\"mode {mode} field\\\");\\n            assert!(plate.data.vertices.iter().any(|v| v.pos[0] > 10.0), \\\"mode {mode} field\\\");\\n            let ember = scene.sdfs.iter().any(|s| (s.a.x + 1.2).abs() < 0.05 && (s.a.z - 0.8).abs() < 0.05);\\n            let cursor = scene.sdfs.iter().any(|s| (s.a.x - 2.0).abs() < 0.05 && (s.a.z + 1.0).abs() < 0.05);\\n            assert!(ember, \\\"mode {mode} ember sdf missing\\\");\\n            assert!(cursor, \\\"mode {mode} cursor sdf missing\\\");\\n        }\\n570→    }\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"540→\\n    #[test]\\n    fn quiet_hub_draws_plate_instruments_hazards_and_cursors() {\\n        for mode in [3_u8, 8] {\\n            let mut op = SurgeryFrame::empty();\\n            op.quiet = true;\\n            op.mode = mode;\\n            op.hazards.push(hazard(K_EMBER, -1.2, 0.8));\\n            op.cursors[0] = CursorView {\\n                active: true,\\n550→                x: 2.0,\\n                z: -1.0,\\n                tool: CRYO,\\n                score: 0,\\n                chain: 0,\\n                meter: 0.0,\\n                color: [0.9, 0.2, 0.2],\\n            };\\n            let mut scene = Scene::default();\\n            emit(&mut scene, &op);\\n560→            let plate = scene.dynamic.first().expect(\\\"plate\\\");\\n            let n = plate.data.vertices.len();\\n            assert!(n > 100 && n < 8_000, \\\"mode {mode} coarse plate had {n} verts\\\");\\n            assert!(plate.data.vertices.iter().any(|v| v.pos[0] < -10.0), \\\"mode {mode} field\\\");\\n            assert!(plate.data.vertices.iter().any(|v| v.pos[0] > 10.0), \\\"mode {mode} field\\\");\\n            let ember = scene.sdfs.iter().any(|s| (s.a.x + 1.2).abs() < 0.05 && (s.a.z - 0.8).abs() < 0.05);\\n            let cursor = scene.sdfs.iter().any(|s| (s.a.x - 2.0).abs() < 0.05 && (s.a.z + 1.0).abs() < 0.05);\\n            assert!(ember, \\\"mode {mode} ember sdf missing\\\");\\n            assert!(cursor, \\\"mode {mode} cursor sdf missing\\\");\\n        }\\n570→    }\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs\",\"offset\":540,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"\\n    #[test]\\n    fn quiet_hub_draws_plate_instruments_hazards_and_cursors() {\\n        for mode in [3_u8, 8] {\\n            let mut op = SurgeryFrame::empty();\\n            op.quiet = true;\\n            op.mode = mode;\\n            op.hazards.push(hazard(K_EMBER, -1.2, 0.8));\\n            op.cursors[0] = CursorView {\\n                active: true,\\n                x: 2.0,\\n                z: -1.0,\\n                tool: CRYO,\\n                score: 0,\\n                chain: 0,\\n                meter: 0.0,\\n                color: [0.9, 0.2, 0.2],\\n            };\\n            let mut scene = Scene::default();\\n            emit(&mut scene, &op);\\n            let plate = scene.dynamic.first().expect(\\\"plate\\\");\\n            let n = plate.data.vertices.len();\\n            assert!(n > 100 && n < 8_000, \\\"mode {mode} coarse plate had {n} verts\\\");\\n            assert!(plate.data.vertices.iter().any(|v| v.pos[0] < -10.0), \\\"mode {mode} field\\\");\\n            assert!(plate.data.vertices.iter().any(|v| v.pos[0] > 10.0), \\\"mode {mode} field\\\");\\n            let ember = scene.sdfs.iter().any(|s| (s.a.x + 1.2).abs() < 0.05 && (s.a.z - 0.8).abs() < 0.05);\\n            let cursor = scene.sdfs.iter().any(|s| (s.a.x - 2.0).abs() < 0.05 && (s.a.z + 1.0).abs() < 0.05);\\n            assert!(ember, \\\"mode {mode} ember sdf missing\\\");\\n            assert!(cursor, \\\"mode {mode} cursor sdf missing\\\");\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":571}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"18f0484d-82fc-4e16-883c-462d7eb9a609"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1097","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe double-application of resolve_hands and sim hands() does not break cryo selection. The simulation folds CRYO to LASER via contextual_tool, then restores it when the surgeon is over an ember. This confirms the tool resolution logic is sound.Checking mod.rs and content for M_OP.","signature":"ZAzEblFQ8LQMbo7xrdVgQsPAm1579NBljQbHbWWVGUBRetsKQtO+2j14yKIG/r9gbCEr/XjsVh6YKpcSmfi1v4i9xHDQhfQAm4gr+202pYTef2hSO0ossoHyEA"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b9611c9c-fdbf-4ead-8ed0-d05fac268acb-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"const M_OP|M_MIRROR|M_OP:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":803,"output_tokens":123,"cache_read_input_tokens":72576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"d540c141-117f-4c67-928c-1d3945e8f5f4"}
