{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1098","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nA slight cursor offset between the shell snapshot and simulation position could theoretically break promotion, but this is an edge case rather than a clear bug.\n\nThe pad's absoluteHub host and client modes match. Both use aim is velocity-based, so resolve_hands correctly hub_quiet. falls back to the previous cursor position. The simulation then promotes the tool again at the new cursor position after steering.\n\nThe test's pre-application of contextual_tool is not faking the simulation result; it is driving the same logic that the simulation runs internally.\n\nThe first test assertion sends the LASER tool and asserts the simulation stores CRYO. This forces the simulation to perform promotion internally. The frost loop then uses mapped() with a pre-promoted CRYO, but the simulation folds it back to LASER and re-promotes it again. The ember clears through real hazard::apply. The test is therefore honest because it exercises\n\nThe blank scene is the full octant, cycle, fixed by emitting draws tray, contextual_tool, and returning a surgery-only and Sim::step pipeline. scene during quiet builds. The next step is to inspect hazard application for ember and dressing, and check if contextual_tool case 5 handles multiple hazard types correctly with the CRYO tool field.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-00019da8-d5d9-41a7-a012-9a0eafb529b2-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/kinds.rs","offset":1,"limit":220}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-00019da8-d5d9-41a7-a012-9a0eafb529b2-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/hazard.rs","offset":350,"limit":200}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":484,"output_tokens":430,"cache_read_input_tokens":73344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"b68998b0-8689-4e6c-89c0-073edb997b5c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-00019da8-d5d9-41a7-a012-9a0eafb529b2-29","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→//! Tool, hazard, rating and cue ids for the Night Ward. Closed lists.\\n\\npub const TITLE: &str = \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\\";\\n\\npub const SCALPEL: u8 = 0;\\npub const FORCEPS: u8 = 1;\\npub const SUTURE: u8 = 2;\\npub const SUCTION: u8 = 3;\\npub const LASER: u8 = 4;\\n10→pub const GEL: u8 = 5;\\npub const SCANNER: u8 = 6;\\npub const IV: u8 = 7;\\npub const CRYO: u8 = 8;\\npub const DRESSING: u8 = 9;\\npub const DEFIB: u8 = 10;\\npub const TOOL_KEEP: u8 = 255;\\n\\npub const TOOL_NAMES: [&str; 11] =\\n    [\\\"Scalpel\\\", \\\"Forceps\\\", \\\"Suture\\\", \\\"Suction\\\", \\\"Laser\\\", \\\"Gel\\\", \\\"Scanner\\\", \\\"IV Push\\\", \\\"Cryoprobe\\\", \\\"Dressing\\\", \\\"Defibrillator\\\"];\\n20→\\npub const N_TOOLS: usize = 11;\\n\\npub const K_INCISION: u8 = 0;\\npub const K_LACERATION: u8 = 1;\\npub const K_POOL: u8 = 2;\\npub const K_BLEEDER: u8 = 3;\\npub const K_FOREIGN: u8 = 4;\\npub const K_POLYP: u8 = 5;\\npub const K_TUMOR: u8 = 6;\\n30→pub const K_INFLAM: u8 = 7;\\npub const K_BONE: u8 = 8;\\npub const K_NODULE: u8 = 9;\\npub const K_SAC: u8 = 10;\\npub const K_EYE: u8 = 11;\\npub const K_EMBER: u8 = 12;\\npub const K_HEAT: u8 = 13;\\npub const K_TETHER: u8 = 14;\\npub const K_TENDRIL: u8 = 15;\\npub const K_DRESSING: u8 = 16;\\n40→pub const K_IV: u8 = 17;\\npub const K_BURN: u8 = 18;\\n\\npub const N_KINDS: usize = 19;\\n\\npub const KIND_NAMES: [&str; N_KINDS] = [\\n    \\\"incision\\\", \\\"laceration\\\", \\\"pool\\\", \\\"bleeder\\\", \\\"foreign\\\", \\\"polyp\\\", \\\"tumor\\\", \\\"inflam\\\", \\\"bone\\\", \\\"nodule\\\", \\\"sac\\\", \\\"eye\\\",\\n    \\\"ember\\\", \\\"heat\\\", \\\"tether\\\", \\\"tendril\\\", \\\"dressing\\\", \\\"iv\\\", \\\"burn\\\",\\n];\\n\\n50→pub const R_IMMACULATE: u8 = 0;\\npub const R_CLEAN: u8 = 1;\\npub const R_GOOD: u8 = 2;\\npub const R_SLOPPY: u8 = 3;\\n\\npub const RATING_NAMES: [&str; 4] = [\\\"IMMACULATE\\\", \\\"CLEAN\\\", \\\"GOOD\\\", \\\"SLOPPY\\\"];\\n\\npub fn rating_points(r: u8) -> i32 {\\n    match r {\\n        R_IMMACULATE => 400,\\n60→        R_CLEAN => 250,\\n        R_GOOD => 120,\\n        _ => 10,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn rate_error(err: f32, strict: f32) -> u8 {\\n    let e = err.max(0.0) * strict.max(0.25);\\n    if e <= 0.22 {\\n        R_IMMACULATE\\n70→    } else if e <= 0.42 {\\n        R_CLEAN\\n    } else if e <= 0.72 {\\n        R_GOOD\\n    } else {\\n        R_SLOPPY\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn chain_mul(chain: u32) -> f32 {\\n80→    if chain >= 20 {\\n        2.0\\n    } else if chain >= 10 {\\n        1.5\\n    } else if chain >= 5 {\\n        1.25\\n    } else {\\n        1.0\\n    }\\n}\\n90→\\n/// Ranks at 50 / 70 / 85 / 100 / 115 percent of par. 0 is below C.\\npub fn rank_of(score: i32, par: i32) -> u8 {\\n    if par <= 0 {\\n        return 1;\\n    }\\n    let p = score as f32 / par as f32;\\n    if p >= 1.15 {\\n        5\\n    } else if p >= 1.0 {\\n100→        4\\n    } else if p >= 0.85 {\\n        3\\n    } else if p >= 0.70 {\\n        2\\n    } else if p >= 0.50 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n110→}\\n\\npub fn rank_name(r: u8) -> &'static str {\\n    match r {\\n        1 => \\\"C\\\",\\n        2 => \\\"B\\\",\\n        3 => \\\"A\\\",\\n        4 => \\\"S\\\",\\n        5 => \\\"ENCORE\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"\\\",\\n120→    }\\n}\\n\\npub const STRAIN_PHASES: [&str; 18] = [\\n    \\\"introit:wander\\\",\\n    \\\"introit:split\\\",\\n    \\\"introit:smalls\\\",\\n    \\\"introit:amen\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:wave1\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:wave2\\\",\\n130→    \\\"lacrimosa:wave3\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:eye\\\",\\n    \\\"dies:embers\\\",\\n    \\\"dies:merge\\\",\\n    \\\"dies:furnace\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:a\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:b\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:c\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:stop\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:soloist\\\",\\n140→    \\\"libera:tendril\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:close\\\",\\n];\\n\\npub fn strain_phase_index(name: &str) -> Option<usize> {\\n    STRAIN_PHASES.iter().position(|s| *s == name)\\n}\\n\\npub fn kind_index(name: &str) -> Option<u8> {\\n    KIND_NAMES.iter().position(|s| *s == name).map(|i| i as u8)\\n150→}\\n\\npub fn tool_for_kind(kind: u8, stage: u8) -> u8 {\\n    match kind {\\n        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => SCALPEL,\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER => SUTURE,\\n        K_POOL => SUCTION,\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL => FORCEPS,\\n        K_POLYP => LASER,\\n        K_TUMOR => match stage {\\n160→            0 => SCALPEL,\\n            1 => FORCEPS,\\n            _ => GEL,\\n        },\\n        K_INFLAM | K_BURN => GEL,\\n        K_BONE => {\\n            if stage == 0 {\\n                FORCEPS\\n            } else {\\n                SUTURE\\n170→            }\\n        }\\n        K_NODULE => {\\n            if stage == 0 {\\n                LASER\\n            } else {\\n                FORCEPS\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_SAC => LASER,\\n180→        K_EYE => match stage {\\n            0 | 1 => SCALPEL,\\n            _ => FORCEPS,\\n        },\\n        K_EMBER => match stage {\\n            0 => CRYO,\\n            1 => SCALPEL,\\n            _ => FORCEPS,\\n        },\\n        K_DRESSING => DRESSING,\\n190→        K_IV => IV,\\n        K_HEAT => TOOL_KEEP,\\n        _ => SCALPEL,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn stages_for(kind: u8) -> u8 {\\n    match kind {\\n        K_TUMOR | K_EMBER | K_EYE => 3,\\n        K_BONE | K_NODULE => 2,\\n200→        _ => 1,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Cue ids. The audio crate renders each one.\\npub const CUE_PICK: u16 = 1;\\npub const CUE_SLICE: u16 = 2;\\npub const CUE_SQUISH: u16 = 3;\\npub const CUE_FORCEPS: u16 = 4;\\npub const CUE_POP: u16 = 5;\\n210→pub const CUE_ZIP: u16 = 6;\\npub const CUE_GURGLE: u16 = 7;\\npub const CUE_LASER: u16 = 8;\\npub const CUE_SIZZLE: u16 = 9;\\npub const CUE_GEL: u16 = 10;\\npub const CUE_IV: u16 = 11;\\npub const CUE_PING: u16 = 12;\\npub const CUE_WHINE: u16 = 13;\\npub const CUE_THUMP: u16 = 14;\\npub const CUE_LUB: u16 = 15;\\n220→pub const CUE_DUB: u16 = 16;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→//! Tool, hazard, rating and cue ids for the Night Ward. Closed lists.\\n\\npub const TITLE: &str = \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\\";\\n\\npub const SCALPEL: u8 = 0;\\npub const FORCEPS: u8 = 1;\\npub const SUTURE: u8 = 2;\\npub const SUCTION: u8 = 3;\\npub const LASER: u8 = 4;\\n10→pub const GEL: u8 = 5;\\npub const SCANNER: u8 = 6;\\npub const IV: u8 = 7;\\npub const CRYO: u8 = 8;\\npub const DRESSING: u8 = 9;\\npub const DEFIB: u8 = 10;\\npub const TOOL_KEEP: u8 = 255;\\n\\npub const TOOL_NAMES: [&str; 11] =\\n    [\\\"Scalpel\\\", \\\"Forceps\\\", \\\"Suture\\\", \\\"Suction\\\", \\\"Laser\\\", \\\"Gel\\\", \\\"Scanner\\\", \\\"IV Push\\\", \\\"Cryoprobe\\\", \\\"Dressing\\\", \\\"Defibrillator\\\"];\\n20→\\npub const N_TOOLS: usize = 11;\\n\\npub const K_INCISION: u8 = 0;\\npub const K_LACERATION: u8 = 1;\\npub const K_POOL: u8 = 2;\\npub const K_BLEEDER: u8 = 3;\\npub const K_FOREIGN: u8 = 4;\\npub const K_POLYP: u8 = 5;\\npub const K_TUMOR: u8 = 6;\\n30→pub const K_INFLAM: u8 = 7;\\npub const K_BONE: u8 = 8;\\npub const K_NODULE: u8 = 9;\\npub const K_SAC: u8 = 10;\\npub const K_EYE: u8 = 11;\\npub const K_EMBER: u8 = 12;\\npub const K_HEAT: u8 = 13;\\npub const K_TETHER: u8 = 14;\\npub const K_TENDRIL: u8 = 15;\\npub const K_DRESSING: u8 = 16;\\n40→pub const K_IV: u8 = 17;\\npub const K_BURN: u8 = 18;\\n\\npub const N_KINDS: usize = 19;\\n\\npub const KIND_NAMES: [&str; N_KINDS] = [\\n    \\\"incision\\\", \\\"laceration\\\", \\\"pool\\\", \\\"bleeder\\\", \\\"foreign\\\", \\\"polyp\\\", \\\"tumor\\\", \\\"inflam\\\", \\\"bone\\\", \\\"nodule\\\", \\\"sac\\\", \\\"eye\\\",\\n    \\\"ember\\\", \\\"heat\\\", \\\"tether\\\", \\\"tendril\\\", \\\"dressing\\\", \\\"iv\\\", \\\"burn\\\",\\n];\\n\\n50→pub const R_IMMACULATE: u8 = 0;\\npub const R_CLEAN: u8 = 1;\\npub const R_GOOD: u8 = 2;\\npub const R_SLOPPY: u8 = 3;\\n\\npub const RATING_NAMES: [&str; 4] = [\\\"IMMACULATE\\\", \\\"CLEAN\\\", \\\"GOOD\\\", \\\"SLOPPY\\\"];\\n\\npub fn rating_points(r: u8) -> i32 {\\n    match r {\\n        R_IMMACULATE => 400,\\n60→        R_CLEAN => 250,\\n        R_GOOD => 120,\\n        _ => 10,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn rate_error(err: f32, strict: f32) -> u8 {\\n    let e = err.max(0.0) * strict.max(0.25);\\n    if e <= 0.22 {\\n        R_IMMACULATE\\n70→    } else if e <= 0.42 {\\n        R_CLEAN\\n    } else if e <= 0.72 {\\n        R_GOOD\\n    } else {\\n        R_SLOPPY\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn chain_mul(chain: u32) -> f32 {\\n80→    if chain >= 20 {\\n        2.0\\n    } else if chain >= 10 {\\n        1.5\\n    } else if chain >= 5 {\\n        1.25\\n    } else {\\n        1.0\\n    }\\n}\\n90→\\n/// Ranks at 50 / 70 / 85 / 100 / 115 percent of par. 0 is below C.\\npub fn rank_of(score: i32, par: i32) -> u8 {\\n    if par <= 0 {\\n        return 1;\\n    }\\n    let p = score as f32 / par as f32;\\n    if p >= 1.15 {\\n        5\\n    } else if p >= 1.0 {\\n100→        4\\n    } else if p >= 0.85 {\\n        3\\n    } else if p >= 0.70 {\\n        2\\n    } else if p >= 0.50 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n110→}\\n\\npub fn rank_name(r: u8) -> &'static str {\\n    match r {\\n        1 => \\\"C\\\",\\n        2 => \\\"B\\\",\\n        3 => \\\"A\\\",\\n        4 => \\\"S\\\",\\n        5 => \\\"ENCORE\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"\\\",\\n120→    }\\n}\\n\\npub const STRAIN_PHASES: [&str; 18] = [\\n    \\\"introit:wander\\\",\\n    \\\"introit:split\\\",\\n    \\\"introit:smalls\\\",\\n    \\\"introit:amen\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:wave1\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:wave2\\\",\\n130→    \\\"lacrimosa:wave3\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:eye\\\",\\n    \\\"dies:embers\\\",\\n    \\\"dies:merge\\\",\\n    \\\"dies:furnace\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:a\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:b\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:c\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:stop\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:soloist\\\",\\n140→    \\\"libera:tendril\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:close\\\",\\n];\\n\\npub fn strain_phase_index(name: &str) -> Option<usize> {\\n    STRAIN_PHASES.iter().position(|s| *s == name)\\n}\\n\\npub fn kind_index(name: &str) -> Option<u8> {\\n    KIND_NAMES.iter().position(|s| *s == name).map(|i| i as u8)\\n150→}\\n\\npub fn tool_for_kind(kind: u8, stage: u8) -> u8 {\\n    match kind {\\n        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => SCALPEL,\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER => SUTURE,\\n        K_POOL => SUCTION,\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL => FORCEPS,\\n        K_POLYP => LASER,\\n        K_TUMOR => match stage {\\n160→            0 => SCALPEL,\\n            1 => FORCEPS,\\n            _ => GEL,\\n        },\\n        K_INFLAM | K_BURN => GEL,\\n        K_BONE => {\\n            if stage == 0 {\\n                FORCEPS\\n            } else {\\n                SUTURE\\n170→            }\\n        }\\n        K_NODULE => {\\n            if stage == 0 {\\n                LASER\\n            } else {\\n                FORCEPS\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_SAC => LASER,\\n180→        K_EYE => match stage {\\n            0 | 1 => SCALPEL,\\n            _ => FORCEPS,\\n        },\\n        K_EMBER => match stage {\\n            0 => CRYO,\\n            1 => SCALPEL,\\n            _ => FORCEPS,\\n        },\\n        K_DRESSING => DRESSING,\\n190→        K_IV => IV,\\n        K_HEAT => TOOL_KEEP,\\n        _ => SCALPEL,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn stages_for(kind: u8) -> u8 {\\n    match kind {\\n        K_TUMOR | K_EMBER | K_EYE => 3,\\n        K_BONE | K_NODULE => 2,\\n200→        _ => 1,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Cue ids. The audio crate renders each one.\\npub const CUE_PICK: u16 = 1;\\npub const CUE_SLICE: u16 = 2;\\npub const CUE_SQUISH: u16 = 3;\\npub const CUE_FORCEPS: u16 = 4;\\npub const CUE_POP: u16 = 5;\\n210→pub const CUE_ZIP: u16 = 6;\\npub const CUE_GURGLE: u16 = 7;\\npub const CUE_LASER: u16 = 8;\\npub const CUE_SIZZLE: u16 = 9;\\npub const CUE_GEL: u16 = 10;\\npub const CUE_IV: u16 = 11;\\npub const CUE_PING: u16 = 12;\\npub const CUE_WHINE: u16 = 13;\\npub const CUE_THUMP: u16 = 14;\\npub const CUE_LUB: u16 = 15;\\n220→pub const CUE_DUB: u16 = 16;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/kinds.rs\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":220,\"raw_output\":\"//! Tool, hazard, rating and cue ids for the Night Ward. Closed lists.\\n\\npub const TITLE: &str = \\\"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion\\\";\\n\\npub const SCALPEL: u8 = 0;\\npub const FORCEPS: u8 = 1;\\npub const SUTURE: u8 = 2;\\npub const SUCTION: u8 = 3;\\npub const LASER: u8 = 4;\\npub const GEL: u8 = 5;\\npub const SCANNER: u8 = 6;\\npub const IV: u8 = 7;\\npub const CRYO: u8 = 8;\\npub const DRESSING: u8 = 9;\\npub const DEFIB: u8 = 10;\\npub const TOOL_KEEP: u8 = 255;\\n\\npub const TOOL_NAMES: [&str; 11] =\\n    [\\\"Scalpel\\\", \\\"Forceps\\\", \\\"Suture\\\", \\\"Suction\\\", \\\"Laser\\\", \\\"Gel\\\", \\\"Scanner\\\", \\\"IV Push\\\", \\\"Cryoprobe\\\", \\\"Dressing\\\", \\\"Defibrillator\\\"];\\n\\npub const N_TOOLS: usize = 11;\\n\\npub const K_INCISION: u8 = 0;\\npub const K_LACERATION: u8 = 1;\\npub const K_POOL: u8 = 2;\\npub const K_BLEEDER: u8 = 3;\\npub const K_FOREIGN: u8 = 4;\\npub const K_POLYP: u8 = 5;\\npub const K_TUMOR: u8 = 6;\\npub const K_INFLAM: u8 = 7;\\npub const K_BONE: u8 = 8;\\npub const K_NODULE: u8 = 9;\\npub const K_SAC: u8 = 10;\\npub const K_EYE: u8 = 11;\\npub const K_EMBER: u8 = 12;\\npub const K_HEAT: u8 = 13;\\npub const K_TETHER: u8 = 14;\\npub const K_TENDRIL: u8 = 15;\\npub const K_DRESSING: u8 = 16;\\npub const K_IV: u8 = 17;\\npub const K_BURN: u8 = 18;\\n\\npub const N_KINDS: usize = 19;\\n\\npub const KIND_NAMES: [&str; N_KINDS] = [\\n    \\\"incision\\\", \\\"laceration\\\", \\\"pool\\\", \\\"bleeder\\\", \\\"foreign\\\", \\\"polyp\\\", \\\"tumor\\\", \\\"inflam\\\", \\\"bone\\\", \\\"nodule\\\", \\\"sac\\\", \\\"eye\\\",\\n    \\\"ember\\\", \\\"heat\\\", \\\"tether\\\", \\\"tendril\\\", \\\"dressing\\\", \\\"iv\\\", \\\"burn\\\",\\n];\\n\\npub const R_IMMACULATE: u8 = 0;\\npub const R_CLEAN: u8 = 1;\\npub const R_GOOD: u8 = 2;\\npub const R_SLOPPY: u8 = 3;\\n\\npub const RATING_NAMES: [&str; 4] = [\\\"IMMACULATE\\\", \\\"CLEAN\\\", \\\"GOOD\\\", \\\"SLOPPY\\\"];\\n\\npub fn rating_points(r: u8) -> i32 {\\n    match r {\\n        R_IMMACULATE => 400,\\n        R_CLEAN => 250,\\n        R_GOOD => 120,\\n        _ => 10,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn rate_error(err: f32, strict: f32) -> u8 {\\n    let e = err.max(0.0) * strict.max(0.25);\\n    if e <= 0.22 {\\n        R_IMMACULATE\\n    } else if e <= 0.42 {\\n        R_CLEAN\\n    } else if e <= 0.72 {\\n        R_GOOD\\n    } else {\\n        R_SLOPPY\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn chain_mul(chain: u32) -> f32 {\\n    if chain >= 20 {\\n        2.0\\n    } else if chain >= 10 {\\n        1.5\\n    } else if chain >= 5 {\\n        1.25\\n    } else {\\n        1.0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Ranks at 50 / 70 / 85 / 100 / 115 percent of par. 0 is below C.\\npub fn rank_of(score: i32, par: i32) -> u8 {\\n    if par <= 0 {\\n        return 1;\\n    }\\n    let p = score as f32 / par as f32;\\n    if p >= 1.15 {\\n        5\\n    } else if p >= 1.0 {\\n        4\\n    } else if p >= 0.85 {\\n        3\\n    } else if p >= 0.70 {\\n        2\\n    } else if p >= 0.50 {\\n        1\\n    } else {\\n        0\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn rank_name(r: u8) -> &'static str {\\n    match r {\\n        1 => \\\"C\\\",\\n        2 => \\\"B\\\",\\n        3 => \\\"A\\\",\\n        4 => \\\"S\\\",\\n        5 => \\\"ENCORE\\\",\\n        _ => \\\"\\\",\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub const STRAIN_PHASES: [&str; 18] = [\\n    \\\"introit:wander\\\",\\n    \\\"introit:split\\\",\\n    \\\"introit:smalls\\\",\\n    \\\"introit:amen\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:wave1\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:wave2\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:wave3\\\",\\n    \\\"lacrimosa:eye\\\",\\n    \\\"dies:embers\\\",\\n    \\\"dies:merge\\\",\\n    \\\"dies:furnace\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:a\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:b\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:c\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:stop\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:soloist\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:tendril\\\",\\n    \\\"libera:close\\\",\\n];\\n\\npub fn strain_phase_index(name: &str) -> Option<usize> {\\n    STRAIN_PHASES.iter().position(|s| *s == name)\\n}\\n\\npub fn kind_index(name: &str) -> Option<u8> {\\n    KIND_NAMES.iter().position(|s| *s == name).map(|i| i as u8)\\n}\\n\\npub fn tool_for_kind(kind: u8, stage: u8) -> u8 {\\n    match kind {\\n        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => SCALPEL,\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER => SUTURE,\\n        K_POOL => SUCTION,\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL => FORCEPS,\\n        K_POLYP => LASER,\\n        K_TUMOR => match stage {\\n            0 => SCALPEL,\\n            1 => FORCEPS,\\n            _ => GEL,\\n        },\\n        K_INFLAM | K_BURN => GEL,\\n        K_BONE => {\\n            if stage == 0 {\\n                FORCEPS\\n            } else {\\n                SUTURE\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_NODULE => {\\n            if stage == 0 {\\n                LASER\\n            } else {\\n                FORCEPS\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_SAC => LASER,\\n        K_EYE => match stage {\\n            0 | 1 => SCALPEL,\\n            _ => FORCEPS,\\n        },\\n        K_EMBER => match stage {\\n            0 => CRYO,\\n            1 => SCALPEL,\\n            _ => FORCEPS,\\n        },\\n        K_DRESSING => DRESSING,\\n        K_IV => IV,\\n        K_HEAT => TOOL_KEEP,\\n        _ => SCALPEL,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npub fn stages_for(kind: u8) -> u8 {\\n    match kind {\\n        K_TUMOR | K_EMBER | K_EYE => 3,\\n        K_BONE | K_NODULE => 2,\\n        _ => 1,\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Cue ids. The audio crate renders each one.\\npub const CUE_PICK: u16 = 1;\\npub const CUE_SLICE: u16 = 2;\\npub const CUE_SQUISH: u16 = 3;\\npub const CUE_FORCEPS: u16 = 4;\\npub const CUE_POP: u16 = 5;\\npub const CUE_ZIP: u16 = 6;\\npub const CUE_GURGLE: u16 = 7;\\npub const CUE_LASER: u16 = 8;\\npub const CUE_SIZZLE: u16 = 9;\\npub const CUE_GEL: u16 = 10;\\npub const CUE_IV: u16 = 11;\\npub const CUE_PING: u16 = 12;\\npub const CUE_WHINE: u16 = 13;\\npub const CUE_THUMP: u16 = 14;\\npub const CUE_LUB: u16 = 15;\\npub const CUE_DUB: u16 = 16;\\n\",\"total_lines\":243}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-00019da8-d5d9-41a7-a012-9a0eafb529b2-30","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"350→                finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / 2.0, strict);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_TUMOR if h.tool == FORCEPS => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, diastole);\\n        }\\n        K_NODULE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n360→            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        // The guard binds the whole or-pattern, so a stage check cannot share this arm\\n        // with wounds that suture on stage 0.\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n370→        K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage < 2 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                h.quality += d * dt;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n380→                    finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.2), strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_POOL => {\\n            if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n390→                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_SAC => {\\n            if tool == LASER && (use_held || just_release) {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, CUE_LASER, 2);\\n            } else if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n400→                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * 0.45 * p;\\n                if h.work >= 1.3 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n410→        K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_EMBER if h.stage == 0 && (h.kind != K_EMBER || h.tool == CRYO) => {\\n            let cue = if h.tool == CRYO { CUE_FROST } else { CUE_LASER };\\n            let misuse = if h.tool == CRYO { 4 } else { 2 };\\n            if tool == h.tool {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, cue, misuse);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage == 1 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n420→                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, 0.1, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_INFLAM | K_BURN | K_DRESSING | K_TUMOR if h.tool == GEL || h.tool == DRESSING => {\\n            paint(h, x, z, tool, use_held, d, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n430→        K_BONE if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            if rot > 0 {\\n                h.aux -= dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            if rot < 0 {\\n                h.aux += dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            h.aux = h.aux.clamp(-80.0, 80.0);\\n            if tool == FORCEPS && use_held && d < 0.55 && h.aux.abs() < 12.0 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n440→                hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n                h.work += dt;\\n                if h.work > 0.25 {\\n                    let err = (h.aux.abs() / 40.0) + (d * 0.4);\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, err, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_IV => {\\n            if tool != IV {\\n450→                return hit;\\n            }\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            if use_held {\\n                h.aux += dt / 1.65 * p;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                if h.aux > 1.12 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n                    hit.heal = -8.0;\\n460→                    hit.misuse = 3;\\n                    h.aux = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n                if (0.75..1.05).contains(&h.aux) {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.9).abs() * 1.4, strict);\\n                    hit.heal = 18.0;\\n                    hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                }\\n470→                h.aux = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {}\\n    }\\n    hit\\n}\\n\\nfn finish(h: &mut Hazard, hit: &mut Hit, err: f32, strict: f32) {\\n    hit.done = true;\\n480→    hit.rating = rate_error(err, strict);\\n    hit.engaged = true;\\n    let cleared = h.advance_stage();\\n    if !cleared {\\n        hit.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn forceps(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32, allow: bool) {\\n    if tool != FORCEPS {\\n490→        return;\\n    }\\n    let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n    if use_held && !h.grabbed && d <= h.radius {\\n        h.grabbed = true;\\n        h.grab_x = x;\\n        h.grab_z = z;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n    }\\n500→    if h.grabbed && use_held {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        let dx = x - h.grab_x;\\n        let dz = z - h.grab_z;\\n        let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n        let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n        let along = dx * dirx + dz * dirz;\\n        let lat = (-dx * dirz + dz * dirx).abs();\\n        if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !allow {\\n            h.work = (h.work - dt * 0.9).max(0.0);\\n510→            h.quality += 0.02;\\n        } else {\\n            h.work = h.work.max(along);\\n            h.quality += lat * dt;\\n            if lat > 0.6 && along > 0.25 {\\n                hit.misuse = 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if h.work >= h.need {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.3), strict);\\n520→            hit.cue = CUE_POP;\\n        }\\n    } else if !use_held {\\n        h.grabbed = false;\\n        if h.work < h.need {\\n            h.work = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n530→fn suture(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != SUTURE || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let (along, side) = side_of(h, x, z);\\n    let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n    let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n    let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n    if side.abs() > 0.06 {\\n        let prev = h.aux2;\\n540→        if prev.abs() > 0.06 && prev.signum() != side.signum() && (along - needle).abs() < 0.55 && side.abs() < 0.9 {\\n            h.samples = h.samples.saturating_add(1);\\n            h.quality += (h.aux - 0.28).abs() * 0.35;\\n            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.cue = CUE_ZIP;\\n            if h.samples >= h.samples_need {\\n                let err = h.quality / h.samples.max(1) as f32;\\n                finish(h, hit, err, strict);\\n            }\",\"content_concise\":\"350→                finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / 2.0, strict);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_TUMOR if h.tool == FORCEPS => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, diastole);\\n        }\\n        K_NODULE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n360→            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        // The guard binds the whole or-pattern, so a stage check cannot share this arm\\n        // with wounds that suture on stage 0.\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n370→        K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage < 2 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                h.quality += d * dt;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n380→                    finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.2), strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_POOL => {\\n            if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n390→                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_SAC => {\\n            if tool == LASER && (use_held || just_release) {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, CUE_LASER, 2);\\n            } else if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n400→                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * 0.45 * p;\\n                if h.work >= 1.3 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n410→        K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_EMBER if h.stage == 0 && (h.kind != K_EMBER || h.tool == CRYO) => {\\n            let cue = if h.tool == CRYO { CUE_FROST } else { CUE_LASER };\\n            let misuse = if h.tool == CRYO { 4 } else { 2 };\\n            if tool == h.tool {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, cue, misuse);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage == 1 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n420→                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, 0.1, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_INFLAM | K_BURN | K_DRESSING | K_TUMOR if h.tool == GEL || h.tool == DRESSING => {\\n            paint(h, x, z, tool, use_held, d, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n430→        K_BONE if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            if rot > 0 {\\n                h.aux -= dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            if rot < 0 {\\n                h.aux += dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            h.aux = h.aux.clamp(-80.0, 80.0);\\n            if tool == FORCEPS && use_held && d < 0.55 && h.aux.abs() < 12.0 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n440→                hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n                h.work += dt;\\n                if h.work > 0.25 {\\n                    let err = (h.aux.abs() / 40.0) + (d * 0.4);\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, err, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_IV => {\\n            if tool != IV {\\n450→                return hit;\\n            }\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            if use_held {\\n                h.aux += dt / 1.65 * p;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                if h.aux > 1.12 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n                    hit.heal = -8.0;\\n460→                    hit.misuse = 3;\\n                    h.aux = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n                if (0.75..1.05).contains(&h.aux) {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.9).abs() * 1.4, strict);\\n                    hit.heal = 18.0;\\n                    hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                }\\n470→                h.aux = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {}\\n    }\\n    hit\\n}\\n\\nfn finish(h: &mut Hazard, hit: &mut Hit, err: f32, strict: f32) {\\n    hit.done = true;\\n480→    hit.rating = rate_error(err, strict);\\n    hit.engaged = true;\\n    let cleared = h.advance_stage();\\n    if !cleared {\\n        hit.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn forceps(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32, allow: bool) {\\n    if tool != FORCEPS {\\n490→        return;\\n    }\\n    let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n    if use_held && !h.grabbed && d <= h.radius {\\n        h.grabbed = true;\\n        h.grab_x = x;\\n        h.grab_z = z;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n    }\\n500→    if h.grabbed && use_held {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        let dx = x - h.grab_x;\\n        let dz = z - h.grab_z;\\n        let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n        let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n        let along = dx * dirx + dz * dirz;\\n        let lat = (-dx * dirz + dz * dirx).abs();\\n        if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !allow {\\n            h.work = (h.work - dt * 0.9).max(0.0);\\n510→            h.quality += 0.02;\\n        } else {\\n            h.work = h.work.max(along);\\n            h.quality += lat * dt;\\n            if lat > 0.6 && along > 0.25 {\\n                hit.misuse = 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if h.work >= h.need {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.3), strict);\\n520→            hit.cue = CUE_POP;\\n        }\\n    } else if !use_held {\\n        h.grabbed = false;\\n        if h.work < h.need {\\n            h.work = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n530→fn suture(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != SUTURE || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let (along, side) = side_of(h, x, z);\\n    let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n    let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n    let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n    if side.abs() > 0.06 {\\n        let prev = h.aux2;\\n540→        if prev.abs() > 0.06 && prev.signum() != side.signum() && (along - needle).abs() < 0.55 && side.abs() < 0.9 {\\n            h.samples = h.samples.saturating_add(1);\\n            h.quality += (h.aux - 0.28).abs() * 0.35;\\n            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.cue = CUE_ZIP;\\n            if h.samples >= h.samples_need {\\n                let err = h.quality / h.samples.max(1) as f32;\\n                finish(h, hit, err, strict);\\n            }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/hazard.rs\",\"offset\":350,\"limit\":200,\"raw_output\":\"                finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / 2.0, strict);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_TUMOR if h.tool == FORCEPS => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, diastole);\\n        }\\n        K_NODULE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage >= 2 => {\\n            forceps(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict, true);\\n        }\\n        // The guard binds the whole or-pattern, so a stage check cannot share this arm\\n        // with wounds that suture on stage 0.\\n        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 => {\\n            suture(h, x, z, tool, use_held, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_EYE if h.stage < 2 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                h.quality += d * dt;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.2), strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_POOL => {\\n            if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_SAC => {\\n            if tool == LASER && (use_held || just_release) {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, CUE_LASER, 2);\\n            } else if tool == SUCTION && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_GURGLE;\\n                h.work += dt * 0.45 * p;\\n                if h.work >= 1.3 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_GOOD;\\n                    h.alive = false;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_POLYP | K_NODULE | K_EMBER if h.stage == 0 && (h.kind != K_EMBER || h.tool == CRYO) => {\\n            let cue = if h.tool == CRYO { CUE_FROST } else { CUE_LASER };\\n            let misuse = if h.tool == CRYO { 4 } else { 2 };\\n            if tool == h.tool {\\n                heat_tool(h, near, use_held, just_release, dt, p, strict, &mut hit, cue, misuse);\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_EMBER if h.stage == 1 => {\\n            if tool == SCALPEL && use_held && near {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_SLICE;\\n                h.work += dt * p;\\n                if h.work >= h.need {\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, 0.1, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_INFLAM | K_BURN | K_DRESSING | K_TUMOR if h.tool == GEL || h.tool == DRESSING => {\\n            paint(h, x, z, tool, use_held, d, dt, &mut hit, strict);\\n        }\\n        K_BONE if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            if rot > 0 {\\n                h.aux -= dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            if rot < 0 {\\n                h.aux += dt * 55.0;\\n            }\\n            h.aux = h.aux.clamp(-80.0, 80.0);\\n            if tool == FORCEPS && use_held && d < 0.55 && h.aux.abs() < 12.0 {\\n                hit.engaged = true;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n                h.work += dt;\\n                if h.work > 0.25 {\\n                    let err = (h.aux.abs() / 40.0) + (d * 0.4);\\n                    finish(h, &mut hit, err, strict);\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        K_IV => {\\n            if tool != IV {\\n                return hit;\\n            }\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            if use_held {\\n                h.aux += dt / 1.65 * p;\\n                hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                if h.aux > 1.12 {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n                    hit.heal = -8.0;\\n                    hit.misuse = 3;\\n                    h.aux = 0.0;\\n                }\\n            } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n                if (0.75..1.05).contains(&h.aux) {\\n                    hit.done = true;\\n                    hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.9).abs() * 1.4, strict);\\n                    hit.heal = 18.0;\\n                    hit.cue = CUE_IV;\\n                }\\n                h.aux = 0.0;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        _ => {}\\n    }\\n    hit\\n}\\n\\nfn finish(h: &mut Hazard, hit: &mut Hit, err: f32, strict: f32) {\\n    hit.done = true;\\n    hit.rating = rate_error(err, strict);\\n    hit.engaged = true;\\n    let cleared = h.advance_stage();\\n    if !cleared {\\n        hit.done = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn forceps(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32, allow: bool) {\\n    if tool != FORCEPS {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let d = h.dist(x, z);\\n    if use_held && !h.grabbed && d <= h.radius {\\n        h.grabbed = true;\\n        h.grab_x = x;\\n        h.grab_z = z;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_FORCEPS;\\n    }\\n    if h.grabbed && use_held {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        let dx = x - h.grab_x;\\n        let dz = z - h.grab_z;\\n        let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n        let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n        let along = dx * dirx + dz * dirz;\\n        let lat = (-dx * dirz + dz * dirx).abs();\\n        if h.kind == K_TENDRIL && !allow {\\n            h.work = (h.work - dt * 0.9).max(0.0);\\n            h.quality += 0.02;\\n        } else {\\n            h.work = h.work.max(along);\\n            h.quality += lat * dt;\\n            if lat > 0.6 && along > 0.25 {\\n                hit.misuse = 1;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if h.work >= h.need {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality / h.need.max(0.3), strict);\\n            hit.cue = CUE_POP;\\n        }\\n    } else if !use_held {\\n        h.grabbed = false;\\n        if h.work < h.need {\\n            h.work = 0.0;\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn suture(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != SUTURE || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n    }\\n    let (along, side) = side_of(h, x, z);\\n    let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n    let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n    let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n    if side.abs() > 0.06 {\\n        let prev = h.aux2;\\n        if prev.abs() > 0.06 && prev.signum() != side.signum() && (along - needle).abs() < 0.55 && side.abs() < 0.9 {\\n            h.samples = h.samples.saturating_add(1);\\n            h.quality += (h.aux - 0.28).abs() * 0.35;\\n            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.cue = CUE_ZIP;\\n            if h.samples >= h.samples_need {\\n                let err = h.quality / h.samples.max(1) as f32;\\n                finish(h, hit, err, strict);\\n            }\\n\",\"total_lines\":642}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"596c16c6-bc9f-4b87-a6fb-41abea35d4db"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1099","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe test would not catch a bug where the simulation promotes the stored tool but `hazard::apply` uses the raw input tool. The first assertion sends LASER and asserts CRYO, which forces A critical bug candidate has been identifiedpromotion. If `contextual_tool` were a no-op, that assertion would fail. in the ember heat path. The frost loop sends pre-promoted CRYO, so the simulation folds it back to LASER and re-promotes it again.\n\nThe dressing test follows the same honest pattern. I need to verify whether this test was actually included in the suite and run, since suite.txt reports\n\nThe ember heat path logic is sound. The 16 passed tests. hazard's tool field correctly matches the player's tool for contextual promotion.\n\nI am tallying the test annotations in surgery.rs, pav_ui, audio, and the view module to confirm the suite contained 16 tests. I will also verify that the captured output reflects the post-fix run by comparing timestamps against file modification times.\n\nChecking whether heat_tool requires release to advance stage. Dressing paint() correctly contextual-promotes gel to dressing. The select() function may fail to deliver tools to dressing or ember hazards, though the current test passed. Need to verify suite.txt timestamps to ensure the evidence is current.\n\nThe suite summary must contain the bot-wins observations, but the tests themselves assert them. I will not re-litigate prior suite structure if it was accepted. The immediate focus is hunting real demonstrable defects in the new code, starting with a careful review of the instruments cursor loop for hub mode.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-df561144-fddb-4787-b05d-1ff298b27d33-31","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_app/src/product.rs","offset":350,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-df561144-fddb-4787-b05d-1ff298b27d33-32","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fn heat_tool|fn paint","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/hazard.rs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4759,"output_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":73728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"32562b02-bba3-4ff4-ad64-cc43dd303ac2"}
