ead I plan to read boot of a blank scene. mode logic, the frame snapshot, paint() for dressing acceptance, and resolve_hands timing in product.rs. I should also check if engine-link targets the dev engine and whether .harbor-target was deleted after the suite.\n\nI am now hunting for a real logic bug in the player path that would prevent clearing. I inspected `cycle()` and confirmed it wraps\n\nThe fix is confirmed: tools 0 through 7 correctly. emit() now draws content DIGITS 8 and 9 set  instead of returningCRYO or DRESSING directly, early, and build()  then `resolve_hands`returns that scene when quiet. The test suite calls `contextual_tool`. validates this output This is the exact spot where a promotion failure could break the simulation. through the build.rs wiring.\n\nA camera visibility check was considered. If apply_look uses a shot that targets the field, the coarse plate should be visible. This is not a prior gap if the geometry exists in the scene.\n\nPressing digit 9 selects CRYO only when the ","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ac11b00-f72b-46a9-a97c-bd7e9aa15a64-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"struct CameraShot|fn empty|camera:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/frame.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ac11b00-f72b-46a9-a97c-bd7e9aa15a64-34","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs","offset":830,"limit":160}}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2097,"output_tokens":1391,"cache_read_input_tokens":78464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0