tStickY))),\\n                south: pressed(Button::South),\\n                east: pressed(Button::East),\\n                north: pressed(Button::North),\\n                west: pressed(Button::West),\\n                l1: pressed(Button::LeftTrigger),\\n                r1: pressed(Button::RightTrigger),\\n                start: pressed(Button::Start),\\n                up: pressed(Button::DPadUp),\\n                down: pressed(Button::DPadDown),\\n                left_b: pressed(Button::DPadLeft),\\n                right_b: pressed(Button::DPadRight),\\n                lt: analog(Button::LeftTrigger2),\\n                rt: analog(Button::RightTrigger2),\\n            };\\n        }\\n    pads\\n}\\n\\nimpl Harbor {\\n    /// Shell step plus one frame of surgeon hands. `aim` is the mouse on the field, if it hit.\\n    /// `local` is the hub seat this page owns; `None` is a solo table where slot 0 is always live.\\n    fn compose(&mut self, dt: f32, aim: Option<[f32; 2]>, local: Option<u8>, block_back: bool) -> (Vec<Cmd>, [SurgeonInput; 4], bool) {\\n        let op = self.shell.screen_name() == \\\"op\\\";\\n        let stick = self.pads[0].present && self.pads[0].right.length() > 0.12;\\n        let keys_aim = self.key(KeyCode::KeyW)\\n            || self.key(KeyCode::KeyA)\\n            || self.key(KeyCode::KeyS)\\n            || self.key(KeyCode::KeyD)\\n            || self.key(KeyCode::ArrowUp)\\n            || self.key(KeyCode::ArrowDown)\\n            || self.key(KeyCode::ArrowLeft)\\n            || self.key(KeyCode::ArrowRight);\\n        if stick || keys_aim {\\n            self.mouse_owns = false;\\n        } else if self.mouse_moved {\\n            self.mouse_owns = true;\\n        }\\n        let pad0 = self.pads[0];\\n        let pad_nav = pad0.present && (pad0.up || pad0.down || pad0.south || pad0.east || pad0.start || pad0.left.length() > 0.2 || pad0.right.length() > 0.2);\\n        let mouse_fine = self.mouse_moved || self.mouse_click || self.just.iter().any(|k| !matches!(k, KeyCode::F1 | KeyCode::F2 | KeyCode::F3));\\n        let device = if pad_nav && !mouse_fine { Some(DeviceKind::Gamepad) } else if mouse_fine || !self.just.is_empty() { Some(DeviceKind::KeyboardMouse) } else { None };\\n        let was = self.was;\\n        self.was = pad0;\\n        let up = self.ate(KeyCode::ArrowUp) || (pad0.up && !was.up);\\n        let down = self.ate(KeyCode::ArrowDown) || (pad0.down && !was.down);\\n        let left = self.ate(KeyCode::ArrowLeft) || (pad0.left_b && !was.left_b);\\n        let right = self.ate(KeyCode::ArrowRight) || (pad0.right_b && !was.right_b);\\n        let confirm = self.ate(KeyCode::Enter) || self.ate(KeyCode::NumpadEnter) || (!op && self.ate(KeyCode::Space)) || (!op && pad0.south && !was.south);\\n        let back = !block_back && (self.ate(KeyCode::Escape) || (!op && pad0.east && !was.east) || (pad0.start && !was.start));\\n        let any = device.is_some() || self.mouse_moved || self.touch_click || self.mouse_click || back || confirm || up || down;\\n        let pointer = if op { None } else { Some([self.mouse.x, self.mouse.y]) };\\n        let click = !op && (self.mouse_click || self.touch_click);\\n        let tab_l = self.ate(KeyCode::PageUp) || self.ate(KeyCode::BracketLeft);\\n        let tab_r = self.ate(KeyCode::PageDown) || self.ate(KeyCode::BracketRight);\\n        let cmds = self.shell.step(ShellIn {\\n            up: !op && up,\\n            down: !op && down,\\n            left: !op && left,\\n            right: !op && right,\\n            confirm: !op && confirm,\\n            back,\\n            tab_l,\\n            tab_r,\\n            pointer,\\n            click,\\n            any,\\n            dt,\\n            device,\\n        });\\n        let confirm_sim = cmds.iter().any(|c| matches!(c, Cmd::ConfirmSim));\\n        self.tools_from_hands(op, local);\\n        let mut surgeons = [SurgeonInput { tool: TOOL_KEEP, ..SurgeonInput::default() }; 4];\\n        if op {\\n            for i in 0..4 {\\n                let owns = local.is_none() && i == 0 && self.mouse_owns || local == Some(i as u8) && self.mouse_owns;\\n                surgeons[i] = self.hand(i, aim, owns, local);\\n            }\\n        } else if confirm_sim {\\n            surgeons[0].active = true;\\n            surgeons[0].tool = TOOL_KEEP;\\n            surgeons[0].held |= surg::CONFIRM;\\n            surgeons[0].pressed |= surg::CONFIRM;\\n        }\\n        self.mouse_click = false;\\n        self.mouse_moved = false;\\n        self.touch_click = false;\\n        self.wheel = 0.0;\\n        self.just.clear();\\n\",\"total_lines\":1000}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6f43b46e-70db-42b5-bf02-e3aeba267a1e-36","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"555→        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n    h.aux += dt;\\n}\\n\\n560→fn heat_tool(h: &mut Hazard, near: bool, use_held: bool, just_release: bool, dt: f32, p: f32, strict: f32, hit: &mut Hit, cue: u16, misuse: u8) {\\n    let fill = h.need.max(0.35);\\n    if use_held && near {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = cue;\\n        h.aux += dt / fill * p;\\n        if h.aux > 1.08 {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n            hit.misuse = misuse;\\n570→            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            h.alive = false;\\n        }\\n    } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n        if (0.80..1.06).contains(&h.aux) {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.92).abs() * 1.6, strict);\\n            hit.cue = CUE_SIZZLE;\\n            let _ = h.advance_stage();\\n580→        }\\n        h.aux = 0.0;\\n    } else if !near {\\n        h.aux = (h.aux - dt * 0.35).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn paint(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, d: f32, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != h.tool || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n590→    }\\n    if d <= h.radius {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_GEL;\\n        let ang = (z - h.z).atan2(x - h.x);\\n        let q = ((ang + std::f32::consts::PI) / (std::f32::consts::FRAC_PI_2)).floor() as u8 % 4;\\n        h.bits |= 1 << q;\\n        h.work += dt;\\n        if h.bits.count_ones() >= 4 && h.work >= h.need * 0.55 {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality * 0.5, strict);\\n600→        }\\n    } else if d < h.radius * 2.1 {\\n        h.quality += dt;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Where the bot should put the cursor to continue this gesture.\\npub fn aim_point(h: &Hazard, cursor_side: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    match h.kind {\\n610→        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n            let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n            let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n            let along = (h.work + 0.22).min(h.need);\\n            (h.x + dirx * along, h.z + dirz * along)\\n        }\\n        K_TUMOR if h.stage == 0 => {\\n            let ang = h.work + 0.28;\\n            (h.x + ang.cos() * (h.radius * 0.75), h.z + ang.sin() * (h.radius * 0.75))\\n        }\\n620→        K_LACERATION | K_BLEEDER | K_BONE if h.stage >= 1 || h.kind != K_BONE => {\\n            let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n            let dirz = h.axis.sin();\\n            let span = h.need.max(0.4);\\n            let n = h.samples_need.max(1) as f32;\\n            let needle = -span * 0.5 + (h.samples as f32 + 0.5) * (span / n);\\n            let across_x = -dirz;\\n            let across_z = dirx;\\n            let sign = if cursor_side >= 0.0 { -1.0 } else { 1.0 };\\n            (h.x + dirx * needle + across_x * 0.5 * sign, h.z + dirz * needle + across_z * 0.5 * sign)\\n630→        }\\n        K_FOREIGN | K_TENDRIL | K_NODULE | K_EYE | K_EMBER | K_TUMOR if h.grabbed || h.tool == FORCEPS && h.kind != K_TUMOR => {\\n            if h.grabbed || h.work > 0.05 {\\n                let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n                let dirz = h.axis.sin();\",\"content_concise\":\"555→        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n    h.aux += dt;\\n}\\n\\n560→fn heat_tool(h: &mut Hazard, near: bool, use_held: bool, just_release: bool, dt: f32, p: f32, strict: f32, hit: &mut Hit, cue: u16, misuse: u8) {\\n    let fill = h.need.max(0.35);\\n    if use_held && near {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = cue;\\n        h.aux += dt / fill * p;\\n        if h.aux > 1.08 {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.rating = R_SLOPPY;\\n            hit.misuse = misuse;\\n570→            h.aux = 0.0;\\n            h.alive = false;\\n        }\\n    } else if just_release && h.aux > 0.05 {\\n        if (0.80..1.06).contains(&h.aux) {\\n            hit.done = true;\\n            hit.engaged = true;\\n            hit.rating = rate_error((h.aux - 0.92).abs() * 1.6, strict);\\n            hit.cue = CUE_SIZZLE;\\n            let _ = h.advance_stage();\\n580→        }\\n        h.aux = 0.0;\\n    } else if !near {\\n        h.aux = (h.aux - dt * 0.35).max(0.0);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfn paint(h: &mut Hazard, x: f32, z: f32, tool: u8, use_held: bool, d: f32, dt: f32, hit: &mut Hit, strict: f32) {\\n    if tool != h.tool || !use_held {\\n        return;\\n590→    }\\n    if d <= h.radius {\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n        hit.cue = CUE_GEL;\\n        let ang = (z - h.z).atan2(x - h.x);\\n        let q = ((ang + std::f32::consts::PI) / (std::f32::consts::FRAC_PI_2)).floor() as u8 % 4;\\n        h.bits |= 1 << q;\\n        h.work += dt;\\n        if h.bits.count_ones() >= 4 && h.work >= h.need * 0.55 {\\n            finish(h, hit, h.quality * 0.5, strict);\\n600→        }\\n    } else if d < h.radius * 2.1 {\\n        h.quality += dt;\\n        hit.engaged = true;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n/// Where the bot should put the cursor to continue this gesture.\\npub fn aim_point(h: &Hazard, cursor_side: f32) -> (f32, f32) {\\n    match h.kind {\\n610→        K_INCISION | K_TETHER => {\\n            let dirx = h.axis.cos();\\n            let dirz = h.axis.sin(