{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1114","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The surgery.rs test timestamp is 03:38.\n\nmap.rs is 03:35. suite.exit is 03:51. product.rs is 04:59. suite.txt is 05:38. The suite was re-run after the last product.rs change. There are 17 tests but only 16 passed. The cargo test filter likely matched six UI tests in `pav_ui::surgery::tests`.\n\nI confirmed there are nine `#[test]` items in surgery.rs. The suite shows zero failures, so the missing test is not a panic or ignored item. I am now checking whether one of those nine tests might be conditionally compiled with `#[cfg]`.\n\nI am now checking whether one test is marked `#[ignore]`, which would explain the count of 16 passed. I also want to verify that all UI tests actually carry the `#[test]` attribute.\n\nI found six UI tests in the source. The total is 17, so the missing test is not a UI item. I ruled out the view test as well: if it had failed to match, cargo would have returned a non-zero exit code and run_all would have counted it as a failure.\n\nThe missing test is `quiet_hub_draws_plate_instruments_hazards_and_cursors` in `pav_view/src/surgery/mod.rs`. Cargo returned zero tests for the `surgery::tests` filter. The module path likely does not match the expected `pav_view::surgery` namespace.\n\nCargo filters match substrings of the full test name, so the path `pav_view::surgery::tests` should satisfy the `surgery::tests` filter. The missing test is likely absent from the library because the module is not declared in `pav_view/lib.rs`, or it is conditionally compiled out.\n\nThe suite script run_all.py was updated at 03:36, so the 05:38 suite.txt used the current version that includes the view test. The view test produced a long compile log in view-test2.txt, which I am now examining to confirm whether it ran or was skipped.\n\nCargo returned zero tests with exit code 0, producing no `test ... ok` lines. This silent skip would explain the missing count. I will inspect `pav_view/lib.rs` to verify the module path. The nine surgery tests were present at suite time.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-32ed0819-59b0-4637-b2b5-38d8e2a53481-39","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"#\\[test\\]|#\\[ignore\\]|#\\[cfg","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-32ed0819-59b0-4637-b2b5-38d8e2a53481-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"mod surgery|pub mod","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/work/Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015/engine/crates/pav_view/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-32ed0819-59b0-4637-b2b5-38d8e2a53481-41","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer/view-test.txt","offset":1,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-32ed0819-59b0-4637-b2b5-38d8e2a53481-42","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"test result|quiet_hub|FAILED|passed","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224015__x42677a/tmp/grok-goal-907ccca5ce3b/implementer"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4355,"output_tokens":1725,"cache_read_input_tokens":94720,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"767c87fa-a5be-4088-b992-e6fa2253506b"}
