e `host.pump` (`product.rs`). Digit 9 and Digit 0 are on the key table as Cryoprobe and Dressing as well. A pad therefore reaches both tools by selecting Laser/Scanner or any ring tool and aiming at the wound.\\n\\n## Mapping test\\n\\n`shipped_mapping_clears_an_ember_and_a_dressing` boots case 5 and case 2 with `Sim::new`, drives `octant`, `cycle`, and `tray_tool`, and sends the ring id (Laser, then Gel) through `Sim::step`. It asserts the sim stores Cryoprobe and Dressing and that the ember and the dressing are actually cleared. `map-test.txt` records that test as `ok`.\\n\\nThe only `#[ignore]` in that file is the print-only `balance_sheet`. The plan lists balance output as evidence, not a gating assertion.\\n\\n## Quiet hub field\\n\\n`emit` no longer returns before drawing. A quiet frame still pushes a coarse plate, cursor instrument meshes, and hazard SDFs. `SceneBuilder::build` takes that path and returns, so the demo world is not drawn instead. Modes 3 and 8 (host operation and client mirror) both draw cursors, and `note_mode` maps those modes to the HUD rather than a full-screen menu. `view-test.txt` records `quiet_hub_draws_plate_instruments_hazards_and_cursors` as `ok`.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"c8da86bc-d93c-4b08-8093-27f3ac707475"}
