p/src/product.rs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1,\"content\":\"//! Hands of Harbor's frame. A surgery scene never enters the demo menu, camera, or touch layer.\"},{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\"use pav_core::games::surgery::{contextual_tool, cycle, octant, tray_tool, Surgery, SurgeryFrame, TITLE, TOOL_KEEP};\"},{\"line_number\":449,\"content\":\"        _ => \\\"title\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":617,\"content\":\"    let name = op.as_ref().map(|o| track_name(o)).unwrap_or(\\\"title\\\");\"},{\"line_number\":815,\"content\":\"        \\\"title\\\": TITLE,\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"12c20b28-aca7-43f5-89a7-8a5ce7c44a4f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1124","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The deliverable is a single HTML file for Chrome or Edge with WebGPU.\n\nThe game is \"Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion,\" a playable browser surgical-action title inspired by Trauma Center: Second Opinion. It runs in one HTML file and features eight instruments, a heartbeat clock, story cases, local co-op, and an optional AI Hub Code Blue round.\n\nOpen the HTML file directly in Chrome or Edge. Aim with the right stick or mouse, operate with R2 or left click, and select tools using the left stick or keys 1–8. After ten seconds of idle time on the title screen, attract mode begins automatically. Press Options or Esc to pause for Dev Mode.\n\nThe draft is 66 words, well under the 80-word limit. The opening sentence and three bullets fit the four-bullet cap. I may add a quick note about local co-op or Code Blue to fill the word budget.\n\nThe opening sentence now specifies one to four players. The draft is 76 words. I will avoid mentioning the review and use complete sentences.\n\nThe draft reached 97 words. I will remove the player count from the opening sentence to keep the total under 80.\n\nThe opening sentence is now twelve words. The second bullet is twenty-three words.\n\nThe third bullet is nineteen words. The draft totals seventy-six words. Adding a flavor line about the heartbeat would push it to eighty-one.\n\nThe opening sentence now includes a setting detail, but the draft reaches eighty-two words. I will keep the total at seventy-six by shortening the first bullet.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"**Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion** is a playable single-file browser surgery game set in a harbour hospital.\n\n- Open `Hands of Harbor: Second Opinion-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224015.html` in Chrome or Edge (WebGPU; `file://` is fine).\n- Aim with the right stick or mouse, operate with R2 or left click, and pick tools with the left stick or keys 1–8.\n- On the title, 10 seconds of idle starts attract mode; Options or Esc pauses into settings and Dev Mode."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1645,"output_tokens":3657,"cache_read_input_tokens":33280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa38-de6f-7dc0-ae0d-e0f717ed75f2","uuid":"7e044997-9167-4f1a-970e-3a25fc2a01ff"}
